window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2801,"title":"Chapter 2801: The Might of Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2801: The Might of Tyrannical Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After adding her as a friend, it became convenient for Miss Long Luo to transmit some program codes to the big-eyed planet. More importantly, leveraging their friendship, Madam Long Luo could use the “virus backdoor” to remotely control and update the “cultivation chat client.”","Miss Long Luo was an exceptionally skilled programmer, dedicated to her work.","In the future, as Song Shuhang’s realm advanced, the functions of his “cultivation” talent would also become more refined. Consequently, the “cultivation chat client” would need to evolve to keep pace with Song Shuhang’s upgrades.","Opposite him, the big-eyed planet boss sensed something amiss. Instinctively, it wanted to evade the beam of light containing vast amounts of information and data shot from Tyrannical Song’s eye socket.","However, its response was too slow—because Tyrannical Song’s third eye was actually its old master’s eyeball, which had a suppressive effect on it.","When experts exchange blows, every move can be fatal.","A moment of network delay could influence the battle’s outcome.","Moreover, under the influence of the third divine eye, the big-eyed planet boss was in a constant state of “stutter,” approaching step by step.","Thus, under the continuous “stutter” effect, Tyrannical Song’s “virus-type cultivation chat client program” took root in its body.","This program package wasn’t large. After being transmitted to the big-eyed planet boss, it was immediately unpacked, occupying a small corner within its enormous body.","The data was transmitted through the divine third eye, akin to something indirectly sent by its master, giving it very high authority.","After the client program was unpacked, Miss Long Luo sent a patch through the private chat function. Striking while the iron was hot, she solidified the client within the fat ball boss’s body and synchronized it with Song Shuhang’s Golden Core QR code.","At this moment, the battle shifted to a confrontation between Lady Long Luo and the big-eyed planet boss.","On the contrary, Song Shuhang had nothing to do, leisurely floating opposite the big-eyed planet boss.","His only role now was to assist Lady Long Luo by occasionally using his third divine eye to suppress the big-eyed planet boss, causing it to remain in a constant state of stutter.","In the Wealth Throne World:","“Master, it seems Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song has dealt with your dao artifact son,” the eyeball butler remarked, taking the opportunity to twist the knife.","Earlier, the three-eyed youth had mentioned that this dao artifact was like his child. He intended to give the best to Tyrannical Song, urging him not to be polite.","“Dealt with? It’s not that simple. This is a dao artifact,” the three-eyed young senior replied leisurely.","While they were talking, the bored Tyrannical Song made a new move.","The tiny Tyrannical Song cautiously approached the big-eyed planet boss.","Under the dual pressure of Lady Long Luo and the third divine eye, the big-eyed planet boss could only watch as Tyrannical Song landed on its body.","“There’s a path to heaven, but you didn’t take it. Tyrannical Song, you’re courting death,” the big-eyed planet boss sent an excited message.","Once Tyrannical Song landed on its body, it would be akin to seeking death.","As a dao artifact, it was likely the largest in history, brimming with weapons and traps in every part of its body.","Its interior was particularly lethal.","“Come, fall into my body!” The big-eyed planet boss’s body opened up a passage, producing a huge suction force to swallow Song Shuhang.","“Saber Nurturing Technique!” Song Shuhang’s long hair spread out and transformed into 66 braided hands. Both of his hands pressed on the big-eyed planet’s surface, sliding frantically.","Tyrannical Song’s scream had a soul.","But Tyrannical Song’s “Saber Nurturing Technique” lacked a soul.","It was soulless and cheap, with the only advantage being its sheer volume.","In just two seconds, Tyrannical Song sent nearly 20,000 rounds of “Saber Nurturing Technique” to the big-eyed planet boss. Given the opponent’s massive size, Song Shuhang’s Saber Nurturing Technique could only affect a small area. He had to rely on quantity to achieve the effect.","In the void, the big-eyed planet’s entire body began to tremble.","Although the Saber Nurturing Technique only impacted a small part of its body, the effect influenced its entire being, akin to someone scratching its foot, causing a full-body itch.","The moment the big-eyed planet was affected by the “Blade Nurturing Technique,” Lady Long Luo seized the opportunity, implanting and solidifying the “cultivation chat client program” and retreating unscathed.","“Warning: Tyrannical Song... prepare to retreat. Countdown to data packet detonation: 5, 4, 3, 2, 1!” Lady Long Luo’s voice echoed in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Song Shuhang quickly retreated.","As the countdown ended, Lady Long Luo detonated the massive data package from when Song Shuhang had given his lecture, causing the cultivators across the myriad worlds to add him as a friend!","Song Shuhang’s body trembled violently, and his mental energy was instantly overwhelmed by countless “friend” messages.","The myriad worlds were infinitely vast, and the number of cultivators was uncountable.","The sheer number of friend requests being unzipped at once could overwhelm even an Immortal.","Fortunately, as soon as the data was unzipped, Lady Long Luo transferred it.","All the “friend requests” were directed to the big-eyed planet, converting into “download the cultivation chat app” messages!","The big-eyed planet boss stopped trembling as the Blade Nurturing Technique’s effect faded. But its disaster was just beginning.","The “add friend” messages from practitioners across the universe surged into its body, transforming into “download messages.”","The massive data impact nearly caused it to crash.","The planet-sized single eye bulged from the data impact, with thick streams of blood appearing on its protruding eyeball.","At the same time, across the myriad worlds, all the fellow daoists who had been watching the “Overlord Speech” suddenly received a message in their minds.","Their “add Tyrannical Song as a friend” messages had been stuck.","But today, there was a sudden change.","The “add Tyrannical Song as a friend” messages gradually transformed into “download the cultivation chat client” messages.","All the fellow daoists’ bodies trembled, their consciousnesses rising infinitely. Vaguely, the daoists who were listening in the universe came into contact with an enormous planet.","This planet radiated the light of Dao Connotation.","“Dao Artifact!” some knowledgeable cultivators couldn’t help but shout.","This kind of radiance from the Dao Connotation, this existence that seemed to have a vague connection with “immortality,” was definitely a dao artifact—no mistake!","“We can actually come into contact with an existence like a Dao Artifact?”","As all the cultivators trembled and carefully touched this Dao Artifact, a data package of the cultivation chat client began to download, using this Dao Artifact as a carrier.","“It’s Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s method!”","“Using a dao artifact as a medium, does that mean Tyrannical Song has already grasped a dao artifact?”","On this day, the myriad worlds were once again shocked by Big Boss Tyrannical Song.","“Big Boss Tyrannical Song is awesome!”"]},{"number":2802,"title":"Chapter 2802: I’m Becoming a Pillar!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2802: I’m Becoming a Pillar!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the past year, the prestige of Tyrannical Song had bombarded all the practitioners in the universe from every angle.","Every time people felt that Tyrannical Song had reached the peak of his prowess, he would always find a more novel way to surpass this limit, constantly refreshing the upper boundaries of people’s perception of his greatness.","This time was no exception.","A few days ago, Tyrannical Song’s clone challenged the Immortals of the myriad worlds on Mars, making his name renowned across the universe. Then, Big Boss Tyrannical Song used a “dao artifact” as a server to download the client, bombarding the entire network.","This was a dao artifact!","It wasn’t a magic weapon that ordinary cultivators could make; it was a Heavenly Dao weapon forged from special materials. If the Heavenly Dao were still in power, the appearance of a dao artifact would be equivalent to the descent of the Heavenly Dao.","Even after the collapse of the Heavenly Dao, the power of a dao artifact still far exceeded that of an ordinary Immortal.","But now, Big Boss Tyrannical Song was actually using a “dao artifact” as the download client’s server. In other words, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had either subdued this dao artifact or obtained its recognition.","Regardless of the method, it was an extremely difficult feat.","In the entire universe, perhaps only Big Boss Tyrannical Song could use the “dao artifact” as a server.","At this moment.","Any cultivator who had seen the speech, no matter where they were, could directly connect their spiritual energy to the Dao Artifact Planet and come into contact with the dao artifact. They could also download the cultivation chat client from the dao artifact.","During the download process, the mental energy of the cultivators could always be connected to the Dao Artifact Planet. This was a fortuitous encounter for cultivators across the universe!","As a Heavenly Dao magic item, it had many extraordinary and special features. Anything related to the Heavenly Dao possessed extraordinary properties.","As long as a cultivator’s spiritual power came into contact with it, they would continuously comprehend some information and benefit greatly.","Additionally, during the process of downloading the “cultivation chat client,” the cultivator’s mental energy was protected by Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s cultivation program. They didn’t have to worry about being exposed to terrifying information that might turn them into fools.","Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s protection seemed to have a filtering function.","As a result, the benefits that the cultivators received during the process of downloading the client were no less than a “Tyrannical Song Speech”!","Therefore, the cultivators screamed from the bottom of their hearts—Big Boss Tyrannical Song is awesome!","Indeed, Big Boss Tyrannical Song was different from others. He was always concerned about the cultivators of the myriad worlds and worked for their welfare.","Even without using the Blade Nurturing Technique, the favorable impression points of cultivators in the universe towards Tyrannical Song were constantly increasing by +1, +1.","Ordinary cultivators were immersed in the excitement of coming into contact with a dao artifact.","However, two of the more attentive big shots had a thought when they came into contact with the big-eyed planet’s dao artifact.","The style of this big-eyed planet’s dao artifact seemed very similar to that of the Three-Eyed Ruler.","That was especially true of the one-eyed Hegemon, who had the same aura as the Three-Eyed Ruler.","“Hiss,” the two meticulous big shots sucked in a breath of cold air again.","Combining the timeline, the time when this dao artifact appeared was exactly when Tyrannical Song “dealt with” the Three-Eyed Ruler and then went to search the Three-Eyed Ruler’s lair to seize its treasure.","So that was how it was. After combining the cause and effect, the truth was out!","Why did Tyrannical Song challenge the Three-Eyed Ruler? The answer was because of this dao artifact, this Heavenly Dao magical artifact that had fallen into the hands of the ruler of the Netherworld!","Why did Big Boss Tyrannical Song want this dao artifact? Because the last time Big Boss Tyrannical Song gave a speech, the “cultivation” friend request function had been stuck. If Big Boss Tyrannical Song wanted to solve this problem, he would need this dao artifact as a carrier server!","In this way, everything could be explained.","Tyrannical Song was terrifying.","Even though he knew that the other party was the ruler of the Netherworld, he coveted the dao artifact and directly went to kill the ruler of the Netherworld to seize it.","Moreover, he was able to subdue the dao artifact in a short period of time.","It had to be known that not much time had passed since Big Boss Tyrannical Song dealt with the Three-Eyed Ruler.","How long would it normally take to subdue a dao artifact? A thousand years? Ten thousand years?","As for Big Boss Tyrannical Song, how much time did he take?","After the two meticulous big shots guessed the reason, they looked at each other and quickly told the big shots around them about this guess.","Hence, the information update about Big Boss Tyrannical Song defeating the ruler of the Netherworld, as well as his feat of subduing a dao artifact in just an hour, spread!","Tyrannical Song’s legend of invincibility had opened a new chapter.","In the void of the world of the Throne of Wealth.","The big-eyed planet’s boss was still desperately processing the information from the myriad worlds and was almost overloaded.","Song Shuhang stretched out his arms and floated in the air with a relaxed expression.","“It’s so comfortable. The data package that oppressed my spirit was suddenly emptied. It feels like I’ve thrown away a 5.965×102?kg burden.” Song Shuhang’s hands gently moved, and he felt that his mental state was unprecedentedly comfortable, giving him the illusion that his body was as light as a feather.","After the mental pressure was cleared, Song Shuhang’s mental energy began to expand and strengthen rapidly. The previous data package was like a heavy load. While it suppressed his spiritual energy, it also tempered his spiritual energy.","Now that the data package was unburdened, his spiritual power naturally began to soar.","Not only that, but when the practitioners in the universe downloaded the client and started to register their accounts to use the “cultivation” function, it would also slightly strengthen Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang’s mental energy seemed to have become a “big net,” receiving endless feedback.","The users were potential power!","With the “cultivation chat client” as a link, in the future, as long as Miss Long Luo upgraded the client and combined it with Song Shuhang’s own body, she would be able to develop a method to unify the power of the “cultivation chat users” in the myriad worlds to attack.","“And the Karma Saber,” Song Shuhang clenched his fist.","Downloading his “cultivation chat client” was equivalent to forming a karmic relationship with Tyrannical Song.","In the future, after this “karma relationship” was strengthened, Song Shuhang’s Karma Saber Technique could directly extract the power of the users of the universe and use it to defeat enemies.","Besides potential power, the users were also potential spirit stones. After the users got used to the function of “cultivation chat,” Madam Long Luo could develop more functions in the future to reap the wealth.","“Time. I just need to wait patiently,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","“Data package cleaning completed. Cultivation chat client carrier structure completed. Server operating normally. Data exchange normal... Tyrannical Song, I need to enter the main world,” Lady Long Luo’s voice rang in Song Shuhang’s ears.","“Do you need my help?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes, I need to use your Inner World as a springboard... Send one of my pure energy clones over,” Madam Long Luo said. “Then, I’ll turn my pure energy clone into a pillar.”"]},{"number":2803,"title":"Chapter 2803: It Hurts Just Looking At It","paragraphs":["Chapter 2803: It Hurts Just Looking At It","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Other than the virtuous lamia who was addicted to sacrificing herself to the pillar, this was the first time Song Shuhang had heard someone ask to become a pillar.","However, Madam Long Luo’s way of thinking was different. After all, she wasn’t human, so no matter what kind of request she made, it wouldn’t be surprising. Song Shuhang only needed to cooperate with her.","“Hint: Please take action before the Dao Artifact planet comes out of its down state,” Madam Long Luo reminded.","“Is it related to the big-eyed planet’s boss?” Song Shuhang replied. “I’ll open my Inner World right away.”","To make it easier for him to return to the Black Dragon World at any time, Madam Long Luo had left a teleportation array for him when he left the Black Dragon World.","Now, she had used the teleportation channel between her Inner World and the Black Dragon World to transfer an energy clone she had recently cultivated in order to upgrade the ‘cultivation chat’ function to Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","In fact, before suggesting that Song Shuhang look for a ‘client server’ carrier, Long Luo had tried to create a small clone of herself and use it as a server carrier.","However, her experiment did not succeed, mainly because there was a generation gap between the Black Dragon World and the main world!","This generation gap was even bigger than the generation gap between people and the world.","A moment later, while the big-eyed planet’s boss was still down, a pure energy clone of Lady Long Luo emerged from the Inner World.","Her appearance was similar to the ‘Lady Kuna’ that Long Luo had transformed into in the Black Dragon World. However, because she was a pure energy body, she was white-skinned.","“Is this the main world?” Madam Long Luo said softly.","“To be precise, it’s Senior Three-Eyed’s small world. It’s not the real world yet,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","“Hmm, open a portal. While I still have some time, I need to get in touch with the information and laws of the main world to prepare for the future upgrade process,” Madam Long Luo replied.","She only needed to follow Song Shuhang’s instructions and improve the ‘cultivation chat’ program step by step. Now, after the client was developed, she needed to adjust the client according to the rules and information of the ‘modern world.’ After all, there was a generation gap between the main world and the Black Dragon World. She couldn’t follow the rules of the Black Dragon World to upgrade the Cultivation Chat client.","Today, Madam Long Luo was as dedicated as ever!","Below, the moment Madam Long Luo appeared, the three-eyed senior raised his head and stared at her.","“The one from the Black Dragon World?” the three-eyed youth said softly.","Before he attained immortality, he had once gone to the Black Dragon World and followed the footsteps of the First Wielder of the Will. He had walked through the corresponding Ancient Nether of the Black Dragon World and planted a pillar of his own in the Ancient Nether.","Thus, the three-eyed youth recognized Lady Long Luo’s aura.","Lady Long Luo’s clone also lowered her head to look at the Three-Eyed Hegemon and nodded slightly.","The two big shots looked at each other and smiled as a form of greeting.","Beside the three-eyed senior, the eyeball butler looked at Madam Long Luo, feeling as though he was facing an undying, and the pressure was overwhelming.","“Master, who is this lady?” the butler asked softly as he pulled out all the spears from his body.","“This lady’s background isn’t small. I didn’t expect little friend Tyrannical Song to have a connection with her. It seems that she has been secretly assisting little friend Tyrannical Song recently,” the three-eyed youth smiled faintly.","“Secretly assisting Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song? Eh, then isn’t my position very dangerous?” the eyeball butler muttered.","Senior Three-Eyed was confused.","Your position?","Tell me clearly, what position is there between you and Tyrannical Song?","“However, it’s not that easy to assist Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. After all, he’s so good at tormenting people,” the eyeball butler said.","“Indeed,” the three-eyed youth agreed. “I see that this lady from the Black Dragon World seems to have lost quite a bit of her hair recently... Compared to my impression of her hairline, it seems to be much more dangerous.”","The eyeball butler touched himself subconsciously. A moment later, he heaved a sigh of relief. “Thank goodness I don’t have hair.”","The three-eyed young senior was speechless.","He felt that his butler was on the brink of death.","Why don’t I just stuff him back into the furnace and rebuild him?","In the sky, Song Shuhang first opened a small spatial gate the size of his palm, which led directly to the main world, Mars. The reason he chose Mars was that he had just opened a spatial gate on Mars, and it would be more convenient for him to open it again with the coordinates.","Madam Long Luo extended her palm and gently reached into the Dimension Portal, reaching into the main world of Mars.","Her white fingers were like an antenna, constantly receiving information from the main world, the laws of heaven and earth, the basic structure of the world, and so on.","This information was received and stored, becoming the basic information for the next upgrade of the cultivation chat client.","A few minutes later.","“Information collection complete, data packing... Sending to the main body...” Madam Long Luo retracted her palm.","Song Shuhang quietly waited at the side.","A few minutes later.","“Data transfer complete. Moving on to the next step of the plan,” Lady Long Luo turned around and faced Song Shuhang. “Let’s begin. Let me become a pillar.”","“I’m sorry, Madam Long Luo,” Song Shuhang said. He stretched out his hand and used the secret technique of the Overlord God Pillar.","Under the watchful eyes of the three-eyed senior and the eyeball butler, Tyrannical Song activated his secret technique, and the light of the Tyrannical Divine Pillar spell enveloped Lady Long Luo.","A beautiful starlight appeared around Lady Long Luo, covering her entire body. The starlight grew thicker and thicker. Through the starlight, one could only vaguely see the shadow of Long Luo’s voluptuous figure.","This was completely different from the scene when he condensed the Emperor Destruction Pillar. When he condensed the Emperor Destruction Pillar, it was like a tornado. When Lady Long Luo transformed into a pillar, it was like the scene of a magical girl transforming in a girl anime.","The style was completely different.","“He actually turned into a pillar and accompanied Tyrannical Song?” The eyeball butler widened his eyes. “This is bad. I’m not a pure energy body.”","The three-eyed young senior was speechless.","His butler was already brazenly trying to become Tyrannical Song’s pillar?","Did you secretly eat little friend Tyrannical Song’s Blade Nurturing Technique?","On the other side of the void, the big-eyed planet boss had finally recovered from the state of hibernation. It was simply going crazy. The number of cultivators in the entire universe was huge.","So many cultivators had downloaded the ‘client’ at the same time. It had almost driven it crazy.","“Ba ” The big-eyed planet sent an angry message.","Opposite him, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and a pillar made of countless golden threads condensed into shape.","The densely packed golden threads seemed to be tangled in a mess, but upon closer inspection, they formed a complete meridian path, which matched the structural characteristics of the dragon channel.","‘A person’s trypophobia really depends on the nature of the object.’ Song Shuhang had this thought.","The densely packed bugs would make one’s scalp go numb, but the dense amount of gold coins would make people happy.","It was the same for the golden pillars in front of him. They were all made of dazzling golden threads. Although they were dense, they were also pleasing to the eye.","After the golden pillar formed by Lady Long Luo’s clone took shape, Song Shuhang didn’t even have to give her a good name or do anything. She took the initiative to rise from the ground and crash into the angry big-eyed planet!","“Song ” The big-eyed planet roared.","Boom","Lady Long Luo’s golden pillar had already smashed into the big-eyed planet’s big shot’s eyeball.","It hurt just looking at it."]},{"number":2804,"title":"Chapter 2804: New Release: The Nunchaku!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2804: New Release: The Nunchaku!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a real thorn in his side!","Besides describing physical pain, they were also used to describe an enemy who had to be eliminated.","Song Shuhang, this annoying rodent, had always been a thorn in the side of the big-eyed planet.","And today, Tyrannical Song had unlocked a new achievement—he had become a thorn in the side of the big-eyed planet, both physically and psychologically, bringing him double the hatred and pain.","The unnamed golden thread dragon net fat ball lady pillar ruthlessly pierced into the big-eyed planet pupil. She did not care if the boss of the eyeball planet could take it or how much pain it would cause. In any case, it was a fierce wave of attacks.","“Ah!” The big-eyed planet let out a painful cry, and his original plan to attack Tyrannical Song froze once again.","Its eyeballs had a very strong defense. Under normal circumstances, it could directly use its eyeballs to hit other planets and destroy them.","However, this time, it was the incarnation pillar of the Heavenly Dao of the Black Dragon World, Lady Dragon Lattice. The big-eyed planet’s eye defense was completely useless and was directly pierced through.","The pain made it stop.","“You won’t go blind, right?” As Song Shuhang said this, he couldn’t help but touch his waist—he shouldn’t hit people in the face, and he shouldn’t stab people in the kidneys.","Piercing the pupils of the big-eyed planet was the same as stabbing Song Shuhang’s own kidney. They were both the most iconic organs of the body.","Below, the eyeball butler subconsciously touched its own pupil and sucked in a breath of cold air. As expected, it felt that it was incompatible with this Lady Dragon Luo. In the future, it would be best to stay far away from this Lady Dragon Luo of the Black Dragon World.","Even Senior Three-Eyed couldn’t help but stretch out his hand to touch the divine third eye on his forehead. He felt as if his own eyeball was being stung.","In the void, the ‘dragon network fat sphere’ that had pierced into the big-eyed planet’s boss’s pupil used its own body to absorb energy from the huge pupil and secretly placed a part of the ‘dragon network’ inside the planet’s boss’s body, strengthening its connection with Song Shuhang and Lady Long Luo’s main body.","A few breaths later, the pillar formed by Lady Long Luo’s clone flew out of the big-eyed planet’s eye socket and returned to Song Shuhang’s side.","At the end of her pillar, there was an additional ‘pure energy’ of the big-eyed planet boss.","Her pillar and the ‘pure energy’ behind her drew a beautiful stream of color in the sky.","Below, the three-eyed young man held his chin and looked at the Dragon Lattice Pillar in the sky. He suddenly realized that there was an inexplicable tacit understanding between him and this ‘Lady Dragon Lattice.’","They had only met twice, yet he could instantly understand what Madam Long Luo wanted to do.","“Go ahead.” The three-eyed youth suddenly raised his finger.","The eyeball butler blinked and acted cute. “Me?”","“I’m not talking about you. Stay at the side and don’t go anywhere,” the three-eyed youth issued a domineering order.","At the same time, the big-eyed planet clone beside him received the order and soared into the sky, landing at the end of the Dragon Lattice Lady Pillar.","This small clone was the clone that the big-eyed planet’s boss had sent to lock onto Tyrannical Song’s coordinates and use it to transfer his main body. It was this clone’s holy light that had angered Senior Three-Eyed, and that was why he had decided to use it as a bet with Song Shuhang.","In the void, the planet’s energy at the end of Lady Long Luo’s clone column stuck to the big-eyed planet clone. After all, the two came from the same source. Once they got close, they naturally fused into one.","Soon after, the clone of the big-eyed planet hung from the clone pillar of Lady Long Luo, and it swung around like a flail, spinning in front of Song Shuhang.","She seemed to be using a flail attack.","Song Shuhang was slightly stunned, but under the effect of tacit understanding, he quickly understood what she meant.","“I understand, Miss Long Luo. Please wait a moment,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he reached out and formed a hand seal, activating the secret technique of the “Overlord God Pillar” once again. Lady Long Luo’s meaning was for him to turn the ‘big-eyed planet’s pure energy + clone’ into a pillar.","Moreover, this pillar must not be separated. It must be connected to the pillar that Lady Long Luo had transformed into, forming a shapeshifting nunchaku.","If it was in the past, Song Shuhang definitely wouldn’t be able to complete such a flashy operation by himself.","However, not long ago, he had tried to combine the energy of the star destruction virus and the energy together to form the ‘Pillar of Imperial Annihilation.’ Therefore, he had some experience and understanding of combining the two energies into a pillar. Furthermore, it was much easier to form the Dual Staff Pillar than the Emperor Destruction Pillar that was formed by twisting two powers into one.","“Pillar Transformation!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, and the effect of the secret technique of the Overlord Divine Pillar fell on the big-eyed planet’s clone. A layer of starlight spun and enveloped the clone.","The pillar transformation process of the big-eyed planet’s clone was somewhat similar to Lady Long Luo’s Magical Girl Transformation. However, the pillar transformation process was more like a weapon transformation or pet evolution.","In the thick starlight, a ball was elongated into a cylindrical shape, and layers of embossed appeared on it. In the end, it turned into a new Overlord God Pillar, and its body and mind became Tyrannical Song’s appearance.","In the middle of the Dragon Lattice Lady Pillar and the big-eyed planet pillar, the pure energy of the two extended and intertwined, forming a chain.","The two pillars combined and turned into a pair of nunchaku that could be combined.","If you split it apart, it would be cut off again, and if you merged it together, it would be a long stick.","“Since it’s the rod that Lady Long Luo and the big-eyed planet’s boss combined, then you’re the ‘Great Dao Pillar-Star Dragon Pillar!’” Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and decided to name the new Overlord God Pillar according to the usual naming standards. He chose one word each from ‘dragon channel’ and ‘planet.’","At this time, the Dragon Ball Pillar that Lady Long Luo had transformed into protested to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang faintly smiled and didn’t reject Lady Long Luo’s obsession. “Alright, its name is ‘Star Dragon Pillar’ and its nickname is ‘Dragon Ball Pillar.’ After all, this is a pair of nunchaku combination pillars, so it can have two star names.”","After successfully transforming into a pillar, Song Shuhang felt that the connection between him, Lady Long Luo, and the big-eyed planet had become even closer.","In the future, with such a ‘Star Dragon Pillar’ as an antenna, upgrading the ‘cultivation chat client’ would be much easier.","Furthermore, Miss Long Luo could also use this ‘Star Dragon Pillar’ to continuously extract data from the big-eyed planet’s user feedback and plan for the next system upgrade.","“Ah, Tyrannical Song, Long Luo!” The big-eyed planet gritted his teeth and roared in pain.","Song Shuhang scratched his head in distress. The main body of a planet was really not easy to deal with.","Why don’t I go up and send a few hundred million copies of Saber Nurturing Technique to cultivate a relationship?","Just as Song Shuhang was in deep thought, the big-eyed planet’s boss suddenly tore open space and made a spatial jump along a coordinate. The place it was heading to was the Black Dragon World!"]},{"number":2805,"title":"Chapter 2805: Updating Too Fast, We’re Running Out of Pages!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2805: Updating Too Fast, We’re Running Out of Pages!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To the big-eyed planet, Lady Long Luo was a thorn in his side, while Tyrannical Song was a thorn in his flesh.","Both were targets he wanted to obliterate and annihilate.","Now, when Tyrannical Song and Lady Long Luo appeared in front simultaneously, and these two formidable enemies could not be eliminated in one go, he had to choose one. In the end, he gritted his teeth and chose to obliterate the “thorn in his side,” Lady Long Luo, first!","One cannot have both fish and bear’s paw, so he could only choose to kill the more hateful one.","Originally, Tyrannical Song’s “hatefulness” in the eyes of the big-eyed planet far exceeded that of Lady Long Luo.","However, perhaps because Song Shuhang had used the Saber Nurturing Technique on it tens of thousands of times, Tyrannical Song’s favorable impression value increased by +1, +1, in the background program of the big-eyed planet.","With multiple accumulations, the planet’s “disgust” for Tyrannical Song had unknowingly weakened to a level much lower than that for Lady Long Luo.","This is the rise and fall of the other.","Moreover, its master’s half-bodied Three-Eyed Ruler had secretly warned him not to take Tyrannical Song’s life this time. Therefore, even if they could defeat Tyrannical Song, they couldn’t kill him.","It would be better to find an opportunity to blow up Tyrannical Song next time.","With many factors combined, the big-eyed planet made a choice.","At that moment, a massive amount of energy gushed out from his core. The laws of space wrapped around its massive body and locked onto the coordinates of the Black Dragon World. It was too large, and each teleportation required a large amount of energy and time.","“Lady Long Luo, the big-eyed planet is heading to your place!” Song Shuhang hurriedly reminded her.","“It’s fine. Let it come over,” Lady Long Luo replied. After thinking for a moment, she added, “Don’t stop it. Let it come!”","She feared that Song Shuhang might act impulsively and suddenly use the Laws of Borrowing and the Karma Saber Technique to stop the big-eyed planet.","Song Shuhang asked, “Are you sure it’s okay? It looks very angry. It’ll definitely cause a ruckus when it reaches the Black Dragon World.”","“Don’t worry, leave it to me.” Lady Long Luo added a rare smiling emoji, “I’ll take good care of it.”","The big-eyed planet was willing to come to the Black Dragon World. This was something she couldn’t have wished for more. The Black Dragon World was her territory. Once the big-eyed planet entered the Black Dragon World, it would be like a sheep entering a tiger’s den.","Moreover, in the Ancient Netherworld World that corresponded to the Black Dragon World, there was still a strand of White Two’s will. Even if there was a chance, she could draw out White Two’s will from the Ancient Nether World and deal with the big-eyed planet together.","Seeing how confident Lady Long Luo was, Song Shuhang nodded. “I’ll leave it to you then, Lady Long Luo. If you need any help, please contact me.”","Walla~~","As he spoke, the big-eyed planet’s “spatial teleportation” finally completed. The massive celestial body disappeared from the sky above the Throne of Wealth and entered the Black Dragon World directly.","At that point, the bet between Song Shuhang and the three-eyed youth at the Eighth Stage Realm was officially completed.","Song Shuhang let out a breath of air, stretched out his hand, and put away the “dragon ball.”","As he came into contact with more and more big shots recently, his Overlord God Pillar series became more and more abundant.","Now, the Longevity Pillar series included the Limitless Pillar, the Kun King Pillar, and the Emperor Destruction Pillar.","The new series of Dao Pillars included the Star Dragon Pillar and the Dragon Ball Pillar.","The series of heavenly tribulation pillars included the Archaic Pillar, a special pillar made from the tribulation of Tyrannical Song, the ruler of the Netherworld.","In addition, there was the Virtue Pillar, Pi Pi Pillar.","Right now, as long as he was good enough, Song Shuhang would be able to show off among the Immortals just by relying on these few ?Overlord God Pillars?.","Additionally, the strongest offensive pillar the day before yesterday, the second strongest pillar yesterday, “More than Pillar,” had finally fallen to the third strongest today. Because of the birth of the Great Dao Pillar, the Stardragon Pillar, the ranking of the pillar fell by one place, from Song Shuhang’s favorite to the third.","After putting away the “Great Dao Pillar: Stardragon Pillar,” Song Shuhang’s figure slowly descended from the sky.","He didn’t descend very quickly. He descended lightly like a willow catkin.","If one looked closely, one would notice that Song Shuhang’s pupils were dull and lifeless. He was distracted—this was Senior White’s special skill, which was to use the mysterious technique at any time.","Song Shuhang, who had Sage White’s Hand of Luck, seemed to have comprehended the secret of this technique.","At this time, Song Shuhang could clearly feel that his body was changing.","This was the transformation of the body brought about by Lady Long Luo’s upgraded “cultivation chat” talent.","Originally, the “cultivation” function was just one of Song Shuhang’s innate abilities. Now that Lady Long Luo had upgraded it step by step, this innate ability was no longer as simple as an innate ability but rather was closer to something as lofty as “Dao.”","In addition, the basic golden core QR code of the “cultivation chat talent” had been modified by Senior White Two into the “ruler of the Netherworld’s authority tattoo,” allowing the “cultivation chat” talent to have a deeper evolutionary foundation.","Today, with the improvement of the Cultivation Chat client and the establishment of the big-eyed planet’s boss, the Cultivation Chat function had completely evolved, gradually showing signs of approaching the Dao and even the path to immortality.","This evolution process was very long. If there was no external interference, it might take a hundred or a thousand years.","Right now, Song Shuhang was in a state of comprehension while being distracted. On the other hand, he was in a state of “epiphany.” After killing the primordial spirit of Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi, Song Shuhang had been in a state of “Song Clan’s epiphany.”","Enlightenment + body transformation, the two complemented each other.","Gradually, Song Shuhang, who was in a daze, suddenly discovered that the fragments of the “Heavenly Emperor’s Dao” contained in the process of the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit shattering were a great inspiration for his “cultivation chat” to transform into the great Dao of immortality!","The fragment of the “Path of the Heavenly Emperor,” which contained a lot of valuable experience, was exactly what Song Shuhang lacked. These rich fragments of the Heavenly Emperor’s Great Dao could save Song Shuhang dozens or even hundreds of years of “comprehending the Dao.”","Below.","The three-eyed youth looked at Song Shuhang, who was falling down, and seemed to be deep in thought.","A moment later, his finger lightly tapped on the armchair, and he secretly flicked his finger. In the air, a small spatial door the size of a palm was blocked by the three-eyed youth.","Within this small spatial gate, there was a remnant of the energy of Lady Long Luo’s clone. The three-eyed youth kept this energy—this was a gift that Madam Long Luo had specially left for him.","“I was wondering when Shuhang would bring a few more rulers of the Netherworld to join my game. I didn’t expect him to bring this person from the Black Dragon World over. What a pleasant surprise,” Senior Three-Eyed said softly.","“So, Old Master, you have to remember Tyrannical Song’s kindness,” the eyeball butler reminded him.","On the other side of the spatial gateway, on Mars, a?Seventh Stage Venerable shivered and said regretfully, “It’s closed. I can’t see it anymore.”","This Venerable was a major shareholder of Earth’s Daily Cultivator Group and an ace reporter. He had previously received news that an Immortal big shot was going to Mars to discuss the Dao with Tyrannical Song.","Therefore, he used the teleportation array to immediately teleport to Mars, locked onto the information on Tyrannical Song and the Immortals, and rushed to the destination according to the information clues, hoping to get first-hand news of Tyrannical Song and the Immortals discussing the Dao.","But when he arrived at the coordinates, he found that the Immortals had already left, and Tyrannical Song was nowhere to be seen. All that was left was a small spatial door in the void.","The curious ace reporter, Venerable, went up and looked inside through the small spatial door.","In the end, he saw Tyrannical Song!","However, because the window was very small, the vision was limited. In addition, he didn’t dare to send his spiritual sense into the spatial gate. Therefore, in his field of vision, he could only see Tyrannical Song and a mysterious woman with a fiery figure standing opposite each other in the air.","The mysterious woman exuded a terrifying?pressure. She was definitely another top-notch big shot. The pressure she gave off was hundreds or even thousands of times stronger than Tyrannical Song’s!","The ace reporter hurriedly started to record the scene in front of him with a Stored Spell.","After killing the Heavenly Emperor, Tyrannical Song seemed to have a new target to challenge?","Where did this mysterious woman come from?","Just as he was looking forward to a shocking battle between Tyrannical Song and this mysterious woman, Tyrannical Song suddenly stretched out his hand and enveloped this mysterious woman with starlight.","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, the powerful and mysterious woman was cruelly refined into a pillar by Tyrannical Song!","Hiss ~ As expected of Big Boss Tyrannical Song, he ruthlessly destroyed a flower without any mercy.","For an existence at Tyrannical Song’s level, the only difference between enemies was whether they were dead or alive, and there was no difference in gender.","In the picture, after Tyrannical Song refined the mysterious woman into a pillar, he used the pillar again, as if to deal with another hidden enemy.","However, because the Dimension Portal was too small, the ace reporter could not see much of the scene.","Then, Tyrannical Song also disappeared from the screen.","After waiting for a long time, when the ace reporter couldn’t hold it in anymore and tried to send his divine sense into the spatial gateway, the spatial gateway suddenly closed.","“What a pity. I shouldn’t have been so impulsive.” The ace reporter slapped his thigh hard. He thought that after sending his divine sense into the spatial gateway, it had triggered a reaction and automatically closed.","“If I hadn’t been so impulsive, as long as I had patience, I might have been able to get more explosive news. Now, there was only this piece of news in his hands...I wonder if it will attract the attention of the readers of the cultivation world.”","Although it was a pity, this first-hand exclusive news material could not be wasted.","Hence, not long after...","After Big Boss Tyrannical Song killed the Heavenly Emperor, dealt with the Three-Eyed Ruler, and plundered the ruler’s Dao artifact, the news of him ruthlessly destroying a mysterious female big shot with an aura stronger than Tyrannical Song and refining her into a pillar spread through the headlines of the Cultivation Daily.","The people of the cultivation world discovered that Big Boss Tyrannical Song had been creating big news everywhere these past few days. Moreover, these past few days, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had been cruel and merciless. It was fine if he didn’t make a move, but once he did, he brought death!","The legend of Tyrannical Song’s invincibility had been added to a new chapter after it was reported by Cultivation Daily!","If the legend of Tyrannical Song’s invincibility continued to be updated at such a fast rate, it was very likely that there would not be enough pages."]},{"number":2806,"title":"Chapter 2806: A Brilliant Idea for Distributing Wealth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2806: A Brilliant Idea for Distributing Wealth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Within the Wealth Throne Space, Song Shuhang, in a state of enlightenment, was like a willow leaf, slowly drifting down. After floating for what seemed like an eternity, he finally neared the ground.","“Old Master, should we catch Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song?” the eyeball butler asked worriedly.","“He’s not a three-year-old child. He won’t die from this height. Don’t worry about him,” Senior Three-Eyed waved his hand dismissively.","The eyeball butler’s tentacle stiffened, and he hesitated.","“If you have something to say, say it,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“It’s too late, Master,” the eyeball butler sighed. As he spoke, he quietly took out his steel umbrella.","Boom!","On the other side, after Song Shuhang landed lightly, he suddenly fell flat on the ground—being in a state of enlightenment, Song Shuhang couldn’t stand at all.","At this moment, Song Shuhang’s physical strength had already surpassed that of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. More importantly, he was still wearing the head of his original body, equipped with the hardest skin part of his main body.","The invulnerable Tyrannical Song’s face smashed into the ground, directly creating a crater in the Throne World of Wealth.","It was as if a giant meteorite had crashed into the ground. Amidst the rumbling sounds of the explosion, a violent shockwave engulfed Senior Three-Eyed and the eyeball butler.","The eyeball butler skillfully opened the steel umbrella, protecting himself like a shield.","What was rare and valuable was that this time, he even thought of his master and tried his best to use the extra umbrella cover to protect the three-eyed young senior!","Unfortunately, the size of the umbrella was limited, and it could only cover half of Senior Three-Eyed’s figure.","The violent shockwave blew up half of the three-eyed youth’s hair, but the other half remained unscathed under the protection of the steel umbrella.","The three-eyed young senior was speechless.","He turned around and stared at the butler.","At this moment, half of his hair was handsome, while the other half was smooth and flat. He looked very much like a punk.","“I reminded Old Master to catch Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, but Old Master refused,” the eyeball butler maintained the smile that a butler should have. He put away the steel umbrella and took out a comb from his pocket to comb his master’s hair.","“Don’t worry, Master,” he comforted as he combed his hair. “I will be responsible for filling up the hole in the ground.”","Senior Three-Eyed urged, “Remember to include Tyrannical Song as well.”","“I won’t do such a stupid thing,” the eyeball butler said. “After burying Tyrannical Song, he’ll end his enlightenment state and wake up. He’ll have to blast open the hole and climb out again. At that time, I’ll have to fill in the hole again. How tiring.”","“Then fill yourself in,” Senior Three-Eyed said in a deep voice.","“Yes, Master,” the butler said happily. “Then I’ll fill myself in later... I haven’t had a good rest in thousands of years. It’s time for my eyeballs to take a break.”","The three-eyed young senior raised his head to look at the sky, unable to speak.","In the sky, a huge snowfall fell, covering Tyrannical Song in the hole.","This time, Song Shuhang’s comprehension of the Dao and enlightenment took a long time, lasting more than half an hour.","As he was comprehending, Song Shuhang’s heart suddenly moved, and he got up from the hole.","“This feeling... Is it because all of my Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure has been upgraded?” Song Shuhang said softly.","It was time to go back and meet the Great Eastern Emperor.","“Eh? Why is it snowing?” After getting up, Song Shuhang wiped off the snow on his body and asked in puzzlement.","Could it be that the failure of this bet has caused the three-eyed young senior to be in such a low mood?","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you’ve finished comprehending the Dao,” the eyeball butler’s voice rang in his ears.","Song Shuhang raised his head and saw the butler holding a shovel in his hand, filling the hole with soil.","“It’s not over yet, but I sensed something. I temporarily switched ‘enlightenment’ and ‘enlightenment’ to the background and let them operate in the background,” Song Shuhang replied.","The eyeball butler gave him a thumbs up.","“Where is Senior Three-Eyed?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Old Master is a little depressed. He went back to be alone. He told me that Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you can leave alone after you wake up. There’s no need to say goodbye to him,” the eyeball butler replied.","“Alright, I’ll go back first. After I advance to the Ninth Stage, I’ll come and look for Senior again,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","The eyeball butler waved his hand warmly and said, “Goodbye, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.”","After saying that, he jumped into the hole.","The shovel started to work on its own, continuously filling the hole with soil. Soon, the butler was buried in the soil.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He absolutely couldn’t let the virtuous lamia see this scene, lest she learn from it and become bad.","“Right, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, Old Master also reminded you not to forget to distribute your wealth. This time, you won a Doctrine Artifact and a sword-shaped saber intent from the old master. The value is relatively high,” the butler’s voice came from underground again.","Song Shuhang sucked in a breath of cold air.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, it’s up to you. I can’t estimate the value of a dao artifact,” the eyeball butler replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“I’m bankrupt. I don’t even know if it’s enough to distribute my wealth?”","The value of a dao artifact could not be calculated using spirit stones, so it was probably impossible to pass the test of ‘physically distributing money.’ He had to find another shortcut and use other methods to distribute his wealth.","“I got it!” After pondering for a while, Song Shuhang came up with a good idea. “I’ll ask Madam Long Luo to add the VIP trial function to the ‘cultivation chat client.’ When I distribute the money, I can directly distribute a six-month VIP gift package to all the fellow daoists in the universe who have downloaded the client!”","It was definitely heavy enough to distribute wealth to most cultivators in the myriad worlds in one go.","Moreover, after experiencing the VIP function, there would definitely be fellow daoists who would fall in love with this VIP function. After six months, they would renew it again... That was simply a source of income.","Song Shuhang silently praised his creativity.","The three-eyed young senior who was sitting quietly by himself was speechless.","Even the butler with the eyeball buried at the bottom of the pit was shocked by Tyrannical Song’s explosive imagination and creativity. He couldn’t say a word of praise for a long time!","However, he had to admit that it was definitely a good idea to distribute wealth to most cultivators in the universe.","“I think so,” the eyeball butler nodded.","“Goodbye, butler. We’ll meet at Rank-9,” Song Shuhang waved his hand and headed to the exit of the Throne of Wealth.","After opening the small wooden door, Song Shuhang first removed the head of his main body and stored it in his Inner World.","After making all the necessary preparations, he left the Throne of Wealth and entered the Celestial Emperor’s world.","Next... It was time to merge the Celestial Emperor World and the ‘Small Giant World’ together and sit on the throne of the ‘Sector Lord.’ He would not allow the ‘Sector Lord’ status of the ‘Small Giant World’ to be stripped away."]},{"number":2807,"title":"Chapter 2807: Shuhang Is Homeless Tonight","paragraphs":["Chapter 2807: Shuhang Is Homeless Tonight","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He put away his main body’s skull and checked that the mask on his face was secure. He also confirmed that he was wearing the ring given to him by Senior White Two to suppress his “Sage Name.”","“Everything’s fine. This way, no one can recognize me,” Song Shuhang nodded, stepping out of the world of the Throne of Wealth and returning to the collapsed world of the Heavenly Emperor.","In the Celestial Emperor’s world, the Great Eastern Emperor smiled. He lifted the last magical treasure, the Tyrant Wild Boar’s Ram, and placed it into the quenching pool.","It was done!","He desperately increased his speed, and finally, before Tyrannical Song’s primordial spirit returned, he upgraded the second set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure to the level of a weak Immortal divine weapon. Each magical treasure gave birth to an elementary weapon spirit.","“As long as my forging speed is fast enough, Tyrannical Song won’t be able to catch up with me,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","Next, it was time to bid farewell to his old friends and leave this place.","The Great Emperor turned around and looked at the members from the ancient Heavenly City: Immortal Fairy White Bones, Fairy @#%×, Zither Master Fengyi, and the white-robed Golden Trigram, who had now succeeded as the new Heavenly Emperor.","After the fall of the ancient Heavenly City, he still had the opportunity to meet so many old friends, which was a joyous occasion. He had wanted to spend more time with them, but considering that Tyrannical Song could return at any time, the Great Emperor wasn’t prepared to stay long.","“I’ve finished upgrading my magic tools. So, everyone, let’s exchange contact information and get together in a few days,” the Great Eastern Emperor suggested.","“Contact information? Let’s add each other as friends in the Cultivation Chat,” Immortal Fairy White Bones suggested.","This group of members, who had added Song Shuhang as a friend before, had also downloaded a client after the Cultivation Chat came out.","However, their control interface was different from other cultivators in the universe. Not only did they have the login function, but they also retained the original cultivation interface that was directly connected to Song Shuhang.","In other words, they could use the client to log into the Cultivation Chat. They could also use the original interface to bypass the client and directly connect to Song Shuhang’s main server.","This was the privilege of a veteran user.","“What is that?” the Great Eastern Emperor asked, puzzled. He suddenly felt a generation gap between himself and Immortal Fairy White Bones.","“Didn’t you see Tyrannical Song’s lecture?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","The white-robed Golden Trigram thought of “Senior Song,” feeling very complicated. He replied, “I just came out of isolation on the island, so I haven’t had time to watch Tyrannical Song’s lecture.”","“Me too,” the Great Eastern Emperor said.","“Tyrannical Song...” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws softly chanted the name.","Then, the pupil on its claw gently glanced at the headless body burning in front of the Heavenly Furnace. Although this body had no head, it was still recognizable at a glance. This headless body belonged to the masked fellow daoist who had brought her out of the Heavenly Dao Prison.","The other party had an item that could suppress the Sage Name, but Zither Master Fengyi had already guessed his true identity.","Tyrannical Song.","Therefore, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were in a dilemma. The other party was the main culprit who destroyed her plan to use the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection array to revive the Heavenly Emperor, and he was also the one who brought her out of the Heavenly Dao Prison.","Moreover, Fairy @#%× and Immortal Fairy White Bones had a close relationship with Tyrannical Song. Senior Great Eastern Emperor even upgraded Tyrannical Song’s life-bound magical treasure.","The complicated relationship was like a knotted earphone cable, dragging Zither Master Fengyi’s claws into a swamp of troubles.","“How do we add him as a friend in the Cultivation Chat? Do you want to watch Tyrannical Song’s lecture?” the white-robed Golden Trigram asked.","According to Immortal Fairy White Bones’s description, the Cultivation Chat function was very convenient. Moreover, it seemed to work even in some secret realms, so there was no need to worry about being blocked.","“Why don’t we just ask Tyrannical Song to add you all?” Immortal Fairy White Bones suggested.","As she spoke, the Space Vortex of the Throne of Wealth opened. Song Shuhang, wearing a mask, stepped out of the vortex. He gently pushed the metal mask up, revealing the lower half of his face.","“I’m back, Senior Dongfang,” Song Shuhang smiled and waved his hand.","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless. Heavens, he was just one step away! Just one step!","“Welcome back, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Zither Master Fengyi said in a low voice as her claws lightly landed on Song Shuhang’s shoulder.","Song Shuhang’s shoulder stiffened. The air became quiet with awkwardness. He had removed the head of his main body and hidden his main body’s Sage Name, but she still recognized him.","Could it be that they were so familiar with each other that they could recognize each other just by looking at their bodies?","“Well, haha,” Song Shuhang glanced at Zither Master Fengyi’s claws.","“Let me continue to be quiet,” Zither Master Fengyi said.","“Alright,” Song Shuhang replied straightforwardly. It was a good thing for him that Fairy Phoenix Claw was willing to look for Jing Jing at this time.","Not far away, Immortal Fairy White Bones waved her hand and said, “Shuhang, add Senior Dongfang, Golden Trigram, and Fairy Fengyi as friends.”","“No problem. Please wait a moment. I’ll return to my physical body first,” Song Shuhang nodded. His body was still burning with all its might.","“I have a Golden Core QR code tattoo on my back. In a while, you can scan my QR code, and I’ll directly add you to my friend list. I’ll also download the client,” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit explained as it came to the side of his body and bent down to return to it.","Under everyone’s gaze, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit gradually entered his body.","“Eh? Why is it a little crowded?” Halfway through the process, Song Shuhang suddenly asked in puzzlement. This didn’t feel right. It was like a single berth on a long-distance bus. There was already one person lying on it, and there was no way for a second person to squeeze in.","“Fairy Virtue? Fairy Creation?”","Fairy @#%× was still floating above his head, and Fairy Creation couldn’t possibly occupy his body. Her existence was very special.","“Don’t squeeze. If you squeeze any more, you’ll explode,” Song Shuhang’s voice came from his body.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Isn’t that my voice?","Just as he was thinking, a projection of Tyrannical Song’s primordial spirit came out of his body. The two projections of Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit looked at each other.","Song Shuhang was speechless. Projection Essence Soul B was speechless.","“I think I need some time alone,” Song Shuhang said.","Why is there another Essence Soul projection in my body?","“Because you entered the Wielder’s small black room,” the projection of Primordial Spirit B replied. “Both the physical body and the primordial spirit in the void of the Tribulation Transcender have forgotten about you.” Then, he cast a new primordial spirit projection into his physical body. That’s right, it’s me.”","“Then what about me?” Song Shuhang said.","With a new primordial spirit projection in his body, what was he? Didn’t he become redundant?","Xiao Hang was homeless tonight...","“I also want to know this question,” Fairy Phoenix Claw, who was sitting quietly on his shoulder, asked. She was also troubled by this question."]},{"number":2808,"title":"Chapter 2808: From Today On, You Are the Tyrant Corpse!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2808: From Today On, You Are the Tyrant Corpse!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","On the side, the Great Eastern Emperor, the White Bone Immortal Fairy, and the White-robed Golden Trigram all came over curiously.","“It’s actually two primordial spirit projections. Interesting,” the Great Eastern Emperor said happily. It seemed that there were benefits to leaving late—at least he could watch this good show.","On the side, Immortal Fairy White Bones thought for a moment and made a very feasible suggestion. “Since they’re just primordial spirit projections, why not just cut one off? After all, no matter how many are cut off, as long as the primordial spirit of the Tribulation Transcender is still in the void, it can be continuously projected again.”","“So, I’m going to kill myself?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I want to kill myself,” the virtuous lamia took the opportunity to record this classic line. Every new line was a small step ahead of Fairy Creation.","With the addition of one small step, she was a huge step ahead of Fairy Creation!","“Who lives? Who dies?” The Great Eastern Emperor gradually entered spectator mode.","“This answer is not very friendly to me,” Zither Master Feng Yi’s claw said. She did not want to fight to the death with the new claw of her resurrected body.","“Can’t I fuse them?” the White-robed Golden Trigram asked.","“I’ve tried, but I can’t fuse them. However, because they are just projections, they can be canceled at any time through the primordial spirit of the Tribulation Transcender,” Song Shuhang said, pinching his chin.","After the two Essence Soul projections connected to the ‘Essence Soul main body’ of the Tribulation Transcender’s void simultaneously, the data difference caused by the forced interruption of the network in the Heavenly Dao Prison began to synchronize.","The Essence Soul projection that was originally unable to synchronize began to move in sync with the Essence Soul’s main body.","Immortal Fairy White Bones asked, “Then, can’t we just cancel one Essence Soul projection?”","“But if that’s the case, don’t you feel it’s a pity? It wasn’t easy to create two Essence Soul projections,” Song Shuhang and Projection B looked at Immortal Fairy White Bones simultaneously and said in unison.","After the data was synchronized, as long as the ‘multitasking’ function was not used, the two Essence Soul projections would be like two different screens displaying the same content.","“Don’t use two individuals to stare at me and say the same thing at the same time. It’s very scary, okay?” Immortal Fairy White Bones said. As a White Bone, she was very sensitive to other people’s gazes. After all, white bones are translucent.","“So,” the White-robed Golden Trigram asked, “Tyrannical Song, what do you want to do with these two different primordial spirit projections?”","“I haven’t thought about it yet, but I feel they will be very useful,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","“Song Shuhang, I’m scared of poverty,” the virtuous lamia replied while reciting the lines she had cut out.","As Song Shuhang’s light of virtue, she understood him very well. In addition, she was a bystander, so she immediately saw through the truth. Song Shuhang was probably afraid of being poor, so he couldn’t bear to waste anything that had some value. Even if it was just a primordial spirit projection, he wanted to extract all its value before canceling it.","“In short, I’ll keep the extra Essence Soul projection for now. If it really doesn’t work, I’ll leave it in the Inner World. In a while, I’ll ask Senior White or Senior White Two for their opinion,” Song Shuhang decided.","Just as he finished speaking...","A spatial rift suddenly appeared behind Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection B.","Then, a huge sword tip emerged from the spatial rift.","The tip of the sword was extremely huge. Rather than calling it the tip of the sword, it was more like the bow of the giant ship.","Primordial Spirit Projection B was caught off guard and was hit by the huge sword tip. He did not even have the time to scream before he was sent flying.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Ah~ My valuable Primordial Spirit Projection B~","Don’t die, you can’t die!","“Bang!” With the sound of glass shattering, a 500-meter-long greatsword emerged from the void.","Senior White Two’s golden thigh and the hamster were standing on the giant sword.","It was the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, Holy Sword of the End.’","“We’re back, Tyrannical Song. Did you successfully upgrade your second set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure?” the hamster shouted.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Speaking of which, I vaguely heard you calling out to my master just now?” the hamster said.","Song Shuhang turned his head around and looked at the primordial spirit projection B that was sent flying. Could it be that the unintentional address of ‘Senior White Two’ that I had just given him earlier had caused his primordial spirit projection B to bear the consequences for me?","The hamster followed Song Shuhang’s gaze and saw the primordial spirit projection that had been sent flying.","“Aiya, that’s great...Hmm, I don’t know, my lord. No. Tyrannical Song was sent flying by us,” the hamster shouted.","Senior White Two’s slender golden leg lightly flicked, and the entrance to the world of the black lotus opened. Soon after, a small ball of silver-white metal flew out of the world of the black lotus and stuck to Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection B, which had been sent flying.","As soon as the silver-white metallic substance came into contact with Primordial Spirit Projection B, it immediately fused into the projection.","Song Shuhang was confused.","He felt a chill in his chest. What was that thing that Senior White Two had merged into his primordial spirit projection B?","After Senior White Two’s golden thigh landed on the Holy Sword of the End, he lightly stepped on it.","A spell formation pattern spread out under his feet.","At the same time, ten black ring-shaped Netherworld Tactics appeared beside Essence Soul Projection B. These ten rings overlapped and extended with Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection as the core.","A moment later, the ten rings began to rotate.","A black hole-like tactic was formed.","This black hole contained an aura that could destroy and devour everything.","Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat, and he said, “Is this the black hole devouring the Heavenly Dao Remnant Ball?”","He had personally come into contact with the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and experienced this terrifying devouring black hole.","The magical technique that Senior White Two used was similar to the black hole of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, which had the property of devouring all matter in the universe.","Could it be that the mass of metal that Senior White Two threw out was the body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball?","Hualala~","In front of him, after the Black Hole Devouring Spell was activated, a large amount of violent energy was absorbed from the collapsed Celestial Emperor’s world and sucked into the black hole.","This ‘violent energy’ was the ‘virus energy’ that had spread throughout the Celestial Emperor’s world, as well as the remnants of the laws after the explosion.","Now, everything was swallowed by the Heavenly Dao Relic Black Hole.","In just over ten minutes, the virus energy, the laws of destruction, and the violent spiritual energy in the Celestial Emperor’s world were all devoured by the black hole.","A pure and unpolluted ‘Celestial Emperor World’ was born.","Senior White Two’s golden thigh released a satisfied electric wave.","Soon after, the black hole in front of Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection B disappeared. The tenth-circle tactic was retrieved and hidden in his body.","“From today onwards, you are the Heavenly Dao Relic, Tyrannical Song. It’s called the Tyrant Corpse for short!” the hamster announced loudly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He, Song Shuhang, was 18 years old this year. After tasting death countless times, he finally had a complete corpse?"]},{"number":2809,"title":"Chapter 2809: The Man Closest to the Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 2809: The Man Closest to the Heavenly Dao","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Opposite him, Essence Soul Projection B, who had transformed into Overlord Corpse, slowly stood up and touched his chest.","Although he was still a projection, his body now had more vein-like structures. Silver-white metallic liquid, resembling blood, flowed through these veins.","The silver-white liquid metal contained the aura of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball, but it was not the body of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","This was Senior White Two’s work. It was a medicinal liquid he created after studying the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","At the end of the veins in the Tyrant’s corpse, a heart-like core had formed. The virus power, the laws of destruction, and the violent spiritual energy of the entire Celestial Emperor’s world were all swallowed and absorbed by the black hole. They were roughly compressed into a ball and stored in this heart core.","“In other words, I am now equivalent to the Heavenly Dao Molt?” the Overlord Corpse asked, raising his head.","“That’s right, Heavenly Dao Relic Song,” the hamster nodded. Seeing this Heavenly Dao Relic Song was like seeing Tyrannical Song’s corpse, making it very happy.","“Heavens,” Tyrant Corpse said, looking up.","“Heavens,” Song Shuhang echoed, also looking up.","He, Song Shuhang, with the Sage Name Tyrannical Song, was still several large realms away from attaining immortality.","However, although he had yet to attain immortality, he had already tasted the feeling of being the ruler of the Netherworld and had obtained the exclusive benefit of the Heavenly Dao, the Heavenly Dao Molt, in advance.","In fact, he even had an imitation of the “eternal” attribute of the Wielder of the Will, the “pseudo-eternal mode.”","From today onwards, he could be called “the man closest to the Heavenly Dao—Tyrannical Song!”","He now deserved this title.","In the current myriad worlds, no one was closer to the Heavenly Dao than him.","Those stronger than him didn’t understand undying as well.","Those who knew more about “immortality” than him didn’t know as much about the ruler of the Netherworld and the Heavenly Dao Shedding.","The white-robed Golden Trigram silently stared at Tyrannical Song. He had actually become a Heavenly Dao Molt.","Up until now, he still refused to admit that this Tyrannical Song in front of him was the same cute new Song Shuhang who had been struggling on his island more than half a year ago.","Time was the most magical spell. It could quietly change a person. However, the effect of this time spell on Song Shuhang was a little too outstanding.","The white-robed Golden Trigram felt that if he admitted that “Tyrannical Song” was “Song Shuhang,” he would lose.","So he subconsciously began to resist this fact.","Opposite him, Senior White Two’s slender golden thigh gently kicked, and the “Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure” that had merged with his aura split apart, turning into 33 magical treasures and returning to Song Shuhang’s body.","Then, Senior White Two kicked the air again, and the entrance to the world of the black lotus expanded.","“Tyrant Corpse, my Lord wants you to follow me for a while. He needs to do some adjustments to you,” the hamster called out to Song Shuhang.","“Adjustments?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes, my Lord said that the Heavenly Dao Molt Potion was just a test product. It’s very likely that there will be some side effects. In short, your Overlord Corpse Essence Soul followed you here. Before the after-effects erupt, my Lord will help you adjust... and test the effects of the experiment,” the hamster reminded.","“Alright, I’ll be right there,” the Overlord Corpse replied.","He was worried about where he should go.","Now that Senior White Two had taken the initiative to invite him to the world of the black lotus as a guest, he was naturally more than happy to do so.","This way, Xiao Hang could go home again tonight.","After the Tyrant Corpse followed Senior White to the world of the black lotus as a guest, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection returned to his body in a cool posture.","He also retrieved his head from the Inner World and reattached it. After all, Zither Master Feng Yi had already guessed his identity with her claws, so there was no point in hiding his head.","“Then, everyone, I have to make a move first.” The Great Eastern Emperor quickly put away his “Heavenly Furnace” and carefully touched it. After making sure that there was nothing wrong with the furnace, he secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","“Senior Dongfang, please wait!” Song Shuhang called out.","After saying this much, he took off his clothes, revealing the “Golden Core QR Code” pattern that Senior White Two had personally tattooed on his back.","“Seniors, use your spiritual power to scan this QR code. I’ll add you as friends,” Song Shuhang said.","If the users of the “cultivation chat” in the universe were Song Shuhang’s resources, they would be the spirit stones of the future.","Then, the great seniors that he had personally added would be his powerful external aid.","These Immortal big shots might be able to lend Song Shuhang a helping hand at a critical moment. As long as there were enough big shots in his friend list, there was no difficulty in the world that he, Tyrannical Song, couldn’t overcome.","This was the experience Song Shuhang had accumulated from the First Stage Realm to the Eighth Stage Realm.","The Great Eastern Emperor subconsciously wanted to refuse, but when he saw that the white-robed Golden Trigram and Zither Master Feng Yi had both swiped the Golden Core’s QR code, he sighed and braced himself to swipe it with his spiritual power.","Little did he know that after he swiped, his body was marked with the “Tyrannical Song’s powerful cheat” mark.","[Ding ~ You have added Tyrannical Song as a friend and have been added to the “VIP Big Boss Group” list, nickname: The World’s Greatest Hammer. I wish you a happy life.]","Tyrannical Song’s VIP big shot group list was the same as the “blacklist” list. Only Immortal big shots were allowed to enter.","Then, [Phoenix Claw Fairy], Zither Master Fengyi, and [Lonely Heavenly Emperor], the white-robed Golden Trigram, joined the list one after another.","“Senior, in fact, I have quite a few members of the Ancient Heavenly City in my friend list. I’ll create a group for you guys in a while. How about we call it the Ancient Heavenly City Group?” Song Shuhang suggested.","“Let’s call it the Heavenly Court of the Past, to remember our lost past,” Immortal Fairy White Bones’ poetic mood surged, and her eyes were filled with sadness.","“Fairy Phoenix Claw?” Zither Mistress Feng Yi suddenly grabbed Song Shuhang’s shoulder with all her might, and the tips of her claws sank deep into Song Shuhang’s shoulder muscles.","“Fairy, you’re mistaken. It’s Fairy Feng Yi. Where did Fairy Phoenix Claw come from?” Song Shuhang hurriedly called out. At the same time, he secretly changed the word “phoenix claw” to “Feng Yi.”","With the change in his authority, after changing his name, there would no longer be a situation like [Crispy (crossed out) head]. Now that he changed his name, there would be a new change.","The “claw” character would be flipped over and become the “instrument” character!","However, there were still some flaws... For example, the words that had been flipped over would occasionally flip back due to vibration.","Zither Master Feng Yi looked at her title again and found that it was indeed [Fairy Feng Yi]. She responded with satisfaction.","However, not long after she shifted her attention, the word “instrument” in her title playfully spun over and turned into the word “claw.”","However, Zither Master Fengyi didn’t notice it.","After confirming that there was no problem with her title, Fairy Phoenix Claw stared at the white-robed Golden Trigram again.","The title of Heavenly Emperor was a very sensitive title for the members of the ancient Heavenly City.","“It’s quite vivid,” the white-robed Golden Trigram laughed self-mockingly. Although he had inherited the Dao of the Heavenly Emperor, he was all alone and had no subordinates. Wasn’t he the Lonely Heavenly Emperor?","“Golden Trigram inherited the Way of the Heavenly Emperor,” the Great Eastern Emperor said slowly. As the Great Emperor of the Four Directions, he could see this at a glance.","“Inherited the path of the Heavenly Emperor? What about the Celestial Thearch?” Fairy Feng Yi said emotionally.","“Good question!” The Great Eastern Emperor pointed at Song Shuhang. “The Heavenly Emperor was hacked to death by him!”","Fairy Phoenix Claw was startled.","Song Shuhang was speechless."]},{"number":2810,"title":"Chapter 2810: Song Goudan, You Fool","paragraphs":["Chapter 2810: Song Goudan, You Fool","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The white-robed Golden Trigram immediately stood up, ready to explain the misunderstanding—after all, he knew the truth about the “Heavenly Emperor seeking death.” The Heavenly Emperor intended to use Tyrannical Song’s hands to escape and complete one of her plans.","However, before he could explain, the Great Eastern Emperor had already thrown out another surprise.","“I have video evidence. Watch this,” the Great Eastern Emperor said. As he spoke, he stretched out his hand and cast a spell.","Under the stirring of the Emperor’s spiritual energy, a 3D projection appeared in the Heavenly Emperor’s world, then began to rewind as if time itself were reversing.","This was a simple technique using spatial abilities, reading the imprint of space to recreate what had happened recently.","The scene quickly rewound to the confrontation between Song Shuhang and the Heavenly Emperor’s primordial spirit.","“Here it is,” the Great Eastern Emperor said, pointing.","In the picture, the Heavenly Emperor was protected by a crystal wall and appeared extremely weak.","Opposite him, Tyrannical Song’s fingers condensed more than ten runes of the “Great Dao to the Simple.” These runes looked very simple, as if they could be learned at a glance. However, each rune contained extremely complex rules; merely learning the outer shell was meaningless.","Tyrannical Song waved his hand, and the ten-plus runes shot out, transforming into a terrifying spell that could kill the primordial spirit and reverse-cut the source.","Bang!","On the other side, the Heavenly Emperor’s crystal wall couldn’t withstand Tyrannical Song’s attack and collapsed.","Even the graceful figure of the Heavenly Emperor inside the crystal wall was torn apart and completely dissipated. He couldn’t be more dead.","Behind the Heavenly Emperor, the Kingese symbolizing her invincibility emitted a sorrowful aura and transformed into a Kingese Elegy, sending the Heavenly Emperor to her grave.","In the end, the Emperor Culture turned into a sandstorm and disappeared.","The Heavenly Emperor, who represented an era of invincibility, had come to an end.","The Great Eastern Emperor flicked his finger, and the scene froze.","“The murderer is you, Tyrannical Song!” the Great Eastern Emperor declared.","Immortal Fairy White Bones exclaimed, “Heavens...”","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws tightened: “!!!”","Her claws were firmly locked onto Song Shuhang’s shoulder muscles—but they didn’t break the skin. At this moment, the muscles on Song Shuhang’s shoulders had turned into a rubber-like elastic state.","“What else do you have to say, Tyrannical Song? If you have nothing to say, then accept the wrath of the members of the ancient Heavenly City!” the Great Eastern Emperor tried to sound as excited as possible.","“I need a lawyer,” Song Shuhang said calmly. “I won’t say anything until my lawyer arrives!”","Fairy @#%× said, “I’m Tyrannical Song, eighteen years old. Please guide me. If I have offended you in any way, why don’t you come and beat me up?”","The Great Eastern Emperor was speechless.","What the hell? How am I supposed to get excited when you guys talk like this?","“You really killed the Heavenly Emperor?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were very uneasy, but she tried to control herself. Immortal Fairy White Bones, the Great Eastern Emperor, and even Golden Trigram, who had inherited the Dao of the Heavenly Emperor, were all very calm when they heard this news. Therefore, there must be some unknown factors involved.","“This matter is quite complicated,” Song Shuhang said.","“Speak, I’m listening,” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws said.","“In fact, the Heavenly Emperor is not dead yet. Allow me to explain from the beginning,” Song Shuhang said as he sat cross-legged.","As he spoke, he bent down and picked up a black-skinned figure from his shadow.","This was the black-skinned Soft Feather. She had fainted from the pain of losing her ghost spirit. Right now, Song Shuhang’s main body was responsible for giving her the Saber Nurturing Technique from time to time to relieve her pain.","It would take some time to explain the “Heavenly Emperor Begging for Death,” so Song Shuhang took Black Panzi out and prepared to give her the Saber Nurturing Technique to rest.","However, when Black Panzi was carried out, Zither Master Fengyi’s claws froze again, and she cried out involuntarily, “Heavenly Emperor! You hid the Heavenly Emperor in your shadow?”","“Don’t be so shocked. This isn’t the Heavenly Emperor; this is Black Feather,” Song Shuhang said as he cast the ?Saber Nurturing Technique? on Black Feather, causing her tightly knitted brows to relax.","Fairy Phoenix Claw was speechless.","She looked around again and found that her friends in the Heavenly Court were all very calm. Only her one claw was particularly unsettled, reacting in shock.","“The person who killed the Heavenly Emperor was indeed me. However, the Heavenly Emperor asked for her own death,” Song Shuhang began to explain.","He briefly described the day when the Heavenly Emperor brought him into this “Heavenly Emperor World,” where the world collapsed, the sun was destroyed, and the Heavenly Emperor begged for death.","“I can prove this,” said the white-robed Golden Trigram, who finally found a point to join the conversation.","“Why did the Heavenly Emperor ask for death?” Fairy Phoenix Claw asked.","The Great Eastern Emperor pinched his chin. “She’s probably trying to escape or achieve some personal goal.”","Fairy Phoenix Claw was speechless.","So, Great Emperor, you knew the truth about the Heavenly Emperor’s death from the beginning? Then why did you get excited for so long?","“Then why is Tyrannical Song so sure that the Heavenly Emperor isn’t dead?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked curiously.","“Because of the remarks,” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, he reached out his hand and tapped on the interface of his “cultivation chat,” creating a new group.","‘Da Da Zi Heavenly Court’","Then, he pulled in the members of the Ancient Heavenly City from his friend list.","‘Group members: Lonely Heavenly Emperor, White-robed Golden Trigram; The World’s Greatest Hammer, Great Eastern Emperor; Golden Dragon Scarf, White Dragon Sister; Orthopedics Department, White Bone Immortal Fairy; Fairy Fengyi (Claw), Zither Master Fengyi; Skygazing Turtle.’ There were also two Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders of the Heavenly Court who were blind and repeatedly thought that Song Shuhang was Cheng Lin-Tooth Fairy ‘Ivory Trigram’, and Wine Immortal who didn’t have a nickname.","“The Ancestral Golden Dragon is here too?” Zither Master Fengyi was stunned.","She hadn’t expected Tyrannical Song to have such a wide network that he even knew the ancestral golden dragon. As for the Great Northern Emperor’s turtle, she had already guessed it because of Tyrannical Song’s habit of looking up at the sky, so she wasn’t surprised.","But it wasn’t over yet. Song Shuhang was still pulling people.","‘Ding! System Notification: ‘Rascal Friends’ Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi (Status Note: Dead as a doornail) has joined Da Da Zi’s Heavenly Court Group.’","That’s right, this was the former Heavenly Emperor.","The reason why Song Shuhang determined that she wasn’t dead yet was because of the “deader than dead” status in the note!","“Is it really the Heavenly Emperor?” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws froze.","However, Song Shuhang’s pulling operation was not over yet.","His hand slipped and pulled another member of the ancient Heavenly City.","‘Ding! System Notification: ‘Blacklist 1: Fairy of the Dead’ Cheng Goudan (Status Note: Dead of the Dead) has joined “Da Da Zi’s Heavenly City”‘","“Who is this?” Zither Master Fengyi was confused.","Cheng Goudan was speechless.","“Song Goudan, you fool!”","‘Ding! System Notification: Group member ‘Cheng Goudan’ has left “Da Da Zi’s Heavenly Court” group.’","“Is it her?” the Great Eastern Emperor said slowly.","The Jade Lake Empress of the Heavenly Court had buried the sinners of the Heavenly Court!"]},{"number":2811,"title":"Chapter 2811: Time to Shine Again!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2811: Time to Shine Again!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Who is it?” Zither Master Feng Yi asked curiously.","The name “Cheng Goudan” didn’t provide any clues about her identity. In the ancient Heavenly City, there wasn’t a “Deadly Fairy” or anyone named Goudan.","“Cough, this is one of my administrator accounts,” Song Shuhang lightly coughed.","“You?” Fairy Phoenix Claw looked at Song Shuhang with distrust.","“Yes, that’s right,” Song Shuhang answered honestly. As he spoke, he removed the ring that Senior White Two had given him to suppress the effects of the “Sage Number.”","On his body, eight tyrant accounts appeared one by one.","Additionally, there were several different dao names entangled with karma.","After reaching a certain level of cultivation, a daoist name became a symbol of oneself. In particular, daoist names given by some elders or big shots would leave a mark on the cultivator’s body.","As the ruler of the Netherworld, Goudan’s father had left a deep mark on Song Shuhang’s body with the daoist name “Cheng Goudan.”","“To be honest, Cheng Goudan is me; it’s one of my daoist names,” Song Shuhang answered honestly.","Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws were speechless.","After a while, she squeezed out a line, “Your daoist name is quite unique.”","“Thank you.” Song Shuhang put Senior White Two’s ring back on.","“Since it’s your admin account, why did she scold you just now?” The Great Eastern Emperor, who had already guessed the truth, raised a key question.","“This is my daily life with her. Although this admin account is me, and I am this admin account, our relationship is like that between a master and a ghost spirit. We can communicate with each other,” Song Shuhang said calmly.","When people spoke the truth, their aura was especially strong, and they were full of confidence.","“I see.” Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws moved a little on Song Shuhang’s shoulder.","“In addition, look at the Heavenly Emperor’s status note—it says ‘dead beyond dead.’ This state is very special,” Song Shuhang continued to explain.","“This state means he’s dead, right?” Zither Master Feng Yi said.","“Yes, it means that the ‘past’ is dead. There is no longer any trace of her ‘living’ in the universe,” Song Shuhang said.","Fairy Phoenix Claw: “Is this the state that the Celestial Thearch is pursuing?”","“When will the Celestial Thearch wake up?” asked the white-robed Gold Trigram after some thought.","“I don’t know. When did she post in the group? When did she wake up?” Song Shuhang replied, “In any case, with this ‘Da Da Zi Heavenly City’ group, everyone can contact and communicate at any time. There’s no need to worry.”","“That makes sense.” The Great Eastern Emperor stood up. He stretched out his hand and put on his luxurious emperor costume again. “Then, fellow Daoists,” he said, “I still have some things to deal with. Let’s part ways here!”","After seeing Song Shuhang constantly showing the ?Saber Nurturing Technique? to Black Panther, the Great Eastern Emperor couldn’t sit still.","“Senior Dongfang, we shall meet again,” Immortal Fairy White Bones replied.","“See you again,” Fairy Feng Yi and Golden Trigram said in unison.","Fairy @#%× waved her delicate hand. “We met at the wrong time but separated at the right time.”","The Great Eastern Emperor was confused.","I feel like Fairy @#%× is implying something?","With a puzzled expression, the Great Eastern Emperor put away his “Eastern Spring Pavilion” and left the Celestial Emperor’s world.","After leaving Song Shuhang for a long time, the Great Eastern Emperor suddenly felt as if he had lost something.","He carefully inspected his auxiliary palace from beginning to end, examining every detail.","“I didn’t lose anything. The Heavenly Cauldron, the hammer, the forging table, the tempering pool...” The Great Eastern Emperor frowned.","He had clearly not lost anything, but he felt as if he had lost something.","He felt lost.","Wait, if you think about it in conjunction with Fairy @#%×’s words...","Could it be that I was actually affected by the ?Saber Nurturing Technique? and didn’t want to leave Tyrannical Song? The Great Eastern Emperor suddenly thought of a terrifying possibility.","After thinking of this, he immediately took his Eastern Spring Pavilion and traveled as far as possible from Tyrannical Song.","“Why did the Great Emperor run away so quickly? He clearly promised to forge a magic tool for me,” Immortal Fairy White Bones said unhappily.","Fairy Phoenix Claw looked at the empty Celestial Thearch World and said sadly, “There’s nothing left.”","“The small world that the people of the ancient Heavenly City had created together, the second base of the Heavenly City... Now, there is nothing left.”","“Tyrannical Song, how are you going to deal with this small world?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","Song Shuhang stretched out his left hand and right hand and combined them. “I need to use it to store another world and merge the two incomplete worlds into one!”","I_have_a_Heavenly_Emperor_World ~I_have_a_Giant_Small_World ~","Uhh~ Giant_Sky_World ~~","“Merging the two worlds together? Tyrannical Song, can you do something like this?” The white-robed Golden Trigram looked at Song Shuhang in confusion.","If he still didn’t know Song Shuhang’s true identity, he would’ve shouted “Senior Song is awesome ~” in his heart. But now, although he was resisting in his heart, he already knew that Song Shuhang was the little cultivator who had come to his mysterious island back then. He was currently at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm.","An Eighth Stage Profound Sage wanted to fuse two worlds, something that most Immortals wouldn’t be able to do. Fusing worlds wasn’t as simple as moving a planet over. This involved the concept of a world plane.","“I have a certain degree of confidence,” Song Shuhang said calmly.","The white-robed Golden Trigram was startled.","Are you really little friend Song Shuhang? You really didn’t get possessed? When you went to the mysterious island, did you suppress your realm to play with me? Your true identity is the ‘Senior Song’ that the Heavenly Emperor mentioned, right?","“Do you need help?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","“If I need help, I will ask Fairy White Bones for help,” Song Shuhang laughed. It wasn’t a shameful thing to ask for help from the big shots.","It was also his own ability to have a group of big shots to ask for help at any time.","Song Shuhang looked at the big shots in his friend list and revealed a gratified smile.","“Do you need to do any preparation work? For example, setting up an array formation? If you want to set up an array formation, we can help you,” Fairy Phoenix Claw asked.","“No need, no need. There’s no need to go through so much trouble,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and pulled out a card from his Inner World.","This was one of the spoils of war that he had won from the bet with the three-eyed young senior... It could also be considered a gift from the three-eyed youth to thank him for bringing back the card drawing divine artifact from the Heavenly Dao Prison.","The card name was World Fusion.","Its effect was just like its name. It could fuse different small worlds together.","The three-eyed teenager had already removed the seal on the card. Song Shuhang only needed to provide spiritual energy to use the card.","Moreover, the design of this card was very humane. If there was not enough spiritual power, it could also provide energy by consuming spiritual stones.","It’s time for me to be awesome again!"]},{"number":2812,"title":"Chapter 2812: Good Thing I Have Backup Power Sources","paragraphs":["Chapter 2812: Good Thing I Have Backup Power Sources","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang took out the World Fusion card. When his fingers pinched the card, the ‘authentication system’ on the top of the card began to verify his identity.","“Fingerprint confirmation successful. Essence Soul verification accurate. Sage Seal normal. Bet ceremony mark passed... Welcome to the Creation Card Set, user Tyrannical Song.” A pleasant female voice sounded on the World Fusion card.","“Huh? This isn’t Senior Three-Eyed’s voice, nor is it Eyeball’s voice,” Song Shuhang noticed.","This voice should have been recorded recently. If it was a real person recording it, was the three-eyed young senior hiding a mistress somewhere?","“Please begin injecting your spiritual power,” the pleasant female voice continued to prompt on the World Fusion card.","Song Shuhang nodded and then called out to Immortal Fairy White Bones, “Fairy White Bones, Senior Island Master, come to my side. I’m going to start fusing the two worlds.”","“Coming,” Immortal Fairy White Bones skillfully came to Song Shuhang’s side and sat on the Divine Lobster’s Chariot. She had a good impression of the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure. After all, this magical treasure could fuse with her ‘White Bone Giant’ and transform into super beast equipment.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, don’t call me Senior,” the white-robed Gold Trigram followed White Bones Immortal Fairy and sat on the war chariot. Then, he took out the cute little bunny from his sleeve and held it in his arms, gently stroking it.","The virtuous lamia floated back to Song Shuhang’s body and made a ‘ready-to-go’ gesture, prepared to assist Song Shuhang at any time.","She had a feeling this World Fusion card would make Tyrannical Song cry. To collect Tyrannical Song’s tears and to make him waste fewer tears, she would lend him a hand.","“Then, let’s begin,” Song Shuhang said.","He circulated the vast amount of spiritual energy in his body and poured it into the World Fusion Card.","An enormous amount of spiritual energy surged from Tyrannical Song’s body.","The 7+1+1 nucleus gave Song Shuhang spiritual energy that far exceeded his own realm.","The spiritual energy in his body was so immense that even Zither Master Feng Yi and the white-robed Golden Trigram were shocked.","“What a huge amount of spiritual energy... In terms of quantity alone, it has already completely surpassed the level of Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders and is approaching the level of Immortals, right?” Zither Master Feng Yi estimated.","“The amount of spiritual energy is even more exaggerated than mine was a few days ago,” the white-robed Golden Trigram felt hurt. Before he had inherited the Heavenly Emperor’s Great Dao, his spiritual energy was about to be completely outclassed by Tyrannical Song.","“After all, it’s seven small cores plus one large core and one jindan. Everyone only installed one engine, but he secretly installed nine. The power is naturally strong,” Immortal Fairy White Bones said calmly. Among the people present, she had been in contact with Tyrannical Song the longest, so she knew him the best.","The advantage of the 7+1+1 core was not only the immense amount of spiritual power but also the recovery speed of spiritual power, which far exceeded that of ordinary cultivators.","With Song Shuhang’s current speed of spiritual energy output, the amount of spiritual energy recovered was almost equal to the amount consumed.","“No wonder he doesn’t need anyone’s help,” Zither Master Feng Yi thought to herself. From the looks of it, Tyrannical Song alone could activate and provide the energy needed for the World Fusion card.","Just as Zither Master Feng Yi’s thoughts fell, the World Fusion card suddenly began to expand.","With the card as the center, a thin black boundary layer spread out.","It looked like a thin sheet of paper, but there was a black vortex on the front and back.","“Card activated. Entering the second stage. Please select the small world you want to fuse with. Please increase the energy input,” the pleasant notification sounded again.","“The worlds that need to be fused are the Heavenly Emperor World and the artificial giant’s small world!” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice.","As he spoke, his divine sense locked onto the Heavenly Emperor’s world through the World Fusion card and connected to the giant’s small world through the Inner World.","The shadows of the two worlds appeared on both sides of the black boundary layer and were slowly pulled by the vortex black holes on both sides.","During this process, the amount of spiritual energy that Song Shuhang poured into the World Fusion card instantly increased by more than thirty times. And this number was still increasing.","The original balance of spiritual power was broken all of a sudden.","Even if it was a 7+1+1 core engine, it could not keep up with the spiritual energy consumption of thirty or forty times.","“Tyrannical Song, how do you feel? Can you still hold on?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked worriedly.","Song Shuhang’s entire body trembled. “I feel as if my body has been hollowed out.”","Although he had so many cores and so much spiritual energy, this World Fusion card was a magical treasure at the level of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Therefore, even the Nine Cores Tyrannical Song couldn’t withstand this consumption.","Fusing the two worlds, and even forcefully fusing the two plane laws together, the amount of energy consumed was simply unimaginable.","“Can you hold on?” Zither Master Feng Yi also asked.","“It’s alright. I still have a backup power source,” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, a few new energy sources in his body began to continuously output power.","One of these backup sources was the ghost spirit. At this time, the fairy ghost spirit in Song Shuhang’s body was temporarily residing in Su Clan’s Sixteen’s body, but she was still able to provide Song Shuhang with an endless supply of backup spiritual energy.","The second was Fairy @#%×. She was Song Shuhang’s virtuous incarnation and also a source of energy. The energy of the virtuous lamia, her virtuous whale, and the virtuous lightning tree, which had been waiting to receive Song Shuhang’s tears, were all sucked dry.","Song Shuhang felt as if his body had been emptied. Before he could cry, she almost couldn’t help but cry.","Third, there were two sets of the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure. Each of these two sets contained a ‘Tyrannical Song’s heart,’ and each set contained a ‘big-eyed planet heart imitation’ forged by Senior White Two. At the critical moment, the two life-bound magical treasures could provide Song Shuhang with a reliable source of spiritual energy.","This energy was one with Song Shuhang and could be recognized by the World Fusion card, which could be used to fuse worlds.","After the three ‘backup power sources’ were activated, Song Shuhang barely managed to hold on.","However, just as Song Shuhang was about to heave a sigh of relief, the sweet voice from the World Fusion card sounded again. “The Heavenly Emperor’s world and the giant’s small world have been successfully locked onto. The initial traction has been completed. The contact of laws has begun... Entering the third stage, material world fusion. Please increase your spiritual energy.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Can you borrow our energy?” Immortal Fairy White Bones, a free warrior, volunteered and asked.","“Try it,” Song Shuhang replied.","Immortal Fairy White Bones stretched out her hand and pressed it on the World Fusion card in Song Shuhang’s hand, trying to input spiritual energy into it.","Her spiritual energy wrapped around Song Shuhang’s palm and merged with the card."]},{"number":2813,"title":"Chapter 2813: I Will Never Hand You Over","paragraphs":["Chapter 2813: I Will Never Hand You Over","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","But the next moment...","“Fingerprint verification failed, Primordial Spirit verification failed, Sage Seal abnormal, Bet Ritual Imprint abnormal,” that sweet voice sounded.","It rejected White Bones Immortal Fairy’s spirit energy.","This was a cruel yet sweet voice.","But in fact, the rejection function of the card was the good intention of the three-eyed young senior.","The process of fusing worlds involved world rules and authority. To prevent any accidents, it was best for Song Shuhang to supply the spiritual energy on his own. Even if he wanted to find external help, the power of the external help should at least be marked with Tyrannical Song’s mark, to avoid affecting the effect of the “world fusion.”","“It doesn’t look like it’s going to work,” Immortal Fairy White Bones retracted her palm and said regretfully.","Fairy Feng Yi pondered for a moment and said, “But Fairy @#%× was drained dry. So, the external energy should be able to be converted, right?”","“Fairy @#%× is Song Shuhang’s virtuous incarnation. She and Shuhang are originally one. However, now that you mention it, it reminds me. If you want to pass this card’s verification, then you have to become one with Tyrannical Song,” Immortal Fairy White Bones twirled her hair and pondered.","“Fairy White Bones?” Zither Master Feng Yi was slightly stunned when she saw the serious expression on her face. “You don’t have to work so hard, do you?”","In order to help Tyrannical Song once, he actually wanted to fuse with him?","It was like lending a dollar to Tyrannical Song but doing so through the method of “giving your body to him.”","“No, Fairy Feng Yi, you misunderstood. I was just thinking if I could borrow Song Shuhang’s body to filter my energy and turn it into Song Shuhang’s energy, which can then be used by this card,” Immortal Fairy White Bones replied with a smile.","Fairy Feng Yi was speechless.","“You’re really considering merging? With Tyrannical Song’s current state of urgency, Immortal Fairy White Bones, if your energy is directly transferred into his body, it will probably cause him to go berserk. If you want to fuse your energy with Tyrannical Song, you need to form a connection with him first,” the white-robed Golden Trigram said slowly.","“So, just give me the spirit stones,” said Zither Master Feng Yi with her claws.","“Bring up the spirit stones... Spirit stones, spirit stones, spirit stones...” Song Shuhang felt his chest tighten.","Spirit stones?","They didn’t exist!","Tyrannical Song still had other methods!","“Immortal Fairy, don’t worry. In fact, I still have a spare battery that can be used,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","He, Tyrannical Song, still had a trump card!","After saying that, he took the initiative to connect to the backup battery of the Ancient God.","The ancient god that was sealed in his heart by the three-eyed teenager had already been rubbed by Tyrannical Song’s aura.","Under Song Shuhang’s control, a huge and pure energy was transmitted from the ancient god.","Through the resonance between the hearts, Song Shuhang divided the ancient god’s energy and transferred it to his main body’s heart and the hearts of the 66 life-bound magical treasures.","In the next moment, Tyrannical Song’s heart and 66 life-bound magical treasures’ hearts beat wildly, quickly transforming the energy in the “Ancient God battery” and sending it into the World Fusion card.","After the ancient god energy had been transformed and sealed in his heart, it had been infected with Tyrannical Song’s aura. Now, after a second transformation, it had reached the requirements of the card’s settings for external help energy.","In addition, the energy of the ancient gods was related to the Giant’s Small World.","With the combination of the two, the World Fusion card successfully received this huge amount of energy and poured it into the “World Fusion Spell.”","“Very good, you’re holding on again,” Song Shuhang said with satisfaction.","“Don’t be too happy. Your spiritual energy is still constantly being consumed. If you can’t find a new source of replenishment, you won’t be able to hold on for long,” Fairy Phoenix Claw reminded.","Moreover, the Ancient God’s battery didn’t have much power to begin with. It was already in an extremely weak state when it was sealed, and Song Shuhang had even used his “eye technique,” turning it into a hairy slime. It hadn’t recovered yet.","“Thank you for your reminder, Fairy Feng Yi,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Where could he find a new source of spiritual power now?","His gaze landed on his Inner World.","Under normal circumstances, the Inner World was also one of Song Shuhang’s backup power sources. As long as the living spring and the Inner World were not blocked, they could continuously supply energy to Song Shuhang.","But now, the Inner World’s energy had long been invested in the “world fusion” process. The giant’s small world was connected to the Inner World, and through the Inner World as a transit point, it merged with the Celestial Emperor’s world.","The Inner World was currently operating at full capacity, and there was no excess energy to support the main body.","Song Shuhang’s gaze finally fell on the batch of “spirit stones” in his hand. This was a warm spirit stone that he had just received. It was a greeting gift from the white-robed Island Master.","Song Shuhang hadn’t even warmed up the gift, and he hadn’t even carefully counted the spirit stones.","Could it be that he was going to use them now?","Just as Song Shuhang was in a dilemma, another huge wave of energy was transmitted from the ghost fairy spirit.","This energy contained the White Dragon’s aura.","This was the long-distance support that Su Clan’s Sixteen and the White Dragon were giving Song Shuhang while they were in seclusion.","A moment ago, when the energy of the Ancient God’s battery was being fed back, Song Shuhang took the initiative to cut it and transfer the ancient god energy into each of the “glass hearts,” using the 66 life-bound magical treasures to speed up the transformation process.","During this process, a portion of the ancient god energy was transferred to Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was cultivating in the White Dragon’s tomb.","Su Clan’s Sixteen deduced that Song Shuhang needed a lot of spiritual energy at this time through the feedback of the ghost fairy.","Therefore, she first used the glass heart to convert the energy that she and the White Dragon had provided, and then used the ghost fairy spirit to provide this energy to Song Shuhang.","With the double conversion of the Glazed Heart and the Ghost Fairy Spirit, this wave of external energy also met the requirements.","The support of the White Dragon and the ancient god’s external energy allowed Song Shuhang to successfully hold on.","He had successfully passed the third stage.","“The final stage has begun. A new world is forming. The new world’s laws are being generated. Sector lord authority merging. Please hold on for the last three minutes,” a sweet voice sounded.","Finally, it was the final stage.","This stage was also the stage where the consumption of spiritual energy was the greatest.","“Can you hold on?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked nervously.","Don’t let all your previous efforts go to waste.","“Three minutes... Fortunately, I left a last resort,” Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief.","Behind him, the Inner World slowly unfolded.","He used his Inner World as a passageway to connect to Song Four in the Netherworld Realm.","On his main body and Song Four’s back, the Golden Core QR code pattern lit up.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet appeared in the air and landed in Song Shuhang’s palm, cooperating with him to activate it.","“Three minutes of true grit!” Song Shuhang shouted in a deep voice. “I definitely won’t hand over the spirit stones!”","The true grit Senior White Two had left for him allowed him to transform into the true ruler of the Netherworld.","Leaving this trump card for the last was indeed the right choice."]},{"number":2814,"title":"Chapter 2814: But Your Lavish Style of Spending Money Looks Truly Beautiful","paragraphs":["Chapter 2814: But Your Lavish Style of Spending Money Looks Truly Beautiful","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Overlord Mode of the Nine Serenities could be sustained for up to three minutes with the assistance of Senior White Two’s partial strength... The final stage of Senior Three-Eyed’s World Fusion card also lasted three minutes.","A Perfect Match!","Using the ‘Core World’ as a transit point, Song Shuhang resonated with Song Four to enter the Overlord Mode of the Nine Serenities.","To prevent the possibility of the Nine Serenities Overlord entering the mortal realm and bringing down divine punishment, Song Shuhang, after entering the mode, used Song Four as a coordinate to open a direct spatial passage to the Nine Serenities.","Then, his physical body stepped back, standing within the spatial tunnel.","White-Robed Golden Trigram, Immortal Fairy White Bones, and Phoenix Rite Zither Master watched as Song Shuhang’s aura suddenly underwent a drastic change, shifting from a righteous and kind aura to a terrifyingly evil and abyssal aura.","Was this the legendary saying that the more righteous a person was, the more terrifying they would be when they turned evil?","“The Nine Serenities Overlord?” The single eye on Phoenix Rite Zither Master’s paw widened in disbelief.","“It’s indeed the Nine Serenities Overlord mode.” White-Robed Golden Trigram slowly spoke—surprisingly, the Heavenly Emperor did not mislead him. Tyrant Song wielded the authority of the Nine Serenities while appearing as a human in the mortal realm, leaving them clueless about how he managed it.","So... This definitely wasn’t the Song Shuhang they knew!","“Tyrant Song, are you the Nine Serenities Overlord?” Fairy Phoenix Claw was shocked to the point her voice changed from a mature woman’s to that of a young girl.","“I’m just a temp worker passing through.” Song Shuhang replied calmly.","With that said, he used his psychic power to pull Senior White-Robed Island Master and Immortal Fairy White Bones over, dragging them into the spatial tunnel.","Supported by the boundless energy of the Nine Serenities Overlord Realm, the World Fusion card operated at full capacity.","Both worlds were completely sucked into the black hole and transformed into a brand new world.","The entire process went smoothly...","The power of the Nine Serenities Overlord was more than sufficient for Song Shuhang to squander. He didn’t even need to tap into his own spiritual power, backup power source, or emergency batteries...","Hence, during these three minutes, Song Shuhang seized the opportunity to start replenishing the spiritual energy consumed by the nine major engine cores.","Not only his main body, but even his spirit ghost, virtuous lamia, and other external energy sources were speeding up their recovery.","Better safe than sorry.","Song Shuhang was a cautious man. Though the three minutes of True Man Mode and the final three minutes of the ‘World Fusion Card’ were a match made in heaven, what if there was a small segment at the end of the ‘World Fusion Card’ that required spiritual energy consumption?","Hence, preparedness was key.","He intended to nip in the bud any chance of the little cutie consuming spiritual stones before it was born!","Three minutes wasn’t too long or too short.","White-Robed Golden Trigram, Phoenix Rite Zither Master’s claw, and Immortal Fairy White Bones remained silent, focused on witnessing the scene of the world’s transformation and gaining some enlightenment from it.","The collision of two different worlds, the convergence of laws, the merging of planes—each step contained the principles of the Great Dao, a grand teaching ceremony for the immortals.","@#%× Fairy diligently recorded this scene... In the future, the content she recorded would be used by Song Shuhang to educate his students through instructional videos.","Rumble","With a loud rumble, a brand new world plane was born!","Song Shuhang’s three-minute True Man Mode had just ended... Their cooperation was seamless.","The connection between the Nine Serenities Realm and Song Shuhang was severed.","Song Shuhang’s physical body was ‘pushed’ into this new world, standing at its very center.","A Realm Seal appeared on his body.","This was his identity as a Sector Lord, reaffirmed after successfully refreshing his credentials in the new world.","The Tyrant Realm floated above Song Shuhang’s head.","Beyond the Nine Heavens, winds and clouds surged... Dazzling seven-colored lights descended from the Nine Heavens, accompanied by auspicious clouds.","These scattered seven-colored lights were all tremendous power of virtue, falling upon this Tyrant Realm Realm Seal.","This power of virtue was incredibly vast, even larger than Song Shuhang’s Profound Sage Speech—it was the immense virtue needed to save a realm and a plane.","The power of virtue dyed the Realm Seal golden and firmly bound it to the new world.","Standing at the center of the world, after a brief contemplation, Song Shuhang raised his right hand and pressed it on the Realm Seal... He raised his hand and began pouring in his spiritual energy!","His precautions were justified—after the successful world fusion, there indeed was a segment that required him to infuse spiritual power! Taking advantage of those three minutes to replenish his own spiritual power and that of the backup power source was the wisest decision.","Hum~~ The entire new world began resonating with Song Shuhang’s spiritual energy, welcoming ‘Realm Lord Tyrant Song’.","After reinforcing Song Shuhang’s ‘Tyrant Realm’ seal with immense heavenly virtue, the remaining colossal virtue was absorbed into the virtuous lamia’s body.","The virtuous lamia’s ‘evolution’ was essentially complete... She had already evolved long legs and could freely switch between legs and her snake tail.","This time, all the heavenly virtue had been converted into her power.","Originally, the virtuous lamia’s strength had been constrained by Song Shuhang’s main body realm. Now, although Song Shuhang still remained at the Eighth Stage realm, the strength of his primordial spirit and physical body no longer restricted the virtuous lamia’s realm. Moreover, Song Shuhang now bore the official identity of ‘Sector Lord’!","The realm of the virtuous lamia continued to rise. Propelled by the immense power of virtue, her strength surged at the pace of Tyrant Song’s expanding mentality.","Under the influence of the Nine Serenities Overlord’s authority, the virtuous lamia’s strength had undergone a dramatic increase, just as Tyrant Song’s mentality expanded!","A few breaths later... The virtuous lamia seemed to have surpassed the limits of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, yet it appeared she hadn’t fully broken through. She hadn’t condensed her own Dao, and her strength still fell short of that of an Immortal.","Similar to the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure’, the virtuous lamia was probably at the special level of a weak Immortal.","The succession process was still ongoing.","In this new world, various strange phenomena rose and fell.","There were white dragon phantoms roaming the world, colossal ancient god phantoms drifting underground, crystal heart phantoms transforming into stars that dotted the starry sky, and golden and black lotuses blooming in every corner of the world!","Countless phenomena celebrated the completion of this new world.","All cultivators in the universe suddenly felt a stir and looked up at the sky.","It wasn’t just ordinary cultivators—even many immortal bigshots sensed something and raised their heads.","Is there a new Profound Sage achieving Dao?","No, it’s not as simple as a Profound Sage... This level of great karma and great fortune, could it be the birth of a Realm Lord?","In the new world.","Song Shuhang withdrew his palm gracefully, revealing a faint smile.","His spirit stone cutie was safe.","“Congratulations, Tyrant Song, on the successful integration of the new world. Hint: The ‘World Fusion’ card is beginning to dissipate. Would you like to use a certain amount of spirit stones to stabilize the structure of the ‘World Fusion’ card and its laws?” The sweetest voice of that world’s top-tier entity made the most devilish of suggestions to Tyrant Song.","Song Shuhang was speechless."]},{"number":2815,"title":"Chapter 2815: Tyrannical Song Has Already Proven Himself To The Heavenly Dao?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2815: Tyrannical Song Has Already Proven Himself To The Heavenly Dao?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Can’t I use spiritual energy to replace it?” Song Shuhang quickly asked.","“Answer: It cannot be replaced by spiritual energy. Even purified spiritual energy contains impurities, which will conflict with the power of the ruler in the card. Hint: Please make your choice as soon as possible. The World Fusion Card will dissipate in five seconds,” the sweet voice replied.","She was reminding Song Shuhang that if he wanted to protect the World Fusion Card, he had to act quickly. Otherwise, every passing second would cause the laws and structure of the World Fusion Card to consume more energy.","Protect the card or the spirit stones?","Protect the big or the small?","Whoever used the World Fusion Card would know its effect. The card’s function was simply too powerful.","More importantly, the materials used to create the World Fusion Card were very precious. Senior Three-Eyed had yet to collect a portion of the raw materials!","As for the spirit stones, Song Shuhang had just acquired them, and he hadn’t counted them yet. They were still warm.","You want my spirit stones? Unless you step over my dead body!","“Throw in, throw in my spirit stones!” Song Shuhang said calmly.","There were two types of calmness.","One was true peace. The big shots who had experienced great storms could face them without changing their expressions, no matter what kind of storm they encountered.","The other was the calmness after one’s emotions reached their limits. Due to excessive stimulation, people no longer knew what expressions and emotions to use to express their hearts, so they could only remain calm.","After the spirit stones were used up by Little Cutie, he could still earn them back. However, the materials needed to create the cards might not be found again in the future after they were used up.","Rustle","Under Song Shuhang’s will, the spirit stones of the Ninth Stage that he had just obtained from the white-robed Island Master were poured out.","Each spirit stone reflected Song Shuhang’s face like a mirror, as if they were bidding farewell to him.","In the next moment, the spirit stones of the Ninth Stage were like moths to a flame, merging into the World Fusion Card to maintain the card’s structure and preserve the nomological meridians on it!","Song Shuhang wished he could give each spirit stone a name in memory of the spirit stones that had been consumed.","“Large amount of spirit stones injected detected. World Fusion Card structure saved, card rules recorded again... Please invest more spirit stones to preserve the effects of the World Fusion Card,” the sweet voice continued.","“Throw it all in!” Song Shuhang said.","Since he had already decided, he could not give up and had to strive to maximize the effect.","Under Song Shuhang’s orders, all the precious spirit stones of the Ninth Stage were put into the World Fusion Card!","The card slightly lit up, turned into a ball of light, and gently landed on Song Shuhang’s palm.","Song Shuhang held the ball of light in his hands, and the complexity of his heart was something that even a ten-thousand-word article couldn’t express.","“How tragic. There’s not even a single spirit stone left,” Immortal Fairy White Bones said softly.","“Tyrannical Song’s spirit stone is like his resurrection magical treasure; it’s destined to be lost unless it’s given away as soon as possible,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said slowly.","As it spoke, the words “Tyrannical Song’s Tomb” on its body emitted seven-colored light, blinding the white-robed Golden Trigram and Zither Master Feng Yi.","“Tyrannical Song, are you lacking spirit stones?” the white-robed Golden Trigram asked. Could this be the reason why the Celestial Thearch had repeatedly instructed him to deliver the spirit stones directly to his doorstep?","“Very, very much. He owes Sage White at least tens of billions of spirit stones,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet replied.","Immortal Fairy White Bones reminded him, “It’s not just tens of billions. He borrowed several Spirit Stone Cutting Balls from Sage White just to upgrade 66 life-bound magical treasures. Each ball is extremely huge. It’s impossible to calculate.”","“Unless he’s like Sage White and picks up a spirit stone planet, he won’t be able to repay his debt... This isn’t even including the interest,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","The white-robed Golden Trigram was speechless.","He raised his head and looked at Tyrannical Song, who was at the center of the world.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song was extremely domineering. The entire new world was dominated by him, and countless phenomena danced for him. The virtuous lamia was protecting him, and the ‘Tyrannical Realm’ world seal on his head complemented his temperament. The entire Netherworld Realm stood behind him.","In terms of aura, it was very difficult to find a few people in the universe who could suppress Tyrannical Song.","However, he had no money.","Some people looked glamorous on the surface and were dressed luxuriously... but in fact, even their socks were torn, and they didn’t have much money in their pockets.","At the center of the world, the strange phenomenon began to slowly dissipate.","The giant’s small world floated in the void. The huge Celestial Emperor Dimension was no longer empty.","However, this world was still a little monotonous. There was only one planet, no sun, and no satellites. Song Shuhang would have to work hard to arrange these things in the future.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently grabbed the seal of the ‘Overlord Realm,’ fusing it into his original dantian.","The next moment, his body trembled slightly.","With the help of the new world and the authority of a Sector Lord, the strength of Song Shuhang’s body and primordial spirit rose again.","Moreover, as the new world stabilized, the energy source of the new world continued to feed Song Shuhang.","In this way, Song Shuhang’s breakthrough to the Eighth Stage and the Ninth Stage was just around the corner!","In addition, as he fused the Realm Seal into his body, he felt the myriad worlds vibrating with him.","“Eh? It felt like the myriad worlds were cooperating with him? It was like... Profound Sage Speech?” Song Shuhang called out softly.","The myriad worlds seemed to be giving Song Shuhang a world announcement, and it was a spamming announcement. This state was extremely similar to the ‘Profound Sage Speech.’","In the myriad worlds, as long as it was a cultivator, they would notice this announcement.","Vaguely, several powerful Immortal consciousnesses were sent over, and these gazes were filled with the intention of prying.","The birth of a new world, the formation of a Sector Lord, did not necessarily mean that it was a peerless powerhouse. It was possible that there would be a Sector Lord that was similar to the Plane of Dreams.","If this new world’s law collection was just born... as long as that Immortal big shot captured it and refined it, he would have a chance to replace it and become the Realmlord!","That was why these powerful Immortal consciousnesses had the intention of prying, wanting to see where the ‘Realm Lord’ of this new world suddenly came from. Was it a powerful peak mighty figure, or was it a collection of laws?","In the next moment, the consciousness of these Immortals swept across Tyrannical Song’s figure.","Tyrannical Song, who stood between heaven and earth, was at his peak.","He had the aura of a ruler of the Netherworld and the power of a new world’s sector lord.","‘Tyrannical Song again?!’","‘Wait, the background of this new world... doesn’t it look like Tyrannical Song’s background when he killed the Heavenly Emperor?’","‘Could it be... the Heavenly Emperor didn’t take the initiative to challenge Tyrannical Song, but Tyrannical Song took a fancy to the world of the Heavenly Emperor, so he killed him? Just like how he killed the ruler of the Netherworld and stole his Dao artifact?’","Just as these Immortals were guessing, as long as anyone in the universe raised their heads, they would be able to see the world announcement from the universe.","It was a video.","Tyrannical Song stood between heaven and earth and stretched out his hand to press the void. Two different planes of the world took shape in his hands!","And on Tyrannical Song’s body, there was a huge burst of spiritual energy.","The amount of spiritual energy was so great that even several Immortal big shots combined couldn’t compare to it.","Not only that, but in the final stage of the world fusion, the image of the Netherworld Realm suddenly appeared behind Tyrannical Song.","In the Netherworld Realm, there was a black Tyrannical Song that corresponded to the Tyrannical Song of the main world.","The power of the ruler of the Netherworld erupted from Tyrannical Song’s body!","‘My God, Tyrannical Song has already given birth to a corresponding ruler of the Netherworld?’","‘He has already advanced to the Heavenly Dao?’"]},{"number":2816,"title":"Chapter 2816: I Didn’t Realize My Situation Was So Dangerous!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2816: I Didn’t Realize My Situation Was So Dangerous!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When they saw that Tyrannical Song actually had a corresponding ruler of the Netherworld, all the practitioners in the universe almost thought their “timeline” had been moved and that they had traveled to the future.","“If Tyrannical Song is already a Heavenly Dao Body, when did he attain immortality? Why don’t we know anything?”","The cultivators looked up at the sky and silently sensed—then, they realized the seat of the Heavenly Dao was still empty.","Since the collapse of the Heavenly Dao during Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s speech, the seat of the Heavenly Dao had been suspended.","At present, no one in the myriad worlds had witnessed the Dao and taken this final step.","“Tyrannical Song didn’t vindicate the Dao, and his position as the Heavenly Dao is still empty!”","“That’s right. The last Heavenly Dao had just dissipated. How long has it been? How can a Heavenly Dao Seat be born so quickly?”","“I almost thought I had gone into seclusion too long, and that time had already reached the distant future.”","The cultivators secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","If Tyrannical Song had already become immortal, that would be too terrifying.","“Wait, since no one has inherited the seat of the Heavenly Dao... then what’s up with Tyrannical Song’s half of the ruler of the Netherworld?”","He clearly hadn’t attained immortality and controlled the Heavenly Dao, but he had already given birth to the ruler of the Netherworld’s half-bodied form. How did Tyrannical Song do it?","From a certain point of view, Tyrannical Song’s state was even more terrifying than attaining immortality and giving birth to the ruler of the Netherworld, right?","He was going beyond the norm!","Unreasonable, not even following the Heavenly Dao!","In the myriad worlds, the thoughts of several Immortals were communicating across planes. However, when they were chatting, they suddenly felt that they couldn’t continue chatting. They wanted to break up and stop talking.","“Can a person really condense his own half of the ruler of the Netherworld before he proves his immortality? The Scholarly Sage and the Heavenly Emperor of the ancient Heavenly City couldn’t have done this back then!”","“Could it be that he’s going to conquer the Netherworld Realm by force and then gain its recognition?”","“Impossible. The Netherworld Realm is incomparably vast. How can it be conquered so easily? Moreover, how long has it been since the collapse of the Heavenly Dao? Time didn’t allow it either. It’s better to directly vindicate the Dao in the main world than to conquer the Netherworld Realm with brute force.”","“There are too many mysteries about Tyrannical Song. He’s really an alluring male.”","“I don’t know why, but I know that the matter of condensing the ruler of the Netherworld before attaining immortality is very extraordinary and unbelievable. But when it happened to Tyrannical Song, my mood didn’t fluctuate at all.”","“To tell you the truth, so am I.”","“Add me in.”","“Speaking of which, the fact that Tyrannical Song possesses the ruler of the Netherworld is already a fact that can’t be changed. Therefore, rather than guessing how Tyrannical Song condensed the ruler of the Netherworld, we should be more worried about the impact of this matter.”","“If it’s an influence, let’s assume... if the next Wielder of the Will isn’t Tyrannical Song, would the Netherworld Realm still be able to give birth to a half-body ruler of the Netherworld? If they were born, wouldn’t the Netherworld Realm have two rulers of the Netherworld?”","“Hegemons are supreme and have sole authority. If there are two rulers of the Netherworld Realm in the Netherworld Realm, wouldn’t the ruler of the Netherworld Realm corresponding to the Heavenly Dao be very aggrieved?”","“If that’s the case... I’m afraid the first thing the Wielder of the Will will do after taking office is to get rid of Tyrannical Song, right?”","“So, no matter what, Tyrannical Song has already taken over this Heavenly Dao competition. If he can’t advance to the Heavenly Dao, then he won’t be able to retreat at all.”","Cultivators in the universe quickly deduced what might happen in the future through one thing.","This time, there was nothing wrong with their serious speculation.","One mountain cannot accommodate two tigers.","If the new Wielder of the Will isn’t Tyrannical Song, then the first thing he would do after he was born would definitely be to kill Tyrannical Song, or at least the ruler of the Netherworld.","“If that’s the case, then it can be seen that Tyrannical Song is very confident in his immortality and becoming the Wielder of the Will! He already regards the position of the Heavenly Dao as his own, which is why he fiddled with the half of his ruler of the Netherworld in advance.”","“Not necessarily. It’s also possible that Tyrannical Song is burning his bridges and cutting off his retreat path, making it impossible for him to retreat and strengthening his determination to vindicate Dao.”","“No matter which angle you look at it from, Tyrannical Song is a terrifying and ruthless person. He’s ruthless to others, but he’s also ruthless to himself.”","As the Immortal big shots and the top-tier Tribulation Transcender were communicating across planes, the “recording” in the world announcement of the myriad worlds came to an end.","Tyrannical Song raised the “Tyrannical Realm” sector lord seal, officially becoming a perfect sector lord.","At this moment, the most handsome and imposing Tyrannical Song was recorded, and his image spread throughout the universe.","The Immortal big shots saw very deeply and far ahead. From the matter of Tyrannical Song becoming the Realmlord, they deduced many possibilities... for example, whether the authority of a sector lord was related to the ruler of the Netherworld.","However, ordinary cultivators didn’t have as much time as Immortals, and they didn’t have as many guesses.","Most of the ordinary cultivators looked up at Tyrannical Song and only had one thought in their minds: Big Boss Tyrannical Song was awesome.","Great Tyrannical Song’s “Profound Sage Speech” segment had already ended, and he no longer needed to use it to verify his Great Dao.","But even without the “Profound Sage Speech” segment, Big Boss Tyrannical Song was still the most beautiful kid in the universe. He could still appear in front of all the cultivators in the myriad worlds through other channels. For example, now, the sector lord succession ceremony had been announced to the entire universe.","“After the Profound Sage Speech, Senior Tyrannical Song is going to challenge the ‘Sector Lord,’ right?”","“Senior Tyrannical Song is really a man who doesn’t want to be lonely.”","“This should be just the beginning. Next month, we should be able to see Senior Tyrannical Song inherit the new world and become the world overlord of the second world.”","“Then, Senior Tyrannical Song will expand at the speed of one world per month. This is all a trick. We’re all familiar with it.”","At this time, Song Shuhang, who had put away the Realm Seal, had a strange expression on his face.","As a genuine Profound Sage, he could vaguely receive feedback from the listeners after appearing on a platform similar to the “Profound Sage Speech.”","For example... he had received comments from the Immortals about the Netherworld Realm having two rulers, as well as the speculation that if Tyrannical Song didn’t attain the Wielder of the Will, he would very likely be killed by the new Wielder of the Will.","“There are two rulers in one world. The new ruler will indeed be in a worse state, such as the fat ball boss.”","‘In addition, according to the speculations of these big shots, if the new Wielder of the Will wasn’t me, I might have been killed... then wouldn’t my current situation be very bad?’ If Song Shuhang hadn’t experienced a lot and had a strong heart, he would definitely have been scared.","I didn’t expect myself to be walking on a tightrope.","Are you forcing me to fight for the Heavenly Dao?","However, I’m only an Eighth Stage Minor Profound Sage right now, so why would I fight for the Heavenly Dao? I don’t have the qualifications to inherit the Heavenly Dao at all.","This was the same as how he was only eighteen years old and had not yet reached the legal age of marriage. Although he had been sterilized, he still could not legally get married."]},{"number":2817,"title":"Chapter 2817: I, Tyrannical Song, am forthright!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2817: I, Tyrannical Song, am forthright!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, if nothing unexpected happened, even if Song Shuhang’s biological daughter was born, he still wouldn’t be able to reach the age of legal marriage.","As soon as he thought about how his daughter would be born without a mother, Song Shuhang felt very sad... My ass!","Moreover, he was a cultivator.","How could a cultivator be judged by common sense? He had too many tricks up his sleeve!","For example...","“I can hold on for a while. Just like how I carried Nezha, I can carry her for a few years. It won’t be too late to give birth to her after she’s legally married.” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and pondered seriously.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","Fairy @#%× silently recorded this line, but she felt that her mind was polluted when she recorded the line.","“However, the new Wielder of the Will is indeed a problem. Perhaps I should find a chance to explain the misunderstanding of my incarnation as the ruler of the Netherworld and let the people of the myriad worlds know that I’m actually just a temporary worker?” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said.","The virtuous lamia rolled her golden eyes and read,”I don’t believe you. You old man, you’re very bad ”","Do you think the people of the universe will believe you?","“That’s right. I don’t believe it myself when I say that I’m the temporary ruler of the Netherworld... Moreover, this would expose Senior White Two’s existence, which was inappropriate. Therefore, why not build a good relationship with the next Tiandao seed in advance? It would be even better if the next Wielder of the Will could come out from among the big shots and seniors I know.” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and said.","For example...Senior White?","If Senior White became immortal and became the Wielder of the Will once again, Song Shuhang would be able to rest easy.","The virtuous lamia was speechless.","Although he didn’t want to admit it, the weight of the big shots in Song Shuhang’s circle of friends was too heavy. It wasn’t strange that some of these big shots had reached immortal dao.","The live effect of the server announcement ended.","Song Shuhang also slowly exited the ‘Profound Sage-like Speech’ state.","All the practitioners in the universe looked up at the sky and saw the powerful figure of Tyrannical Song gradually fade away.","‘Eh? Senior Tyrannical Song didn’t give a speech this time? Just a simple manifestation?’","‘Senior Tyrannical Song, aren’t you going to say anything this time? It’s good to share some experience of vying for dao!’","‘Senior, don’t leave. We’re looking forward to your monthly benefits now!’","The cultivators in the universe immediately gave feedback with all their might.","Just say a few words, Senior Tyrannical Song!","Song Shuhang smiled wordlessly the entire time.","The announcement was just an announcement, there was no need to talk about the law...Perhaps if Song Shuhang was interested, he could give a few words of appreciation.","However, he clearly wasn’t in the mood for that right now. More importantly, he was at a loss for words. He had given too many Profound Sage Speeches not long ago, and he had been completely drained. He really could not squeeze out anything to share with the fellow daoists of the myriad worlds.","During the Profound Sage Speech previously, he had asked the fellow daoists of the myriad worlds to look at his face.","He did not have any useful information in his stomach to begin with. The previous few times, he had relied on piecing together things and barely managed to survive the speech segment. He had long been squeezed dry. If he had to say something now, he would probably only be able to respond to the audience with a “okay ~”","Therefore, how could he dare to speak at this time?","There was no need to speak. At this moment, it was fine to just maintain a smile.","In the sky, Tyrannical Song was laughing, and on the ground, the audience was roaring.","The feedback information was still being transmitted over.","Song Shuhang didn’t pay much attention to the speculations of the ordinary cultivators that ‘Tyrannical Song’s inheritance ceremony was just the beginning, and there would be another ceremony every month after that.’ Did they think that the planes of the universe were cabbages that could be picked up anywhere?","If it was so easy to succeed a Realm Lord, then there would not be only a few Realm Lords in the myriad worlds!","It was all thanks to Senior White’s blessing that No. Tyrannical Song had been able to pick up two incomplete worlds, fuse them together, and become the next Sector Master.","Song Shuhang didn’t even dare to think about picking up a sector lord every month!","Even if he was dreaming, he wouldn’t have such a ridiculous dream.","Congratulations, Shuhang, for becoming the master of a world.” Immortal Fairy White Bones waved her hand with a smile.","Congratulations, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.” The white-robed Golden Trigram rejected the title ‘little friend Shuhang’ from the bottom of his heart.","“Congratulations.” Fairy Feng Yi nodded.","Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, what are your thoughts after becoming the Realm Lord?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","Song Shuhang seriously pondered for a moment, and then replied,” I’m prepared to fully support ‘Miss Long Luo’ in developing the ‘cultivation’ chat client function. I’ll strive to improve the function as soon as possible, develop the VIP charging function and various benefits, and strive to establish the ‘charging system’.”","Customers were power, customers were money!","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","When Song Shuhang mentioned ‘Lady Long Luo’, Lady Long Luo seemed to have picked up the conversation.","‘It’s done.’ Madam Long Luo replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Done what? Could it be...The charging function and cash withdrawal function had already been created?","Miss Long Luo is awesome ~","‘I’ve developed the VIP trial function, but it’s not as long as six months. The VIP trial function can last up to one month. The amount of data that needs to be processed is too large. If the trial time is too long, it will affect the subsequent client upgrades.’ Madam Long Luo replied.","‘So fast?’ Song Shuhang immediately began to think of a script to flatter Lady Long Luo. He felt that he had to use at least 10,000 words of praise to describe how awesome Lady Long Luo was.","‘The VIP trial function already existed when the client was developed. This time, he only needed to adjust some of the data to activate the module. Therefore, it won’t take long.’ Madam Long Luo calmly replied, ‘So, I only needed to lose two strands of hair to settle it.’","Song Shuhang said, “Miss Long Luo, you are awesome ~”","He had no choice. Recently, he was at a loss for words. He wanted to flatter her, but he couldn’t think of a better word at the moment.","“You can distribute your wealth now,” Madam Long Luo said.","The members who downloaded the client for the universe would each be given a month’s worth of VIP trial qualifications.","“I almost forgot about giving away money.” Song Shuhang patted his forehead.","He immediately checked his ‘server announcement’ mode-it was alright, there was still a little bit of time left.","This little time was enough.","“Ahem.” Tyrannical Song, who was in the server announcement, finally spoke!","“Unfortunately, because the way the myriad worlds appear is different this time, I can’t satisfy everyone’s request for a speech. After all, he didn’t have the time. There is a time limit for the announcement. However...” Song Shuhang slowly said. Becoming a sector lord is indeed something worth celebrating. I’m willing to share this joy with all of you.”","It’s time to show the cultivators of the universe the forthright side of Tyrannical Song!"]},{"number":2818,"title":"Chapter 2818: Distributing VIPs Worth Trillions of Spirit Stones","paragraphs":["Chapter 2818: Distributing VIPs Worth Trillions of Spirit Stones","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","I am Tyrannical Song, and I’ve made an unprecedented decision. I’m going to distribute wealth to all the practitioners in the universe, giving them the right to use the ‘cultivation chat client VIP for a month,’ worth trillions of Ninth Stage spirit stones!","This is also the largest money-distribution ceremony in the history of the ‘money-distribution monarch.’","In the past, the ritual of the Wealth Throne only involved a small area. Anyone who was fated could come and get the treasures.","From ancient times until now, the largest scale of the Throne of Wealth ceremony had only involved a small city.","After all, distributing wealth was a blessing, not a heavy rain.","In one breath, Song Shuhang raised the scale of the ‘wealth distribution ceremony’ to the peak. From the small city level, it went beyond the provincial level, national level, planetary level, solar system level, silver system level, and universe level, directly rising to the peak of the ‘myriad universe.’","“Senior Tyrannical Song, are you going to share your joy with us?”","“But... how could he share joy? Could it be that Senior Tyrannical Song wants to describe his current mood to us?” someone asked doubtfully.","Next to him, a cultivator immediately replied, “Don’t use your own situation to guess Senior Tyrannical Song. You have to know that he can forcefully share the concept of ‘great motherly love’ with others. Moreover, don’t forget that during Senior Tyrannical Song’s last speech, he even put people in the place of ‘death’ and shared the experience of death with them. As long as Senior Tyrannical Song wants to do it, he can definitely do it.”","“Senior Tyrannical Song, what eye-bloodline technique did you develop that can forcibly make people happy?”","Many thoughts appeared in the minds of the cultivators in the myriad worlds.","In terms of speech, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had already become the authority in the field. No matter what kind of speech he wanted to come up with, most cultivators believed that Tyrannical Song could do it.","“Wealth Scattering King Level Expert.” At this time, Tyrannical Song, who was on the server announcement screen, raised his hand.","In his palm, the vortex of the Throne of Wealth spread out...","However, because this time, the VIP one-month trial qualification was about to be given away, the shelves of the Throne of Wealth were empty. There was nothing on them.","Opening the Wealth Throne Space was just a formality to fulfill the agreement with the three-eyed youth.","After opening the Wealth Scattering Throne, Song Shuhang’s mind moved, and he cooperated with Lady Long Luo’s ‘cultivation chat client.’","Soon after, Song Shuhang’s divine sense and Lady Long Luo’s mental energy connected with the big-eyed planet’s big shot who had chased into the Black Dragon World.","Song Shuhang discovered that his divine sense had easily penetrated the body of the big-eyed planet and was operating the main program of the ‘cultivation chat client.’","‘The big-eyed planet’s boss has been subdued by Lady Long Luo?’ Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","Otherwise, the planet would not have cooperated so well.","This dao artifact planet’s big shot was quite pitiful. He had packed himself up and sent himself to the Black Dragon World, a sheep entering the tiger’s den.","Rustle~","Following Song Shuhang’s actions, the Throne of Wealth could sense it.","On the server announcement screen of the myriad worlds, countless stars suddenly appeared from the Throne of Wealth...","These little stars sprinkled on every cultivator in the myriad worlds.","All the cultivators who had downloaded the cultivation chat app subconsciously reached out their hands to hold the starlight.","When the starlight came into contact with the cultivator’s palm, it melted like snowflakes, as if it had fused into the body of the cultivator from all over the universe. However, in fact, this process was just a formality for the ceremony of distributing wealth. It was purely beautiful and had no effect.","The real reward had long been activated and sent to all the cultivators through the server of the big-eyed planet.","Ding~ Congratulations, you’ve received the ‘cultivation chat client VIP function’ personally gifted by Tyrannical Song for a month. You will obtain the following privileges: Super Colorful Light Member Name, Self-portrait function, VIP chat font privilege function, member free advertisement function, live broadcast room top advertisement function, establish sect Group chats function, voice call trial function...","“Blocking designated friends for 7 days every month, reminder of friend’s death status.”","‘Great Gift Bag for Listening to Speeches Online: Listen to a speech of a Sixth Stage True Monarch once a month for free... A 40% discount to listen to the speech of a Seventh Stage Venerable... 30% discount to listen to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Speech... A 20% discount to listen to the Tribulation Transcender’s speech... There are also random Immortal lectures waiting for you to listen.’","“Every month, you will have the chance to instantly kill a top Immortal Chef and grab some new dishes.”","There was a long list of nearly 80 VIP privileges with all kinds of functions. Some of the functions were still in the trial period and only VIP customers were qualified to have them.","Some functions only had the framework, and the other supporting programs had not been developed yet.","“I can listen to a speech from a Sixth Stage True Monarch once a month for free?” For most ordinary cultivators, the speech of a Sixth Stage True Monarch was already very grand.","Normally, not to mention Sixth Stage True Monarchs, it would already be pretty good if the disciples of some large sects could listen to a speech by a Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor once a month.","It was only because the market was good this year that so many Profound Sages appeared. In addition, Big Boss Tyrannical Song had to give a speech once a month, which greatly improved the quality of what the practitioners in the universe heard.","In the past, he would never have dared to dream of listening to a Profound Sage Speech once a month.","Moreover, other than listening to the Profound Sage Speech, the VIP members also had the privilege of listening to Venerable Speeches, Profound Sage Speeches, and Tribulation Transcender Speeches. There were even Immortal speeches!","Although they had to pay spirit stones, they could still buy speeches from Profound Sages, Tribulation Transcenders, and Immortals. It was simply too profitable! Moreover, there was a VIP discount!","After the one-month trial period, he had to top up!","For practitioners from all over the universe, receiving a speech with a top-up was simply too tempting. Madam Long Luo immediately caught the main point.","As for the colorful member light and selfie profile pictures, they were not that important to normal cultivators.","But...","One of them was the function of ‘blocking designated friends for 7 days every month,’ which deeply attracted the attention of the two top Immortal bosses!","When the Demon Emperor saw this function in the notification message, his eyes lit up.","This was the function he wanted. Then, he had to block Tyrannical Song for seven days every month to avoid being taken advantage of.","“Since it’s a free VIP function, it’s not impossible for me to try it.” The Demon Emperor slowly spoke.","Then, he followed the instructions and started to receive the ‘VIP trial for a month’ function.","First, he opened the client and bound his account.","Then, he entered a line of ‘VIP Member Trial Code’ in the box on the top-up page.","‘Confirm to activate VIP membership function?’","“Yes.” Not only did the Demon Emperor click the confirm button.","A beautiful firework exploded on the client interface.","‘Congratulations to the user, Demon Emperor, you have become a distinguished VIP member... No way? You still want to get a free VIP? You’re dead~’","The blossoming fireworks turned into the face of Lady Long Luo.","The Demon Emperor was speechless."]},{"number":2819,"title":"Chapter 2819: Big Shot, Let’s Talk Business!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2819: Big Shot, Let’s Talk Business!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In this infinite universe, besides the Demon Emperor, there was another top-notch Immortal who couldn’t wait to register for the VIP one-month experience function.","Unlike the Demon Emperor, who had been marked with a special designation long ago, this Immortal successfully activated a month’s worth of VIP privileges.","[Congratulations to the veteran user [Blacklist 1·My Good Friend] Almighty Merchant, you have become a distinguished VIP user. Current level: Astral. Welcome to the ‘Cultivation Chat’ client. I wish you a happy life.]","“What about my nickname? What happened to the nickname I registered at the beginning? Why did it change back to this title?” the Almighty Merchant said unhappily.","After he downloaded the client, he finally managed to change himself to a cool nickname. However, as soon as he activated the VIP function, the nickname displayed on the client also synchronized back.","There was nothing wrong with Blacklist Number 1, but what the hell was “My Good Friend”? He and Tyrannical Song were good friends? What a joke!","And the VIP level of this star... at first glance, it was filled with the aura of money.","The Almighty Merchant was sure that Tyrannical Song might even introduce VIP VIP players in the future.","“This is really a good way to earn money,” the Almighty Merchant was tempted. Why not cooperate with Tyrannical Song?","Bah!","Cooperation? It was impossible in this lifetime!","I’ll blacklist Tyrannical Song for seven days.","[Do you want to use the VIP function to block specified users in your friend list?]","“Yes, sir!” The Almighty Merchant clicked to confirm.","[Please select a friend to block. You can use the voice function to read out your friend’s nickname or account. Note: Once you choose to block, your friend’s information will be locked for seven days. Please choose carefully.]","“Block Tyrannical Song,” the Almighty Merchant said.","[No friends found for ‘Tyrannical Song.’ Please manually select a friend to block.]","The Almighty Merchant was confused.","Impossible, Tyrannical Song has always been in my friend list; how could I not find him?","Could it be... friends in the blacklist function could not be blocked?","The Almighty Merchant suddenly had a guess.","He hurriedly opened his friend list and clicked on the blacklist.","Tyrannical Song was alone on the blacklist—but his nickname wasn’t “Tyrannical Song.”","[Server. Cheng Goudan. Group Owner] Song Shuhang.","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","“No wonder I couldn’t find Tyrannical Song. I didn’t expect him to change his name. If I hadn’t blocked him, I might not have been able to find his real body.” After the Almighty Merchant said that, he manually added [Server·Cheng Goudan·Group Owner] Song Shuhang to the blocked list.","[Ding ~ Blocking friend [Server. Cheng Goudan. Group Leader] Song Shuhang has been successful. This friend will be blocked for seven days. During these seven days, you will not receive any private messages, voice messages, or calls from him. If you are in the same group as him, you will also automatically block his messages.]","“Awesome!” the Almighty Merchant said happily.","This function was simply amazing.","Moreover, this was only the level 1 VIP privilege. In the future, the level 1 VIP and level 2 VIP might be able to block their friends for a longer period of time. Perhaps they could block their friends for a whole month?","So...","Do I need to renew it after the one-month VIP trial is over?","Wouldn’t paying a fee to Tyrannical Song be the same as paying money?","Wouldn’t that be equivalent to paying protection fees to Tyrannical Song?","It was inappropriate.","This kind of behavior was inappropriate and undignified!","Why don’t I just pawn “Anything Can Enter Fairy Maiden” as collateral?","Just as the Almighty Merchant was thinking about this problem, Tyrannical Song, who was the ‘server’ in the air, received real-time feedback.","A VIP customer had blocked him!","Song Shuhang: “???”","As the carrier of the ‘cultivation chat’ function and the server itself, all kinds of information would first be calculated by the big-eyed planet boss’s client server, and then the simplified amount would be fed back to Song Shuhang.","“Who’s blocking me for seven days?” Song Shuhang doubtfully called up the background data.","Then, he saw that [Blacklist 1·My Good Friend] could sell anything that had blocked him from the data display.","“Big Boss, this is really heartbreaking,” Song Shuhang said.","He didn’t expect the Almighty Merchant to still be wary of him even after working together so many times.","“After being blocked by the VIP function, I won’t be able to communicate with Senior Almighty Merchant for the next seven days. How am I supposed to talk business with him?” Song Shuhang rubbed the space between his eyebrows.","Just now, when he saw the option [Pay a random fee to listen to an Immortal’s speech], Song Shuhang immediately thought of the Almighty Merchant, as well as the pendants he had on him.","He had originally wanted to invite the Almighty Merchant to enter the ‘cultivation chat’ client’s speech channel. If he was interested, the Almighty Merchant could take the time to “sell a batch of Immortal speeches.”","After all, in the universe, apart from Song Shuhang’s pendants, only the Almighty Merchant would have the opportunity to be moved by ordinary things like spirit stones and sell himself to give a speech.","If the big shot was willing, Song Shuhang was even prepared to exempt the “service fee.” The big shot would keep all the spirit stones that his Immortal Speech was sold for!","With the activation of the new function, fame was very important. The “Immortal Speech” could become a golden signboard.","In the end, before he could talk business with the Almighty Merchant, the other party rejected him.","“I have no choice but to use the server’s notification function to communicate with the Almighty Merchant,” Song Shuhang sighed.","While he was in deep thought, the “server announcement” mode ended, and Song Shuhang’s figure disappeared.","This money-sharing ceremony was a great success.","The practitioners of the myriad worlds were immersed in studying the VIP function, trying out new functions one after another.","Senior Three-Eyed was very satisfied with Tyrannical Song’s “wealth distribution ceremony.”","The wider the scope of the wealth distribution ceremony, the greater the influence, and the more feedback the three-eyed youth would receive.","This was the first time Senior Three-Eyed felt that little friend Song Shuhang was so cute.","On the other side.","The Almighty Merchant was also casually flipping through the functions of the Cultivation Chat client.","Business opportunities, he saw many hidden business opportunities in this!","“Perhaps I can let Fairy of Everything seize the business opportunity here.” The big shot pinched his chin and pondered.","Just as he was immersed in the endless business opportunities and could not extricate himself, a system message popped up.","[System Message–System Pixie, Squirrel: Dear VIP member of the Almighty Merchant, hello, do you have time now? Can you spare some time to discuss a business deal with us?]","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","A little squirrel?","This seemed to be the system spirit of the Cultivation Chat.","However, the tone of their conversation...","“Tyrannical Song?” the Almighty Merchant replied.","[System Message–Little Squirrel Branded Hand: F*ck, Senior Almighty Merchant, you can recognize me just like that? I even used a mechanical tone to chat with you.]","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","F*ck, it really was Tyrannical Song!","There’s actually a system message? Then what’s the point of me blocking him for seven days?"]},{"number":2820,"title":"Chapter 2820: I Have No Problem With That","paragraphs":["Chapter 2820: I Have No Problem With That","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","I was also naive. I knew that Tyrannical Song was the main server for the “cultivation chat” function, but I still believed that a level VIP could block Tyrannical Song’s nonsense.","The rules were set by them. In their territory, what did they have to fight with them?","The Almighty Merchant looked up at the sky, not wanting to speak.","In fact, when he used his VIP privilege to block Tyrannical Song for seven days, the Almighty Merchant had already guessed this possibility.","Because of this, when Song Shuhang used the system’s little fairy, “Little Squirrel That Hurts My Hand,” to contact him, he immediately guessed Tyrannical Song’s true identity.","It was just that sometimes, even though people clearly knew the outcome and the final possibility of something, they would always hold a certain kind of magical fluke mentality that was beneficial to them.","It was precisely because of this fluke mentality that the Almighty Merchant used his special privilege to try and block Tyrannical Song. What if he succeeded, right?","Even if the chances were slim, it was free anyway, so why not give it a try?","[System Message – Pushing Squirrel: It seems that Senior Almighty Merchant knows me very well! I can’t hide it from you even with my disguise. As expected, the two of us have the potential to become best friends.]","“Your mom is calling you home for dinner,” the Almighty Merchant replied coldly.","[System Message – Pushing Squirrel: Senior, I’m an Eighth Stage Profound Sage, after all. I’ve long since fasted. Moreover, my mother is currently staying in the scholarly world. She won’t call me home for dinner if there’s nothing...]","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","Song Shuhang, who was far away on the other side of the “cultivation chat,” faintly smiled. How could it be so easy to get me to scram?","Some words, as long as you don’t say them clearly, I can fool you by pretending to be stupid.","The Almighty Merchant knew him very well. He also had a certain understanding of his personality.","[System Message – Pushing Squirrel: Senior Almighty Merchant, let’s be frank. I have a good business here and want to cooperate with you. Speaking of which, it’s very troublesome for us to communicate through the system messages. Why don’t I use my backstage authority to remove your level 1 VIP’s “block friends for seven days”? Let’s have a good night chat over wine?]","“Get lost!” This time, the Almighty Merchant couldn’t help but put it on the table.","It’s fine if you use the system message to isolate me. Now, you want to use the host privilege to unlock my VIP function? You slapped my left cheek, and now you want to turn me over and slap my right cheek?","Don’t even think about it!","No matter how troublesome it was to communicate with the system, I refused to remove the “block friends for seven days.”","[Little Squirrel: Senior, you’re really awkward. Then let’s talk about our cooperation. Senior, you saw it just now. My “cultivation chat” function has already activated the “speech channel” function. Senior Almighty Merchant, are you interested in occasionally coming to this “Speech Channel” area to open a “standing speech” qualification? As the first Immortal to be stationed here, I can give you a discount. You don’t have to pay a single cent for the spirit stones you get from each speech. Are you interested in selling the “Immortal Speech” project?]","After hearing Song Shuhang’s suggestion, the Almighty Merchant’s expression slightly changed—he was tempted!","After all, he could naturally see the great potential of Song Shuhang’s “cultivation chat.”","Users were money, and having enough users meant having everything.","If all the cultivators in the universe became dependent on the cultivation chat client and got used to its existence, then Tyrannical Song would be in control of an unlimited spirit stone mine.","The Almighty Merchant had been thinking about whether or not he should encourage his disciples to enter Tyrannical Song’s “cultivation chat client,” so that he could make use of this platform to make a fortune.","But now, Tyrannical Song had taken the initiative to give him the opportunity to cooperate.","Although it was just a collaboration to start a “stay-at-home speech,” everything had to have a beginning. Once the “station-to-station speech” was successful, other collaborations between him and Tyrannical Song could also be initiated in the future.","Faced with such a huge temptation, the Almighty Merchant could not help but be tempted.","In the universe, if one wanted to use spirit stones to exchange for an Immortal’s smile, they could only buy it from the Almighty Merchant.","“Why isn’t it Fellow Daoist White? If Fellow Daoist White was the one who had this ‘cultivation chat’ function, then I would have directly agreed to enter and have a pleasant cooperation with him. But why Tyrannical Song?” the Almighty Merchant said softly.","[Little Squirrel: Uh... If you want Senior White to invite you, that’s not a problem. I have many types of Senior White here. Which Senior White do you want to invite?]","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","[Little Squirrel: How is it, Senior? Have you considered it?]","The Almighty Merchant sighed.","On the other side was the loathsome Tyrannical Song, the person he had blacklisted.","On the other hand, there was a business opportunity with unlimited potential. Once he grasped this business opportunity, his career would reach a higher level.","Senior Almighty Merchant’s heart was at war with the heavens.","His thoughts kept wandering between agreement and disagreement.","[Little Squirrel: Senior, why don’t you change your way of thinking? How about I spend a lot of money to buy your live broadcast of the “Immortal Speech”? Would you be able to accept a deal that gives you money?]","When the Almighty Merchant heard this, he tried to change his train of thought. As expected, he seemed to be able to accept it.","After all, no matter how much he tried to blacklist Tyrannical Song, the business was innocent, the spirit stones were innocent, and blacklisting Tyrannical Song wouldn’t affect his income.","“Master, what are you doing?” Just as he was thinking, the voice of a fairy sounded in his ears.","“Yes, someone wants to buy my ‘Immortal Speech’...” the Almighty Merchant replied.","“You look conflicted. Aren’t you going to sell it?” Fairy There’s Anything asked curiously. “Then why don’t I sell it? Give me the script of the ‘Immortal Speech,’ and I’ll go up and speak. After this is done, we will split the spirit stones 70 – 30, I will take 70, and you will take 30.”","The Almighty Merchant was confused.","Recently, my cute disciple has become more and more proficient in her work. This was obviously a tactic of “raising the price on the spot and paying back the money on the land.”","“60 – 40, I’ll take 60 and you take 40.” The Almighty Merchant sighed. Although he had seen through his disciple’s trick, he still returned the price to his disciple because of his doting heart.","Fairy Almighty smiled and said, “Deal! You can earn 40% just by talking. I’m so happy!”","[Gripped Squirrel: Alright, then I’ll just find whatever I want to chat with Fairy. I still have to rely on the system message to chat with you, Senior. It’s too troublesome to operate.]","The Almighty Merchant was speechless.","Suddenly, he felt like he had been abandoned."]},{"number":2821,"title":"Chapter 2821: Exercising Heavenly Authority with a Mortal Body","paragraphs":["Chapter 2821: Exercising Heavenly Authority with a Mortal Body","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He felt that Tyrannical Song had abandoned him too quickly. Why didn’t he try to persuade him to stay?","This made the Almighty Merchant feel like he had lost his value.","A few breaths later, Fairy “Anything Can Enter” smiled and said, “Alright, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, let’s sign the contract.”","In just a few words, she and Song Shuhang reached an agreement. She would replace her master in Tyrannical Song’s “speech channel” and become the first “resident speaker.” In addition to occasionally receiving the “Immortal Speech Manuscript” from her master, she would also handle the “Tribulation Transcender Speech” project.","“Happy cooperation,” Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Anything Can Enter smiled slightly. “Pleasure working with you.”","The entire process was so swift it was suffocating. The Almighty Merchant even suspected that his beloved disciple had already joined forces with Tyrannical Song to cheat him out of the “Immortal Speech Manuscript.”","On the other side, after Song Shuhang and Fairy Anything Can Enter signed the contract that Lady Long Luo had prepared beforehand, Lady Long Luo officially launched the “Trial Version of the Speech Channel” function.","As the cultivators in the universe who had downloaded the “cultivation chat client” eagerly anticipated it, the area of the speech channel that had originally been displayed as “waiting to be opened” was slowly unsealed.","Miss Long Luo asked, “During the process of opening the speech channel, do you want to draw the support of Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s main body?”","“The support of my laws? What laws do I have that can support the speech channel?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","“Pseudo Immortal Law Information, Profound Sage Speech Law Fragment, Profound Sage Speech Space Land,” Madam Long Luo reminded.","In addition to the omnipotent “pseudo-eternal law” on Tyrannical Song, there was also a bit of information about the “Profound Sage Speech” rules. When Song Shuhang had condensed the Sage Name “Tyrannical Annihilation” and during the speech segment where the Wielder of the Will had collapsed, his consciousness had increased infinitely, and he had come into contact with a little bit of information about the rules of the Profound Sage Speech.","That was a very special and exceptional experience. It was compensation for the natural law forcefully interfering with Song Shuhang’s process of condensing the Sage Seal and changing his Sage Name to “Tyrannical Annihilation.”","Borrowing the sublimation of his soul, Song Shuhang’s consciousness rose infinitely and finally came into contact with a bit of information about the Profound Sage Speech that ordinary people could not come into contact with. Unfortunately, at that time, his consciousness had separated from the “Profound Sage Speech” as soon as it came into contact with it. He had only comprehended a tiny bit of information about the rules. It could not even be considered superficial.","“Can my little bit of information about the rules of the Profound Sage Speech be of use?” Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","“I’m here,” Lady Long Luo replied confidently. Although her Black Dragon World was pitifully small, it was still well-equipped. The Black Dragon World also had a law similar to the “Prominent Divinity.”","The rules of the two worlds were different, but Ma’am Long Luo could rely on Song Shuhang’s “Profound Sage Speech” to correspond to it and make up for it to a certain extent. With this little bit of information about the Profound Sage Speech rules and Ma’am Long Luo’s support, it was strong support for the [Cultivation Chat Platform]’s speech channel.","“Alright, then go ahead and draw. I’ll give you access,” Song Shuhang replied.","As for the plot of land in the Profound Sage Speech space, it had now become the 100th floor of Song Shuhang’s tomb. That piece of land was a part of the “Profound Sage Speech Platform.” Later, it was directly cut out and brought into the main world.","“The plot of land in the Profound Sage Speech space has already become a part of my tomb. I’m afraid I can’t cut it out,” Song Shuhang added to Madam Long Luo.","“Host... We can set up the server of the speech channel on your Tomb of Immortality and make it a dedicated sub-server. This way, it can also reduce the pressure on the big-eyed planet server,” Madam Long Luo replied calmly.","The structure of the Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue was based on the blueprint of the Dao Weapon “Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber” and the structure of the “Immortal Tomb” designed by the Immortal. It had unlimited potential and was enough to bear the traffic of the “sub-server.”","Furthermore, Madam Long Luo had a strategic vision that was extremely far-sighted! It wasn’t just the speech channel. If the conditions permitted, she also wanted to build a new “sub-server” for the various new functions of the cultivation chat client in the future.","Now that Song Shuhang had become the “Sector Lord,” he had a complete plane of existence and more space to operate. In the future, in Song Shuhang’s “Tyrannical Realm,” every planet and every star could become a sub-server for a certain function of the “cultivation chat.”","Madam Long Luo had long since been calculating carefully.","“Alright, then I’ll move the tomb of Nine Virtues into my overlord realm. I’ll give you the authority to move the Immortal Tomb,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“I’ll be done in five minutes,” Lady Long Luo confidently replied to Song Shuhang. She was in a very good mood today, probably because she had just fought the “Demon Emperor” head-on. Her only joy now was to get up and upgrade the “cultivation chat” function.","Four minutes and fifty seconds later, under the watchful eyes of everyone, the Cultivation Chat Client-Speech Channel was officially launched! A large number of cultivators eagerly entered this functional area. When their consciousness merged into the speech channel, they suddenly felt something.","“This feeling... I can’t be wrong. It’s the feeling from the Profound Sage Speech!” A fellow Daoist with sharp senses asked in surprise.","After all, over the past few months, the cultivators of the myriad worlds had been baptized by the various Profound Sages’ speeches. They were very sensitive to the state of the “Profound Sage-level Speech.”","“Tyrannical Song’s speech channel actually gives people the feeling of experiencing a Profound Sage Speech. I feel like a Profound Sage is about to vindicate his Dao and wants to look up at the sky!”","“Theoretically speaking, Tyrannical Song’s ‘speech channel’ is indeed somewhat similar to the Profound Sage Speech... For example, the audience were all cultivators from the myriad worlds. The scale is similarly enormous.”","“Will the power of virtue gather?” At this moment, someone raised a crucial question. Since Tyrannical Song’s “speech channel” could give people the feeling of a “Profound Sage Speech,” would someone receive a large amount of merit after giving a “speech” to the practitioners of the universe through this platform, just like the “Profound Sage Speech”?","“I’m not sure if the power of virtue will gather, but I’m sure that the speech in the speech channel will definitely be the focus of attention!”","“Especially the first member who tries to give a speech. He will definitely be remembered by fellow Daoists from all over the universe!”","At present, no big shot had gone on stage in this speech channel. Therefore, once someone opened a forum to give a speech, it would definitely attract everyone’s attention.","In the future, there might be many big shots giving speeches at the same time in a speech channel, diverting a large number of viewers. Then, who would be the first to eat the crab? The cultivators began to look forward to it.","On the other side, some top-tier Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals were stunned when they entered the speech channel. Ordinary cultivators had limited vision and thinking, so they could not see that far. However, the top-tier Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals were able to see further and think more thoroughly. Tyrannical Song’s “speech channel” was clearly using a mortal body to exercise the authority of the Heavenly Dao!","After condensing half of the ruler of the Netherworld with his mortal body, Tyrannical Song had finally extended his demonic claws into the forbidden Heavenly Dao’s jurisdiction."]},{"number":2822,"title":"Chapter 2822: Tyrannical Song’s Boosters","paragraphs":["Chapter 2822: Tyrannical Song’s Boosters","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon careful reflection, from Tyrannical Song’s “Profound Sage-Level Speeches to Verify His Own Great Dao” to his subsequent series of actions, one can see that every step he took was meticulously planned.","Back then, when Tyrannical Song’s clone challenged the experts of the myriad worlds on Mars, many people noticed that his clone had the aura of the Netherworld.","And now, Tyrannical Song’s “Netherworld Ruler Clone” finally revealed itself to the myriad worlds.","Additionally, he now possessed the authority of the Heavenly Dao as a cultivator!","‘Tyrannical Song, could this be some kind of alternative method?’","This thought appeared in the minds of many Immortals and was impossible to shake off.","‘From Tyrannical Song’s series of actions, it seems he wants to infiltrate the various Heavenly Dao authorities before proving his immortality.’","“I want all the abilities of the Wielder of the Will, but I don’t want to bear the responsibility of the Wielder of the Will.” This was probably the feeling Tyrannical Song gave everyone.","‘Can this really be done?’ an Immortal asked, puzzled.","‘If it’s Tyrannical Song... perhaps he could really do this? After all, Tyrannical Song has repeatedly shattered our understanding. Before this, who would have thought a mortal could rule the Netherworld and condense the body of the Netherworld Ruler? Before Tyrannical Song, who would have thought mortals could wield the power of the Heavenly Dao? It feels like anything is possible in front of Tyrannical Song.’ This Immortal was simply a fanatic, crazily praising Tyrannical Song.","In the void, the divine senses of these Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders, who had already stepped into the embryonic form of their own Great Dao, crossed many planes and communicated with each other.","Because Tyrannical Song had shocked the myriad worlds time and time again, these Immortals who were paying attention to him had unknowingly gathered into a group.","Although they hadn’t met each other, whenever Tyrannical Song made big news, their divine senses would gather and secretly communicate.","‘Speaking of which, it’s a little tiring for us to communicate like this. We have to cross several planes every time. It’s very troublesome.’ As they spoke, a big shot suddenly spoke.","‘Why don’t we set up a group on Tyrannical Song’s “Cultivation Chat” client and communicate in the group?’ Immediately, a big shot put forward a very feasible suggestion.","‘But... would there be any restrictions on the “Cultivation Chat” client? For example, like the ancient Heavenly City, which would bind the Immortal’s own Dao and prevent the Immortal from escaping?’ a big shot said warily. This seemed to be a big shot who understood the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City.","‘I’ve tried this before. I specially created a clone that could cut off contact with the main body. I asked him to download a “Cultivation Chat” client and conducted research. In my research, this “client” doesn’t have any restrictions... even if there is a problem, you can delete this client at any time without any restrictions.’ Another Immortal big shot said, ‘Moreover, I think it’s not just me. Everyone here should have studied this “Cultivation Chat” client. After all, it was something Tyrannical Song created. I don’t believe everyone wouldn’t be curious.’","‘Indeed, this fellow daoist is right. I also secretly tested Tyrannical Song’s “client,” and so far, I haven’t found any problems.’","‘Me too. Moreover, since Tyrannical Song has sent out a month’s worth of VIP functions, we can take the opportunity to create a group so that everyone can communicate with each other. Otherwise, it won’t be easy to create another group after this month,’ another Immortal said.","Then, with the help of the big shot who had used his clone to research the Cultivation Chat client, these Immortal big shots and the Tribulation Transcenders who had condensed their own fledgling Great Dao finally agreed to establish a group.","The name of the group was “Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group.”","‘Group Owner: Black and White Dragon Lady-Fairy He Cheng. It was this Fairy He Cheng who suggested creating the group, so she was naturally in charge of creating the group.’","‘Administrator: Lord of the Ancient Realm-Lady Half Moon’","There were also a few other administrators, all of whom were extremely powerful Immortals.","There was the Primordial Demoness. She was the first Demoness in the myriad worlds and the ancestor of the Demoness system.","There was the Sage of Beast Tamer. He was the founder of the Summoner’s cultivation system, but he did not enter the path of immortality through summoning. His path of immortality was very mysterious and unknown to date.","The members of the group were all top existences.","For example, there was a certain master from the Titanium Temple. His fame spread far and wide, and his physical combat strength was extraordinary, causing the evil devils and heretics of several planes to tremble.","Another example was “Saint Scythe Heavenly King.” He was a survivor of the ancient Heavenly City. It was said that after the destruction of the Heavenly City, he had obtained a new opportunity and had already condensed the embryonic form of his path to immortality. He could become an Immortal at any time.","There was also a big shot who didn’t reveal his real name, and his nickname was “My Family Has A Twin Eggs.” Although he didn’t reveal his true identity, everyone could vaguely sense how powerful he was during the previous “Immortal Divine Sense Interdimensional Communication.” He was incomparably powerful!","The reason why these members didn’t ask for the “administrator” authority was because everyone’s realm was there. Other than undying, they didn’t care about the title.","In this way, a group of Immortal big shots and top-notch Tribulation Transcenders who had stepped into the embryonic form of their own path, the Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group, was established with the cooperation of Cheng Goudan, Madam Long Luo, Goudan’s father who had been dragged into this double act, and the great master of the Titanium Temple.","It was equivalent to a group of top Immortals becoming stable users of Tyrannical Song’s “Cultivation Chat” client.","These top users could not be underestimated. Each of them had extraordinary influence in their own plane. Moreover, they were the most precious resources.","“Done. Thank you for your cooperation, Fairy Goudan,” Lady Long Luo thanked Fairy Cheng Goudan.","In order to develop the “Cultivation Chat” client as quickly as possible, the programmer Long Luo personally went to work and created a side account to chat with the Immortals and brag about Tyrannical Song.","Fairy Cheng Goudan was the assistant that Madam Long Luo had contacted. After all, Madam Long Luo was so busy that she didn’t even have time to clean up her hair.","Sometimes, when she was too busy, she would need Fairy Cheng Goudan to come on her alternate account and guide the conversation among the Immortals.","And Fairy Cheng Goudan didn’t disappoint Madam Long Luo. She guided the Immortals’ conversation time and time again, causing the Immortals to unknowingly have many beautiful misunderstandings about Tyrannical Song.","Recently, Tyrannical Song had been blown up time and time again, and his influence among the Immortals was growing. Aside from Tyrannical Song’s unceasing actions and the news that kept coming out, the credit of these “Tyrannical Boasting” troopers behind the scenes couldn’t be ignored!","And this matter... even Tyrannical Song himself didn’t know!","“No need to thank us, Ms. Chubby Ball. We enjoyed it too. Do you have any new targets?” Fairy Cheng Lin asked.","“I don’t have any for now. I need time to digest these resources of Immortals and use them reasonably. If you are free, you can find a group of targets and operate according to this mode,” replied Lady Long Luo."]},{"number":2823,"title":"Chapter 2823: New Year’s, Giving Everyone One Billion Cultivation Chat Coins as Red Packets","paragraphs":["Chapter 2823: New Year’s, Giving Everyone One Billion Cultivation Chat Coins as Red Packets","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Alright, I’ll go find another group of Tribulation Transcenders and see if I can brag about Tyrannical Song again and establish a top-notch Tribulation Transcender Tyrannical Song group chat,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","It was clear how free Fairy Cheng Lin had been recently. She was so free that she was willing to become a troll for free and promote Tyrannical Song.","“In addition, Miss Fat Ball, I feel that if you can sometimes compile a Boasting Manual, I can lead the newcomers to promote Shuhang and build up his momentum,” Fairy Cheng Lin added.","“After upgrading the client this time, I’ll see if I can come up with something to attract the interest of the users,” Lady Long Luo dutifully accepted Fairy Cheng Lin’s suggestion. Of course, something like the “Blowing Manual” was too awkward, so she wouldn’t do it.","This time, she mainly became a temporary braggart to attract this batch of top-notch Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders.","“Forget it, I’ll see if I can make a booklet myself. Lady Fatty Ball, you’re too busy. I’ll do it myself,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","“Yes,” Long Luo replied simply.","Seeing that Madam Long Luo was busy with work again, Fairy Cheng Lin did not disturb her any further. She turned around and began to plan her own fun.","On the other side.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“Cultivation chat client? Today, little friend Shuhang has finally become a server,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator sighed.","In fact, on the day little friend Song Shuhang established the Nine Provinces Number Two Group and developed the talent of ‘cultivation chat,’ the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had already guessed this possibility.","Sure enough, in just a few months, Song Shuhang had turned himself into a server for the myriad worlds.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer replied, “The important thing is that he even created an online speech channel. I feel like I should @ someone at this moment, but I can’t remember who.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s words reminded me of someone, and I vaguely remember that this fellow daoist has something to do with the ‘online speech channel: a free speech for a month for Sixth Stage True Monarchs,’” Fairy Lychee frowned and replied.","“Where’s Senior Yellow Mountain? If it was Senior Yellow Mountain, perhaps he would have remembered something,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer asked.","Doudou replied, “Stupid Yellow Mountain and one of Shuhang’s clones went to the depths of the universe to take risks. It seems like he was going to take out some treasures and give them to his fellow daoists as new year gifts. After all, it will be the new year in a few days.”","“So fast. Has another year passed in the ordinary human world?” Cave Lord Snow Wolf said slowly.","As cultivators, their concept of time was different from that of ordinary people. A year might not be a short time for ordinary people, but for cultivators, a year was really insignificant.","“Is it fast? I feel that this year hasn’t passed too quickly...” “Perhaps too many things have happened this year,” Fairy Dongfang Six said. “I feel that this year has been especially fulfilling.”","“I have to go find Shuhang,” When the Bright Moon Appears replied.","“For example, this year, little friend Tyrannical Song has become a Profound Sage and is no longer a fake,” Fairy Dongfang Snow giggled.","“Indeed, this year feels particularly fulfilling because little friend Shuhang and Senior White came out of seclusion,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator concluded. “It has been a very contradictory year. It felt like time was still the same as before—time passed very quickly, and in the blink of an eye, a year had passed. However, I also feel that time is passing very slowly. I’ve watched little friend Shuhang grow until now, but it hasn’t even been the new year yet.”","“It’s rare that Senior White hasn’t gone back to his secluded meditation this time, and the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group are quite complete this year. Why don’t we get together this year?” Fairy Lychee suggested.","“We definitely have to get together. I’m already looking forward to Senior Yellow Mountain giving us some new year gifts,” Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman appeared and smiled happily.","Great Master Profound Principle sent a thumbs-up emoji.","Medicine Master: “[Voice Transmission], static ~” I don’t know what Medicine Master is doing. It’s just static, and I can vaguely hear Riverly Purple Mist’s voice.","“Speaking of which...Shouldn’t Shuhang give everyone red packets? He is now a Profound Sage! He can’t possibly ask us to give him red packets, right? How can a group of Fifth and Sixth Stage cultivators give Red Envelopes to Eighth Stage Profound Sages during the New Year?” Doudou suddenly reminded.","Although the Nine Provinces Number One Group was different from an official sect, the relationship between the seniors and juniors in the group wasn’t completely based on strength and realm.","In Song Shuhang’s heart, the seniors in the group would always be seniors and would always change.","However, Doudou’s words made sense. Were they going to give little friend Shuhang red packets during the new year?","Immortal Master Copper Trigram said, “I’m finally online again... Little friend Shuhang giving everyone red packets? Ahahaha, don’t make things too difficult for little friend Shuhang. He spent a lot of money, so he did not have many spirit stones and treasures on hand. If you’re desperate, be careful that he develops a ‘cultivation chat coin’ function and gives everyone one billion ‘cultivation chat coins’ every year to become VIP members.”","Doudou was speechless.","As long as it imagined this scene, its face would be filled with despair.","“When the time comes, let’s give Shuhang’s disciples red packets,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator suggested a more appropriate plan. “Giving little friend Shuhang a red packet is indeed a bit strange. Therefore, it’s appropriate to give this red packet to his disciple instead.”","“Old Northern River is still the most reliable,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer liked it.","At the moment, the Nine Provinces Number One Group couldn’t do without Senior Yellow Mountain, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator, and Senior White.","Although Senior White was sometimes unreliable, he could be used to suppress a group of people. He was the strongest mascot.","While the fellow daoists of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were happily discussing the new year, a scholar quickly contacted Song Shuhang. “Shuhang, are you there? Do you still have the chance to listen to the free speech of a Sixth Stage True Monarch once a month?”","After Song Shuhang suddenly received the message from the internal channel of the ‘elder function plate,’ he was slightly stunned.","Who is this? Have I added him before?","There wasn’t even a nickname or daoist name.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment, and then his heart suddenly moved.","Wait a minute... It was him.","It was ten million yuan!","Fortunately, after developing the ‘cultivation chat’ function, he, as the ‘main server,’ had some privileges, which offset the special effect of the ‘ten million phone bill household.’","“How terrifying! My primordial spirit is now as strong as a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, or even stronger, but I’m still unable to resist the effects of Scholar’s cultivation technique,” Song Shuhang sighed.","Then, he replied to Scholar Fei Dian, “Senior, the opportunity to give the speech is still available. However, didn’t Senior already advance to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm?”","He vaguely remembered that the scholar had advanced to the Seventh Stage, but he couldn’t remember clearly.","“It doesn’t matter. A speech of the Sixth Stage by a Seventh Stage is more effective. Give me this opportunity, how about it? If it’s possible, I’ll buy all the free lectures of the Sixth Stage every month for the year 2020!” Scholar Phone Bill said. “In return, I can take you to the cultivation mystic realm passed down from my ancestors. If you were lucky, you could obtain a BUFF that weakened the effects of the heavenly tribulation...","Eh, did I bring your ghost spirit into that secret realm? Why can’t I remember?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","You give me lectures for free every month, and you even repay me?","For Scholar Fei’s faction to be able to persist until today, it was definitely the heavens and earth that were pitying them.","“There’s no need to repay Senior. There’s no need to be so polite between us. Senior, if you want, you can come and give a speech at any time. I’m more than happy to do so,” Song Shuhang replied.","Also... My ghost spirit fairy has been to the mystic realm of the scholar faction? Why can’t I remember clearly?","The Scholar faction would be finished sooner or later!"]},{"number":2824,"title":"Chapter 2824: Such a Handsome and Charismatic Scholar","paragraphs":["Chapter 2824: Such a Handsome and Charismatic Scholar","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Thereupon, Song Shuhang secretly gave up on the idea of venturing into the ancestral secret realm of the scholars.","He didn’t want to end up like Scholar Ten Million Phone Bill, turning into an invisible person who was permanently passive.","Being invisible was very useful sometimes. For instance, when he was being chased all over the world by the fat ball and its remains, Song Shuhang longed for the small, invisible body of a scholar.","However, aside from that, the permanent passive state of being invisible would bring great trouble to life. For example, when you were forgotten by your biological parents and the new parents decided to have their “first” child, there was the terrifying possibility of being forgotten by your loved ones.","Speaking of which, I wonder if Senior Scholar has ever been in a relationship? These thoughts flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind, and he felt even more pity for the scholar.","‘Senior Scholar has already reached this realm. We have to treat him well. Before we completely forget him, we have to cherish every moment that he exists in our memories.’","“Senior, do you have a Sixth Stage speech now? If you do, why don’t you come up now and give a lecture to attract some attention?” Song Shuhang suggested.","Since the cultivators in the universe had just downloaded the ‘cultivation chat client’ not long ago and had received his generous VIP trial permission, the number of online users should be at its peak.","If he immediately launched the ‘free speech of the Sixth Stage’ function at this time, he would be able to attract more users to watch it at once. Besides, before the spirit stone charging system was completed, only the ‘speech of the Sixth Stage True Monarch’ that was free to watch could be activated as the first step.","The contracts for the ‘Tribulation Transcender Speech’ and the ‘Immortal Speech’ that he had signed with Fairy Anything Can Enter would only be officially released after the ‘cultivation chat client’ was upgraded.","“You can go up and give a speech now?” Scholar Ten Million Phone Bill asked.","Little friend Shuhang had formed many groups to give speeches, but he hadn’t been brought along to play. However, the rules of this ‘First Free Speech of the Sixth Stage’ weren’t much weaker than the Profound Sage Speech.","Moreover, because it was the first time this function was being shown, the first time would have a very special meaning.","People could only remember the special significance of the first, while the second was often easily overlooked.","“Of course,” Song Shuhang replied. “As long as you’re ready to give a speech of the Sixth Stage, we can start anytime.”","“Then there’s no need to wait. I’ve prepared a lot of Sixth Stage speeches. In fact, I’ve prepared a speech for every level,” Scholar Ten Million said.","He was preparing for his future disciple. In the past, he also wanted to take in a disciple, just like many fellow Daoists in the group.","However, as his cultivation level increased and his sense of existence became lower and lower, the kind scholar temporarily gave up on the idea of ‘taking in a disciple.’ Moreover, he was afraid that his disciple would forget about him as he taught. How heart-wrenching would that scene be?","In fact, if his disciple was talented, he might even forget about his disciple as he practiced. That was double the pain.","Therefore, before he found a way to break it, he was not prepared to take in a disciple easily.","“I can’t wait to go on stage and give a speech. This might very well be the only shining opportunity in my life,” Scholar Ten Million revealed a sincere smile.","Sometimes, the happiness of a Seventh Stage Venerable was as simple as that.","“Senior, I’ll send you the contract. After you sign it, the backstage will open a channel for you to enter the ‘Speech Channel-Sixth Stage Speech Platform.’ At the same time, I’ll also give you the authority to give a speech at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm. After the function of charging spirit stones is perfected, you can give a speech to a Seventh Stage Venerable as well, in addition to the free speech of the Sixth Stage every month,” Song Shuhang’s heart ached for the scholar, and he tried his best to show his gentle side.","“Send it to me. I’ll sign it now,” Scholar Ten Million said. At this time, even if it was a slave contract, he would sign it without hesitation.","Song Shuhang sent the contract that Madam Long Luo had prepared beforehand to the scholar from the backstage.","Scholar Drunken Eyes glanced through the contract and signed his name on it before sending it back.","Opposite him.","After receiving the feedback from the contract, Song Shuhang frowned.","Although he had forgotten what the scholar’s Daoist name was, he felt that it shouldn’t be this ‘Drunken Eye.’ It should be a word or two that was very similar to this ‘Eye.’","“Scholar, is your signature correct?” Song Shuhang asked tentatively.","“Don’t worry, I can’t be wrong. I’ve always been Drunken Eye. You must have forgotten my Daoist name, right? Don’t worry, I’m already used to it. You don’t have to be afraid of pricking my heart,” Scholar Ten Million Dollar mocked himself.","‘Is it really because I forgot?’ Song Shuhang scratched his head.","“Right, little friend Shuhang. It’s almost the new year. Do your disciples want any gifts? We won’t give you any red packets this New Year. After all, you are already a genuine Profound Sage. We’ll give this red packet to your disciple.”","Scholar Drunken Eye recalled the content of the conversation in the Nine Provinces Number One Group and casually mentioned it.","“My New Year red packet is gone? But Senior, I didn’t receive any red packets last year!” Song Shuhang was stunned.","“We didn’t even know each other last year,” Scholar Drunken Eye reminded him.","“In other words, I haven’t received a single ‘New Year Red Envelope,’ so it’s too old and expired?” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky. For the first time, he discovered the disadvantages of leveling up too quickly.","How many chances did a person have in their life to receive red packets from their seniors?","Is it too late for me to disperse my cultivation and lower my realm?","“When the time comes, remember to tell me what treasure your disciple wants. I’ll give them a big red packet for the new year this year. I hope they will remember me,” Scholar Drunken Eye said.","At the same time, he ended the Immortal Soul Version Cultivation Chat page and logged into the Cultivation Chat client function to enter the VIP speech channel.","Over there, the channel of ‘free speech for cultivators of the Sixth Stage once a month’ had already been verified for him, and he had gained access to it.","“I’m here,” Scholar Drunken Eye said softly.","He had just become a Seventh Stage Venerable not long ago, and there was still a long way to go before he could reach the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Speech. Under normal circumstances, he would need at least several hundred years to train.","But now, he had a chance to shine ahead of time.","In order to make Scholar Phone Bill’s debut even more dazzling, Song Shuhang sent him a ‘pinned announcement’ through the server’s authority.","All the cultivators who were studying the VIP function online received the notification.","‘The first speech of a Sixth Stage True Monarch on the speech channel is about to begin. The speaker this time is Scholar Drunken Eye, a Seventh Stage Venerable. VIP users can watch a speech of the Sixth Stage for free once a month!’","Under the server announcement, more than 60% of the users had entered the speech channel, and the number was still increasing.","Then, a handsome man with the aura of Scholar Hermit appeared in front of everyone.","His first impression was that he was a handsome and elegant scholar. Then, she looked down at her figure.","Second impression: Wait, what does his face look like? He looked up and turned back to look at his face. What a handsome and elegant scholar!"]},{"number":2825,"title":"Chapter 2825: The Reliable Senior Twin Goudan in the Group","paragraphs":["Chapter 2825: The Reliable Senior Twin Goudan in the Group","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Looking down: Who was I looking at just now? What did he look like?","Looking up: Oh my god, this scholar is really handsome and elegant.","Looking down: Was I looking at something just now?","Looking up: My god, it’s the first time I’m seeing this face, but why does it feel like I’ve seen it hundreds of times? Is this what it feels like to be moved?","This cycle repeated.","In the short period before Scholar Drunken Yong began his speech, he continually received the gazes of practitioners from all over the universe.","The cultivators’ gazes kept moving back and forth over him.","In fact, some of the fairies even misunderstood their feelings each time they looked up.","Even some of the Immortals were slightly affected. As long as they moved their eyes away from Scholar Drunken Yong’s face, the image of his handsome face would start to blur in their minds.","In the Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group:","‘Where did Tyrannical Song find this strange fellow daoist? Isn’t this kind of presence too strange?’ The Sage of Imperial Beasts couldn’t help but comment.","This was his first message in the Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group, and also the first message in the entire group. This was a good start, a great step for the Immortal big shots in the ‘cultivation chat’ function.","Behind the scenes, Madam Long Luo revealed a chubby smile, contentedly collecting the data of the Immortals. She planned to take the time to properly nurture this group of Immortals and strive to expand it. It would be best if she could add as many Immortals from the myriad worlds into this group, making it easier to nurture them.","Every Immortal was a high-quality customer for ‘cultivation chats’ and a precious asset.","‘More importantly, did you notice the Daoist name of Scholar Speech? The system announcement should have mentioned his Dao name before, but I just can’t remember it. Tyrannical Song’s friends are indeed extraordinary. This Seventh Stage Venerable is able to affect us. It’s really strange.’ Indeed, birds of a feather flock together. Demons will become friends with demons. Great Master Tyrant of Titanium Temple took the opportunity to brag about Tyrannical Song’s friends and indirectly brag about Tyrannical Song himself.","The real blow was not from the front, but from the side, from different angles. This way, he could create a sense of mystery and show Tyrannical Song’s awesomeness.","Moreover, they weren’t blindly praising Tyrannical Song. They would secretly guide him based on reality.","As soon as the master finished speaking, the Immortal and the top-notch Tribulation Transcender, who had condensed the embryonic form of their own Great Dao, were slightly stunned. They tried to recall, but all they could think of was ‘drunk? Scholar, they could not remember what the word in the middle was.","This was extremely terrifying!","‘I’ve suddenly become interested in the ‘Immortal Speech.’ Would there be an Immortal willing to cooperate with Tyrannical Song and give a speech in this ‘cultivation chat’ channel?’ the group member, I Have A Twin Eggs, suddenly said.","Although ‘My Family Has A Twin-Egg’ didn’t reveal his Daoist name, his divine sense was incomparably powerful. When they had first communicated, he had already given the Immortals quite a bit of pressure.","Most of the time in the cultivation world, strength reigned supreme.","Therefore, even if ‘My Family Has A Twin Eggs’ didn’t say much, every time he spoke, he would attract the attention of the group members.","‘If there really isn’t anyone else to attend the Immortal’s speech, Tyrannical Song can also participate. He’s very good at giving speeches.’ an Immortal replied.","‘No, that’s not what I’m concerned about.’ The member of the “I Have A Twin Eggs” group, who had vaguely become a reliable senior and a potential big shot in the group, slowly said, “I’ll use the ‘internal password’ of our group to describe the following words because it involves important information.”","The ‘cultivation chat client’ was very convenient to use, but it was something Tyrannical Song had created after all. Therefore, to keep the chat confidential, the administrator, the Primordial Demoness, had specially designed a set of ‘password’ and sent it to every member through the previous divine sense communication method.","Once the content of the chat in the group involved important information, they would use a ‘password’ to communicate.","When they heard “I have a pair of dog balls” was going to use a password to speak, all the group members immediately perked up.","‘Code text: What I’m really concerned about is that since this speech channel conforms to the rules of the ‘Profound Sage Speech,’ if we participate in the segment of the ‘Immortal Speech,’ will we be able to come into contact with the rules of the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ that Tyrannical Song has comprehended to the greatest extent possible and gain some insights from it? Tyrannical Song is able to wield the power of the Heavenly Dao with his mortal body. There must be some technique that is worth pondering over.’ My Family Has A Twin Eggballs commented.","After he sent the message, all the members in the group fell into deep thought!","A big shot was a big shot. The way he looked at things was different from others.","But what the big shot said made sense. Tyrannical Song was able to use his human body to exercise the power of the Heavenly Dao, so there must be some technique involved. Moreover, if Tyrannical Song could do it, they might be able to do it too.","However, if they wanted to understand this point in depth, the ‘Immortal Speech’ segment was an extremely good way to experience it.","‘Code: Big Boss Shuang Goudan, now that you’ve mentioned it, I’m also interested in the speech channel of Immortals. I’ll wait for Scholar Drunken What to finish his speech and see the feedback and effects.’","‘Code text: Perhaps we can also try out the ‘Immortal Speech’ project and see what we can gain from it, as well as comprehend some Dao and rules related to Tyrannical Song.’","The conversation among the Immortals in the group had completely opened up.","Even their attention was successfully directed to the segment of the speech channel.","In the Netherworld Realm:","The most cunning representative in the world, the ruler of the Netherworld, Goudan’s father, had a satisfied look on his face.","Inducing something was the instinct of the ruler of the Netherworld. Goudan’s father only needed to think about it for a while in his cerebral hemisphere to come up with thousands of flawless ways to induce something.","On the other side:","“Very good. So far, at least 80% of the users of the ‘Cultivation Chat’ client have entered the speech channel to watch Scholar Yuchang’s speech. Scholar Yuchang’s free speech has already achieved the effect of attracting the attention of everyone. He should be satisfied.” Song Shuhang nodded.","Fairy @#%: ‘From today onwards, he will ascend the throne as king!’","The black-skinned Soft Feather weakly turned over and slowly sat up from the ground. She had finally recovered and didn’t need Tyrannical Song to use the Blade Nurturing Technique to reduce the pain of losing her ghost spirit.","“Senior Song, what are you doing?” Soft Feather rubbed her eyes.","“I’m watching the most dazzling moment of Scholar Fish Gall’s life. Oh right... Black Panther, can you download the client? Or use Soft Feather’s client to go online? If not, can I transfer the video to you?” Song Shuhang said.","He had great expectations for the scholar’s speech.","This was because the Sixth Stage Profound Sage Speech was free.","Theoretically speaking, he should be able to obtain a batch of merit points by giving a speech to the myriad worlds for free!","Song Shuhang discovered a new method to harvest merit."]},{"number":2826,"title":"Chapter 2826 The Dazzling Moment and the Crystallization of Merit","paragraphs":["Chapter 2826 The Dazzling Moment and the Crystallization of Merit","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the speech channel, Scholar Drunken Eyes slightly clenched his fists.","“Look at me, everyone is watching me!”","At this moment, the scholar felt like a star about to explode, bursting with his strongest radiance in the night sky. Originally, it was just weak starlight, but in that instant of explosion, it could rival the sun and moon!","Is this what it feels like to give a “Profound Sage Speech”? No wonder Shuhang became obsessed with giving speeches, delivering seven in a row.","Although he didn’t get to ride the wave of Shuhang’s “group tribulation transcending speech,” this opportunity wasn’t bad either.","After everything was ready, Scholar Drunken Eyes revealed a charming smile. He slowly opened his mouth and, with a gentle voice, began to share his speech with the practitioners across the universe.","Scholar Drunken Eyes was handsome, elegant, and had a pleasant voice, akin to that of an idol superstar. When he began his speech, practitioners from Rank-1 to Rank-5 across the universe became engrossed and couldn’t extricate themselves.","The more they listened, the more absorbed they became. Eventually, practitioners from Rank-1 to Rank-5 forgot who the speaker was, what he looked like, whether he was male or female, and even his name. It was as if they forgot someone was giving a speech, leaving only the gentle voice echoing in their ears.","They forgot everything; their minds were free from distractions. There was only that gentle and clear voice in their ears and hearts. This state of listening was second only to the supreme state of enlightenment. Their hearts were as still as water, free from distracting thoughts, and the effect of listening was maximized.","This state of listening could even be described as an extreme enjoyment. Even most Venerables and Profound Sages were engrossed in this state. Although the content of a Sixth Stage True Monarch level speech wasn’t very meaningful to them, this state of listening could calm a cultivator’s mind and was beneficial to their state of mind.","In the Tyrant’s World, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and cast a spell, pulling the upper and lower 100 floors of his Tomb of Nine Virtues from the Netherworld Realm and the Dream World, and placed them on the planet of his “newborn Tyrannical Song.”","Senior White’s “God Creation Plan” had come to an end, and his Tomb of Nine Virtues had completed its mission. After some thought, he released the small sun of Sun Ship that he had retrieved from Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi and placed it in his Tyrant Realm.","He planned to give this Sun Ship to Lady Long Luo as a New Year’s gift so she could take care of the Black Dragon World. There were still a few days before the New Year, so he could leave Sun Ship in his overlord realm to shine for a few days.","The Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue was now a sub-server of the Speech Channel. With it behind him, Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and projected Scholar Fish Gall’s first speech through the Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, so the pendants on his body could also watch it.","“This is Scholar Fish Gall’s first speech. Don’t forget to give Scholar Fish Gall a thumbs up after the speech,” Song Shuhang reminded.","“Senior Song, it’s Scholar Zuiyue,” Soft Feather said after pondering for a moment and tilting her head.","“Zuiyue?” Song Shuhang was stunned. Then, he stretched out his hand and pulled out the contract the scholar had signed with him. He smiled and said, “Soft Feather, you’re wrong. It’s Drunken Eyes. Look, it’s his signature.”","Soft Feather glanced at the signature and was stunned. After a while, she said, “The scholar’s faction is doomed.”","“It’s over!” Fairy @#%× nodded in agreement.","“Drunk and dazed!” Fairy Creation, who had returned with the Tomb of Nine Virtues, said in cooperation.","“If the speech segment is beginning, I have to go back first,” said Daoist Stone Tablet. “I’m now an inseparable part of the Tomb of Nine Virtues. After the speech is completed, I’ll still need to go on stage and cooperate!”","After saying that, without waiting for Song Shuhang to ask any more questions, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet flew back to the Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue and turned into a tombstone. After the scholar finished his speech, it would be time for him to show his card.","The scholar’s speech continued. His clear and gentle voice unknowingly soothed people’s hearts. Even the active fairy pendants on Song Shuhang’s body unknowingly calmed down.","Fairy @#%× floated above Song Shuhang’s head, while Fairy Creation and Black Panther floated beside him. Fairy Phoenix Claw stood on Song Shuhang’s shoulder. Immortal Fairy White Bones and the white-robed Gold Trigram sat beside Black Panther. Even Pavilion Master Chu’s fur was lying on Song Shuhang’s head.","The light of the small sun shone gently on everyone in the giant’s small world. This scene was like a peaceful afternoon rest, quiet and comfortable.","Unknowingly, Scholar Drunken Eyes’ speech ended. As a Seventh Stage Venerable, he was able to explain the techniques of the Sixth Stage even more thoroughly, which would be very useful for scholars of the Sixth Stage and below.","After the speech ended, the entire universe seemed to be immersed in Scholar Drunken Eyes’ speech. Everyone seemed to have forgotten everything. Their worries, concerns, and unwillingness were all soothed at this moment.","In fact, they had even forgotten when Scholar Drunken Eyes had finished his speech.","In the void, a golden light suddenly shone in front of Scholar Drunken Eyes. This was the power of virtue. This power of virtue wasn’t huge, and it wasn’t on the same level as Song Shuhang’s “Profound Sage Speech.” This was the blessing of Scholar Drunken Eyes’ free speech to all practitioners in the universe.","However, the power of virtue didn’t enter Scholar Drunken Eyes’ body! Under Scholar Drunken Eyes’ puzzled gaze, the power of virtue landed two meters away from him. Then, it began to condense.","Scholar Drunken Eyes was confused.","He could clearly sense that the power of virtue was meant for him, and it was the reward he wanted. However, what was this power of virtue landing two meters away from him?","Could it be that even the laws of the myriad worlds had forgotten about him or couldn’t lock onto his exact location? So when the power of virtue descended, they “forgot” about him and could only land the power of virtue near his approximate location?","This was no longer as simple as “piercing the heart.” This was simply “piercing the lung”!","Scholar Drunken Eyes felt his heart ache. Although it was much smaller than the power of virtue from the Profound Sage Speech, it was still sincere feedback from the cultivators of the myriad worlds.","Strands of power of virtue condensed in the void. Even if they didn’t find their true bodies, they didn’t dissipate. Instead, they began to condense out of thin air. First, they formed something in the shape of a core of virtue. Then, with this core as the center, a lifelike lotus of virtue bloomed.","Scholar Drunken Eyes had a feeling when the lotus of virtue bloomed. He reached out and gently caught the lotus.","“Avoiding disasters, pursuing blessings... Was this Lakshmi White Saint’s weakening card? And the most important effect was... avoiding the tribulation?” Scholar Drunken Eyes frowned. He had a feeling that as long as he injected the unique power of his element into this lotus flower of virtue, it would have the effect of avoiding the tribulation."]},{"number":2827,"title":"Chapter 2827 Join Our Family, Shuhang!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2827 Join Our Family, Shuhang!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The power of virtue that was originally about to fuse into his body eventually formed a Golden Lotus of Virtue outside his body.","So, even though he knew it was a treasure, Scholar Drunken Eyes felt as if he had been stabbed from the heart to the lungs when he held the Golden Lotus of Virtue. He had the urge to throw the Golden Lotus of Virtue to the ground and smash it into pieces.","But in the end, he held back.","No matter how angry he was, he couldn’t go against the treasure. No matter how angry she was, she couldn’t tear the money apart.","Moreover, after sensing the effects and attributes of the Golden Lotus of Virtue, Scholar Drunken Eyes made a decision in his heart. He decided to gift the first Golden Lotus of Virtue to little friend Shuhang.","He could use it to thank little friend Shuhang for giving him the opportunity to give a Sixth Stage lecture for the entire year of 2020. In the eyes of others, giving a lecture for free was a job that required a lot of energy. However, in the eyes of Scholar Drunken Eyes and his disciples, this was the only “shining” time in their lives, and it was hard to find even for a thousand gold coins.","Although the Golden Lotus of Virtue had the effect of avoiding calamities, Scholar Drunken Eyes wouldn’t be able to use it for the time being. He wasn’t like little friend Shuhang, who would advance every few days.","Moreover, there were twelve months in a year. After that, he would have a chance to condense a “Virtuous Golden Lotus” every month during his lecture.","The number of people who would pay attention to him might not be as many as today, and the effect of the Golden Lotuses of Virtue would be weakened. However, he could still obtain eleven Golden Lotuses of Virtue, so he did not have to worry about the effect at all.","“The only troublesome thing now is that this ‘Virtuous Golden Lotus’ needs to be injected with my spiritual energy to be completely activated... However, once I inject my spiritual energy into it, it will be bound to me and cannot be given to others. However, if I don’t inject spiritual energy into it, its ‘tribulation dodging’ attribute won’t be activated.” Scholar Drunken Eyes frowned.","This was very contradictory.","Unless... Song Shuhang could think of a way to simulate the spiritual energy of their type and activate the Golden Lotus of Virtue?","“Or... should I teach little friend Shuhang the cultivation technique of my type? You don’t need to master it to any extent; you just need to condense a wisp of our sect’s power to activate the golden lotus?” Scholar Drunken Eyes pondered.","With little friend Shuhang’s reputation in the universe, he should be able to offset the effects of the “little invisibility” of their cultivation technique, right? Not to mention that he had 7 sage accounts and 1 sector lord account; he could definitely suppress the side effects of their cultivation method.","The more Scholar Drunken Eyes thought about it, the more he felt that this plan was feasible.","Thereupon, he contacted Song Shuhang and said, “Little friend Shuhang.”","“I’m here,” Song Shuhang replied.","He was so immersed in the scholar’s lecture that he couldn’t extricate himself. When the scholar sent him a message, he couldn’t remember who he was talking to.","Fortunately, he quickly used the clue of “10 million yuan” to lock onto the scholar’s identity.","“What do you think of the effect of the lecture, sir?” Song Shuhang said with a faint smile.","“I can only say that I can die without regrets!” Scholar Drunken Eyes said exaggeratedly.","“Scholar, don’t die!” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Scholar Drunken Eyes smiled and replied, “After the free lecture... I’ve obtained the power of virtue!”","“Yes, I know. Yes,” Song Shuhang nodded, and said, “I’ve also received the power of virtue. It’s probably because I’m the main server that provided the platform.”","As he spoke, he raised his head and glanced at the nearby Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","After Scholar Drunken Eyes finished his lecture, the background of the lecture channel transformed into the structure of the “Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.”","Similarly, the power of virtue fell on this “platform” to strengthen the “lecture platform” of the Tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue. At the same time, a portion of the power of virtue was fed back to Song Shuhang’s “main server” and used to strengthen Fairy @#%×.","Fairy @#%× was currently in the same realm as the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, the “Weak Growth.” He had surpassed the limit of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, but because he hadn’t nurtured his own path to immortality, he couldn’t attain immortality.","Her current state was the exact opposite of the “top-notch Tribulation Transcender who had stepped out of the embryonic form of his own Great Dao.”","The power of virtue that Song Shuhang had obtained was now all added to the virtuous lamia’s body, accumulating her strength infinitely. He was looking forward to seeing if the quantity of the power of virtue would cause a qualitative change when it reached a limit.","In the myriad worlds.","All the cultivators who were engrossed in Scholar Drunken Eyes’ lecture slowly withdrew from that wonderful listening state.","“What a perfect lecture. Although it’s only a lecture of the Sixth Stage, its effects are comparable to an Eighth Stage Profound Sage Lecture.”","“I hope I have the chance to come into contact with such a lecture again.”","“By the way, who is the one giving the lecture this time? Which big shot is it?”","“Eh? Where are the cultivators?”","All the cultivators who were listening to the live broadcast of the lecture curiously sized up the background of the VIP lecture channel.","Soon, they noticed the strangeness of the background.","It seemed to be a tall tower, but upon closer inspection, it looked like the structure of a tomb.","“Whose tomb is this?”","Just as the cultivators from all over the universe were curious, a stone tablet at the entrance of the tower began to glow.","The words [Tyrannical Song’s Tomb] flashed!","“It’s Senior Tyrannical Song! Is it his grave?”","“Why did Senior Tyrannical Song leave behind a tomb?”","“Wait, could it be that the person who gave the lecture just now was one of Senior Tyrannical Song’s smurf accounts?”","“Senior Tyrannical Song is awesome.”","At the same time.","“Little friend Shuhang, I want to give you the Golden Lotus of Virtue that I condensed. You should be able to use it. It has the attribute of ‘avoiding tribulations,’ and can affect the effects of heavenly tribulation!” Scholar Drunken Eyes said slowly.","“Avoiding the tribulation?” Song Shuhang paused slightly.","The original 1,000-day tribulation of the Tribulation Transcender could be compressed into “one year and two months of heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage” with his Heavenly Lightning graduation certificate, the fat ball’s research materials, and the number of days that his clone had passed.","Adding on his complete “sector lord authority” now, this period of time was estimated to be reduced by more than half, making the remaining heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage become half a year’s tribulation or even shorter!","But now, the “Virtuous Golden Lotus” in the scholar’s hand could affect the effects of the heavenly tribulation... Could it be that his half a year’s tribulation could be shorter?","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel tempted.","This was indeed what he needed.","“Then I won’t stand on ceremony, Senior Scholar. I do need a treasure to avoid the tribulation.” Song Shuhang replied.","“However, if you want to activate the Golden Lotus of Virtue, you need to do one thing,” Scholar Drunken Eyes said slowly.","“Scholar, please go ahead,” Song Shuhang said.","“Little friend Shuhang, practice my cultivation technique,” Scholar Drunken Eyes said.","Song Shuhang was confused.","At the same time, in the background of the lecture channel, the words “Tyrannical Song’s Tomb” on the stone tablet shone brilliantly.","“Wait, Senior Scholar, wait. Why do you suddenly want me to learn your cultivation technique? I’m cultivating my cultivation technique well now, so I don’t plan on changing it,” Song Shuhang hurriedly said.","He was afraid that Scholar Drunken Eyes would take a fancy to his talent and take him into a small invisible family."]},{"number":2828,"title":"Chapter 2828 The “Forgotten Divine Technique”","paragraphs":["Chapter 2828 The “Forgotten Divine Technique”","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There were many benefits to being invisible. However, being invisible all the time was quite troublesome.","The biggest problem with Scholar Fish-belly’s faction was the uncontrollability of their “invisible state”! Their invisible state was a permanent passive skill, accompanying them throughout their lives.","If this “invisible state” could be freely controlled, then Scholar Swimming Bladder’s cultivation technique would be the best in the world!","For example, if I insulted a big shot, I could activate “Little Invisible,” and the big shot would forget about me.","After a while, I would find an opportunity to come out of my “small invisible state” and insult the big boss again. After that, I would turn around and activate “small invisible” again. It would be simply wonderful.","Opposite him, Scholar Drunken Eye replied, “You don’t need to delve deeply into our faction’s cultivation techniques... After all, we know our own techniques’ flaws best. Until we find a solution, I don’t want to trick people.”","Song Shuhang felt wronged in his heart.","Scholar Drunken Eye was confused.","Even though he was a member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and the fellow daoists in the group had tempered his way of thinking, when he chatted with Song Shuhang, he still felt that his brain was unable to connect with Song Shuhang’s—perhaps it was because his speed was too slow, while Song Shuhang’s speed was too fast.","“Why aren’t you human?” The senior scholar was tired and followed Song Shuhang’s topic with a question.","“Senior, this is the hidden meaning in your words just now. You don’t want to trick me, but you want me to learn your cultivation method. Aren’t you saying that I’m not human? Senior, you’re going too far,” Song Shuhang seriously protested.","The scholar was speechless.","I can’t continue chatting. Let’s break up!","After a long while, Scholar Drunken Eye sighed and said, “The Golden Lotus of Virtue’s ‘tribulation evading’ effect requires the support of our faction’s special cultivation technique. Once activated, the Golden Lotus of Merit will bind to you.”","“So, Scholar, you want me to cultivate your faction’s technique? Then, you want me to inject spiritual energy into the golden lotus?” Song Shuhang immediately responded.","Scholar Drunken Eye said, “Yes... Therefore, you don’t need to cultivate our technique to a profound level. You only need to get a little bit of the basics and cultivate a bit of spiritual power. Given your current realm, it’s easy for you to cultivate a technique to the beginner level.”","Song Shuhang was already at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm. As long as he didn’t practice “sword art,” it would be easy for him to reach the level of the First or Second Stage Realm in a short period.","The learning bonus effect of realm suppression.","“I see,” Song Shuhang nodded.","However, was it really okay for him to casually spread the special cultivation techniques of the scholars?","Song Shuhang also knew the rules of the cultivation world. Cultivation techniques, divine powers, and spells were not taught to outsiders. Especially a sect’s origin technique, which was even more important. It was the root of a person’s life!","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang voiced his doubts to the scholar.","“Don’t worry. If it were any other sect, they might have this problem. However, if it’s my faction, I can pass on my sect’s cultivation techniques as I wish. No one can control me,” Scholar Drunken Eye said slowly.","He vaguely remembered that he had a master or an elder. He seemed to have just come into contact with him not long ago. However, he had already forgotten what the other party looked like, who he was, and what his name was.","Perhaps the other party had already forgotten about him...","Other sects had structures such as the Law Enforcement Elders and Law Enforcement Hall. Once a disciple passed on their sect’s cultivation technique without permission, they might be punished by the Law Enforcement Elders. In serious cases, they might even have their memories sealed and their cultivation techniques abolished.","However, it was impossible for their faction to have an existence like the Enforcement Elder. Even if there were, it would definitely be forgotten...","“Moreover, I’ll teach you the opening chapter of my cultivation technique. It can be considered insurance and backup. I don’t want the inheritance to be cut off one day,” Scholar Drunken Eye added.","After hearing the scholar’s sad reply, Song Shuhang really wanted to comfort him, but he didn’t know how.","After all, he did not have any talent for comforting people. He, Tyrannical Song, was eighteen years old, and he didn’t even have a wife. He had no chance to comfort his angry wife, so his experience in comforting others was basically zero.","Moreover, the scholar was not a fairy. As a man, he could just lick his own wounds when he was sad. There was no need to comfort him so pretentiously.","“Since you feel that there’s no problem, then it would be impolite of me to refuse. There’s no problem with cultivating the first chapter,” Song Shuhang replied.","Scholar Yuchang’s “small invisible” state wasn’t that strong from the start. When he was at the First or Second Stage, he was still similar to ordinary cultivators. Everyone would remember him and his daoist name, and they would not ignore him when chatting. It was just that his presence would be slightly affected.","It was only after he reached the Fourth Stage Realm that the effects of the little invisible state began to show.","Therefore, if Song Shuhang only cultivated the technique to the First or Second Stage Realm, it wouldn’t affect him much.","“Then, I’ll pass the opening chapter of the cultivation technique to you now,” Scholar Drunken Eye said.","“Alright,” Song Shuhang said, “What’s the name of this technique?”","Scholar Drunken Eye was silent for a moment before he said, “I forgot...”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Alright, from today onwards, this cultivation technique shall be called “Forgotten Divine Technique.”","Opposite him, Scholar Drunken Eye used the “cultivation chat” function to send Song Shuhang the opening page of the divine technique of his sect that he had forgotten its name.","After Song Shuhang received this divine technique, he was suddenly dumbfounded.","This divine technique was no small matter!","Its opening content was completely composed of ancient characters!","Song Shuhang had already mastered the ancient language. At the very least, he had mastered quite a number of everyday words and could even stutter a few sentences in the ancient language.","However, cultivation techniques written in ancient languages involved many professional names.","Song Shuhang’s head hurt from watching.","“Am I going to activate my ‘Primordial Language’s Laws’ again?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","However, just as he was thinking, a spatial door opened in the void.","A blurry fairy seemed to have received a call and came through space.","She had long braids, and her eyes were covered by bangs.","Did the ghost fairy return from Su Clan’s Sixteen?","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and smiled, preparing to welcome his ghost spirit.","Above his head, Fairy @#%× pursed her lips and said softly, “The wind is so noisy today.”","As she spoke, the virtuous lamia opened her arms and waved them gently.","Song Shuhang was confused.","What kind of secret signal was this?","The virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather seemed to have a secret code between them.","They would often speak in secret in front of Song Shuhang.","Could it be that the ghost fairy in front of him was also a member of the code group?"]},{"number":2829,"title":"Chapter 2829 Father Goudan, Help Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2829 Father Goudan, Help Me!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Faced with the virtuous lamia’s secret signal, the ghost fairy opened the scroll, her long eyelashes slightly drooping.","Then, she began to improvise wind-themed poems.","Five-character quatrains, seven-character quatrains, narrative poems, lyric poems, modern poems...","The ghost fairy used Song Shuhang’s voice and recited twelve poems related to the “noisy wind.”","Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia were both stunned.","At the same time, Song Shuhang discovered a problem. The pendant fairies on his body were increasingly unwilling to use their own “original voices” to speak. In the past, only the virtuous lamia had this issue. Later, Fairy Creation was also infected, and now the ghost fairy had become one of them. She would rather use Song Shuhang’s voice than speak herself.","After reciting the twelve poems, the ghost spirit fairy closed the scroll.","The virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather clapped their hands repeatedly. It seemed like they had met with a secret code?","After closing the scroll, the ghost spirit fairy arrived in front of Song Shuhang.","She stretched out her hand and gently knocked on Song Shuhang’s chest, as if she were politely knocking on the door.","Song Shuhang was confused.","In the next moment, an illusory door suddenly appeared on his chest!","The ghost fairy calmly raised the huge book in her hand and pressed it against the illusory door.","The door slowly opened.","Then, the ghost fairy gracefully entered the door and closed it.","When she closed the door, she politely waved at Song Shuhang, the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and Black Panther.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","After the ghost fairy closed the door, Song Shuhang quickly stretched out his hand and pressed it on his chest.","What was that illusory door just now?","“It’s the materialization of the ghost spirit contract,” Pavilion Master Chu explained softly above his head.","“A ghost spirit contract? But it wasn’t like this in the past,” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood on end slightly. She said lazily, “In the past, your ghost fairy spirit only had you as a home. Now, she has two homes and needs to switch between them. Therefore, she naturally has to lock the door before she leaves the house to prevent her home from being stolen...”","She vaguely remembered that Song Shuhang’s ghost fairy spirit had signed a temporary agreement with Su Clan’s Sixteen. Right now, Su Clan’s Sixteen was also the ghost fairy’s other home.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Although he felt that there was something wrong with this explanation, he also felt that Pavilion Master Chu’s explanation was very reasonable. He simply couldn’t refute it.","“You’d better take a good look at the cultivation technique that the scholar sent over first,” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","“That’s true,” Song Shuhang nodded.","He had to first try and see if he could cultivate the Forgotten Divine Technique.","If he could successfully cultivate it and push it to the Second Stage Realm, he could condense some of the Forgotten Divine Technique’s spiritual power and receive Scholar Fish Bone’s Virtuous Golden Lotus to avoid the tribulation.","After saying that, he perked up and read the opening of the Forgotten Divine Technique from beginning to end again. At the same time, he secretly prepared to activate the Primordial Language Law.","But this time, just as his attention fell on the opening of the Forgotten Divine Technique, he suddenly had an idea.","The ancient text cultivation technique that was originally like a heavenly book in his eyes suddenly seemed to come alive.","Every word, phrase, and sentence seemed to have a life of its own, actively revealing its own information to him.","Song Shuhang easily read the opening chapter of the Forgotten Divine Technique and instantly understood its meaning!","One had to know that every divine technique was like a classical Chinese text, very obscure and difficult to read. However, Song Shuhang had only seen it once and had already mastered it.","It was as if he had already grasped this cultivation technique from the beginning.","“Could it be...” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","He quickly contacted Scholar Fish-liver and asked, “Senior, is this Forgotten Divine Art actually a saber technique?”","Scholar Drunken Eye was startled.","Saber techniques, my ass. They were not saber cultivators.","“Isn’t it a saber technique?” Song Shuhang was stunned. “If it wasn’t a saber technique, then why did I immediately understand its meaning and grasp the opening chapter after reading it once?”","“Complete mastery of the opening chapter? Are you dreaming?” Scholar Drunken Eye widened his eyes.","“No, I’m not dreaming,” Song Shuhang said with certainty. “I’ve carefully recalled it again. I completely understand the opening of the Forgotten Divine Technique.”","“Let me test you,” Scholar Drunken Eye said.","“Please give me a question,” Song Shuhang said.","Scholar Drunken Eye pondered for a moment, then randomly picked a cultivation description from the beginning of his cultivation technique and asked a question.","Opposite him, Song Shuhang answered smoothly as if he were cheating.","After answering more than ten questions in a row, Scholar Drunken Eye was amazed.","“How is it, Scholar? My comprehension ability is not bad, right? It seems that I have a good compatibility with this cultivation technique,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","“Shuhang... Did you cultivate our cultivation technique in the past?” Scholar Drunken Eye suddenly said. “The last three questions I asked just now weren’t just about the content of the opening chapter, but also about the second part of the cultivation technique of our sect. Shuhang, you answered them fluently from beginning to end. However, I only sent you the opening chapter.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He had only read the beginning, but he could even answer the rest of the content fluently?","Song Shuhang didn’t think that he was a genius in the field of cultivation theories. Therefore, he couldn’t possibly deduce the second part of the Forgotten Divine Technique according to the opening chapter.","Even if he had the hardware foundation for this deduction, he lacked the data. His software configuration couldn’t keep up... Deducing cultivation techniques was simply too much for him.","So... Was it a ghost fairy spirit?","Song Shuhang gently pressed his chest.","After the ghost spirit fairy returned home, he suddenly knew the contents of the Forgotten Divine Technique like the back of his hand.","Thinking back carefully, it seemed that the ghost spirit fairy had once cultivated with the scholar for a period of time? Or did she follow the scholar into a secret realm?","“Perhaps I’ve guessed the reason,” Song Shuhang replied. “Anyway, let’s put this problem aside for now. I’ll try to take this opportunity to practice the Forgotten Divine Technique.”","He wanted to take advantage of the fact that the ghost fairy’s knowledge and his understanding of the cultivation technique were still there to see if he could cultivate the technique to the Second Stage in one go.","After replying to the scholar, Song Shuhang directly sat cross-legged.","According to the memory and understanding of the Forgotten Divine Technique in his head, he began to try to cultivate the opening chapter.","With the foundation of the Eighth Stage Realm and the hardware foundation, it was not difficult to cultivate the opening chapter of the Forgotten Divine Technique.","The entire cultivation process was like a hot knife through butter.","Then, as he practiced, Song Shuhang... was distracted.","During the process of practicing the divine technique, Song Shuhang suddenly discovered some key points.","Thus, while he was having an epiphany, comprehending the Dao, and cultivating, he opened the “cultivation chat” function and contacted Father Goudan. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s life was often so busy, simple, and boring.","“Father Goudan, do you have the data of the Wielder’s small black room?” Song Shuhang begged.","If he remembered correctly, the Wielder’s small black room was the work of Wielder’s Eggface Daddy."]},{"number":2830,"title":"Chapter 2830 The Scholar Between Existence and Non-Existence","paragraphs":["Chapter 2830 The Scholar Between Existence and Non-Existence","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, unlike Senior Three-Eyed, Heavenly Dao Father Goudan and Netherworld Father Goudan had a pretty good relationship.","The Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon had devised several escape methods, including plans for the world of the black lotus and the world of the golden lotus. However, to preserve Netherworld Father Goudan, the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon ultimately abandoned these plans and instead studied the ‘Primordial Ghost God’ plan and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’s escape method.","“Do you want to enter the Heavenly Dao Prison? Do you want me to help you get in?” Father Goudan asked. Although he didn’t have the authority to open the Heavenly Dao Prison, he was the true ruler of the Netherworld. If he attached a part of his original ‘Netherworld ruler power’ to Song Shuhang, the Heavenly Dao laws would automatically be guided, either sending down heavenly punishment or pulling Song Shuhang into the Heavenly Dao Prison.","“Thank you for your kindness, senior, but there’s no need... I just came out of the Wielder’s small black room, and I don’t plan on going back anytime soon,” Song Shuhang hurriedly explained. “I came into contact with Scholar Fishstomach’s inherited cultivation technique and tried to practice it. While cultivating, I suddenly thought of the theory behind the Wielder’s small black room. It seemed similar to Scholar Fishstomach’s technique. So, I wanted to ask if you have any data on the Wielder’s small black room to analyze.”","“Unfortunately, no,” Father Goudan replied. “I’m only the ruler of the Netherworld, not the Heavenly Dao. The Heavenly Dao Prison was created by my Heavenly Dao Body after vindication. I don’t have that part of the memory. Moreover, my corresponding Heavenly Dao never shared the ‘experimental process and data’ with me.”","Whether it was the Heavenly Dao Space experiment, the Black Golden Lotus experiment, the Ghost God experiment, or the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber experiment, the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon developed them all secretly. Even if he needed Netherworld Father Goudan’s help, he was always mysterious about it.","There was even a time when Netherworld Father Goudan suddenly woke up and found he had been experimented on—the corresponding Heavenly Dao had disappeared, leaving only fragments of the ‘Ghost God’ on the ground.","These ghost god fragments were assembled, with the largest part becoming the ghost spirit, Cheng Lin. The remaining fragments spread throughout the myriad worlds, each with their own fortunes.","“In other words, only the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon has the detailed data on the Wielder’s small black room? What a pity... I thought I found a breakthrough for Scholar Fishstomach’s technique,” Song Shuhang sighed.","“It’s not ‘Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon.’ It’s Cheng Goudan’s ‘Wielder of the Will Father Goudan.’ Watch your words,” Father Goudan said in a deep voice.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Fairy Cheng Lin was speechless.","When the striped dragon boss gave up on himself and admitted he was Father Goudan, Cheng Lin suddenly realized that the possibility of changing back from Cheng Goudan to Cheng Lin was very far away, causing her to despair.","Furthermore, Daoist names are extremely important. Sometimes, a Daoist name can affect a person, especially when given by important figures. They can have the effect of ‘the law follows the words spoken.’","Fairy Cheng Lin felt her personality becoming more like that of a puppy, and her style had been distorted.","“However, when you mentioned Scholar Fishstomach’s technique... I seem to recall it,” Fairy Cheng Lin interjected.","Fairy Cheng Lin’s predecessor, ‘Ghost God,’ was created by Heavenly Dao Father Goudan. After being created, she didn’t immediately carry out the plan to preserve the ruler of the Netherworld. Instead, she stayed by the side of Wielder of the Will Father Goudan until the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was forged, then carried out the plan.","Thus, Fairy Cheng Lin knew some secrets about ‘Wielder of the Will Father Goudan.’","Song Shuhang proposed his guess, “Could it be that Scholar Fishstomach’s technique was invented by Heavenly Axiom’s Father Goudan?”","Scholar Fishstomach’s ‘Forgotten Divine Technique’ was written in ancient characters and had been around for a long time.","Considering the nature of the Wielder’s small black room created by the Wielder’s Striped Dragon, Song Shuhang’s guess seemed plausible.","“I’m not sure. Why don’t you show us Scholar Fishstomach’s technique first?” Fairy Cheng Goudan suggested.","“I’ll go ask the scholar and see if he agrees,” Song Shuhang said.","His consciousness used the ‘cultivation chat’ function to contact Scholar Fishstomach.","“Scholar, there’s something I need your approval for,” Song Shuhang sent a message.","Opposite him.","“Who are you?” Scholar Fishstomach asked.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“It’s me, Shuhang!”","As expected, Scholar Fishstomach was doomed. Right now, apart from his almost nonexistent presence and inability to remember his Daoist name and technique, he couldn’t even remember other people’s information.","One day, Scholar Fishstomach would enter a state of ‘no self.’ No one in the universe would remember him, and he wouldn’t remember anyone in the universe. No one would know of his existence, and he would forget the existence of others. No one would be able to detect him, and he would be ‘nonexistent.’ However, he was real. As long as someone could observe him, he would exist.","This was Master Quantum!","“Wait, I was distracted just now. Little friend Shuhang, is there something you need my permission for?” Scholar Fishstomach quickly recovered and said.","“Can I open the chapter of your technique for a big shot to appraise?” Song Shuhang asked.","Scholar Fishstomach asked, “Big shot? What level of big shot?”","“Ruler of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang replied.","Scholar Fishstomach: “I’m just asking. It’s just the beginning. Little friend Shuhang, you can show it to whoever you want.”","“Okay, Scholar. With your words, I can rest assured,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Then, he exited the ‘cultivation chat’ function and sent the opening chapter of Scholar Fishstomach’s ‘Forgotten Divine Technique’ to Cheng Goudan and Father Goudan.","A moment later...","“It really is this technique. I’ve seen this technique from Heavenly Axiom’s Father Goudan,” Fairy Cheng Goudan replied.","“It really is the work of Heavenly Dao Father Goudan?” Song Shuhang asked.","“No. This is because I’ve come into contact with this technique before I vindicated my Dao. I have relevant memories.”","After reading the opening chapter of Scholar Fishstomach’s technique, Father Goudan dug out the relevant memories from the depths of his memory.","“The origin of this technique is even older than mine. I did not expect it to be passed down until now... It’s a miracle,” Father Goudan said.","He had always thought this technique would be lost in ancient times.","From the ancient era until now, many new inheritances would be born every once in a while, and many inheritances would be lost.","And this technique, which seemed the easiest to lose its inheritance, had actually been passed down until now.","Father Goudan couldn’t find a better word than ‘miracle.’","“Shuhang, you’re right. Back then, when my corresponding Wielder of the Will created the ‘Heavenly Dao Prison Space,’ it was very likely that he referenced this technique... Perhaps you should enter the Heavenly Dao Prison to study it. Do you want me to send you in?” Father Goudan asked."]},{"number":2831,"title":"Chapter 2831 Childish, but I Like It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2831 Childish, but I Like It!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Father Goudan, do you have the authority to freely enter and exit the Wielder’s small black room?” Song Shuhang asked.","If he really had such authority, then it would be incredibly valuable!","As long as they didn’t encounter a special existence like Senior White, who could come and go freely in the Wielder’s small black room, once the enemy was locked inside, even the very source of their existence would be cut off. Not only would they be unable to get out, but people outside would also forget about them. Even rescue efforts would be futile.","And as long as there were enough customers in the Wielder’s small black room, it would be a huge fortune!","In an instant, Song Shuhang’s mind conjured dozens of ways to make money, including bail money, reform-through-labor compensation, and special communication fees for contacting the outside world.","He had even thought about how to cooperate with Father Goudan and drafted a contract.","The speed of the brain of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage was that powerful and reliable!","“No, I haven’t,” Father Goudan shook his head and said. “But I’m the ruler of the Netherworld. If I imbue you with a layer of the aura of the origin power of the ruler of the Netherworld, as soon as you appear in the world, you will attract heavenly punishment or be captured into the Heavenly Dao Prison.”","“What if I attract the heavenly punishment?” Song Shuhang asked bitterly.","“Don’t worry, I’ll take care of everything.” Father Goudan’s affirmative reply gave him great confidence.","Divine punishment was something that even Senior White Two couldn’t avoid, but in Goudan’s father’s eyes, it was a trivial matter that could be easily dealt with.","“If you attract divine punishment, I’ll just change the nickname in the Cultivation chat client to ‘I have a dog egg at home.’ Anyway, your dog egg is redundant,” Father Goudan continued.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Is this the solution you’re so confident in, Father Goudan?","The solution you mentioned is to let divine punishment strike me into ashes?","You’re going to lose me, this troublesome mammoth.","Cheng Goudan was also speechless.","From his tone, even if Song Goudan died, Father Goudan wouldn’t consider changing her daoist name back.","“There’s only a 50% chance that you’ll attract divine punishment, but there’s a 50% chance that you’ll successfully sneak into the Heavenly Dao Prison space. In short, you win either way,” Father Goudan said impatiently.","“Thank you, Father Goudan, but I don’t need it.” Song Shuhang refused firmly. “If I really want to use the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld to sneak into the Heavenly Dao Prison, I can do it myself. After all, I’m now a representative ruler of the Netherworld.”","Father Goudan was speechless.","“Moreover, I have other methods to enter the Wielder’s small black room.” With that, Song Shuhang waved his sleeve, and a turtle shell immortal boat flew out.","This was an item he had obtained from a bet with the three-eyed youth. This immortal boat was made from the turtle shell of the giant turtle of disaster, and during the gambling event, it had been filled with energy by the three-eyed youth. It now had the ability to enter and exit the Wielder’s small black room and could be used five times.","Song Shuhang only had three chances left to use it. After the bet was completed, he hadn’t had time to return the turtle shell immortal boat to the three-eyed senior.","Now, it could come in handy.","“There is an uncomfortable smell on this immortal boat,” Father Goudan frowned. In his current state, he was staying in the Netherworld Realm by possessing Song Four’s body to go home and take a look.","Therefore, although he and Song Shuhang’s main body were in two different worlds, through the connection with Song Four, Father Goudan could sense the situation around Song Shuhang’s main body.","“It’s Senior Three-Eyed’s scent,” Song Shuhang replied.","“The thing you won from him?” Father Goudan beamed.","As long as it was something Song Shuhang won from the three-eyed youth, even if it had the smell of the three-eyed youth, Father Goudan would feel that it was like smelling stinky tofu. It was acceptable!","“I didn’t win it. It’s a prop from the previous bet. I forgot to return it,” Song Shuhang explained.","“Isn’t that even better?” Father Goudan laughed.","Since you forgot to return it, then don’t return it.","Why should he return the mission item that he had obtained with his own abilities, right?","“Come, come, come. I’ll help you wipe off the personal mark of Three-Eyed Boy on the turtle shell immortal boat and let this immortal boat change its surname to Song. Three-Eyed’s things are ours; don’t be polite with him,” Father Goudan said enthusiastically.","“No need, no need. This is not appropriate.” Song Shuhang waved his hand repeatedly.","He didn’t want to get involved with Father Goudan and Three-Eyed.","Moreover, Senior Three-Eyed is already so unlucky. He had to cherish him and not hurt him anymore.","Even if he wanted his immortal boat, he could just add it to the bet next time. There was no need to use such a despicable method.","“You’re welcome. What’s there to be polite about between you and me?” Father Goudan said.","While speaking, Father Goudan’s power used Song Four as a transit point, crossing the Netherworld Realm and arriving in Song Shuhang’s ‘Overlord Realm.’","Next, Father Goudan’s power poured into the turtle shell immortal boat and began to erase the mark of the three-eyed youth.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","On the side, Fairy Cheng Lin saw him in a daze and couldn’t help but remind him, “Don’t just stand there, Song Goudan. Hurry up and contact the Three-Eyed Ruler and broadcast this scene to him. Father Goudan will have to take the blame for erasing the immortal boat’s mark!”","[You don’t have to contact me. I’m watching.] The voice of the three-eyed youth suddenly rang out in the air!","Previously, Father Goudan possessed Song Four and went to the Netherworld Realm to ‘go home and take a look.’ Senior Three-Eyed was the same.","Therefore, Father Goudan’s actions were seen by the three-eyed youth.","“You want to erase my mark? Damn it! Father Goudan!” the three-eyed senior shouted.","Father Goudan wasn’t angry but laughed instead.","As he spoke, he changed his nickname on the cultivation chat app to ‘My Family Has Three Eggs.’","Two Cheng Goudan and one Three-Eyed Goudan.","“Childish!” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“I’m happy to.” Father Goudan beamed with joy, his two dragon whiskers curling up high.","The power of the two rulers of the Netherworld crossed planes and competed on a small turtle shell immortal boat.","Cheng Lin was speechless.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Even a wisp of power was enough to cause devastating damage to the world.","“I can’t let them continue to cause trouble in my Tyrant’s World. My Tyrant’s World is a new world...I can’t withstand the torment of two rulers of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang said.","He had just obtained the ‘Overlord Realm Lord’ throne. He didn’t want to lose it so quickly.","“Essence Soul Leaving Body!” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection came out of his main body again.","The main body continued to cultivate, comprehend the Dao, and gain enlightenment.","His Essence Soul projection entered the turtle shell immortal boat.","The turtle shell immortal boat was activated, and with the consciousness and strength of the two rulers of the Netherworld, he stepped on the accelerator. He charged into the Heavenly Dao Prison!"]},{"number":2832,"title":"Chapter 2832 Am I Not the Worst Off After All?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2832 Am I Not the Worst Off After All?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, Song Shuhang didn’t have to worry about his body projecting another “primordial spirit projection.” After all, he already had a primordial spirit projection No. 2, which had been taken away by Senior White Two.","Therefore, even if his Primordial Spirit Projection No. 1 was forgotten again, with Primordial Spirit No. 2 around, the Primordial Spirit Original Body in the Tribulation Transcender Void wouldn’t project another Primordial Spirit No. 3.","Whoosh! The turtle shell immortal boat accelerated, breaking through the limitations of space, and charged into the Wielder’s small black room world!","“Wait, Shuhang, wait!” The three-eyed teenager sensed that the turtle shell immortal boat was heading toward the Wielder’s small black room and hurriedly called out.","Song Shuhang replied, “It’s too fast, there’s no way to stop it. Senior Three-Eyed, you control the immortal boat yourself.”","“Stop!” Father Goudan called out affectionately. “Don’t stop!”","No matter why Three-Eyed wanted Song Shuhang to stop, Father Goudan was going to oppose it. If Three-Eyed wanted to stop, then he couldn’t let the immortal boat stop.","As he spoke, he tried his best to entangle Three-Eyed Boy, preventing him from having the strength to control the turtle shell immortal boat.","A moment later...","As the three-eyed youth sighed, the turtle shell immortal boat entered a Heavenly Dao Prison space.","“We’re done for,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","Then, he glared at Father Goudan.","These Wielder of the Will small black rooms were all works of the Wielder of the Will corresponding to ‘Father Goudan.’ Every single one of these Heavenly Dao Prison spaces had hidden settings targeting the Three-Eyed Hegemon.","Once the Three-Eyed Sovereign’s consciousness or clone entered the Heavenly Dao Prison, he would be targeted.","During the bet with Song Shuhang, the small clone that the Three-Eyed Ruler had painstakingly created, along with the turtle shell immortal boat, was confiscated. What was worse, the Heavenly Dao Prison had a notification function.","When the incarnation of the three-eyed youth was captured, it even sent a message similar to a notification to the three-eyed youth Hegemon. It was clear he wanted to disgust him.","Even his little incarnation had been captured, let alone this strand of spiritual will. Once it entered the Wielder’s small black room, it would definitely be locked down and imprisoned.","“Although I don’t know what’s going on, I feel very happy,” Father Goudan laughed happily, his dragon whiskers dancing in the air.","When Three-Eyed glared at him fiercely, Father Goudan felt as if his entire body had been pierced with acupuncture. No matter how sharp and piercing his gaze was, it still felt very comfortable!","He liked the way Three-Eyed looked at him, annoyed and helpless.","At the side, Song Shuhang put away the turtle shell immortal boat. At the same time, he said to the three-eyed teenager, embarrassed, “Senior, I left in a hurry after the gambling ceremony ended. I forgot to return this turtle shell immortal boat to you.”","After taking someone else’s thing and not returning it, he accidentally bumped into the person in question. It was a little awkward.","“It’s fine. Although you took the turtle shell immortal boat away, you also forgot your bet with me,” the three-eyed youth slowly said. “I thought you would remember your bet sooner or later. After that, you can come back to me to exchange for the immortal boat. But now it seems that you have really forgotten about the bet.”","“Bet? Heavens, Demon Emperor Og is still with you, Senior?” Song Shuhang suddenly remembered the Immortal Demon Emperor that he had brought along.","“Yes, he’s still with the Celestial Slaying Thunder. Don’t worry, he’s an Immortal. The Celestial Slaying Thunder will only hurt him a little, but it won’t kill him,” the three-eyed teenager explained.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Still being struck by lightning?","“Since he won’t die, then let him stay there a while longer. After I advance to Rank-9, I’ll find you for the last bet. At that time, Demon Emperor Og can still become part of the wager. However, it would be best if you could bring him out of the area of the Immortal Slaying Thunder first. After all, he is still heavily injured. If he is damaged, it will affect the quality of the wager,” Song Shuhang said.","At this time, Tyrannical Song was the ruler of the Netherworld.","“Alright, if I can go back, I’ll bring you a message,” the three-eyed teenager said, although he felt that he might not be able to return.","“In that case, let’s take this opportunity to study the relationship between the Wielder’s small black room and Scholar Fish-breasted’s cultivation technique,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and pointed in the air, projecting Scholar Drunken Eye’s cultivation technique text using his spiritual energy.","“According to our guesses, the Heavenly Dao Prison World created by Heavenly Dao Father Goudan is very likely related to this cultivation technique. Therefore, I want to see if I can find some inspiration or data from the Wielder’s small black room and analyze the cultivation techniques of the scholars,” Song Shuhang said.","The three-eyed youth also came over and carefully examined the opening page of this cultivation technique.","“Do you have an impression of this cultivation method?” Father Goudan suddenly said.","“Senior Three-Eyed, you’ve also come into contact with this cultivation technique?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","“I’m not sure,” the three-eyed youth shook his head.","“No, you must have come into contact with it. I’m sorry,” Father Goudan said. “The figure and traces of your existence under the pillar that you left behind in the black sea of the Ancient Nether World corresponding to the Black Dragon World of the old world have all been erased. Only one sentence is left behind.”","The Black Dragon World was a fragment of the old world. Its current size might not even be comparable to some of the small plane worlds in the myriad worlds. But it was a system of its own. There was the main world, and there was also the ancient underworld that corresponded to the main world. It had its own complete set of laws.","A portion of the top figures in the myriad worlds had gone to that Ancient Nether before vindicating their Dao.","The Three-Eyed Boss, the Striped Dragon Boss, Daoist Priest Virtue, White Wielder of the Will, the Scholarly Sage, the Demon Emperor—they had once left their own pillars in the Black Sea World and left their own ‘imprints’ under the pillars. Later generations could see the figure of the pillar’s owner through the imprints.","Among the many pillars, there was a pillar with the word “eyeball” drawn on it. However, the brand under the pillar had already been wiped away, leaving only a baffling sentence: “Is only immortality eternal? Hehe.”","Father Goudan was sure that the pillar was three-eyed, and all traces of its existence had been erased. This technique was exactly the same as the Wielder’s small black room.","“But I don’t have any relevant memories,” the three-eyed youth shook his head. “Even... It’s very likely that he did something to my memory.”","“Every Wielder of the Will has the habit of playing tricks on the ruler of the Netherworld,” Song Shuhang comforted Senior Three-Eyed, and said, “Senior Three-Eyed, your Wielder of the Will only tampered with your memories. It’s much better than White Wielder of the Will. Tiandao Bai is the one who really tampered with it!”","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","“In that case, I’m not the worst?”"]},{"number":2833,"title":"Chapter 2833 Body Memory Learning Method","paragraphs":["Chapter 2833 Body Memory Learning Method","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The three Sovereigns of the Nine Hells wandered through the space of the Heavenly Prison, studying the structure of the Heavenly Small Black Room.","“I may have a slight clue,” Father Goudan spoke up.","With a gentle stroke of his dragon beard, a complete manuscript titled “Forgotten Divine Art” appeared, filling in the missing information from Song Shuhang’s ‘Opening of the Divine Art’ projection. However, Father Goudan’s completed “Forgotten Divine Art” was written in ancient language—the original text he obtained.","The Sovereigns of the Nine Hells and the Heavenly Path originate from the same source. In some aspects of thinking, their differences won’t be too great. Especially in the way of deducing techniques, there are always clues to be found.","When Father Goudan created the ‘Heavenly Small Black Room’, he referred to the Divine Art series of Fish Neck Scholar. Therefore, under the circumstances where Sovereign of the Nine Hells Father Goudan had techniques, and the Small Black Room template were available, he could deduce things in his own way... Soon he found some clues.","Father Goudan glanced triumphantly at the three Sovereigns—the game was his again! He found the information data between the ‘Heavenly Prison World’ and Divine Art even faster than the three-eyegold Sovereign.","The three-eyed youth looked at Father Goudan, who suddenly had a smug expression and was puzzled—why did this guy suddenly have a ‘I won’ expression? As if he had successfully rubbed it against the ground?","Could this guy be planning to use the ‘Heavenly Prison Space’ to plot against me?","The senior three-eyed youth couldn’t help but secretly vigilant.","“I have to admit, Father Goudan, you found the information so quickly.” Song Shuhang said without changing his color, sending a wave of ‘blow-up’.","After blowing, he asked Father Goudan for advice, “So what is the connection between this Heavenly Small Black Room world and the Fish Neck Scholar’s series of techniques?”","“Haha, let me calculate for you, watch it!” Father Goudan said.","In the next moment, he used his dragon beard as a pen and spiritual force as ink to continuously write in the void.","Father Goudan wrote in ancient language that Song Shuhang could not understand at all—after all, the original text of “Forgotten Divine Art” was written in ancient language.","Song Shuhang felt confused.","But this is just the beginning!","Father Goudan’s dragon beard was flying like a pen. In addition to ancient language characters, there were also strings of ‘formulas’ similar to runes, which he wrote and engraved in the void.","Among these ‘formulas,’ each one contained the principles of Dao. If the cultivator’s strength was insufficient, just seeing these formulas would cause mental shock, coma, and vomiting.","Song Shuhang felt dazzled, not because of ‘insufficient realm’—although he was currently at the eighth rank, in fact, his 15 + 1 share of the original gods was far superior to ordinary ninth-ranked fairy. The rune characters and symbols contained in these formulas made him feel dazzling.","Although he couldn’t understand it, he still felt very powerful.","[Even if I can understand ‘ancient languages’, I may not be able to understand these ‘ormulas?’ Song Shuhang was self-aware.","Unless he went to the Nine Hells world and, under the blessing of the Nine Hells Sovereign, he might understand one or two.","Father Goudan continued to write.","Soon, the void in front of Song Shuhang and the senior three-eyed boy was filled with runes and formulas written by Father Goudan.","It was a full screen of complex formulas and deductions.","This move, even if released, could be turned into a ‘spiritual attack spell’, its name—desperation of the poor students!","In contrast to Song Shuhang’s confusion, the three-eyed young senior beside him.","At this point, the three-eyed young senior’s three eyes widened, quickly scanning Father Goudan’s written formulas and deduction processes.","Even Song Shuhang noticed that the three-eyed senior’s three eyes could simultaneously view three different perspectives, and analyze Father Goudan’s deduction process with one mind.","Song Shuhang, who also had three eyes, couldn’t do this. He could gather his eyes into a chicken fight, but he couldn’t distribute his eyeballs like left, right, and top.","This skill is really enviable.","Of course, what he envied more was the ability of the three-eyed young senior to easily understand Father Goudan’s formula deduction.","This ability cannot be learned in a short time.","This is a communication between top students, and people who are not strong enough have no qualifications to participate in this knowledge battle.","Song Shuhang secretly used the ‘original text, language rules’ in his body, and then vaguely understood the meaning of ancient characters—but he still couldn’t understand what the characters were supposed to express.","“I think I need thousands of years to participate in this battle of top students,” Song Shuhang calmly said.","His mentality is very calm, after all... youth is capital.","He still has plenty of time to learn.","When he proves eternal life in the future, he will have countless time to swim in the endless ocean of knowledge. He can even swim in various postures, breaststroke, butterfly, backstroke, freestyle, and dog-paddling, whatever he wants!","Opposite.","Father Goudan finally stopped writing deductions after covering an area the size of a runway playground.","“How about it, do you surrender?” Father Goudan turned around and looked at the three-eyed Sovereign.","“Very good.” The three-eyed young senior gave Father Goudan a thumbs-up. “After I figure out the principles... ”","“After figuring out the principles, you can’t create the ‘Heavenly Prison Space’ like I can. There are the permissions of Heavenly Path and Daoist instruments involved... You can’t gain the freedom to enter and exit the ‘Heavenly Prison Space’ because you are a ‘Heavenly Prison Space’ black household. At most, you can study the skills to erase your own existence imprint.” Father Goudan laughed.","“Do you have to be so childish?” The three-eyed young senior said with a headache. “There is a head to be wronged and a master to be owed. You want to fight the Heavenly Path, and what does it have to do with our Nine Hells Three Eyes? Why do you always fight me?”","Upon hearing this, Father Goudan fell into thought and nodded in agreement after a moment: “You say that, there is some truth.”","The two Sovereigns of the Nine Hells looked at each other, seemingly about to shake hands and make peace.","“But if I encounter bad luck, would you be happy?” Father Goudan suddenly asked.","“How could it be? I am not that kind of person who takes pleasure in other people’s misfortunes!” The three-eyed young senior said—but behind him, an illusionary meteorological map appeared at some point.","The weather in the image was as sunny and beautiful as the mood of the three-eyed young senior.","Father Goudan chuckled, “So am I.”","“You see, when I encounter bad luck, you will be happy... so will I.”","Although I’m going to fight the Heavenly Path, but when I see Nine Hells Three Eyes unlucky, I will be very happy.","The reason is so simple and pure.","“Father Goudan, if I master the deduction formulas you wrote + the core world in my hands, can I evolve the core world to create the effect of ‘Heavenly Prison’?” Song Shuhang suddenly had a bright idea and asked.","“Can!” Father Goudan affirmed.","“Can I still learn now? If so, it would be better to help me simplify these theories.” Song Shuhang said, remembering Senior Bai’s ‘Bai’s Simplified Learning Method for Rune’.","“No need to simplify, I have a better learning plan.” Father Goudan said, showing a kind smile.","A dragon’s face showed a kind father’s smile, which was very difficult and required cooperation from the love that surged from within.","Song Shuhang was confused.","“We can use the body learning method... use the body to remember these contents.” Father Goudan said, “Now, your true body should be practicing that Divine Art. We will try to make your true body cultivate that technique to the eighth or ninth grade! Let the Heavenly Tribulation ignore your insignificance.”"]},{"number":2834,"title":"Chapter 2834 The Ancient Wild Path Plan","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As long as you cultivated fast enough, the heavenly tribulation would not be able to catch up to you or even remember you.","“Cultivate Scholar Fish-Spleen’s Forgotten Divine Art to the Eighth or Ninth Stage Realm? Father Goudan, are you serious?” Song Shuhang stared at Father Goudan.","Didn’t Father Goudan know how difficult it was to cultivate a cultivation technique from the First Stage to the Eighth Stage?","Training was no child’s play.","It was also unlike playing games, where a few experience points could upgrade the divine technique he cultivated! No matter what cultivation technique it was, it needed to be down-to-earth and cultivated step by step.","Song Shuhang recalled that it had taken him more than eight months to reach the Eighth Stage Realm of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique!","If there were no fortuitous encounters or the help of natural treasures, it might take hundreds of thousands of years or even longer to practice the Forgotten Divine Skill to the eighth level.","Moreover, if Scholar Fish-Spleen’s divine arts were cultivated to the eighth or ninth realm, everyone in the universe would forget about him.","That kind of invisible state was too miserable. As for how miserable it was, one could see Scholar Fish-Spleen’s current situation.","Song Shuhang had reason to suspect that Father Goudan wanted to forget about Goudan Song and leave only Goudan Cheng behind to become Dan Dan’s father.","“I’m not joking. I’ve already deduced the relationship between the Heavenly Dao Prison and that scholar’s cultivation technique. With the results of my deduction and your current Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm, you only need a little help. With the help of the ‘Heavenly Dao Prison’ that can cut off the source, you’ll be able to push that divine technique to the Eighth Stage Realm and above very quickly,” Father Goudan smiled.","“Alright, even if there’s a way for me to quickly raise the Forgotten Divine Technique to the eighth grade, if a person cultivates several different cultivation techniques at the same time, and there’s no distinction between the main and auxiliary ones, it’s very easy to go berserk, right?” Song Shuhang asked.","In the process of cultivation, although cultivators would sometimes cultivate several cultivation techniques at the same time, one of them would always be the backbone while the others were supplementary. Moreover, the cultivation techniques that were cultivated at the same time would complement each other in terms of attributes, forming a cycle of the five elements.","If he cultivated recklessly, it was very likely that he would cause the attributes of his cultivation techniques to clash, go berserk, and explode.","“You don’t have to worry about this. In fact, your current state is very suitable for you to walk a cultivation path,” Father Goudan’s lips curled up. “Not only that ‘Forgotten Divine Technique,’ you can also cultivate a Merit and Morality-type technique and a Devil Dao technique. Then, through that kind of cultivation path, I can also cut off the cultivation technique I cultivated.”","Song Shuhang was alarmed.","Father Goudan really wants to lose me!","“Eh? Father Goudan, are you talking about the way to cut three corpses? That path was relatively wild, and it was popular for a period of time during the immemorial era. However, at most, it would reach the level of a ‘weak Immortal.’ The investment and effort would not be proportional, and it would be of little value. No one will use it in the later stages, right?” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“That’s because we’re too strong, that’s why we feel that the way to kill three corpses is too wild,” Father Goudan shook his dragon head handsomely.","These former Wielders of the Will were all prodigies who had suppressed their entire lives before they proved their Dao. Most of them had already figured out their own ‘path to immortality’ when they were at the Eighth Stage. They had just stepped into the Ninth Stage when they began to condense the embryonic form of their ‘Dao.’ Then, when their strength accumulated enough, they would naturally step into the realm of ‘immortality.’","Under such circumstances, the method of killing three corpses was naturally meaningless to them.","The reason why the method of severing the three corpses was not passed down was that when severing the three corpses’ obsession, there needed to be a powerful carrier to carry the severed three corpses. There were not many suitable powerful carriers in the myriad worlds.","“I feel that Ba Tian is also very strong. He doesn’t need the method of cutting three corpses even more than us,” the three-eyed young senior said. Little friend Tyrant Emperor had the fastest cultivation speed he had ever seen.","“Ba Tian?” Song Shuhang suddenly had a bad premonition.","“Yes, under normal circumstances, he wouldn’t need to use this method of killing three corpses. But look at Ba Wan’s current state. Although he’s only at the Eighth Stage Realm, he has a primordial spirit, physique, mental power, and spiritual power that are at or beyond the Ninth Stage Realm. In other words, even though he was still at the Eighth Stage, he could still play the ‘Three Separations’ technique that only Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders could do. This is an advantage,” Father Goudan said.","“It makes a little sense,” the three-eyed youth said with a nod.","Ba Wan? Another name change?","Not good.","I’m afraid I’m finished today.","“Then, look at Ba Dan’s pendant state. He has the materialization of his body of virtue, the materialization of his mental equipment, and a special ghost spirit that is closely connected to him but relatively independent. Don’t you think it’s a coincidence?” Father Goudan continued.","“Yes,” Senior Three-Eyed nodded slightly. “Correspond to the Good Corpse, Evil Corpse, and Self Corpse?”","“That’s right. Other than the lower level of the inner demon that materialized, the virtuous lamia and the special ghost spirit are very compatible,” Father Goudan said.","The virtuous lamia and the ghost fairy were closely connected to Song Shuhang and could be regarded as one entity. However, they were also independent entities with their own origins.","Unfortunately, the inner demon that Ba Dan materialized did not have such a great background and lacked the special attribute of being an independent individual.","“If only I could fuse Black Panther with Ba Yuan’s inner demon. The structure of Black Panther isn’t simple. I like it very much,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","“Red Cloud Sword’s inner demon is not bad either. The material feels better, and it has great potential,” Father Goudan said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Don’t be too domineering!","Black Panther and Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword are special. Don’t hurt them!","Moreover, I’m also very satisfied with my inner demon. This was a little cutie who knew how to cook the ‘Inner Demon Tribulation Set Meal.’ It was the only one in the universe who knew how to cook it, and Song Shuhang couldn’t bear to see it get hurt.","“Forget it, there is no such thing as perfection in this world. Although it lacks the ‘individual’ attribute, it doesn’t affect the effect of the ‘Three Separations’ path,” the three-eyed teenager said.","Father Goudan nodded and added, “Anyway, Tyrant, you can try. I see that your main body is currently cultivating in AFK Farming. You’re probably at the Fourth Stage Realm after cultivating the Forgotten Divine Technique. I can already vaguely remember your daoist name now. If not for the divinity display effect at the beginning of the string of ‘tyrant’ characters, I would have almost called you by the wrong Sage Name. Therefore, why don’t we rush our cultivation technique to the Eighth Stage in one go?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Father Goudan, you’ve already called me the wrong person several times.","“Moreover, if you had succeeded in the ‘Three Separations’ at the Eighth Stage, you might have been able to forcefully advance to the Ninth Stage before transcending the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage. After that, I’ll go back and transcend the tribulation before strengthening again,” the three-eyed teenager analyzed.","Song Dan should be familiar with the method of leveling up before transcending the tribulation.","At that time, with the strengthening effect of the heavenly tribulation, Tyrant’s Foot should be able to rise to the level of a weak Immortal in one go."]},{"number":2835,"title":"Chapter 2835 The Master of All Laws Learning Mode","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In addition, Song Shuhang already had a trace of the embryonic form of the ‘Dao,’ although it was still very weak. However, that was indeed the essence of Song Shuhang’s unique Great Dao of Immortality.","In this way, Song Shuhang first killed his three corpses, transcended the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, advanced to the ‘weak Immortal’ realm after transcending the tribulation, and perfected his Great Dao of Immortality.","A wide road with five cars running side by side appeared.","According to this method, Song Shuhang would be able to squeeze into the ranks of Immortals in the shortest time possible. He didn’t need to worry too much about the process of accumulating spiritual energy.","Song Shuhang was still the master of a world and had the official qualification of a ‘world master.’ As the lord of a realm, his spiritual power accumulation speed was very fast, so he did not have to worry about this problem at all.","“Interesting, very interesting. It’s worth a challenge,” the three-eyed youth said.","On the side, Father Goudan also revealed a satisfied smile. Three-Eyed had once again submitted to his wisdom and had no choice but to agree with his idea of ‘killing three corpses.’ In terms of intelligence, he had already pressed Three-Eyed Boy to the ground!","As if sensing Father Goudan’s gaze, the three-eyed youth turned his head and looked at the striped dragon with a strange smile on his face. He was dumbfounded.","What was wrong with the striped sock dragon today? First, he smiled at him with ill intentions.","What does he want to do to me?","“So, Shuhang, what is your choice?” Father Goudan asked.","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment and then asked, “Will it hurt Fairy @#%& and the ghost fairy?”","Although the virtuous lamia had the hobby of sacrificing herself to the pillar and had the special attribute of being immortal as long as Song Shuhang didn’t die, there were similar legends about this method of ‘cutting three corpses’ that had been passed down from ancient times in the modern Dao Sect. In short, it sounded very high-class.","Song Shuhang was worried that this ‘Three Separations’ technique would cause the virtuous lamia and the ghost fairy to suffer from the root of the problem.","“Not really. On the contrary, it’s beneficial to them,” Father Goudan replied. No matter how much he cheated, he wouldn’t cheat Song Dan’s ghost fairy. To Father Goudan, the ghost spirit fairy was much more important than Song Goudan.","“Then, let’s try it first,” Song Shuhang said. “I’m currently practicing the Forgotten Divine Technique. What should I cut first?”","Father Goudan thought for a moment. “The Forgotten Divine Technique corresponds to your ghost fairy spirit. It’ll be the carrier of the self-corpse’s obsession.”","The three-eyed youth added, “The Merit Fairy and the Good Separation’s obsessions correspond, but the first step is not to kill the Good Separation.”","“So, the first step is to kill the evil corpse’s obsession? But I don’t have the corresponding demonic cultivation technique. It’s not just the Demon Emperor’s Demon God Pillar; it was originally a pretty good demonic divine art, but I’ve already changed it into the Tyrant God Pillar secret art,” Song Shuhang said.","On the contrary, the divine technique corresponding to the obsession of the virtuous corpse was easier to solve. The virtuous lamia had the Dual System Virtue Technique, which was the supreme Virtue Heart Sutra. Song Shuhang had also touched upon it before, so he only needed to increase the speed of the cultivation of this technique.","“The Overlord God Pillar is enough. After all, it is based on Fellow Daoist’s Demon God Pillar, a pure demonic cultivation method. It’s completely enough to be used as a carrier technique to kill the evil corpse’s obsession,” Father Goudan replied.","Speaking of the Demon Emperor, who was once known as the Twin Kings of the East and West of the Myriad Worlds, Father Goudan missed him very much.","This was how old people were. It was easy to reminisce about the past and reminisce about the past.","“It’s not just this fellow. It’s mainly because he didn’t have enough talent at birth. He only had eight dragon patterns at the fifth grade. Otherwise, with his creativity and hard work, he would have been able to last at least ten more moves against me in the final battle back then!” Father Goudan sighed. He had a very high opinion of the Demon Emperor.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He silently copied down this sentence and sent it to Lady Long Luo.","Father Goudan’s words would become Lady Long Luo’s spear against the Demon Emperor! One stab could accurately pierce through the heart of more than the Demon Emperor, causing him to be so heartbroken that he could not breathe.","“Right! Why don’t we think of a way to squeeze out Fellow Daoist More than One’s inner demon and fuse it into Bagou’s inner demon?” Father Goudan was reminiscing about the past and thinking about the Demon Emperor who had once fought with him. Suddenly, such a good idea came to his mind.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","As expected of the ruler of the Netherworld. The real one was different from his agent. As the ruler of the Netherworld, he couldn’t think of such a brilliant idea.","However...","“It’s not just the devil emperor’s heart demon. Forget it,” Song Shuhang shook his head and said. “He wants nothing more than to skin me alive and pull out my tendons. I don’t dare to leave his inner demon behind and make it a hidden danger.”","In this universe, Song Shuhang was definitely in the top three on the list of people the Demon Emperor hated the most. Father Goudan was definitely in the top two!","“Then forget it. It’s a pity. It’s obviously a good idea.” After saying this much, Father Goudan got up and went to Song Shuhang’s side. He curled his dragon beard, and a field-sized deduction rune formula that he had written in the void was condensed into the shape of a God-beating Whip.","When Song Shuhang saw this whip, his scalp immediately went numb.","“Then, Three-Eyed and I will work together. I’m responsible for letting your body remember the contents of these ‘deduction formulas.’ Three-Eyed Boy is in charge of teaching you the way to ‘Slay Three Corpses.’ After that, you only need to cultivate the divine arts of the scholar’s line and be prepared to kill the evil corpse,” Father Goudan said as he gripped the whip tightly with his single claw.","“How do I use my body to memorize this knowledge?” Song Shuhang asked in a hurry.","Pa! The whip in Father Goudan’s paw flicked lightly in the air. “Remember physics. I will use the whip of knowledge to whip you hard. Every whip will imprint knowledge on your body. When this whip is done, you will be able to use your body to grasp and understand all the knowledge.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I don’t believe it!","Who in this world would whip people with knowledge and make them learn?","You definitely wanted to give me a beating and found an excuse!","“Don’t dodge. If you dodge, it won’t work,” Father Goudan laughed maniacally.","Pa! The whip arrived in front of Song Shuhang, but it didn’t hit his body. Instead, it passed through his body. In this place, Song Shuhang was just a projection of his primordial spirit.","The whip of knowledge directly cut through the source and hit Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit, allowing his body to withstand it.","At this time, Song Shuhang’s automatic defense system was activated.","Under the lead of the Defiant Whale Fairy, the two weapon spirits of the Combined Magical Treasure appeared and protected Song Shuhang.","The ghost spirit stretched out her hands to receive the whip of knowledge.","The whip landed on the ghost spirit fairy’s hands and spread out into countless runes.","A portion of the runes of this knowledge was accepted by the ghost fairy spirit, while a portion was accepted by the weapon spirits of the 66 life-bound magical treasures.","The weapon spirits of these 66 life-bound magical treasures were like sponges, greedily absorbing the knowledge in the runes.","Moreover, they had the aptitude to understand this knowledge!","Learning the life-bound magical treasure meant that Song Shuhang had learned it as well.","All the information was absorbed and digested by the ghost fairy spirit and the 66 cuties. Then, they combined this knowledge and simplified it into information that Song Shuhang could understand and fed it back to Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit.","Song Shuhang, the master of all laws, activated the learning mode."]},{"number":2836,"title":"Chapter 2836 Pure as a Lily","paragraphs":["Chapter 2836 Pure as a Lily","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang felt like he was practically a cripple. Even his few remaining hobbies, like the “learning function,” had been divided up by the pendants all over his body.","Now, Song Shuhang couldn’t think of anything he could still do.","Lines and dialogues were split among Fairy Virtue, Fairy Creation, and Black Panther.","The task of upgrading the “cultivation chat” talent was handled by Madam Long Luo.","Beating up the Immortals of the various worlds was taken care of by Song Pangqiu.","Training was managed by the ghost fairy and the Inner World, and he also had the support of the “Heavenly Emperor’s” epiphany card.","In terms of spell cultivation, he was striving to advance toward the great path of the Variant, the Master of All Spells.","Almost everything a cultivator could do was better handled by the pendants on Song Shuhang.","Now, even learning knowledge had been divided and taken over.","“Am I just supposed to shout ‘666’?” Song Shuhang mused, recalling the holy ape phantom above his head. Shouting ‘666’ was something the Holy Apes were professionals at.","In this scenario, Song Shuhang’s only role was to use the “Saber Nurturing Technique.”","“This is life,” Song Shuhang suddenly sighed.","Father Goudan was confused.","“Yes, this is life,” replied the three-eyed youth. His divine third eye lit up, forcefully feeding Song Shuhang the contents of the secret technique of the “Ancient Three Separations Slayer.”","In ancient times, the methods to kill the three corpses were as varied as the current [Sword Nurturing Art]. Some major sects had their own versions of the “Three Separations” methods.","Ultimately, these “Three Separations” methods were similar in origin. Each sect had its own research and tricks for the “carrier” of the Three Separations.","First, kill the evil corpse, then the good corpse, and finally the self-corpse. After the Three Separations Slash, the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender could break through limits, reaching the level of “weak Immortals,” and slightly extending their lifespan.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection sat cross-legged, guarded by two rulers of the Netherworld.","Within a few seconds, the “presence” of Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection became weaker and more transparent.","Combining Father Goudan’s deduction formula with the Wielder’s small black room’s effects exponentially strengthened the cultivation process of a scholar’s divine technique.","“Is your Knowledge Whip so powerful?” the three-eyed youth couldn’t help but be astonished.","The whip-style education program that Father Goudan had developed was truly surprising.","With just a whip, one could learn a vast amount of complex knowledge and even understand it. Why would cultivators still painstakingly comprehend the Dao, listen to the Dao, and understand it?","Everyone lined up to let Father Goudan whip them, instantly grasping profound cultivation knowledge.","“Of course. The principle behind this Knowledge Whip is extremely complicated. You wouldn’t understand even if I explained it,” Father Goudan said proudly.","But in fact, he was also puzzled. Who knew why Song Shuhang could absorb all the formulas so quickly with just one whip?","It felt as if dozens or even hundreds of people were helping Song Shuhang learn and absorb this knowledge.","Moreover, those helping Song Shuhang deduce and learn had to possess the knowledge level of the ruler of the Netherworld.","Could it be that Overlord Sword is really a genius at learning? Father Goudan couldn’t help but think.","After all, Tyrant Hammer was a student at a prestigious university in the modern world, with excellent grades.","Could it be that we’ve always underestimated Tyrant Hook?","However, no matter how shocked he was internally, Father Goudan showed no reaction. He wanted to maintain a high and mighty posture, shocking Three-Eyed Boy.","Song Shuhang’s official practice this time lasted a long time.","A full 24 hours had passed in the outside world, but Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit was still in a state of cultivation.","This time, he didn’t pull the training program to the background to run. He wasn’t distracted, dreaming, or multitasking. Instead, he trained quietly for a full 24 hours like a real cultivator.","Moreover, his cultivation state wasn’t over yet. It seemed he could continue for a very long time.","In the main world, Overlord World.","Song Shuhang’s main body’s existence was almost non-existent. The Forgotten Divine Technique of the scholar’s faction was quite compatible with him, and he could cultivate it rapidly.","The newly formed spiritual energy of the Forgotten Divine Technique and Song Shuhang’s Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique didn’t clash. Instead, they complemented each other.","The spirit energy of the Forgotten Divine Technique was like wind, pushing the spirit energy of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Technique, accelerating accumulation, and improving quality.","On the other hand, Song Shuhang’s Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm and Tribulation Transcender-level strength also helped him practice the Forgotten Divine Technique, accelerating progress.","In just 24 hours, with the help of his realm, Father Goudan’s deduction formula, and the effects of the Wielder’s small black room, Song Shuhang’s Forgotten Divine Technique had reached the peak of the seventh level, just a breath away from breaking through to the eighth level.","This was the same logic as when the big shots practiced low-level spells; they only needed to glance to understand the structure and principle of the spell and could master it instantly.","Father Goudan’s analysis of the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, the Wielder of the Will’s small black room’s effects, and Song Shuhang’s Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender-level strength were all powerful aids to his cultivation.","Not only that, but while Song Shuhang was practicing the Forgotten Divine Technique, his ghost fairy spirit would also synchronize with him, raising the level of his Forgotten Divine Technique.","The ghost spirit fairy’s mastery of this divine technique was very high.","She was like a Bugatti, carrying Song Shuhang along the path of the Forgotten Divine Technique, speeding up crazily, launching deadly attacks repeatedly.","A few breaths later, the ghost spirit fairy synchronized with Song Shuhang again and took off with him.","Under her synchronization, Song Shuhang’s Forgotten Divine Technique, which had been stagnant for a while, broke through again and entered the eighth level in a berserk manner.","At this point, Song Shuhang’s practice of the Forgotten Divine Technique came to an end.","After resting for a while, the ling power in his body started to circulate the cultivation method of the Overlord God Pillar.","The contents of the “Three Separations Secret Technique” that the three-eyed young man had poured into Song Shuhang’s brain were retrieved from the D disk in Song Shuhang’s mind and slowly unfolded.","The method to kill the evil corpse and the secret technique to entrust the evil corpse’s obsession to a carrier appeared first.","From Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection’s nose, mouth, and ears, mist quietly emerged and covered his face.","Everyone would have some evil thoughts or obsessions they couldn’t let go of.","However, the mist that came out of Song Shuhang’s nose, mouth, and ears was as pure as snow.","Father Goudan was confused.","Senior Three-Eyed Youth was startled.","This pure white mist represented that Ba Pan was as pure as a lily, without a trace of evil intentions.","But it was impossible for humans to have no evil thoughts.","Unless Ba Tong wasn’t human."]},{"number":2837,"title":"Chapter 2837 The belly button is black, it’s evil!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2837 The belly button is black, it’s evil!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Ba Tong was, of course, a real person. Although he was in the form of an Essence Soul projection, the method of Slaying Three Separations connected the Essence Soul projection, Essence Soul, and true body.","“Three-Eyed, is there something wrong with the ‘Three Separations Secret Technique’ you taught me? The first corpse he killed wasn’t an Evil Corpse but a Good Corpse?” Father Goudan couldn’t help but ask.","It wasn’t the first time he had met Song Dan, so he naturally knew Song Shuhang’s character.","Although Ba Bei was kind, helpful, and full of positive energy, it was impossible to say that he did not have any evil thoughts or obsessions in his heart.","Song Shuhang’s character was just a very ordinary and kind-hearted young man, excluding the influence of external factors.","Although he was kind and upright, there were times when he was greedy for certain things, such as spiritual stones. He also had an obsession with certain things, such as death and resurrection artifacts. He would also harbor malicious intentions, such as when he took advantage of the blacklisted big shots.","“The secret technique I taught him was correct. It’s a very basic Three Separations Secret Technique. The first corpse is definitely an Evil Corpse,” the three-eyed senior youth slowly said.","Father Goudan straightened his long beard and pointed at the pure white fog that covered Song Shuhang’s face. “Then, what’s wrong with this fog? Can you give me an explanation?”","At this moment, the pure white mist that was spewing out from Ba Bu’s mouth and nose was simply blinding his eyes!","When slaying evil corpses, they should be spewing out an evil black mist. This white mist was like a white flower, and it had a strong provocative smell. Was it trying to pick a fight?","“Isn’t the answer obvious? Believe everything you see! Little friend Ba Da was a true little white flower. He seemed to be obsessed with spirit stones. But in fact, these were just appearances!","His true heart is as pure as this white mist,” the three-eyed young senior spoke, closing his divine third eye. He really couldn’t lie with three eyes open.","Therefore, at the very least, he could close his divine third eye and lie with his eyes open!","Father Goudan was speechless.","Do you believe what you say? If you believe it, open your third eye!","Moreover, if Ba Da was really a ‘little white flower,’ then how did his inner demon come about? He had to have some raw materials to condense his inner demons, right?","“If the first corpse is an Evil Corpse and Ba Da can’t form the Evil Corpse Obsession, then he might fail,” Father Goudan said after sighing.","“Don’t be nervous. Think about the reason. Even if he was a tyrant, it was impossible for him to not have any obsessions or evil thoughts in his life. Therefore, there must be a reason for this. Let’s deduce it properly,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","Father Goudan drew symbols in the air with his dragon whiskers as he pondered.","Then, he suggested a few possibilities. “I haven’t seen many people with such a profound power of virtue since the immemorial era. The overly large power of virtue suppressed his evil thoughts?”","“Or perhaps, his ‘evil thoughts’ and ‘obsessions,’ or something similar, have been purified by someone?”","“It’s also possible that something has already absorbed his evil thoughts in advance?”","The three-eyed youth replied, “The evil thoughts drawn out by the secret technique of Slaying the Three Separations should not be suppressed by the power of virtue. However, Ba Da’s power of virtue was too strong, so it was really possible. As for the possibility of the malicious obsession being purified, could it be related to the Scholarly Sage? The last possibility was that the malicious obsession had been absorbed in advance... This is it!”","“Right?” Father Goudan reacted at the same time. “The authority of the ruler of the Netherworld?”","“And Song Four, Song Youyou, who was born with the corresponding authority of the ruler of the Netherworld,” the three-eyed youth said.","This was it!","The ruler of the Netherworld, as the counterpart of the Heavenly Dao, was an existence that gathered all negative energies such as evil, destruction, disaster, death, blood, and slaughter.","With Bai Youyou’s support, Ba Da obtained the temporary authority of the ruler of the Netherworld and gave birth to Song Four, the ruler of the Netherworld.","The moment Song Four was born, all the evil thoughts in Tyrant’s body had probably been taken away. In fact, as long as Song Four was still around, all the ‘obsessions’ born from Tyrant’s main body would automatically be categorized and transferred to Song Four.","“Then can Song Youyou be considered a tyrant’s ‘evil corpse’?” Father Goudan frowned.","“The ruler of the Netherworld is of a much higher level than the ‘evil corpse,’” the three-eyed young senior shook his head and said. “It’s the same even if he’s just an agent.”","“It’s nerve-racking,” Father Goudan said.","He had thought that Song Shuhang would kill the most ordinary and least unique of the three corpses. From the looks of it, this ‘evil corpse’ was actually the most special part of Song Shuhang’s body.","“Do you have a solution?” As Father Goudan spoke, he used his tentacle to draw in the void and began to deduce.","“Unless Song Four disappears, this problem will never be solved,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","Song Four, as an individual, would disappear sooner or later. After all, he was only a substitute ruler of the Netherworld, and his term would eventually expire.","But the problem was...no one knew when Song Four would disappear.","“Then we can only solve the problem from another angle.” Father Goudan waved his dragon beard in the air and said, “I’m going to reconstruct the secret technique of ‘Slaying Three Separations.’ I’ll skip the stage of ‘Slaying Evil Separation.’ I’ll first kill the Good Separation and the Self-centric Separation.” He adjusted the order of the three corpses. “When the situation permits, I’ll get Ba Da to replace the evil corpse.”","“I think so. This is a way to solve the problem,” the three-eyed youth nodded.","Father Goudan smiled—look, he was one step ahead of Three-Eyed.","Ever since he entered the Heavenly Dao Prison, he had suppressed Three-Eyed over and over again in terms of intelligence. He was the first to discover and solve any problem.","Three-Eyed could only shout “666” at him from the side, and he was completely useless.","Father Goudan was in a good mood.","Senior Three-Eyed was startled.","Why did it feel like the striped sock dragon was inexplicably happy again?","Did it take the wrong medicine today?","Just as Father Goudan and the three-eyed young man were preparing to take drastic measures to solve the problem of the three corpses, Song Shuhang’s condition changed again.","The ‘pure white fog’ he spat out began to condense into form. In the blink of an eye, it condensed into the form of a person.","This was the prelude to the success of Executing Three Separations.","Father Goudan was confused.","Could it be that Ba Da had figured out a way to kill the Good Separation first?","Just as he was in deep thought, Song Shuhang exhaled.","The white mist figure lightly jumped into Song Shuhang’s shadow.","Then, a mechanical heart demon’s palm slowly stretched out from the shadow.","A moment later...","This cute little demon had completely crawled out of the shadow.","After it appeared, it slowly turned around and took the form of Song Shuhang, who was dressed in white.","After the white-robed Song Shuhang appeared, he grabbed his clothes and looked at his belly button. “Fortunately, my belly button is black.”"]},{"number":2838,"title":"Chapter 2838 True to Myself, Gentle and Considerate","paragraphs":["Chapter 2838 True to Myself, Gentle and Considerate","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even if only his belly button was black, even if there was just a tiny bit of obsession, it could represent his identity as an “evil corpse” and wouldn’t disgrace the evil corpses.","After examining his belly button, the evil corpse in white, Shuhang, let his shirt fall back down and elegantly tidied his clothes.","With his white-robed scholar attire, his “gentle and warm” appearance, and his elegant and unrestrained movements, he looked exactly like a scholar and gentleman who had stepped out of an ancient painting.","Perhaps his appearance was the only aspect of Song Shuhang that hadn’t been absorbed by Song Youyou.","After straightening himself up, the evil corpse in white, Shuhang, bowed to Song Shuhang and said indifferently, “This poor monk is Ba Er. Greetings, Senior.”","As the first corpse of the three corpses, he was formed from Song Shuhang’s “malicious obsession,” the Godly Overlord Pillar, and the inner demon carrier.","In addition, he had also inherited a saber intent from Song Shuhang. It was the additional sword-shaped saber intent that Song Shuhang had just won from the gambling ceremony of Senior Three-Eyed.","“There’s no need to be so polite, Fellow Daoist. You and I are one,” Song Shuhang said, raising his head and faintly smiling. This very cool line was part of the script of the “Three Separations Secret Technique” that the three-eyed youth had taught him.","After each “Three Separations” was cut out, they would report to the main body and give their own Daoist name, or the main body would give them a Daoist name. The “Three Separations” that would give themselves a Daoist name were all of relatively high quality. When they were “born,” their Daoist name would be born with them, just like the “real names” of the children of some powerful races in the myriad worlds.","And when the three corpses meet the main body, the main body needs to reply to the above conversation.","It was filled with a sense of ritual.","“Fortunately, the ‘Three Corpse Slaying Secret Technique’ comes with its own lines. Otherwise, Ba Mie might have used the Blade Nurturing Technique on his evil corpse and forcefully entered the state of ‘human and corpse,’” the three-eyed youth thought to himself.","As he pondered, the three-eyed senior suddenly realized that Father Goudan seemed to have the same expression on his face.","The two arch-enemies of the Netherworld looked at each other in tacit understanding, then nodded slightly at the same time.","Clearly, Father Goudan and the three-eyed youth were thinking the same thing.","In front of Song Shuhang, the white-robed Song Shuhang, “Ba Er,” faintly smiled. He elegantly bowed to Song Shuhang once again and said, “Then, this poor monk won’t disturb this venerable self from executing the three corpses. This venerable self, please continue.”","Since they were originally one body, he could naturally sense that Song Shuhang was about to kill the three corpses in one go.","“Fellow Daoist Ba Er is indeed me. You’re so considerate,” Song Shuhang praised. Praising oneself required a strong inner quality and extremely thick skin. However, the three corpses who praised him felt it was very natural. This was the difference between boasting directly and indirectly.","The corners of the evil corpse’s white-robed Song Shuhang’s mouth curled up. He turned around slightly and transformed into Song Shuhang’s “Little Cutie.”","The “evil corpse” that was transformed from the inner demon had inherited Song Shuhang’s Godly Overlord Pillar, Sword-shaped Saber Intent, and other techniques. It also possessed all the characteristics of the inner demon.","Due to the special nature of the carrier, the evil corpse could freely switch between the Little Cutie Heart Demon and the Evil Corpse Tyrant.","After turning back into the little cutie, the mechanical arm timidly retracted back into Song Shuhang’s shadow and handed him a portion of “demon cuisine” that had been fried.","Song Shuhang currently had quite a lot of “raw materials” for the inner demon. Apart from Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Chu Chu’s experiments, there was also a portion for the inner demon cutie.","“This time, there’s no need,” Song Shuhang said, stretching out his hand and gently touching the little cutie. “I’m currently in the form of a primordial spirit projection, so I can’t eat the demon’s cuisine.”","And so, the Little Cutie Heart Demon seemed to “heave a sigh of relief” and shrank back.","Song Shuhang closed his eyes again, accumulating spiritual energy and adjusting the state of “Three Separations.”","After successfully killing the evil corpse, Song Shuhang felt that his state of mind and Dao heart had been strengthened once again. In fact, the strengthening of his Dao heart and state of mind didn’t affect him much.","He, Song, had experienced unimaginable storms in his life.","If his life experiences were made into a movie, even Immortals would be dumbfounded.","Furthermore, he had the bonus of entering the dream.","The strength of Song Shuhang’s Dao heart and mental state could no longer be described with “data.” They were so strong that they were indescribable.","Even if it was a disaster like the collapse of the universe, Song Shuhang would still actively face it.","In this world, there was no setback that could hit Tyrannical Song, except for losing his treasured private stash of money and spirit stones.","No matter how powerful a man was, the moment his secret money was dug out, his eyes would lose their luster.","“Speaking of which, killing three corpses in the Wielder’s small black room is a pretty good choice,” the three-eyed teenager said, pinching his chin.","Under normal circumstances, the process of “severing three corpses” would attract heavenly tribulation. It wasn’t a heavenly tribulation for cultivators to advance but a “Dharma treasure tribulation.” The Three Separations Society was considered an extreme “Dharma treasure” that needed to be tempered by the heavenly tribulation.","And while he was in the Wielder’s small black room, the heavenly tribulation targeting the “three corpses” didn’t condense.","“It’s just delayed. Once Tyrant’s Three Separations appear in the main world, the Heavenly Tribulation will still make up for it. However, the Heavenly Tribulation targeting the Three Separations was just that. Perhaps it will merge with Tyrant’s heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage and increase its power or something,” Father Goudan analyzed.","“The stronger the power of the heavenly tribulation, the better the tempering effect. For Ba Jiao, it’s worth a try,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","Just as they were talking, a dazzling golden light shone from Song Shuhang’s body, causing Father Goudan and the three-eyed youth to stop talking.","“Light of virtue...” Father Goudan retreated ten meters.","“It’s only the light of virtue. It’s still acceptable,” the three-eyed senior youth also retreated and said.","Compared to the holy light power of “law-abiding kindness” that was completely opposite to the Nine Nether, the light of virtue was a positive energy that was more neutral.","The ruler of the Netherworld also hated the power of the light of virtue, but it was much better than the holy light. It was almost the difference between 100 points and 80 points.","“It’s time to try to kill the Good Separation,” Father Goudan said.","“However,” the three-eyed young senior said, “before he kills the Good Separation, he has to cultivate the cultivation technique related to merit to the Eighth Stage Realm.”","“This is not difficult for him. The strength of his power of virtue is obvious,” Father Goudan said.","As he spoke, the light of the power of virtue on Song Shuhang’s body became more and more dazzling.","The Dual System Virtue Technique had a mysterious origin, and its creator had an extremely profound vision. This cultivation technique could not be mastered by just immersing oneself in bitter cultivation.","Rather than focusing on bitter cultivation, it paid more attention to the strength of the cultivator’s power of virtue.","When necessary, it could consume the cultivator’s “merit” to raise the level of this cultivation technique, as long as the body could withstand it!"]},{"number":2839,"title":"Chapter 2839 Tyrant’s Comfort","paragraphs":["Chapter 2839 Tyrant’s Comfort","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If he cultivated the Dual System Virtue Technique while also practicing a body-tempering technique and possessed enough power of virtue, he could achieve cross-realm cultivation.","As long as he had sufficient merit and a robust body, cultivating the sixth level of the Dual System Virtue Technique at the Fifth Stage Realm was theoretically feasible.","In the present world:","Song Shuhang’s main body began to operate the Dual System Virtue Technique and once again commenced high-speed cultivation. This time, the driver was Fairy @#%×.","Among the myriad worlds, Song Shuhang was the least lacking in ‘power of virtue.’ His physique, primordial spirit, mental energy, and spiritual energy had all reached the level of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. Cultivating the Dual System Virtue Technique would yield twice the results with half the effort.","Additionally, during the cultivation process, he was guided by the virtuous lamia, who was at the level of a weak Immortal. He could also use his ‘power of virtue’ to overcome the technique’s barriers.","The cultivation speed of the Dual System Virtue Technique was even faster than the Forgotten Divine Technique.","After all, Song Shuhang had a special light of virtue that could materialize Fairy @#%×.","When others cultivated the Dual System Virtue Technique, they needed to comprehend and cultivate it bit by bit.","However, for Song Shuhang, cultivating this technique was like copying it from the virtuous lamia. The entire process was equivalent to copying a file from disk E to disk D.","During the copying process, there was also the power of virtue to accelerate it, making it incredibly fast.","Soon, the Dual System Virtue Technique within Song Shuhang’s body was pushed to the ninth level, equivalent to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, and reached the level that Sage Monarch Melon Eater dreamed of! Back then, because there was no ninth level, Sage Monarch Melon Eater was stuck at the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm and couldn’t advance.","The moment the Dual System Virtue Technique broke through to the ninth level, the virtuous lamia emerged from behind Song Shuhang’s main body.","She extended her hand and pointed in the air.","The Tyrant God Pillar and Virtuous Pillars appeared.","The virtuous lamia summoned the ‘virtuous fat whale’ and ‘virtuous lightning tribulation tree.’ Like a knight wielding a lance, she held the shrunken virtuous lightning tribulation tree and climbed onto the virtuous fat whale.","“Go,” Fairy @#%× called out softly.","The virtuous fat whale carried her and the virtuous lightning tribulation tree and smashed its head against the pillar, sacrificing itself to strengthen the pillar. If it continued sacrificing itself to the pillar like this, one day this special pillar would surpass the ‘more than one pillar’ and become one of the top three main pillars among Song Shuhang’s ‘overlord divine pillars.’","At that time, the ‘more than one pillar’ would fall out of the top three, becoming the fourth strongest pillar.","After sacrificing itself to the pillar, the virtuous lamia, the virtuous fat whale, and the virtuous lightning tribulation tree all disappeared, entering the ‘resurrection’ period.","Inside the Wielder’s small black room:","The power of virtue on Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection exploded.","The Dual System Virtue Technique was fully activated.","A few breaths later:","The power of virtue ‘resurrected’ in his body.","The invincible female knight, the virtuous lamia, held the virtuous lightning tribulation tree in her hand and rode the virtuous fat whale back from death. She used Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection as a resurrection point and reappeared in the martial world.","“The Knight of Merit is here to obey the summons. Are you my Ba?” Fairy @#%× recited her lines solemnly as soon as she appeared.","She had to appear in a ceremonial manner and establish new character traits to surpass Fairy Creation.","However, as soon as she finished speaking, Fairy @#%× frowned.","Just now, she had intended to recite Song Shuhang’s Sage Name, but although she had the correct Sage Name in her mind, she mispronounced it when she spoke. Moreover, the Sage Name Tyrant Bar was too advantageous.","This tyrant name had broken her momentum.","Fairy @#%×’s morale: -1.","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","Father Goudan was speechless.","To be honest, if Fairy @#%× hadn’t materialized from the power of virtue, Father Goudan would have taken a liking to her personality.","After all, was this her daughter-in-law?","Even if she was a bit playful, Father Goudan was very tolerant of her.","Even knowing she was a manifestation of the light of virtue, he wouldn’t hate her existence.","As long as there was love, there would be no disgust.","Love was a magical thing. Extreme love could surpass everything!","“Fairy @#% ¥, you and I are one after all. I didn’t expect that even you would call me by the wrong name,” Song Shuhang raised his head and sighed.","He thought that at least the virtuous lamia, who was one with him, wouldn’t forget his Sage Name and wouldn’t be affected by the cultivation technique.","The side effects of the cultivation techniques of the scholars were truly terrifying.","Therefore, he had to kill the Good Separation and Self-centric Separation as soon as possible.","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, Fairy Virtue looked at him as if he was trash.","He could barely call her by her name, yet he still had the cheek to scold her?","The only time he had called her name correctly was under the blessing of the ‘Language Origin Law.’","Eyes were indeed the biggest cover-up. They could only see the rice grains on other people’s faces, but not the tender green onion leaves on their own teeth.","“I’ll look for Madam Long Luo later and see if she can operate on my tongue,” Song Shuhang laughed dryly. He was one with Fairy Virtue, so he naturally understood the meaning of her gaze.","Then, he forcefully changed the topic. “Then, Fairy Virtue, please cooperate with me and cut out the Good Separation!”","“My tyrant, I obey your command. From now on, my tree will be with you, and your fate will be with me.” The virtuous lamia lowered her head from time to time, looking at the lines in her palm while reading.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He felt that Soft Feather might like the side effects of the Forgotten Divine Technique. This way, she would be able to obtain many Daoist names in a day.","Additionally, he was glad that everyone still remembered the ‘Ba’ as the holy name’s prefix, and the virtuous lamia always added the word ‘mouth’ to her name. At least this ‘mouth’ had a slight connection with his ‘Ba’ holy name, which gave him some comfort.","After consoling himself, Song Shuhang closed his eyes and began to execute the ‘good corpse.’","In the distance:","Father Goudan proudly said to the three-eyed boy, “Three-eyed boy, did you see that? Fairy @#%×, who was conjured by the power of virtue, has a good personality, right? She’s my daughter’s girlfriend.”","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","Where should I start complaining?","However, when he saw Fairy @#%×, for some reason, the three-eyed youth thought of his old butler.","“You must be envious,” Father Goudan said.","“No, I’m not envious at all,” the three-eyed youth said.","“You’re being stubborn.”","“Childish!” the three-eyed youth said.","The two rulers of the Netherworld looked at each other, and their auras began to turn solemn.","“Slash!” At this time, Song Shuhang shouted.","The Dual System Virtue Technique was slashed out along with his ‘good thought,’ falling towards Fairy @#%×... the tree spear in his hand!","This change was beyond the expectations of the three-eyed youtj and Father Goudan."]},{"number":2840,"title":"Chapter 2840 The Knight and the Forty-Meter Lance","paragraphs":["Chapter 2840 The Knight and the Forty-Meter Lance","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Originally, Father Goudan and the three-eyed youth thought that Song Shuhang’s ‘good corpse’ would use the virtuous lamia as a carrier. However, once Song Shuhang’s ‘good corpse’ was slashed out, it went straight for the virtuous tribulation lightning tree in the virtuous lamia’s hand and actively crashed into the muzzle of the gun.","“What’s going on?” Father Goudan asked.","“If you ask me, who should I ask?” the three-eyed youth replied. “You know Ba Xuan better than I do. Why are you asking me?”","Father Goudan was speechless.","Could it be because Song Dan’s surname was ‘Song,’ which has the character for ‘wood’ in it, that he has a special liking for trees and even prefers ‘trees’ when choosing a carrier?","“In any case, no matter what, it’s fine as long as the good separation is cut out. I’m about to reach my limit. I’ve been staring at the light of virtue, and my eyes feel a little uncomfortable. I’ll have to use some eye drops later,” the three-eyed youth said.","“Are you saying that my daughter-in-law isn’t good-looking enough?” Father Goudan said, sensitive to the comment.","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","Rebuke me again?","We’re the rulers of the Netherworld! Do we have to be so childish?","Are you pretending to be childish and just looking for an opportunity to rebuke me? Considering Father Goudan’s bad personality, the latter was more likely!","The two rulers of the Netherworld were once again at loggerheads.","At this time, the virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and threw out the ‘Virtuous Thunder Tribulation Tree.’","The ‘good corpse’ that Song Shuhang had slashed out merged with the virtuous tribulation lightning tree, using it as a carrier and starting to transform.","The process of killing the good corpse was smoother than killing the evil corpse. The ‘good thoughts’ in Song Shuhang’s body weren’t absorbed or suppressed, and his good thoughts were relatively large.","The Virtuous Thunder Tribulation Tree began to transform, and in the blink of an eye, it took the form of Song Shuhang in golden monk robes.","There were faint traces of lightning coiling around his monk robe, making crackling sounds.","Under the monk’s robe, his muscles were strong and powerful.","The Dual System Virtue Technique circulated endlessly, dyeing the golden monk Song Shuhang with a layer of treasure light, making it difficult for others to look directly at him.","“This poor monk, Ba Shan, greets me.” The golden monk Shuhang clasped his hands together and bowed to Song Shuhang.","The moment the golden monk Ba Shan lowered his head, the world lit up!","That bald head was like a small sun, releasing boundless light that illuminated the entire small black room.","“Sun Fist!” The virtuous lamia was dubbing Monk Ba Shan from behind.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Just like the evil corpse, the good corpse ‘Tyrant’ had inherited Song Shuhang’s cultivation technique, the Dual System Virtue Technique, as well as one of Song Shuhang’s innate skills, Sun Finger.","At this moment, this talent was inherited by Ba Shan and was carried forward. Ba Shan’s entire head was a huge light source. If he wanted, even his body could release this level of light!","“There’s no need to be so polite, Fellow Daoist. You and I are one.” Song Shuhang covered his eyes and recited his lines. After completing the ritual of ‘cutting three zombies,’ he said, “Fellow Daoist Tyrant Kindness, please raise your head quickly. Everyone is going blind.”","On the opposite side, Benevolent Tyrant raised his head, and the dazzling light slightly converged, turning into a pillar of light that shot into the sky. From the perspective of Song Shuhang and the others, the head of the good corpse ‘Benevolent Tyrant’ was like a powerful flashlight, shining the light into the sky.","“Why does he look like a monk?” Song Shuhang asked while looking at Kindness Tyrant, who had completed the ritual. The power of virtue was not the same as the power of Buddhism, right?","Ba Shan maintained the posture of putting his hands together. He smiled slightly and did not get angry. “However, your initial merit was condensed through the soul ferrying method of the Buddhist Sect. This is the karma that you planted yourself.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Besides, in terms of appearance, I have to distinguish myself from the Evil Corpse Tyrant,” Ba Shan said.","It was supposed to be an evil corpse dressed in black, but because there were too few obsessions and malice on the main body, only its belly button was black. In this way, if he continued to assume the appearance of the white-robed Daoist, his image would overlap with the evil corpse and he would lose his independence.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky. There was no way to solve the problem of the Fruit of Terror.","“In addition, this penniless monk and this venerable self are one. In other words, this penniless monk’s image is also accepted by this venerable self in the depths of your heart. Otherwise, This Penniless Monk would never be able to appear in this form,” Ba Shan added.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but recall the image of his ‘true self’ in the past, and he was speechless.","“This is all your fault,” Monk Ba Shan smiled gently. After he finished speaking, his eyes darkened slightly and he bowed again. “I’m still in the state of cutting three corpses. I won’t disturb you any longer. I wish this venerable self can successfully sever the third corpse and attain the supreme Great Dao.”","The light of the power of virtue shone on Song Shuhang’s face like the powerful headlights of an Audi.","“Fellow Daoist Ba Shan is indeed a good corpse. He has inherited my kind side and is considerate,” Song Shuhang opened his eyes and said. This was a physical blindness, blinded by the light.","Monk Ba Shan raised his head and smiled. He slowly retreated.","“Gun!” At this time, the virtuous lamia behind him suddenly called out softly.","Ba Shan stepped back in cooperation. His hands were raised above his head, and his legs were tightly lined up.","The powerful light of virtue condensed into a forty-meter-long light spear under the restraint of Ba Shan.","The virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and grabbed the monk by his waist. Just like how the heavy cavalry of the west held a knight’s spear, she held the monk and used him as a knight’s spear.","The virtuous fat whale kept raising its head and roaring.","Heavy armored virtuous fairy cavalry!","Moreover, Song Shuhang, Father Goudan, and the three-eyed youth were keenly aware that the virtuous lamia and Tyrant were truly one.","When ‘Ba Shan’ turned into a fourteen-meter-long knight’s spear and the virtuous lamia equipped him, the virtuous lamia and the monk entered a synchronized state. At this time, the virtuous lamia was Ba Shan, and Ba Shan was the virtuous lamia.","“Giddyup ~” The heavily armored virtuous fairy shouted softly.","The virtuous fat whale carried her and began to swim around the small black room, extremely happy.","“Look, Fairy Virtue is so interesting. Are you envious?” Father Goudan said to the three-eyed youth again.","Senior Three-Eyed Youth: “I’m really not envious at all. Don’t ask anymore. If you ask, you’re a dog egg.”","As she spoke, the heavy-armored virtuous lamia ran... He didn’t know where she had gone.","This Heavenly Dao Prison was very big, enough for Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders to play hide-and-seek here.","“Finally, Self-centric Corpse,” Song Shuhang collected his thoughts and said.","After killing two corpses in a row, his strength had increased by a large margin.","It was estimated that after he finished killing the third corpse and stepped into the main world, he would receive a welcome from the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation big shot."]},{"number":2841,"title":"Chapter 2841 Youth Is the Greatest Advantage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2841 Youth Is the Greatest Advantage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Before preparing to kill the last corpse of the ‘Three Separations’ in one go, Song Shuhang sent a message to the virtuous lamia, telling her not to run too far.","The space of the Heavenly Dao Prison was strange and unpredictable. There were big and small spaces, and the spatial structures inside were also different.","Song Shuhang was worried that some of the ‘Heavenly Dao Prison spaces’ would be connected to other ‘Heavenly Dao Prison spaces.’ Now, the virtuous lamia was running too happily, and Song Shuhang was afraid that she would run into the ‘Heavenly Dao Prison space’ next door. Then, he forgot that he had killed the Good Separation. At that time, it would be troublesome if another Good Corpse was cut out.","After all, he had learned a lesson from the past, so Song Shuhang was very cautious when facing this problem.","No one could guarantee what kind of impact it would have if the Three Separations became Four Separations.","After the virtuous lamia received Song Shuhang’s message, she ran even more happily.","There was clearly something wrong with her state!","In the past, although the virtuous lamia was cheerful, she was a very reliable fairy in critical moments. Moreover, she still retained a trace of the reserved nature of the flower of the ancient Heavenly City in her bones. Even when she was jumping around, she would have a bottom line.","But today, her bottom line seemed to have been completely destroyed.","‘Could it be...Is it the influence of the Good Separation?’ Song Shuhang frowned.","His evil corpse only had a black belly button, while his good corpse seemed to have inherited his outspoken nature while inheriting his good thoughts. After the attribute of being outspoken and the personality of the virtuous snake fairy was amplified, perhaps it would produce a chemical reaction?","‘Since that’s the case, I’ll try my best to get rid of the third separation, the ‘Self-centric Separation’ before the ‘Virtuous Separation + Virtuous Lamia’ causes any accidents!’ Song Shuhang thought to himself.","As long as the three corpses were complete after the Self-Separation was cut out, there was no need to worry about the Good Separation.","“I need to calm down and adjust my condition,” Song Shuhang said softly.","He silently circulated the Forgotten Divine Technique.","This divine technique had the effect of calming one’s mind. As it circulated, Song Shuhang felt as if he had merged with heaven and earth. It was even quieter than the sky.","“This is the last corpse,” the three-eyed young senior looked at Song Shuhang and said.","“And this final corpse, the Self-centric Corpse, is also the hardest to kill. If he comprehended it, he could instantly kill it. If you can’t comprehend it, then even if you spend thousands of years, you won’t be able to make any progress,” Goudan’s father said.","The Good Separation and Evil Separation of the Three Separations Secret Technique weren’t too difficult. As long as he spent some time and effort, he could cut it off.","And this self-centric corpse was the key.","“Is there a shortcut to the ‘Three Separations’ technique you gave Ba Cha?” Goudan’s father suddenly said.","Senior Three-Eyed was confused.","“If there’s no shortcut, it’ll be troublesome if Ba Ti’s comprehension isn’t high enough and he can’t sever his Self-Self Corpse in a short period of time and comprehend the Dao for eight to ten years. I don’t want to stay here with him for so long,” Goudan’s father replied.","“Wonderful,” the three-eyed young senior revealed a smile that resembled the ruler of the Netherworld.","Ever since this wisp of consciousness entered the Heavenly Dao Prison World, it had never thought that it would be able to leave safely. He had learned from his mistakes that the Heavenly Dao Prison had a setting that targeted him.","Since he couldn’t leave in a short period of time, it wouldn’t be a bad idea to let Goudan’s father accompany him here for eight to ten years.","Even though he felt disgusted when he saw Goudan’s father with him, the other party definitely hated him as well. In fact, Goudan’s father hated him even more.","His dislike of the striped stockings dragon was 800, and the striped stockings dragon’s dislike of him was at least 1000+.","Of course, he had to do such a good thing.","Things that harmed others without benefiting themselves were the favorite of the rulers of the Netherworld. Even if he had to sacrifice 1,000 to defeat 800 enemies, he would be willing to do so.","Goudan’s father was speechless.","“There’s no shortcut to cutting off the self-corpse,” Senior Three-Eyed smiled brightly. Unable to rely on external forces, he could only rely on himself. In fact, the original goal of the “Three Separations” secret technique that had been passed down since the immemorial era was not to turn Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders into weak Immortals, but to give Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders a chance to recognize themselves. From there, you can comprehend your own Dao.”","The process of cutting off the Self-Separation was an opportunity to examine oneself from the beginning to the end. After removing the obsession of good and evil, he would see himself from a neutral point of view.","In the process of slaying the Self-centric Corpse, there was a chance that the cultivator could see himself clearly and comprehend his own Dao.","But even Goudan’s father and the three-eyed youth didn’t know if this method had succeeded.","“Tyrannical Song originally had his own embryonic form of Dao, so when he killed the self-centric corpse, he might have an advantage?” Goudan’s father extended his single claw and scratched his dragon beard.","“Who knows? I haven’t killed three corpses,” the three-eyed senior youth said.","The two rulers of the Netherworld looked at each other and laughed happily.","Song Shuhang remained silent.","Then, he followed the method of ‘Slaying Three Separations’ and began to slash his ‘Self-centric Separation.’","Compared to an ordinary Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, Song Shuhang had a huge advantage when he killed his self-centric corpse—he was young!","He was only 18 years old this year and would only turn 19 in two months.","Well, except for the life of entering a dream...","Being young meant that he had lived a short life.","In the ‘self-separation’ segment, he was not like an ordinary Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender who would have to go through tens of thousands of years of life experiences and look back on them.","He could look back on his tender eighteen years in the blink of an eye. Moreover, in these eighteen years, seventeen of them were ordinary years without any major events, so it was easier to look back.","For ordinary Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders, it would take several months just to ‘review the past.’ However, Song Shuhang only needed a dozen minutes to see his entire life.","His life had been very normal until he was eighteen.","He had also experienced what most young people had experienced...","It was not until May 20th last year that his life took a turn.","From the experience of coming into contact with the Nine Provinces Number One Group, to Soft Feather, Senior Medicine Master, Riverly Purple Mist, Su Clan’s Sixteen, Doudou, and Senior White...","Everything played in his mind like a movie replay.","In the end, the scene stopped at the part where he condensed his talent—cultivation chat and Jindan QR code.","This segment was extracted and replayed repeatedly.","From the initial ‘Golden Core QR code’ function to the function of adding friends, and then to the complete ‘chat group framework’ step by step, and then to the recently upgraded ‘cultivation chat client.’","The changes in each step corresponded to the various fortuitous encounters Song Shuhang had during his cultivation.","Refining the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, condensing the 7+1+1 core, and giving Profound Sage Dao Validation Speeches again and again...","Everything gathered together.","“I think I feel something,” Song Shuhang’s heart stirred, and he began to replay his life.","It was replayed again and again.","Anyway, it only took ten minutes for his life to be replayed again. It could even be fast-forwarded.","If he couldn’t grasp the feeling once, he could watch it ten times, or even a hundred times.","After seeing too much, a quantitative change could cause a qualitative change.","That feeling of touching the heart... She couldn’t escape from his palm."]},{"number":2842,"title":"Chapter 2842: The Weight of Heavenly Dao Authority","paragraphs":["Chapter 2842: The Weight of Heavenly Dao Authority","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang didn’t know how many difficulties the practitioners of ancient times had to endure in the process of slaying their “self-corpse.”","The most challenging part of the “Three Separations Slaying Secret Technique” that the three-eyed youth senior had given him, the “Selfcentric Separation,” didn’t seem that difficult to him.","Every time he reviewed his life from the beginning, his understanding of himself deepened. If the quality wasn’t enough, he would make up for it with quantity, which was something he was quite good at.","After repeatedly watching his life and replaying the year when he started cultivating, he quickly seized the opportunity to sever his self-corpse.","“The turning point of my life is the Nine Provinces Number One Group. There’s no doubt about this.”","After joining the Nine Provinces Number One Group and coming into contact with the seniors in the group, his originally ordinary life suddenly became turbulent.","This huge wave was just like Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber. It was so violent that it instantly shattered his outlook on life.","Therefore, the opportunity began with the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group!","“Golden Core composition, Star Path Map, out!” Song Shuhang said.","In the main world, in his original body’s dantian.","The fat whale golden core, which had been revived by the resurrection magical treasure after it shattered into a Nascent Soul, began to swim with all its might.","On the body of the fat whale golden core, the Golden Core composition appeared.","It was a star map. All the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, as well as the seniors who had a great influence on Song Shuhang, were engraved on this star map.","The star map started with Soft Feather, and the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group that Song Shuhang had come into contact with were arranged in order: Venerable Yellow Mountain, Su Clan’s Sixteen, Medicine Master, Riverly Purple Mist, Doudou...","At the end of the star map, another “Soft Feather” stretched out her hand and pushed open a “door,” leaving it half-closed.","Inside the door, there was an illusory figure.","This figure wasn’t a member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, but it could be anyone.","It was the True Self, manifested by the fat whale golden core’s ninth golden core dragon pattern.","When an ordinary cultivator’s Golden Core was performing the Golden Core composition, the dragon patterns on it would melt and become the paint for the composition. The small golden cores in Song Shuhang’s seven small dantians were no exception.","However, the fat whale golden core in his original dantian was completely different from ordinary golden cores. The Golden Core composition on its body was formed by the starlight scattered on its scales. It did not consume a single Golden Core dragon pattern throughout the entire process.","Each of the nine golden core dragon patterns had a special meaning. Seven of them were created by Senior White Two using the power of the Heavenly Dao, which he could only use once in his life.","The ninth dragon pattern he added was a Golden Core dragon pattern that represented his True Self.","The True Self was like a mirror. No matter who saw this dragon pattern, they would see their True Self.","The opportunity for Song Shuhang to kill his three corpses, the Self-centric corpse, was here!","His gaze crossed the long star path and entered the “door” at the end of the star path map.","The True Self inside the door transformed into Song Shuhang’s figure.","The figures of all the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group in the star map were also reflected in the mirror of “True Self,” turning into “life experiences” and merging into the body of Song Shuhang, making the image of True Self even more vivid.","Senior White Two had used the authority of the Wielder of the Will to create the “True Self Dragon Tattoo” effect, which was equivalent to White of the Wielder of the Will helping Song Shuhang create his “self.”","Handsome Wielder of the Will used a remote hack!","Now, what Song Shuhang needed to do was... boring replication!","His consciousness stared at the full “True Self” and copied and pasted the information of the True Self.","After the replication was successful, Song Shuhang could directly use the replicated “True Self” as a template and create a “Self-centric corpse”!","Song Shuhang silently stared at the dragon pattern on the fat whale golden core while doing the boring copying.","As his strength and horizons increased, he gradually understood the weight of the Heavenly Dao’s authority.","The seven dragon patterns that Senior White Two had drawn for him with the authority of the Heavenly Dao were his strongest foundation.","Now that he thought about it, the reason why he was able to come into contact with the laws of “immortality” at the low-level realm without any problems and even form a “pseudo-immortal body,” apart from the help of various external devices, was probably because of the silent support of Senior White Two’s seven dragon patterns.","After all, even a powerful existence like the Immortal Lord fell into a long slumber after coming into contact with the concept of immortality. Immortal Information was something that mortals could not bear.","About an hour and a half later, hum~ Song Shuhang’s consciousness heard a violent vibration.","This was the notification that his “True Self information” had been successfully copied and pasted onto his D drive.","“The time has come!” Song Shuhang opened his eyes and shouted, “Slash!”","Invisible mental energy surged out of his eyes. When a large amount of mental energy forcefully passed through his eyes, it also carried two precious lines of “Tyrannical Song’s tears.”","Powerful spiritual power gathered into a ball, transforming from invisible to tangible, illusory human figures.","Three Separations, Self-centric Separations, successfully killed.","He would use the Forgotten Divine Technique as the core, and the ghost fairy as his sustenance.","But now, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection was in the Wielder’s small black room, while the ghost fairy was in the main body.","If he wanted to let the self-conscious corpse rely on the ghost spirit, Song Shuhang needed to step out of the Heavenly Dao Prison and return to the main world.","Therefore, the self-centric corpse that was cut out was still an illusory spiritual figure that appeared beside Song Shuhang.","As the Forgotten Divine Technique was slashed out along with the Self-centric corpse, Senior Three-Eyed and Goudan’s father quickly regained the correct names Tyrannical Song and Goudan Song in their minds.","“As expected of the most difficult ‘Self-centric Separation’ among the Three Separations. Goudan Song was indeed much more difficult than the previous Evil Separation and Good Separation. It took him a full hour and a half.” Goudan’s father looked at the three-eyed youth with a hidden meaning in his words.","The three-eyed youth was speechless.","He originally thought that it would take some time for Tyrannical Song to kill the Self-centric corpse, so Goudan’s father would have to stay in the Heavenly Dao Prison World for a while longer to share the pain with him.","“Senior, we’re returning to the main world now.” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection stretched out his hand and took out the turtle shell immortal boat.","“Coming ” A wisp of Goudan’s father’s consciousness entered the turtle shell immortal boat and waved at the three-eyed youth. “Then, goodbye, Three-eyed. Stay in the Heavenly Dao Prison and enjoy your old age. I will miss you!”","The three-eyed senior was silent for a moment before calmly replying, “Goodbye, Goudan’s father.”","Young Goudan’s father, let’s meet again!","Senior Three-Eyed’s words also had a hidden meaning."]},{"number":2843,"title":"Chapter 2843: I Miss You. Don’t Leave, Okay?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2843: I Miss You. Don’t Leave, Okay?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior Three-Eyed, why don’t you try to possess me and return with me?” Song Shuhang suggested.","Perhaps after the three-eyed youth possessed his Essence Soul and became a pendant, the restriction that Heavenly Dao Father Goudan had left in the Heavenly Dao Prison wouldn’t take effect, and the three-eyed youth would be able to leave smoothly.","“It’s useless. I can feel that I’ve been locked onto by the Heavenly Dao Prison Realm and can’t leave,” the three-eyed youth waved his hand. “Go on, go. Don’t worry about me!”","“Let’s go, let’s go. Ignore Three-Eyed,” Father Goudan had been waiting for this moment for a long time.","Whenever he thought about how Three-Eyed Boy’s consciousness would be left in the Heavenly Dao Prison for the rest of his life, Father Goudan felt elated. He wished he could conjure up a weather forecast like Three-Eyed Boy’s to share his happiness with the world.","“Senior Three-Eyed, I’ll ask Senior White for a ‘disposable flying sword small black room-breaking edition’ and see if I can send you out,” Song Shuhang comforted him.","“Don’t overthink it,” Father Goudan patted him. “Once we leave this Heavenly Dao Prison, we’ll forget about the wisp of consciousness that Three-Eyed left behind. Don’t worry, as long as we forget him, we won’t have any psychological burden.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The three-eyed teenager turned his head away in anger, refusing to look at Father Goudan.","“Study the data I left behind. Maybe you’ll find some inspiration to leave the Heavenly Dao Prison,” Father Goudan revealed the standard evil smile of a ruler of the Netherworld.","His evil smile could make Three-Eyed suspect the data derived from the formula and hinder his research.","Regardless of whether it was useful or not, it was just a sentence to dig a hole. If it could trick Three-Eyed, great. If not, it didn’t matter.","Boom","The turtle shell immortal boat ignited.","After accelerating slightly, the turtle shell immortal boat began to break through the restrictions of the Heavenly Dao Prison space. The front end of the turtle shell created ripples in the space.","“Farewell, Three-Eyed,” Father Goudan stood by the window of the immortal boat and waved his hand. “I will forget you.”","Behind him, the three-eyed young senior suddenly couldn’t control his emotions and called out in a heart-wrenching voice, “Wait a minute, Father Goudan. I miss you. Can you stay with me?”","Movie King Mode activated!","Song Shuhang was confused.","What kind of godly development was this?","If he didn’t know that Father Goudan and the three-eyed youth had a bad relationship, he might have imagined a love-and-hate story that was tens of thousands of words long.","“Not good. I will forget you. You don’t have to think about me,” Father Goudan replied heartlessly.","Hua","As he spoke, the turtle shell immortal boat completely broke through the restrictions of the Heavenly Dao Prison space. Half of the turtle shell squeezed into the Heavenly Dao Prison space.","Looking at the unwilling three-eyed youth not far away, Father Goudan’s dragon face revealed a lively smile.","A few breaths later, the turtle shell immortal boat completely squeezed into the space tunnel and disappeared.","After a few more breaths.","The smile on Father Goudan’s face froze.","Next to Father Goudan, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit was dumbfounded.","He turned around and looked at the void behind him.","Father Goudan was startled.","The turtle shell immortal boat disappeared into the void.","However, Father Goudan and Song Shuhang’s primordial spirits remained where they were.","What happened?","Who am I? What is this place?","“Could it be that I’ve also been blacklisted by the Heavenly Dao Prison and locked down?” Song Shuhang was puzzled.","“We meet again, young Father Goudan,” on the other side, the three-eyed young senior placed his hands behind his back and smiled like a ruler of the Netherworld. “Have you forgotten that the turtle shell immortal boat is my work? Since it was something I made, I definitely had the corresponding remote control method. So, I missed you, so I asked you to stay with me. Aren’t you touched?”","Father Goudan was speechless.","I’m not touched. I’m not touched at all!","Moreover, he remembered that he had already erased the mark that Three-Eyed Zai left on the turtle shell immortal boat. How could this guy still control the immortal boat from afar?","Could it be that there was a hidden control system imprint inside the immortal boat?","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Wait, Senior Three-Eyed. You want Father Goudan to stay with you. Why do you want me to stay too?","“As for little friend Tyrannical Song, you don’t have to panic. I’ve already sent your Self-centric Corpse to the main world using the turtle shell immortal boat,” the three-eyed young man looked at Song Shuhang and said, “As for you, stay in this Heavenly Dao Prison space and act as the coordinates.”","Song Shuhang was confused.","As coordinates? Senior Three-Eyed, are you trying to get my main body to send the disposable flying sword-Small Dark Room Destruction Version?","“Don’t let your imagination run wild. Your Essence Soul was left behind to act as a coordinate to preserve the shielding effect of the Heavenly Dao Prison. This way, we can ensure that your third corpse, the Self-centric Corpse, can smoothly integrate with the ghost spirit in the main world without any accidents,” the three-eyed teenager explained.","After all three of his corpses were executed, Song Shuhang’s realm would be forcefully increased.","At that time, Song Shuhang would be able to reach the Ninth Stage Realm before transcending the heavenly tribulation. Once he transcended the heavenly tribulation and was strengthened by it, he would be able to rise to the level of a weak Immortal in one go.","“Are you sure you’re thinking for Song Goudan? That’s why you left his primordial spirit behind? It wasn’t a mistake. While forcing me to stay, it accidentally affected Song Goudan and caused an accident?” Father Goudan retorted.","“Do you think I’m as childish as you?” the three-eyed young senior confidently raised his head and looked up at the sky.","In the distance, the virtuous lamia and the ‘Good Corpse Tyrant Good Spear’ were still jumping around, unable to stop.","In the main world.","Song Shuhang’s main body.","A turtle shell immortal boat suddenly appeared out of thin air and crashed into Song Shuhang’s meditating body.","At this time, Fairy Feng Yi, who was sitting quietly on Song Shuhang’s shoulder, made a move in time. She stretched out her claw and pressed it on the turtle shell immortal boat, blocking it.","The door of the immortal boat opened.","A blurry spiritual figure stepped out of the turtle shell immortal boat.","“What is this?” Fairy Feng Yi asked in puzzlement.","Pavilion Master Chu’s dazy hair spun around and detected Song Shuhang’s aura on it.","The blurry mental energy figure floated in front of Song Shuhang’s main body, stretched out its hand, and gently knocked on his chest.","Knock, knock.","Squeak","A door opened in his heart, and the ghost fairy spirit’s figure came out of Song Shuhang’s chest.","The Self-centric Corpse’s mental energy figure extended its palm toward the ghost fairy.","The ghost spirit fairy also extended her palm and met the palm of the self-centric phantom.","This was a ritual where the self-corpse entrusted itself to the ghost spirit. As long as he came into contact with Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit, he would be able to successfully complete the last step of ‘Slaying Three Separations: Self-centric Separation.’","One second, two seconds... Fifteen seconds...","The ghost spirit fairy and the self-body maintained the posture of palm to palm internal energy.","However, the final step of the Three Separations had no signs of beginning.","The illusion of the Self-centric Corpse couldn’t be synchronized with the ghost fairy."]},{"number":2844,"title":"Chapter 2844: The First Spirit Ghost Contract","paragraphs":["Chapter 2844: The First Spirit Ghost Contract","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The power of the corpse and the spirit ghost fairy couldn’t synchronize, as if something crucial was missing. They stared at each other in confusion, feeling like they were gradually forgetting each other.","“What’s happening? Are they competing in inner strength?” Bone Fairy asked, watching Song Shuhang’s self-corpse and the spirit ghost fairy.","Next to her, Master Golden Hex gently petted the rabbit in his arms, lost in thought.","“This is... severing the three corpses?” Feng Yis claw twitched, her eyes lighting up as she spoke.","She had only read snippets about “severing the three corpses” in ancient heavenly court documents.","The phantom in front of her, with an aura of Ba Song, radiated a sense of “true self,” aligning perfectly with the description of the “self-corpse” in the severing process.","Black Skin Soft Feather asked curiously, “Is it some kind of clone?”","“Corpse dumb-dumb,” the Fairy of Creation replied solemnly.","Pavilion Lord Chu’s hair strand perked up as she examined the self-corpse. “Severing the three corpses isn’t cloning, but it’s somewhat similar. It’s an ancient celestial technique for tribulation immortals to break through the ninth level... but it doesn’t lead to the Eternal Life stage, as it lacks one’s own Dao. At best, it only reaches the level of a weak Eternal Life being.”","“But isn’t Shuhang still at the eighth tribulation realm? How did he manage to mess around with a tribulation immortal’s secret technique?” Bone Fairy wondered. “Did I fall asleep without realizing and slept for a month?”","“A month?” Feng Yi’s claw quivered, confused by Bone Fairy’s implication.","“He was challenging the Nether Sovereign at the fifth or sixth stage; practicing a tribulation immortal’s technique is no big deal for him,” Pavilion Lord Chu’s hair strand twirled in boredom.","Forget about practicing tribulation immortal techniques; even if Song Shuhang suddenly declared he had become the Heavenly Dao and offered to help her retrieve the reincarnations of the members of Jade Lake Pavilion, she wouldn’t be surprised.","As an old companion of Song Shuhang, she had learned to adapt.","Living means constantly adapting... if you can’t adapt to the market, you get eliminated!","Master Golden Hex, hearing this juicy gossip, accidentally pulled out a tuft of rabbit fur, causing the rabbit to struggle in pain.","“Is Senior Song about to break through to the ninth tribulation realm?” Black Skin Soft Feather asked, looking at the spirit ghost fairy and the self-corpse. “What are they doing now?”","“From what I understand, during the severing process, the three corpses need a host. It seems Ba Song is trying to synchronize his corpses with the spirit ghost fairy... but something seems off,” Feng Yi’s claw speculated.","“The spirit ghost fairy is missing something,” Pavilion Lord Chu’s hair strand commented. For some reason, when she looked at the spirit ghost fairy, she felt the fairy was incomplete.","Based on this observation, she deduced that Song Shuhang’s spirit ghost fairy had a significant connection to her. The bond seemed very intimate.","However, she had no memory of the spirit ghost fairy.","The spirit ghost fairy paused, realizing something. She kept her hand touching Song Shuhang’s corpse, while the other hand traced a circle above her head.","A spatial hole opened within the circle, and a delicate white hand emerged, grasping the spirit ghost fairy’s outstretched hand.","At the moment this hand appeared, Pavilion Lord Chu’s hair strand trembled slightly.","Faint memories of a Jade Lake Pavilion fairy, her disciple and the last survivor aside from her, surfaced.","However, the white hand only lingered briefly before pulling the spirit ghost fairy’s arm into the spatial hole.","As quickly as it appeared, the memory vanished.","“Is this the effect of the Heavenly Dao prison?” Pavilion Lord Chu quickly grasped the situation... Song Shuhang often entered and exited the “Heavenly Dao black room,” so she was familiar with its “root shielding” effect.","As she processed this, a faint “light of merit” appeared on Song Shuhang’s body, forming an eye of merit.","This was a protective measure left by the Virtuous Lamia to ward off evil influences in Song Shuhang’s body while she was summoned to the “Heavenly Dao prison.”","Just now, she sensed Dog Egg’s aura.","What is Dog Egg playing at?","In the void.","As the white hand connected with the spirit ghost fairy, the fairy’s presence felt complete.","Now whole, she theoretically met all conditions.","The spirit ghost fairy’s other hand exerted force, matching the self-corpse’s grip.","This time, there was a response.","A powerful wave of energy surged around them, their bodies synchronizing the “Forgotten Divine Art.”","Then...","Song Shuhang’s corpse, originally at the eighth level, broke through, reaching the formidable ninth level.","The Fish Jaw Master’s divine art at the seventh level could almost erase their existence from others’ memories, making them a vague recollection at best.","At the eighth tribulation realm, they became entirely invisible... even the “manifestation before men” effect was diluted, and the practitioner themselves was affected.","At the ninth level, it almost severed their ties to the Heavenly Dao prison.","Now, the corpse seemed to vanish from existence, as did the spirit ghost fairy.","Their synchronization rate hit maximum!","Yet, despite this, the spirit ghost fairy and the self-corpse couldn’t complete the severing process.","The spirit ghost fairy frowned, turning to gaze at Song Shuhang’s body, peering into his soul’s two contracts.","One belonged to her.","The other was a shattered “first spirit ghost” contract.","Could it be... they needed Song Shuhang’s first spirit ghost to complete the process?","“This is troublesome,” the spirit ghost fairy muttered.","Song Shuhang’s first spirit ghost had long disappeared, its fate unknown.","Where could she find it now?","Maybe... temporarily disable this first spirit ghost contract?","The spirit ghost fairy reached through Song Shuhang’s chest, gently touching the shattered contract."]},{"number":2845,"title":"Chapter 2845: White Bones, White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair","paragraphs":["Chapter 2845: White Bones, White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The ghost spirit fairy speculated that Song Shuhang’s self-centric corpse needed to synchronize with his complete ghost spirit to finalize the Three Separations technique.","She was already in a complete state, but Song Shuhang still had the broken contract with his first ghost spirit, which prevented the self-centric corpse from achieving full synchronization.","Therefore, she wanted to see if she could directly block the first ghost spirit contract and complete Song Shuhang’s Three Separations technique first. Then, when he had time, he could undo the first ghost spirit contract.","The ghost spirit fairy’s palm passed through Song Shuhang’s body, first reaching the complete ghost spirit contract between Song Shuhang and herself. Using her own contract as a medium, she moved her delicate hand and gently touched the first ghost spirit contract with her fingertips.","“It’s done... Next, let’s see if we can block it!” the ghost spirit fairy said softly.","No one had ever tried to block a ghost spirit contract since ancient times.","Cultivators wouldn’t be so bored as to block their own ghost spirit contract, and outsiders couldn’t directly affect the origin of the ghost spirit contract. Even the Heavenly Emperor, after occupying Soft Feather’s ghost spirit, couldn’t erase the contractual relationship between Soft Feather and the ghost spirit, and he would occasionally be tortured by Soft Feather’s main body or Black Panther.","As the spokesperson of the first ghost spirit in the world, Ghost God Cheng Lin, the ghost spirit fairy had extensive knowledge and data related to ghost spirits, which was why she dared to attempt this.","Her slender fingers landed on the first ghost spirit contract. She had already deduced a set of methods to block the ghost spirit contract in her mind and was now trying it out.","Runes were drawn out between her fingers, forming a formation pattern that wrapped around the broken first ghost spirit contract.","The runes and patterns transformed into a huge cocoon that tightly wrapped around the first ghost spirit contract.","Just as the ghost spirit fairy was about to make her move...","Cheng Goudan, who was chatting with Father Goudan through the ‘cultivation chat,’ suddenly froze. She looked up at the sky.","She sensed the ghost fairy’s movements.","“Interesting,” Fairy Cheng Lin smiled sweetly a moment later. “This is very interesting.”","“What’s interesting?” Father Goudan asked.","“Your granddaughter is rebelling. Goodbye, Father Goudan,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","Father Goudan raised his eyebrows.","What are you doing? We’re having a good chat. Don’t leave. Chat with me until dawn!","At the same time.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair, standing on top of Song Shuhang’s head in a daze, and Immortal Fairy White Bones, standing next to him, suddenly felt something.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair stood up high like an antenna, as if it had sensed some kind of electric wave.","Immortal Fairy White Bones turned her body uneasily and looked around as if she were trying to find someone.","“What happened?” Zither Master Fengyi sensed that Pavilion Master Chu’s Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair and Immortal Fairy White Bones were not in the right state.","“No, it’s nothing,” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","“It’s fine, it’s fine,” Immortal Fairy White Bones echoed, going against her own will.","Both of them subconsciously didn’t want to say something.","As soon as Pavilion Master Chu and Immortal Fairy White Bones finished speaking, Island Lord Golden Trigram suddenly received a new message.","It was a message from the Ancestral Golden Dragon, asking him to help open a coordinate.","This was a piece of cake. With a snap of his fingers, Island Master Golden Trigram opened a spatial coordinate passage for the Ancestral Golden Dragon.","The spatial gate opened.","The White Dragon’s figure crossed space and emerged from her dragon tomb, arriving at the scene.","“Why are you here?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","“Why are you here?” Immortal Fairy White Bones echoed in unison.","The White Dragon was speechless.","Forget about Pavilion Master Chu being stunned, but Immortal Fairy White Bones, what’s with your reaction?","White Dragon, White Bones, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair looked at each other in silence.","Island Lord Golden Trigram keenly sensed that the atmosphere was not right.","He quietly shifted, moved like a crab, silently distancing himself from Song Shuhang’s body.","Fairy Creation’s eyes lit up, and she followed Island Master Golden Trigram’s example, moving silently.","Although the black-skinned Soft Feather didn’t know what had happened, she felt something was wrong. Therefore, she followed Fairy Creation and moved with crab steps, distancing herself from Sister White Dragon, Immortal Fairy White Bones, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair.","However, as she moved, she suddenly felt that something was wrong.","She felt as if she had been influenced by something. She suddenly had the urge to join in the fun between White Bones, White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair because it would be very interesting!","This kind of influence was similar to the influence of her original body, Soft Feather. However, she was certain that this wasn’t the will of her main body, Soft Feather.","Could it be that it was the Heavenly Emperor that Senior Song had just killed?","She was resurrected?","Or was he being resurrected?","But why would the resurrected Heavenly Emperor influence her?","“At this time, I might need Senior Song’s Saber Nurturing Technique to help me calm down and isolate the influence of the Heavenly Emperor,” black-skinned Soft Feather thought to herself.","After Senior Song recovered, she would mention this matter to him.","Thinking of this, she moved a distance away and quietly began to film the scene between White Dragon, White Bones, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair.","Inside Song Shuhang’s body.","The ghost spirit fairy flicked her delicate hand and condensed the last rune.","The rune turned into a huge lock, locking all the formation patterns that wrapped around the first ghost spirit contract and blocking it.","If she succeeded, as long as she did not unlock the lock, she could block the contract.","In this way, Song Shuhang’s last step of Executing Three Separations would be completed.","“Lock!” the ghost spirit fairy shouted softly and tapped hard.","The rune lock firmly locked the formation pattern, not even leaving a crack.","The moment she finished forming the formation patterns, the synchronization between her and Song Shuhang’s self-corpse increased once again.","It seemed that she had guessed correctly!","The synchronization rate between her and the self-centric zombie kept increasing.","A moment later.","The shadow of the self-centric corpse began to dissipate, turning into mist that enveloped the ghost fairy.","The last step of Executing Three Separations was finally activated.","On the side...","White Bones, White Dragon, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Hair all looked at the self-centric corpse and the ghost fairy’s feet.","There, a pure white lotus bloomed. The lotus flower petals gradually closed and wrapped around the ghost fairy.","Moreover, a ‘Full Moon of the Path of Longevity’ appeared above the ghost spirit fairy’s head.","A powerful life force emerged from the lotus.","“Cheng Goudan!” The eyeball of the virtuous lamia let out a delicate cry.","The Immortal’s full moon and the pure white lotus flower were clearly Cheng Lin’s path to immortality—a special path to immortality related to nurturing new life.","“Cheng Lin?” The White Dragon frowned.","“Jade Lake Empress?” Immortal Fairy White Bones also felt that something was wrong.","Only Pavilion Master Chu’s hair swayed in the wind. She had noticed the truth.","It was the age of information. The more information he had, the more he would be able to grasp the key to victory.","She had once heard Slow-Witted Song mention that he had already grasped Cheng Lin’s method of giving birth to a new life and attaining immortality!","White Dragon and White Bones didn’t know about this.","Therefore, they felt that there was nothing wrong just now... It was Slow-Witted Song!"]},{"number":2846,"title":"Chapter 2846: Tyrant Corpse, Tyrant Body, Tyrant Three?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2846: Tyrant Corpse, Tyrant Body, Tyrant Three?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Compared to Bonehead and the Spirit Dragon, the two members of the Spirit Race, Pavilion Master Chu had more information and was more comprehensive.","She knew that Slow-Witted Song had been working with Fairy Cheng Lin ever since the end of the ancient Heavenly City.","Moreover, Slow-Witted Song had somehow grasped Cheng Lin’s path to immortality. What was the relationship between Slow-Witted Song and Cheng Lin?","Although it was rumored that Cheng Lin’s partner was Fairy @#%×, who could guarantee that her preferences would not change after tens of millions of years?","After all, Slow-Witted Song knew how to flirt.","Moreover, Fairy Cheng Lin’s partner, the flower of the ancient Heavenly City, Fairy @#%×, had changed drastically. The shell was still the same shell, but the inside was no longer the same as before. It could completely be described as “things remain the same, but people have changed.”","‘Perhaps I should think of a way to snatch Fairy @#%×’s scenes and make her unable to act, forcing her to return to the template of the flower of the ancient Heavenly City? So that Fairy Cheng Goudan won’t have a change of heart?’","Also, although Slow-Witted Song had said that she was joking when they met the last time, Pavilion Master Chu had recently begun to suspect that Song Shuhang might be Slow-Witted Song’s child or descendant.","The reason why she had such a guess was because Song Shuhang had gotten himself pregnant with his own abilities!","The child in his stomach was still growing healthily!","Since Song Shuhang could skip the ‘girlfriend’ part and become self-reliant and have a child on his own, then why couldn’t Slow-Witted Song do it?","After all, they were both surnamed Song.","Perhaps even Song had this hidden ability?","If Song Shuhang and Slow-Witted Song were really related by blood, then when they saw Song Shuhang for the first time, they clearly felt that he looked completely different from Slow-Witted Song, but they always subconsciously mistook him for someone else. This could be explained.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair slowly spun, and she ‘looked’ at Song Shuhang’s main body as well as the lotus flower that was giving birth to the Dao of Rebirth. She had a definite answer in her heart.","Slow-Witted Song was secretly helping Song Shuhang.","Her guess was pretty close.","However, Pavilion Master Chu wasn’t prepared to share this guess with the two undead.","The undead duo would continue to play the role of the Eternal Undead. The rest of the matters would be left to her, a living person!","“This is indeed Cheng Lin’s path to immortality,” she chimed in. “I’ve seen her path to immortality with my own eyes. She gave birth to a child.”","After the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion was destroyed, Cheng Lin had displayed the ‘path to immortality.’","“It seems that Fairy Cheng Lin is helping Song Shuhang,” the White Dragon sounded a little depressed.","Fairy Creation: “Cheng ~ Goudan ~ Dumb?”","“Yes, Fairy Creation,” Soft Feather nodded and replied. “Senior Cheng Goudan has been keeping in touch with Senior Song recently.”","Beside Black Panzi, Immortal Fairy White Bones was deep in thought.","She crossed her arms and used her heart to cover her fingers.","Then, she secretly cast a spell and condensed a shrunken ‘Slow-Witted Song’s big bone dregs’ finger bone on her fingertip. The shrunken finger bone was like a ‘finger cot’ that was attached to White Bones Immortal Fairy’s pale finger.","White Bones Immortal Fairy’s fingers moved slightly and performed a gesture similar to a ‘single-handed hand seal’ according to a special rhythm.","As she moved, the ‘Slow-Witted Song’s big bone shards’ on her fingertips began to emit a ‘scouting’ ripple. This scouting ripple was only effective against Slow-Witted Song.","A moment later...","Immortal Fairy White Bones’ eyes darkened, and her long eyelashes fluttered.","The ‘Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shards’ spell transmitted the most realistic feedback to her. This was Slow-Witted Song’s resonance feedback!","After so many years, she had improved the secret technique of ‘Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shards’ many times and had more advanced functions!","You can hide it from others, but you can’t hide it from me, Immortal Fairy White Bones thought.","However, she wasn’t prepared to share this information with Bai Long and Pavilion Master Chu, Slow-Witted Song’s two ‘sisters.’","The sister duo only needed to deduce the role of the ‘caring sister.’ The rest of the matters should be done by the young her!","At this time, she couldn’t wait for the White Dragon to return, and it would be even better if Pavilion Master Chu returned to Song Shuhang’s Inner World because of her disappointment.","“It’s about to end. The effect of the Lotus Reincarnation is about to be completed,” at this time, the black-skinned Soft Feather said expectantly.","She had Soft Feather’s memories, and she had personally seen Fairy Cheng Lin’s speech in the ruins, as well as the process of Cheng Lin’s birth of the new life path.","Therefore, when she saw the ‘Immortal’s Great Dao Moon Wheel’ above the lotus flower begin to shine brightly, she knew that this lotus flower reincarnation was about to enter the final stage.","Senior Song’s ‘self-corpse’ and ‘ghost spirit’ were about to be combined.","About two breaths later.","The lotus flower formed by the path of immortality slowly opened.","However, there was nothing on the lotus platform!","There was nothing.","The Self-Corpse was gone...","The ghost spirit fairy was also gone...","Slow-Witted Song, whom Pavilion Master Chu and Immortal Fairy White Bones wanted to see, didn’t appear either.","“What happened? Did you fail?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who was standing next to the tomb of Nine Cultivators, asked from afar.","“Nothing? Why is it like this?” Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws flew off Song Shuhang’s shoulder and landed on the lotus throne.","However, just as her claws landed, a figure suddenly flashed across the lotus platform. The figure gently stretched out her hand and used her wrist as a support to catch the claws of Zither Master Feng Yi.","“There’s something!” Black-skinned Soft Feather called out.","“Is it that? Is it the Overlord Corpse?” Immortal Fairy White Bones opened her mouth, wanting to call out this figure’s identity. However, the moment she opened her mouth, she felt as if she was being disturbed by some kind of interference, and she was unable to remember the name of this ‘figure on the lotus throne.’","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair shook slightly. “It’s the third separation of the Three Separations, the Selfcentric Separation. I’ve finally succeeded in condensing it.” However, due to the influence of the Forgotten Divine Technique, Song Shuhang’s third corpse might have changed.”","It wasn’t transparent, but its existence had been completely eliminated.","He was clearly standing in front of everyone, but if he didn’t take action, even the Immortals would ignore him.","Song Shuhang’s third corpse’s ninth level Forgotten Divine Technique and the ghost fairy’s ninth level Forgotten Divine Technique were synchronized, pushing the realm of this divine technique to the level of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. Even Immortals would be greatly affected.","“Speaking of which, if Senior Song’s third corpse and the ghost fairy are combined... What about the ghost fairy? Will it become the third corpse?” at this time, the black-skinned Soft Feather asked.","As she spoke, she seemed to still remember the ghost fairy and was not affected by the Forgotten Divine Technique.","As soon as the black-skinned Soft Feather finished speaking, a light flashed from the lotus platform, and the ghost fairy with a braid stepped down from it.","However, on the lotus platform, Zither Master Feng Yi’s claws seemed to be still on one of her arms.","Other than the ghost spirit and fairy on the lotus platform... there was still one more thing!"]},{"number":2847,"title":"Chapter 2847: A Book Every Man Should Own","paragraphs":["Chapter 2847: A Book Every Man Should Own","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Seeing the ghost spirit fairy stepping out of the lotus platform, the fairies present were stunned.","“The ghost spirit fairy didn’t sync up? The last step of the Three Separations still failed?” Immortal Fairy White Bones frowned.","Why was the last part of Song Shuhang’s [Three Separations] like squeezing toothpaste that was about to run out? It was intermittent; couldn’t it be a little more straightforward?","“I still have an arm here!” Zither Master Fengyi’s claws made a sound. She could feel that she was still standing on one arm.","In other words, besides the ghost spirit fairy, there was another ‘person’ on the lotus platform.","However, wasn’t the last step of Song Shuhang’s Three Separations supposed to make the ‘self corpse’ and the ‘ghost fairy spirit’ synchronized? Now that the ghost spirit fairy had left the lotus platform, who was the one left behind?","Had he succeeded in killing the three corpses?","“It should be a success,” the attentive White Dragon said.","She had been observing the changes in Song Shuhang. At this time, the strength of Song Shuhang’s main body began to increase again.","In the Three Separations Secret Technique, every corpse that was cut off was equivalent to breaking through a small realm, allowing the original body’s strength to increase. Judging from the feedback from Song Shuhang’s main body, the third separation, the ‘self-centric separation,’ should have been successfully severed.","As for why the ghost fairy spirit came down from the lotus throne alone, it was probably because the third corpse was only a part of the ghost fairy spirit.","Or was there something else that replaced the ghost fairy?","Or could it be that the ghost fairy spirit could switch between the ‘Third Corpse’ and the ‘ghost fairy spirit’?","As they spoke, the ghost spirit fairy carried a thick book and came to Pavilion Master Chu.","She had a peaceful smile on her face, and her beautiful eyes were especially watery because of the moisture in them.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded. “???”","The ghost fairy blinked her eyes, and then she reached out her hand and touched her glabella, as if she had pressed a switch button.","In the next moment, her ‘presence’ became clear.","She was no longer transparent, and her personal information was no longer blocked.","“Ye Si!” Pavilion Master Chu’s mind jolted, and many of the information that had been ‘blocked’ in her mind was restored at this moment. She called out the true name of the ghost fairy in front of her.","“Pavilion Master, I’m back,” the ghost spirit fairy lifted her dress and turned around. Then, she bowed to Pavilion Master Chu. “Pavilion Master, it’s been a while since I’ve heard you call me that.”","After the destruction of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, Pavilion Master Chu was the pavilion master, her master, and her mother to Ye Si. She was a very important person to her.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair stood on end, and she asked, “Did you merge with Song Shuhang’s self-centric corpse?”","“It can be said that it has fused, but it can also be said that it has not fused... We didn’t fuse as individuals, but we did fuse in terms of energy. Borrowing Fairy Cheng Lin’s path to immortality, the third corpse had its own body. Right now, he and I are like twins. This is better than I expected,” the ghost spirit fairy replied softly.","In fact, she was only a shell in front of Pavilion Master Chu.","The real Ye Si was in that special space and was Cheng Lin’s spokesperson.","Originally, she had planned to leave this ‘body’ to the third corpse and let it complete its transformation.","However, halfway through the ritual, someone suddenly intervened and used Cheng Lin’s Way of Breeding Rebirth to create a twin for the Third Corpse that was synchronized with Ye Si’s energy.","At this time, Song Shuhang’s third corpse, the Self-Separation, was standing on the lotus flower. When the ‘ghost fairy spirit’ in Ye Si’s body pressed the button between her eyebrows, the existence of the third corpse became even more illusory!","The ghost spirit fairy and he shared the same techniques, energy, and special talents. With this, the ghost spirit fairy could transfer the ‘invisible’ state to the third corpse for a short period of time. And vice versa, the Third Corpse could also use the button to stack the ‘invisible’ state on the ghost fairy’s body.","“You were with Song Shuhang the whole time? What are you doing? Why were you previously under the influence of the Wielder’s small black room?” Pavilion Master Chu asked, seizing the opportunity.","“I’m laying the foundation for saving the world. I don’t want Shuhang to regret it in the future,” the ghost fairy replied seriously. “I’ve already cried enough. Therefore, in the future, both of us shouldn’t cry anymore.”","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Now that she was gradually getting used to being a salted fish, she suddenly felt a little uncomfortable with the hot-blooded goal of saving the world.","‘Pavilion Master, do you want to meet someone?’ the ghost spirit fairy suddenly used a secret voice transmission method to ask.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair curled up slightly.","As expected, it was Slow-Witted Song who had secretly assisted Song Shuhang in completing the last part of the Three Separations.","Is he nearby now?","[Pavilion Master, pat my head,] the ghost spirit sent mentally.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair grew slightly longer, and she patted the ghost fairy spirit gently with a strand of her long hair, looking very doting.","Just as her hair landed on the ghost fairy’s head, her ‘vision’ was opened, and she saw some hidden scenes.","She saw a ‘Song Shuhang’ standing on the lotus throne—it was Song Shuhang’s self-centric corpse.","At this moment, the Self-centric Corpse stretched out its arm and carefully held Zither Master Fengyi’s paw. As if it had sensed Pavilion Master Chu’s ‘stare,’ the small invisible self-corpse nodded and smiled gently at her.","At the same time, Pavilion Master Chu suddenly realized that beside her... or rather, an illusory figure was standing beside Song Shuhang.","“I haven’t seen you for some time. I’m relieved to see that you’re in good spirits. It’s not easy for me to get a chance to come out and take a breather. I thought I could only silently look at you from afar. Now that I have the chance to talk to you, it’s really great,” the illusory figure said gently.","The gentle voice that seemed to be able to calm one’s anxiety had the effect of +1 favorable impression the moment it opened its mouth.","Moreover, this illusory figure spoke with great skill.","She first expressed her longing.","Then, she expressed that it was not easy for her to get a chance to come out for a breather, hinting that it was not easy for her to come out in her current situation.","Then, the sentence “I can only look at you from afar silently” put her in a sad position and touched the listener’s heart.","Finally, she said, “It’s great to have a chance to talk to you.” She expressed her joy.","With a full score of 100 points, this was at least 85 points.","[You’re missing the word ‘we’ in your words,] Pavilion Master Chu replied telepathically.","Opposite him, the illusory figure reached out and gently stroked Pavilion Master Chu’s hair, covering it with his palm.","Then, he opened his other hand behind his back and took out a thick book.","“Guide to Chu’s Solitude + Correspondence Formula.”","Then, he flipped his fingers and opened the chapter on how to analyze Chu Wei’s lonely mood through his expression and tone.","A moment later, the finger of the illusory figure froze slightly.","Pavilion Master Chu was like a strand of silly hair now... Moreover, the conversation was a ‘telepathy,’ so he couldn’t hear the details.","Then he could only use the formula to deal with it.","Q: How should I answer when Chu Weiguo says, “You’re missing the word ‘we’?”"]},{"number":2848,"title":"Chapter 2848: All Problems Solved in at Most Three Years","paragraphs":["Chapter 2848: All Problems Solved in at Most Three Years","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Answer: (1)","The target of the formula is Chu Weijun.","The various values of the formula are limited to between +10 and -10.","Let Chu Weijun’s Emotional Value be X, our standard answer be Y, and our ending be Z. Then, Z = X – Y.","Chu Weijun’s hair is currently soft, not resisting, and her true form hasn’t appeared.","It is inferred that her emotions are relatively stable and haven’t entered the irritable stage. Thus, the value of X is taken as the middle value, X = 5.","5 is the danger level; if it falls below 5, it could cause Chu Weijun to explode, bringing an unpredictable crisis.","The value of Y must be ≤ 0.","In the [Survival Desire Formula], the Z value must be greater than 5. The current situation requires achieving at least some understanding.","Z value = 6.","Z = X – Y, 6 = 5 – Y","Y = -1","Answer: I have to take an unusual way to answer Chu Weijun’s question, with a -1 answer.","Otherwise, even a direct answer would reduce Chu Weijun’s original 5 points of emotion by 1 point and enter a dangerous situation at 4 points.","In an instant, the illusory figure’s mind had already completed the deduction.","He reached out his hand and lightly pressed it, putting away the book, “Guide to Chu Weijun’s Solitary State + Correspondence Formula.” At the same time, the other hand, which had been blocking Pavilion Master Chu’s hair with a “head-patting” attack, also took the opportunity to loosen its grip.","[I won’t take the normal path. I have to use the extreme -1 method to answer.] The illusory figure smiled. He already had an answer in his heart.","The best -1 answer was to directly and crudely divert the conflict.","The illusory figure gently stroked Chu Weijun’s hair as he said, “Weijun, do you want to become my daughter...”","Pavilion Master Chu suddenly became nervous, and her hair was obviously a little unnatural.","“Son.” The illusory figure gasped for breath and replied, “You want me to use the ‘reincarnation method’ to give birth to you so that you don’t have to stay in Tyrannical Song’s living spring?”","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","Pa!","The hair turned into a whip and struck the illusory figure’s wrist, leaving a red mark.","Why didn’t you die from panting?","“Hahaha.” The illusory figure smiled lightly.","The crisis was resolved.","Sometimes, in the face of a major disaster, one could choose to use a minor disaster to avoid it. A 50-point beating was much better than a 90-point beating.","“You haven’t answered my question,” Pavilion Master Chu said again.","The illusory figure’s hand froze.","A moment later, he revealed the gentlest smile and said, “Without ‘us,’ where would there be ‘us’? At this moment, I only have you and your hair in front of me.”","“I recorded it,” Pavilion Master Chu said. “I’ll use the ‘cultivation chat’ function in a while to send this video to the undead duo.”","“Haha, haha, haha.”","The smile gradually lost its soul.","“We are no longer young. Even if ‘Immortals’ aren’t affected by the passage of time, it has been too long since ancient times,” Pavilion Master Chu sighed.","The illusory figure paused for a moment, and the smile on his face disappeared.","A moment later, he said solemnly, “Don’t worry... There will be a perfect answer between us. Besides, I won’t make you wait too long.”","When Pavilion Master Chu heard this, she was shocked. She hadn’t expected to hear such a clear reply from the other party.","“It has been a long time since ancient times, but it has also been a short time. Don’t worry, at most another four years, no... At most, it will be enough in a little more than three years,” the illusory figure replied.","“Only three years?” Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","“Yes, three years is enough,” the illusory figure said.","Three years later... It was legal!","Pavilion Master Chu was stunned.","“I have to go,” the illusory figure said softly. “It’s almost time for my break.”","“Can’t you appear in the main world at will now?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","“It’s not time yet,” the illusory figure replied. He couldn’t hurt Tyrannical Song. Therefore, it was already the limit for him to appear in a short period of time with the level 9+ Forgotten Divine Power after stacking.","“But don’t worry. As long as I have the chance to come out for some fresh air, I will definitely come and find you,” the illusory figure promised.","“Take care of yourself,” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","“You too, recover well in Tyrannical Song’s ‘living spring.’ You must take good care of yourself when I’m not around,” the illusory figure said.","After saying that, his figure began to slowly dissipate, turning into a light spot and disappearing from Pavilion Master Chu’s ‘vision.’","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair curled up slightly.","Her main body was holding her hands, and in her hands was a rune for ‘Stored Spell.’","What was recorded in the rune was not an image, but the last sentence: [There will be a perfect answer between us. Besides, I won’t make you wait too long.]","This sentence was played repeatedly.","However, Pavilion Master Chu’s memories were becoming blurry. The memories of the moment when her hair was blessed and saw the illusory figure disappeared along with the illusory figure.","Only the rune of the ‘message’ was left in her hand.","Was it the effect of Level 9+’Forgotten Divine Technique’? Or was it the influence of other states?","“Three years, what special day is it in three years?” Pavilion Master Chu’s main body blew a bubble in the living spring.","The core assistant thought that Pavilion Master Chu was asking her. After checking her database, she replied, “In three years, Tyrannical Song will be close to 22 years old. According to Chinese law, 22 years old is the legal age for men to get married.”","Pavilion Master Chu was speechless.","The speaker had no intention, but the listener had the intention.","Pavilion Master Chu’s lower half of her face was submerged in the living spring as she spat out a string of bubbles.","Three years later, Song Shuhang’s legal age for marriage... Three years later, Slow-Witted Song said that he wanted to resolve their relationship perfectly.","“I feel like I have to do something,” Pavilion Master Chu said slowly.","She couldn’t continue to be idle like this.","Perhaps, she had to consider taking the initiative to contact Chu Two.","On the other side.","After the illusory figure dissipated in Pavilion Master Chu’s vision, it condensed again above the lotus platform where the self-centric corpse was standing, opening a spatial door there.","However, he didn’t go in immediately. Instead, he waited quietly above Song Shuhang’s self-proclaimed corpse—he didn’t have much time left.","A moment later.","The White Dragon suddenly opened a spatial door and disappeared into it.","It looked like she had left this world.","But in fact, her spirit body had lazily swum to the lotus platform through the power of space and came into contact with the illusory figure.","“Long time no see, Sister White Dragon,” the illusory figure said with a smile. “Congratulations, Sister White Dragon, on successfully escaping from the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City.”","“Why didn’t you come to the mysterious island to see me?” the White Dragon said directly.","From the White Dragon’s visual angle, she couldn’t see the illusory figure’s conversation with Pavilion Master Chu.","From what she could see, not long after confirming that ‘Tyrannical Song’ had successfully severed his third corpse, she finally found this ‘spatial gate’ in the sky above the lotus platform.","And this illusory figure was right in front of the Space Door, as if it was waiting for her."]},{"number":2849,"title":"Chapter 2849: I’m Back-Welcome Back!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2849: I’m Back-Welcome Back!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Unlike Chu Weidu, who had spent a long time growing up with Slow-Witted Song at the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, the White Dragon and Slow-Witted Song had always maintained a “confidante” relationship.","Back then, the weak Slow-Witted Song was just a little brother in front of the White Dragon Ancestor, while the powerful White Dragon Ancestor always interacted with him as a “caring sister,” a strong support, and a parental figure.","Whenever Slow-Witted Song was beaten to tears, he would run to the White Dragon Ancestor to seek shelter.","Occasionally, he could even bring the White Dragon out to get back at his enemies, using his fake dragon might to turn his tears into double the enemy’s tears and bring them back.","Occasionally, there would be instances of Slow-Witted Song courting death and getting smashed by the White Dragon’s dragon fists...","This feeling was very pure, without any impurities.","The White Dragon Ancestor had always treated Slow-Witted Song like a doting older sister.","If that was the case, there was no problem with this way of getting along.","However, time is the most wonderful spell. It can make living beings grow and change.","Slow-Witted Song would also grow.","Even though he had been courting death, it did not hinder his growth.","Over the long years, he had grown from a “little brother” state to not-so-little brother state.","Under the effect of the spell of time...","When the White Dragon could no longer treat Slow-Witted Song like a little brother, the relationship between the two naturally became complicated.","However, because of the White Dragon’s self-restraint, her relationship with Slow-Witted Song didn’t progress any further until she entered the coffin and escaped.","On the contrary, after “dying” once, the White Dragon had seen through many things, and her mentality had also changed.","“Death” was truly the most precious life experience.","Sometimes, many things that could not be seen through, explained, or let go would be seen through and let go after death.","However, some things required interaction between the two parties to be effective.","It was meaningless for only one side to let it go!","Beside the spatial gateway.","“Yes,” the illusory figure answered the White Dragon’s question honestly. “I was planning to go to the mysterious island not long ago and meet you.”","“And then?”","“Then, the Celestial Thearch ruined my plan. She came to the mysterious island before me and passed the ‘Dao of the Heavenly Emperor’ to Gold Trigram...” The illusory figure looked up at the sky.","The White Dragon pondered for a moment. Indeed, the timeline matched.","Slow-Witted Song wasn’t lying about this matter. It could only be said that the Heavenly Emperor was one step ahead.","“At least you can explain it well. I’ll let you off,” the White Dragon replied. “So, when are you going to visit my dragon tomb on the mysterious island?”","“I will go... However, it’s not up to me to decide when to go to the dragon tomb on the mysterious island,” the illusory figure replied.","The White Dragon was confused.","“My current state can only appear in the main world for a short period of time. Just like the prisoners in the prison, they would occasionally come out to let out some wind. If we want to go to the mysterious island, we need his cooperation.” The illusory figure gently pointed at Song Shuhang’s main body in the distance.","The White Dragon frowned.","It wasn’t just her. In fact, anyone who had met Song Shuhang would definitely guess the relationship between Song Shuhang and Slow-Witted Song. Now, Slow-Witted Song’s answer confirmed this point.","“Shuhang is your child?” the White Dragon asked.","“No, he’s my father,” the illusory figure said with a serious expression.","As soon as he finished speaking, the White Dragon’s dragon fist landed on his body, knocking him to the ground. However, it didn’t hurt.","“I’m just joking, Sister White Dragon,” the illusory figure laughed.","The White Dragon withdrew her dragon fist. After a moment of silence, she suddenly said, “After dying once, I’ve thought things through a lot.”","The illusory figure sat cross-legged and looked up at the White Dragon.","“I’ve figured out how to face our relationship,” the White Dragon replied. “So...”","“So, Sister White Dragon, you’re finally going to face me and stop treating me like a little brother?” The illusory figure suddenly smiled.","The White Dragon replied, “Okay.”","“Death is such a wonderful thing. It’s fascinating,” the illusory figure said. “Since you’ve made up your mind, Sister White Dragon, if I don’t respond to your determination, then I’ll look too weak.”","The illusory figure stood up as he spoke.","“Three years,” he said confidently. “Three years later, I will prepare a perfect ending for us.”","“How perfect?” The White Dragon shook her head after asking this question. “Forget it. I’ve just thought it through. I’ll tell you what I think. What you decide is your own business.”","At most, she would just be an elder sister for the rest of her life.","Anyway, there was no difference.","“Don’t worry, my plan is perfect.” The illusory figure paused for a moment, then suddenly said in a low voice, “Sister White Dragon, I’m back.”","“Welcome back,” the White Dragon replied subconsciously.","Opposite him, the illusory figure smiled casually.","Then, his body was sucked into the spatial gate and disappeared.","The White Dragon’s spirit body stopped in the air.","That magnetic and soft “Sister White Dragon, I’m back,” his words kept echoing in her ears.","After the illusory figure was sucked into the spatial gateway, the spatial gateway closed.","Just like Pavilion Master Chu, the White Dragon’s memories would also be disturbed and become blurry.","“I won’t marry He Liao, but the White Dragon is special,” the illusory figure muttered.","Now that this caring sister had suddenly started to face her own feelings, he had to face it even if he had to brace himself.","In fact, he had never taken the initiative to flirt with the White Dragon before... He had always been like a little brother.","“Big Sister White Dragon is special, and so is Big Sister Chu. That’s great, Big Brother Song.” As they were talking, a huge hammer suddenly smashed out from the sky and hit the waist of the illusory figure.","Dong","The hammer sounded like it had hit a leather drum.","The illusory figure’s waist was shaken so much that it echoed and fell to the ground.","“Yo, long time no see, Sister White Bones.” Even though the illusory figure’s waist was echoing, he could still maintain a gentle smile and smile at the fairy.","No matter how painful it was, he couldn’t stop smiling.","An energy body made purely of white bones appeared beside him.","It was Immortal Fairy White Bones’ secret technique, “Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shred.” This time, she had the Big Bone Shred moving out of her body, remotely controlling it to sneak into the world inside the spatial gateway.","“Although a hammer suits you very well, you are actually more suited for a sword. A hammer is a little barbaric.” The illusory figure covered his waist and sat up. At this moment, his forehead was covered in cold sweat, but he was still smiling.","The relationship between Immortal Fairy White Bones and him was even stranger.","The relationship between them started after he sold the “Hammer Dao Speech” in the diary of the Great Eastern Emperor to Immortal Fairy White Bones.","Since then, Immortal Fairy White Bones had been chasing him in the ancient Heavenly City.","As he slashed... they became good friends.","Compared to his childhood sweetheart Chu Weidu and his intimate sister, Fairy White Dragon, Immortal Fairy White Bones was undoubtedly more difficult to deal with."]},{"number":2850,"title":"Chapter 2850: Information Overload","paragraphs":["Chapter 2850: Information Overload","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Pavilion Master Chu was the fairy he knew best, and he held the “Guide to Chu Wei’s Solitary State + Correspondence Formula.”","On the other hand, Sister White Dragon understood him the most. Because of this, she could understand him without needing much explanation.","However, Immortal Fairy White Bones was the most challenging to deal with. The best way to handle her was to fight. After getting tired, they could sit down and have a proper conversation.","The problem was, he really didn’t have the strength to fight Bai Gu right now.","Therefore, he had to use exceptional language skills to persuade her.","On the other side, Immortal Fairy White Bones’ “bone fragment incarnation” lightly tossed the sledgehammer in her hand. “Brother Song, you’re wrong. How can a hammer be barbaric? This is the content of the speech you personally gave me... Besides, I’m very good at it.”","“I took the wrong script back then,” the illusory figure replied.","If he had known that this hammer would be used against him, he would have changed to a gentler script, such as the string method or the rope method.","“Brother Song, your time is limited. Let’s not waste time. Let’s talk about the main topic.” Immortal Fairy White Bones tossed the two hammers up and spun them in her hands as if performing a trick.","“Sister White Bones, what topic do you want to discuss?”","“How are you going to deal with me next? Do I have to use the answer ‘three years’?” Immortal Fairy White Bones swung her hammer vigorously.","“Haha, haha, haha.” The illusory figure laughed rhythmically.","“What are you going to do in three years?” Immortal Fairy White Bones’ hammer spun faster and faster, lightning flashing and crackling.","The smile on the illusory figure’s face disappeared, and his expression became serious.","Immortal Fairy White Bones stared at him, not missing any of his facial expressions.","“Actually, three years later... I want to reincarnate.” The illusory figure said slowly, “In fact, you should have noticed that I’m not a complete individual. I know you have vaguely sensed it, but you are not willing to believe it in your hearts. It’s ridiculous for me to want to be with you guys like this. Therefore, I need to reincarnate.”","Immortal Fairy White Bones was speechless.","After being stunned for a moment, she suddenly had an idea.","“Don’t tell me you want to complete your reincarnation through Tyrannical Song? Do you really want to become Tyrannical Song’s child?” Immortal Fairy White Bones couldn’t help but ask.","“You guessed right.” The illusory figure nodded. “And I have a very good plan. It can make everyone happy.”","Immortal Fairy White Bones was confused.","How could it be possible for everyone to achieve perfection?","“When we reincarnate, I hope that Tyrannical Song can get pregnant with triplets. As long as triplets are born, there will be three of me,” the illusory figure said, pinching his chin.","Immortal Fairy White Bones put down her hammer and patted her head hard.","Triplets, three of me, Tyrannical Song pregnant?","There was too much information.","“Tyrannical Song is pregnant with triplets, so he’s not Tyrannical Song’s partner?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","“What are you thinking? Tyrannical Song is a man, and I’m obviously talking about Tyrannical Song’s partner being pregnant with triplets... Three years later, he can also get married legally,” the illusory figure said.","Immortal Fairy White Bones replied, “Tyrannical Song is pregnant right now.”","The illusory figure was speechless.","“In addition, even if there are three of you... I want it all too. The White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu would probably have the same thought. Your perfection is only in theory.” Immortal Fairy White Bones reminded him again, “Brother Song, you should continue to think of a ‘more perfect’ plan while there’s still some time.”","“I’ll go walk the dogs.” The illusory figure looked up at the sky.","“In the end, the hammer came down, and I’ll have to leave.” Immortal Fairy White Bones put away her hammer.","“I’m sorry.” The illusory figure stood up with his hands on his waist. He stretched out his hand and gently pressed it on the head of the incarnation of Immortal Fairy White Bones. “I’m sorry. We’ve just met, but we have to part so soon.”","Immortal Fairy White Bones lowered her head and said nothing.","“I’m sorry, Sister White Bones... There won’t be a next time. The next time we meet, we’ll have countless times to spend together,” he said gently.","After saying that, he gently tapped the glabella of Immortal Fairy White Bones’ incarnation, and her figure dissipated.","Staying in this special space for too long would cause irreparable damage to Immortal Fairy White Bones, even if it was her incarnation.","After Immortal Fairy White Bones’ incarnation disappeared, all the information was sent back to her main body.","“Sorry, Sister White Bones... There won’t be a next time.” That gentle but firm voice repeated in her mind.","“Perfect answer?” After saying that, Immortal Fairy White Bones turned to look at Tyrannical Song’s main body, who was sitting cross-legged, with a conflicted expression.","After struggling for a long time... She opened her lips and tried to overcome the shame in her heart. She tried to call out to him in the lowest voice possible.","In the future, three years later, there would be a day where he could not escape.","Three years was just a fleeting period of time for an Immortal.","Therefore, she had to get used to this form of address in advance and even get used to this mentality. She had to be mentally prepared.","In this way, she would be able to take the lead over the White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu three years later.","When Sister White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t get used to calling Tyrannical Song “daddy,” she could have adjusted her mentality and used the most natural tone to call him that.","Immortal Fairy White Bones’ voice was so low that only she could hear it.","But... Beside her, there were several Immortal big shots.","The hearing of an Immortal was one of the best in the universe.","Therefore, the white-robed Gold Trigram and Zither Master Phoenix Rites both heard Immortal Fairy White Bones’ low voice.","“Immortal Fairy White Bones, your father has appeared?” Island Lord Golden Trigram asked in confusion.","“No, no, I just suddenly miss my father.” Immortal Fairy White Bones waved her hand.","Zither Master Feng Yi was confused.","If she remembered correctly, Immortal Fairy White Bones came from a special plane called the Myriad Worlds. From time to time, there would be the spiritual energy of heaven and earth and unique materials of the plane that condensed into white bone creatures.","Immortal Fairy White Bones, where did her father come from?","On the other side.","In the special world where the illusory figure was.","“Perfect... How can there be anything perfect in this world?” The illusory figure sighed.","Opposite him, a fairy with braided hair, long bangs covering her eyes, and a large book in her arms walked over.","“What’s the matter? Fairy Ye Si.” The illusory figure asked with a smile.","“Thank you for your help, Senior, allowing Shuhang to successfully complete the ‘self-corpse’ segment,” Ye Si said.","“You’re welcome. It’s nothing.”","“Right, Senior. When I cooperated with Shuhang in the process of killing his self-corpse, I sealed the ghost spirit contract in Shuhang’s body. I also closed the door and windows. It won’t affect Shuhang, right?” Ye Si asked worriedly.","“Haha, haha, haha.”","The laughter gradually died down..."]},{"number":2851,"title":"Chapter 2851: Senior Melon Eater, I’m Here to Take Over the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2851: Senior Melon Eater, I’m Here to Take Over the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Tyrant’s World.","Song Shuhang’s main body remained in a state of closed-door cultivation. The spiritual energy within him surged and exploded. When he was at the Eighth Stage Realm, his physique, spiritual energy, and primordial spirit had already surpassed those of ordinary Tribulation Transcenders. But now, even his realm had to be forcefully broken through using the ‘Three Separations’ secret technique.","Above his head, Pavilion Master Chu was in an excellent mood, occasionally transforming her hair into various shapes: triangles, quadrilaterals, pentagrams... and even heart shapes.","Not far away, Immortal Fairy White Bones was also in high spirits. She glanced at Song Shuhang from time to time and began the “simulation training three years later” in her heart.","Compared to the White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu, she had a significant advantage—she didn’t have any ‘juniors’ hanging around Tyrannical Song!","The White Dragon had Su Clan’s Sixteen, and this little fairy had a very deep relationship with Tyrannical Song.","Pavilion Master Chu had the ghost spirit fairy, and if the ghost spirit fairy was attached to Song Shuhang’s body, it was equivalent to Tyrannical Song. Even Pavilion Master Chu herself was an accessory to Tyrannical Song.","Their ‘juniors’ were all of the same generation as Tyrannical Song, so if they wanted to call him ‘Daddy’ in the future, there would be an additional layer of mental barrier.","It was even possible that their ‘juniors’ were candidates for their mothers.","As for her, Immortal Fairy White Bones, she had nothing to worry about!","Therefore, it was better for the two sisters to continue being her close sisters or elder aunts. She could take care of the triplets in the future. In fact, she didn’t even mind calling them Grandma White Dragon or Grandma Chu in the future.","Immortal Fairy White Bones was delighted.","She secretly glanced at Tyrannical Song again, finding him more and more pleasing to the eye... After all, he was going to be a father in the future.","Opposite Song Shuhang.","The ghost spirit fairy bowed to Pavilion Master Chu and said, “Pavilion Master, it’s about time. Shuhang’s realm has almost reached its limit. Next, I’ll give Shuhang’s ‘self corpse’ time to complete the ritual of severing three corpses.”","“Go. Remember to show up occasionally. Don’t be invisible like before,” Pavilion Master Chu replied in a lazy voice.","“Yes, I will,” the ghost fairy giggled.","After saying that, she gently tapped her glabella and pressed the ‘switch’ again.","Then, her state became transparent and gradually disappeared from everyone’s memories...","When the ghost fairy turned transparent, the presence of Tyrannical Song’s third corpse, the Self-centric Corpse, appeared in front of everyone.","The third corpse still maintained its outstretched hand, and Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were standing on his arm. The Self-centric Corpse had inherited Tyrannical Song’s true gentleness, and every move it made was extremely warm.","“Eh? Has he appeared?” Zither Master Fengyi said with her claws.","“The communication with the ghost spirit fairy has ended, so she left her presence to me,” the Self-centric Corpse smiled. He stretched out his hand and placed Zither Master Fengyi’s claw on his shoulder.","Then, he stepped down from the lotus platform.","When he stepped down, the lotus platform instantly turned into countless specks of light and dissipated.","The Self-centric Corpse stepped into the air and walked toward Tyrannical Song’s main body. Beneath his feet, lotuses blossomed with every step. Unlike the black lotus on Song Shuhang’s main body, the lotus under the self corpse’s feet was pure white.","After arriving in front of his main body, the Self-centric Corpse bowed to Tyrannical Song’s main body and called out, “Overlord Body, I’m here to greet you.”","This was the final ritual of the Three Separations Secret Technique.","It was just that Tyrannical Song’s main body was a shell that had lost its soul. Tyrannical Song’s primordial spirit projection was still lingering in the Heavenly Dao Prison World. Therefore, this shell couldn’t respond to the third corpse.","Fortunately, Tyrannical Song had many accessories on him.","The virtuous lamia wasn’t around, so Black Panther didn’t know much about the ritual of ‘Three Separations.’","Therefore, it was Fairy Creation’s turn to appear.","Fairy Creation coughed lightly. She then entered Song Shuhang’s body and said in his voice, “Fellow Daoist, there’s no need to be so polite. We are one.”","Imitating a voice was a piece of cake for a song immortal like Fairy Creation.","This voice came from Song Shuhang’s body, and it could barely be considered as completing the etiquette.","Opposite her, the Self-centric Corpse Overlord Body looked at Fairy Creation gratefully.","“From now on, the three corpses will return to their original positions,” Overlord Body said slowly.","Following his announcement, Song Shuhang’s realm broke through!","The Tribulation Transcender’s life force, the spatial tribulation bone, and the primordial spirit that was entrusted to the Tribulation Transcender’s void resonated at the same time.","The special effect of the Three Separations Slaying Secret Technique allowed Song Shuhang to forcefully advance to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm without transcending the tribulation.","The Tribulation Transcender’s life force erupted, extending Song Shuhang’s life force indefinitely.","The complete Space Calamity Bone grew inside Tyrannical Song’s body. It was so huge that it wasn’t just a section, but it covered Tyrannical Song’s entire body, turning all his bones into it.","The primordial spirit that was placed in the void of the Tribulation Transcender was strengthened once again. Each of the 15+1 primordial spirits was nourished and strengthened. This was the nourishment and strengthening of the Tribulation Transcender’s primordial spirit that was 15+1 times stronger!","Walla","Spatial fluctuations appeared.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit, which was in the Wielder’s small black room, was sent back. At the same time, Fairy Virtuous returned with the ‘Good Corpse Spear’ in her hand.","A wisp of Father Goudan’s consciousness and a wisp of Senior Three-Eyed’s consciousness... They were still in the Wielder of the Will’s small black room, loving and killing each other.","After Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection returned to its original position, his main body opened its eyes.","“I’m finally back... I almost thought that I was going to retire in the Heavenly Dao Prison World,” Song Shuhang said slowly.","After his primordial spirit returned, he stretched out his hand and tapped lightly.","In the shadow, the inner demon appeared and transformed into the Evil Corpse, Ba E.","The virtuous lamia rode on the whale and waved the Good Corpse-Bashan in her hand.","Self-centric Corpse Overlord Body stood in the center.","The spiritual energy in Song Shuhang’s main body surged crazily.","Immortal Fairy White Bones, Pavilion Master Chu, Golden Trigram, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Zither Master Phoenix Rites, and the other Immortals all sensed something and looked at Song Shuhang.","They could clearly feel that the ‘path to immortality’ on Song Shuhang’s body had become clearer...","In other words, Song Shuhang had already condensed the embryonic form of his own ‘path to immortality’? Stepping into the realm of a top-notch Tribulation Transcender in one step?","“Pavilion Master Chu, Fairy Creation, Black Panther, wait for me in the Tyrant’s Realm. I’ll be right back,” Song Shuhang said.","“Tribulation?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","“Yes, I’m going to see the Tribulation Transcender’s Thousand-Day Tribulation,” Song Shuhang nodded.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and pressed down in the air. He activated the power of space, and the lotus of virtue that he had promised Scholar Yukong was transferred over.","This lotus flower of virtue that had the effect of ‘avoiding tribulation,’ along with the effect of Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit fairy’s “Forgotten Divine Technique,” had finally completed the last part of Song Shuhang’s heavenly tribulation.","“Tyrannical Song, how long will it take?” Fairy Creation sang.","“I’ll be right back!” Song Shuhang replied handsomely.","The next moment, he stood up and took a step forward.","With one step, he stepped into the space of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation.","“Senior Melon Eater, I’m here to take over the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.”"]},{"number":2852,"title":"Chapter 2852: You Don’t Even Qualify to Make Me Use the Hezhu Pillar!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2852: You Don’t Even Qualify to Make Me Use the Hezhu Pillar!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, Song Shuhang entered the space of the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation using his own abilities!","In the beginning, he had come in thanks to Senior Melon Eater’s Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. Then, under the control of Ma’am Long Luo and Senior White, he had entered and exited the space of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","Although relying on Lady Long Luo and Senior White to bully the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation was fun, doing it with his own abilities would indeed give him a greater sense of accomplishment!","At this moment, in the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","The Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation that originally belonged to Sage Monarch Melon Eater was now divided into two worlds, east and west.","The members who were transcending the tribulation were separated and could not take care of each other.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was all alone, struggling to support one world as he endured his thousand-day tribulation.","On the other side, Song Shuhang’s clone and Senior White’s half-body and half-clone combination were also going through their thousand-day tribulation.","In the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, the power of the heavenly tribulation would become stronger with each passing day. Now that more than three months had passed, the power of the Thousand Day Tribulation had already reached +100.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater had already transformed into his virtuous divine whale body, struggling to hold on. He opened up the ‘network of virtue’ around him and had to burn his lifespan from time to time to support it. When ordinary Profound Sages transcended a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, they would have to burn their lifespan to unleash their power.","Therefore, when an Eighth Stage Profound Sage tried to break through to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, the younger, the better. The longer the lifespan, the more confident he would be.","As long as he advanced to the Tribulation Transcender Realm, his lifespan would be greatly extended. Tribulation Transcenders had long lifespans. As long as they didn’t seek death, there weren’t many Tribulation Transcenders who died of old age.","At the same time, Sage Monarch Melon Eater would pay attention to Song Shuhang and Sage White from time to time, hoping that they could hold on.","Song Shuhang and Senior White had been accidentally dragged into his Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, and he felt very guilty. If the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm hadn’t been separated into two spaces, he would have done his best to help Song Shuhang and Sage White. Sage Monarch Melon Eater, who could condense a large amount of merit, was very kind.","The three of them transcending the tribulation as a group strengthened the effect of the heavenly tribulation to a certain extent. However, splitting the heavenly tribulation into two meant that Song Shuhang and Sage White shared half of the power of the heavenly tribulation with Sage Monarch Melon Eater.","Therefore, in theory, as long as Song Shuhang and Sage White were able to hold on, the power of Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation would decrease.","Therefore, no matter what, Sage Monarch Melon Eater hoped that Song Shuhang and Sage White could persevere and survive the remaining 900 days of the heavenly tribulation.","“All the best, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. We can do it. We’ve already transcended one-tenth of the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation.” Sage Monarch Melon Eater narrowed his eyes as he looked at Song Shuhang and Sage White, who were on the other side. He was silently cheering for them.","Just as Sage Monarch Melon Eater was silently cheering for Tyrannical Song... Suddenly, there was a strange movement in the Heavenly Tribulation Space on the other side!","Intense spatial fluctuations were produced.","Someone had forcefully torn apart the space of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation and entered the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation!","“Again?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater was anxious.","What happened to little friend Tyrannical Song?","Three months ago, all kinds of situations kept happening at little friend Tyrannical Song’s place, and he even sent a few guests in, almost killing them several times... Would something similar happen again this time?","“Hahaha, I’m finally here. As expected, we will still enter this Heavenly Tribulation Realm...It won’t reopen a new Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation space.” Another Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s voice sounded.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater turned his eyes and saw a taller and older ‘Tyrannical Song,’ stepping on a black lotus.","This is little friend Tyrannical Song’s true body?","Song Shuhang’s gaze also fell on his clone.","Three months ago, the clone that he had used to replace himself with Ma’am Long Luo and Senior White seemed to be a little shorter than his current body. Even her face looked a little more tender...","This kind of tenderness did not only refer to appearance, but also in terms of spiritual temperament.","[That’s true. I’ve experienced many things in the past three months.] Song Shuhang thought to himself.","The clone had been transcending the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation in place of the main body, so its temperament had not changed much. However, his main body had advanced from the Sixth Stage to the current Ninth Stage in one go. It had risen by three major realms, so his temperament would naturally be a little more ancient.","He didn’t pay attention to her height. Now, it seemed that his height had increased by another notch...","“Fellow Daoist, you’ve worked hard.” Song Shuhang said to his clone.","This clone was different from the ‘Three Separations’ clone. It didn’t have its own consciousness and was completely controlled by Song Shuhang. Previously, when he was in the Tribulation Transcendence Space, he also relied on a wisp of divine sense to operate.","Now that the main body had returned, the clone smiled and turned into a cloud of smoke with a bang, merging into the main body. At the same time, his experiences of transcending the tribulation in the past three months were also integrated into Song Shuhang’s memories.","“Senior White ~ you’ve worked hard too.” Song Shuhang said to Senior White.","Senior White waved his upper body and replied,” Stop fooling around. I was just cut up and sent here. How could it be hard?”","“Senior White, let’s end this thousand-day tribulation together!” Song Shuhang said seriously.","“Yes.” Senior White’s clone replied, “I hope to return before the new year.”","“Senior White, your wish is our goal.” Song Shuhang said handsomely.","Then, he shouted at Sage Monarch Melon Eater from afar, “Senior Melon Eater, are you alright? Can you still hold on? I’m here to take over the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage ~”","Sage Monarch Melon Eater: “Little friend Tyrannical Song, be careful!”","He saw that after Tyrannical Song came in, the power of the heavenly tribulation on the other side had increased dramatically. In fact, half of the power of the heavenly tribulation on his side had been drawn away.","In the space of the heavenly tribulation on the other side, the power of the heavenly tribulation had transformed into a huge bow. On it, the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning, which was specially aimed at ‘geniuses of heavens,’ had transformed into an arrow and was aimed at Song Shuhang.","Nearly a thousand Nine Heavens Divine Thunderbolts, which were specially targeted at the geniuses who had the ability to fight across levels, were highly compressed and turned into destructive arrows.","As soon as the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow took shape, it gave Sage Monarch Melon Eater a huge sense of oppression. Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s soul seemed to be trembling.","If this arrow went down, even a heaven’s favored son who could fight across levels would die on the spot, right?","Can little friend Tyrannical Song block this arrow?","“Yo, this is interesting.” Song Shuhang looked at the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow in the sky and said in a relaxed manner.","Unknowingly...This heavenly tribulation that could kill Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders actually didn’t give him any pressure.","“Although it doesn’t feel too painful to be shot, I ‘M not a masochist after all. I don’t have the hobby of being blown up while standing.” Song Shuhang said softly.","“Come out, Longevity Pillar. Kun King Pillar!” he said.","Facing such a powerful heavenly tribulation, he didn’t even need to use the Hezhu Pillar!"]},{"number":2853,"title":"Chapter 2853: The Charm of Heavenly Tribulations, Discounts Available Online","paragraphs":["Chapter 2853: The Charm of Heavenly Tribulations, Discounts Available Online","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Additionally, the Longevity Pillar, Kun King Pillar, had a very practical skill, Black Hole Devour. This skill could directly devour the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow and preserve it.","After all, King Kun inherently had the attribute of devouring everything, and there was an incomparably huge small world within his body.","Boom","In the sky, the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow, with the power to destroy the world, shot toward Song Shuhang and Senior White.","When the arrow of divine lightning was shot out, space itself was shattered!","In an instant, the Heavenly Lightning Divine Arrow pierced through space and directly appeared above Song Shuhang’s head, fiercely exploding!","In the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage, the heavenly lightning actually contained the power of space. This was a very cheating matter.","Unfortunately, even with the addition of the strange spatial power, this Heavenly Thunder God Arrow was destined to be unable to establish any effect.","The body of the Longevity Pillar, Kun King Pillar, directly turned into a black hole beside Song Shuhang. The lightning arrow, which was enough to kill a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, or at least seriously injure a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, fell into this black hole like a clay ox entering the sea... It was completely devoured by the black hole without causing any waves!","Not to mention the waves, there was not even a sound!","At the very least, one could hear a sound when the clay ox was thrown into the black hole. However, the Heavenly Thunder God Arrow did not even make a sound before it was humbly absorbed by the black hole!","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s mouth was wide open, and he was so shocked that he couldn’t close his mouth. My god, he dealt with the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow so easily?","What is the origin of little friend Song Shuhang’s pillar?","What level of magic treasure was this?","Even an ordinary Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender magical treasure wouldn’t be able to do this, right?","Could it be an Immortal’s magical treasure?","Was it because Tyrannical Song had obtained this top-grade magical treasure and had the confidence to resist the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation that he returned to the Heavenly Tribulation Realm?","But that didn’t seem right. If it was an Immortal’s magical treasure, refining it would take an extremely long time. Three months wasn’t enough for Tyrannical Song to refine the Immortal magical treasure and even bring it into the heavenly tribulation, right?","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s mind was in turmoil, and he felt like he was dreaming.","“I’ve successfully preserved this heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage. I haven’t eaten a heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage yet.” Perhaps it was because he had used up a lot of energy during the Three Separations Execution, Song Shuhang felt a long-lost sense of hunger. Just thinking about the delicacy of the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation made him salivate involuntarily.","How should he eat this fresh heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage to be healthier?","Steamed? Stir-fried? Fried? Or cut it into pieces and eat it raw?","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang couldn’t control himself and greedily looked at the tribulation cloud above his head.","Come on, continue your performance, Lord Heavenly Tribulation!","This might very well be the last time we meet. After transcending the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage, theoretically, there should be no more heavenly tribulation to transcend.","Therefore, you don’t have to be polite, Lord Heavenly Tribulation. Just use whatever you have.","This is your last chance to destroy me ~","“Shuhang, be careful. The power of the heavenly tribulation on my side has decreased by another 30%. The power of the heavenly tribulation has been attracted to you!” At this time, Sage Monarch Melon Eater suddenly felt something and immediately reminded him.","He felt as if he had been underestimated by the Heavenly Tribulation...Or rather, the heavenly tribulation instinctively didn’t want to waste more energy on him. As a result, a large amount of heavenly tribulation energy was transferred to Song Shuhang’s side. They wanted to focus their fire on him first.","“Does your magic tool have a limit? You have to be careful. There might be more than one Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow in the next wave.” Sage Monarch Melon Eater shouted.","He didn’t want Tyrannical Song to get into an accident because of his carelessness.","Tyrannical Song had done him a great favor, and if something happened to him during the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, Sage Monarch Melon Eater would definitely feel extremely guilty.","“Senior Melon Eater, don’t panic!” Song Shuhang comforted him. “No matter if he wants to shoot two or three arrows, even if it’s more arrows, they won’t hurt me.”","In order to prevent Sage Monarch Melon Eater from worrying, Song Shuhang waved his hand with a smile.","Rustle","Several Overlord God Pillars rose from the ground and filled the space beside Song Shuhang.","The Longevity Pillar series consisted of the Emperor Destruction Pillar, the Void Sun Pillar, the Beyond Pillar, and the Kun King Pillar.","Merit Pillar Series: Pipi Snake Immortal Pillar.","The heavenly tribulation pillar series was an archaic pillar, a special pillar condensed from the demonic tribulation of Song Shuhang of the Netherworld.","As for the strongest pillar at the moment, the Dao Pillar, Star Dragon Pillar—a double-section pole made from the raw materials of Lady Long Luo and the clone of the big-eyed planet big shot.","A series of powerful pillars almost blinded Sage Monarch Melon Eater!","Each of these pillars had the power to destroy the world. At this time, they gathered around Tyrannical Song and vaguely set up a pillar array!","“Wherever the Overlord Divine Pillar is inserted, it is my country!” The virtuous lamia appeared behind Song Shuhang and, without hesitation, snatched the lines that belonged to Demon Emperor More than One.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater:","He thought that Tyrannical Song had only obtained one pillar, but he didn’t expect that Tyrannical Song would have so many.","If each of these pillars had the power of the Kun King Pillar, then the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage wouldn’t be able to do anything to Tyrannical Song, right?","What had Tyrannical Song’s main body experienced in the outside world during these three months? He had actually obtained such a huge opportunity and so many magic tool pillars?","As he pondered, Sage Monarch Melon Eater finally found some time to focus his attention on Tyrannical Song’s main body.","A moment later...","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s jaw was dislocated.","Not to mention the Sage Names that started with the word tyrann, the Eight Tyrants were simply unprecedented.","Let’s first talk about Tyrannical Song’s current realm—Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender!","Melon Eater wasn’t wrong. Tyrannical Song’s current realm was a genuine Tribulation Transcender.","The Tribulation Transcender’s vitality, the Spatial Tribulation Bone, and the Primordial Spirit no longer existed in his body. Only the projection of the Primordial Spirit remained. The characteristics of the three Tribulation Transcenders had already merged into one.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was confused.","Could it be that the world had changed and time was distorted?","I’ve been transcending the Heavenly Tribulation in the Tribulation Transcender Realm for three months, but in the outside world, 300 or 3,000 years have actually passed?","Otherwise, there was no way to explain Tyrannical Song’s current Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, right?","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s brain was on the verge of crashing.","However, the shock that Song Shuhang brought to him had only just begun.","“The Tyrant God Pillar Formation has been set up. The heavenly tribulation is no longer able to affect me. Then it’s time to start operating,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he took out a lotus flower of virtue.","At the same time, with a thought, three figures stepped out from behind him.","Good Corpse Tyrant Good, Evil Corpse Tyrant Evil, Self Corpse Tyrant Body!","The three corpses appeared at the same time.","Song Shuhang activated the lotus flower of virtue and began to use his own methods to influence the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage above his head.","Today, he, Tyrannical Song, was going to turn the thousand-day tribulation into a ten-day tribulation!","A thousand days was too long, and Senior White was still thinking of rushing back to celebrate the new year in a few days.","Moreover, this new year was also very special to him.","This was the first New Year he had celebrated since joining the Nine Provinces Number One Group!","He didn’t want to waste such a special day in the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation space."]},{"number":2854,"title":"Chapter 2854: Our Attack: Forced 40% discount","paragraphs":["Chapter 2854: Our Attack: Forced 40% discount","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What treasure is this? I can feel an enormous amount of virtuous power from it!” Senior Melon Eater from next door couldn’t help but ask.","Currently, he had a body of virtue, and in the future, he would step out of the Great Dao of Virtue and become an existence that could attain immortality. Therefore, he was especially sensitive to treasures of the virtue system.","The moment Song Shuhang took out the golden lotus of virtue, Sage Monarch Melon Eater keenly estimated the huge amount of virtue hidden within it.","Not only that, but he could also sense a deep sense of sorrow from the golden lotus of merit.","The owner of the golden lotus of merit had performed an extremely grand deed of great merit, one that could even affect the myriad worlds, under a very sad and helpless situation. Only then had they condensed such a precious treasure of merit.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater really couldn’t imagine what kind of good deed could affect the myriad worlds, but at the same time, was accompanied by endless sadness.","Could it be that they had to destroy something they loved the most to save the myriad worlds’ merit?","“I don’t know what this Merit Golden Lotus is called either. I only know that... it can affect the heavenly tribulation,” Song Shuhang replied.","After saying that, the self-centric corpse, Overlord Body, stepped on the white lotus and pressed his hand on the golden lotus of virtue. He injected a wisp of the spirit energy of the Forgotten Divine Technique into it, activating the golden lotus of virtue.","The reason Tyrannical Song had entered the Heavenly Tribulation Realm with such confidence wasn’t because he wanted to enjoy the beating of the heavenly tribulation big shot. He had the confidence to do so, and the treasures he had collected over the past three months that could counter the heavenly tribulation were his confidence!","Walla ~~","The golden lotus of virtue bloomed, and a huge amount of light of virtue enveloped Song Shuhang and Senior White. The remaining power of the golden lotus of virtue flowed to Senior Melon Eater next door.","Everyone who saw it would have a share of the good fortune. This was also the reward for Senior Melon Eater bringing Song Shuhang and Senior White to transcend the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.","Senior Melon Eater was kind-hearted, and both Song Shuhang and Senior White could see it. Therefore, Song Shuhang and Senior White were both willing to help Sage Monarch Melon Eater at the critical moment.","The blooming golden lotus of virtue transformed into a lotus imprint and floated beside Song Shuhang, Senior White, and Senior Melon Eater.","This brand began to silently influence the heavenly tribulation above their heads, compressing the duration of the heavenly tribulation. This influence was not a one-time deal but a long, continuous stream.","As long as Song Shuhang and the others were still in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm, the lotus flower of virtue would continuously influence the heavenly tribulation. From time to time, it would tease the heavenly tribulation, causing the duration of the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation to decrease by 1, 1.","“This, there’s actually such a treasure in the world!” Senior Melon Eater said in shock.","Although the -1, -1 was very weak, and it would only cool down after a while before the -1 effect was completed, it accumulated!","One had to know that the most difficult part of the Thousand Day Tribulation was the length!","How many Eighth Stage Profound Sages had fallen after 990 days of the Thousand Day Tribulation?","And this lotus imprint would occasionally bring about a -1 effect on the heavenly tribulation. The small amount of water flowed long, and after accumulating, it was very impressive!","Perhaps, this reduction in the length of the heavenly tribulation was the key to surviving the heavenly tribulation!","“This treasure is too precious. It’s a treasure that all tribulation-transcending cultivators dream of. Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, where did you get it?” Senior Melon Eater looked at Song Shuhang gratefully.","He hadn’t expected that Tyrannical Song would be willing to share the effects of such a precious merit treasure with him. He felt that he owed the other party a huge favor, and he didn’t know how to repay it.","If he could successfully advance to the Ninth Stage this time, he would definitely find a way to repay Tyrannical Song’s favor after returning to the main world.","It would be best if he could find a very valuable treasure, but he definitely couldn’t directly give him spirit stones. Tyrannical Song didn’t even blink and shared such a precious treasure with him. If he gave him spirit stones, it would be an insult to Tyrannical Song’s character.","“It should be quite precious.” Song Shuhang nodded and turned around. Scholar Fishlips could only condense one similar treasure every month, and perhaps only Scholar Fishlips could condense such a treasure in the myriad worlds.","His Selfcentric Corpse Overlord Body was also unable to do so.","The Selfcentric Separation’s Forgotten Divine Skill had double the effect. If he went up to give a speech, the practitioners in the universe would not be able to see him or hear him. It would only be a waste of the opportunity.","“Thank you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... In the future, I will definitely repay you.” Senior Melon Eater raised his head and looked at the heavenly tribulation.","With the effect of the lotus flower of virtue, he was even more confident in transcending the heavenly tribulation.","Boom? Rumble","Just as they were talking, several Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrows shot down from Song Shuhang’s side. Even if Sage Monarch Melon Eater used the merit network and burned his lifespan, he would only dare to take one of these arrows.","However, Song Shuhang’s body was now covered with the Dominating Divine Pillars!","Sage Monarch Melon Eater had been thinking that if every single one of these Tyrant Divine Pillars was as powerful as the Kun King Pillar, then the heavenly tribulation of the level of the Nine Heavens Divine Lightning Arrow wouldn’t be able to harm Tyrannical Song.","However, he did not expect that every single one of the remaining Overlord Divine Pillars was actually stronger than the Kun King Pillar!","The Kun King Pillar was the little brother of all the Overlord Divine Pillars.","In the pillar array of the Overlord God Pillar, every Overlord God Pillar transformed into a corresponding pillar spirit to welcome the heavenly tribulation.","The Kun King Pillar transformed into the Immortal, King Kun, who swallowed everything within ten thousand miles.","However, a peerless Demon Emperor flashed beside him. That Demon Emperor was incomparably domineering. The difference between King Kun and him was like the difference between the rising sun and the small moon.","Beside the Demon Emperor, a real Illusory Rising Sun appeared. The strength of this Illusory Rising Sun was not inferior to the Demon Emperor at all. It even felt like it could suppress the Demon Emperor.","However, there was an even more powerful existence beside the illusory sun and the Demon Emperor. The Heavenly Emperor transformed from the Emperor Destroying Pillar completely suppressed the Demon Emperor and the illusory sun.","Behind the Emperor Destroying Pillar, a phantom of Tyrannical Song appeared. However, Tyrannical Song had the aura of a ruler of the Netherworld that could destroy the world!","The strongest was still behind—the combination of Lady Long Luo and the big-eyed planet boss. The power of this combination was not as simple as 1 + 1 = 2!","Even the aura of the Virtue Pillar, Pi Pi Pillar, was stronger than the Kun King Pillar after the virtuous lamia sacrificed it again and again!","Senior Melon Eater’s fish jaw was once again dislocated from the shock.","After three months, what happened to Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song?","So many magic tools, so many powerful magic tools, how did he obtain them?","An ordinary Eighth Stage Profound Sage would be able to do whatever they wanted with just one of them, but Tyrannical Song had taken out seven in one go.","Also, what was that pillar that had the image of Tyrannical Song and the aura of the ruler of the Netherworld?","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was so shocked that his scalp went numb.","However, Song Shuhang’s showy actions had only just begun!","“Show yourself, Heavenly Thunder graduation certificate!” Song Shuhang took off his shirt, revealing the heavenly lightning graduation certificate on his body.","[Our attack: Heavenly Thunder graduation certificate, dealing 40% discount damage to lightning-type heavenly tribulation, and forcing a 20% discount effect on all heavenly tribulations of the Ninth Stage!]","The Thousand Day Calamity reduced HP by 200 days."]},{"number":2855,"title":"Chapter 2855: Continue, Shuhang. Roger that, Senior White!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2855: Continue, Shuhang. Roger that, Senior White!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior Melon Eater no longer had a fish jaw to dislocate this time...","He only saw the laws related to ‘heavenly lightning’ faintly flash on Tyrannical Song’s body, and then the heavenly tribulation targeting Tyrannical Song seemed to be weakened!","This time, Senior Melon Eater could only widen his eyes to express his shock, and with his dislocated fish jaw, he completed his ‘dumbstruck’ expression.","What kind of law was this? Why was even the heavenly lightning affected?","Why was Tyrannical Song so skilled? How many times had he been struck by lightning?","Unfortunately, this ‘Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation forced discount’ was only for Tyrannical Song, and Senior Melon Eater next door couldn’t enjoy this benefit.","If that’s the case, wouldn’t Tyrannical Song transcend the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage before me? This is clearly my heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage!","Even the kind-hearted Senior Melon Eater felt a little aggrieved at this moment. However, he wasn’t jealous of Tyrannical Song. It was a good thing that he could escape from the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation earlier!","“Speaking of which, if Tyrannical Song escapes in advance, then only Sage White and I will be left to transcend the final Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, right?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater thought about it and then turned his gaze to Sage White.","If only he and Sage White were left to transcend the tribulation together, would that be a good thing?","The main reason was that Sage White had a high affinity with people. Even if he stayed in the same space as Sage White for eight to ten years, he wouldn’t get sick of it.","However, when Sage Monarch Melon Eater turned around, he saw a ‘Heavenly Thunder graduation certificate’ appear on Sage White’s body.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit projection was currently in a 15+1 state, and one of the arms of the primordial spirit projection belonged to Senior White.","Back then, when Senior White was being struck by the ‘Immortal Slaying Thunder’ of the three-eyed young man to condense his ‘heavenly lightning graduation certificate,’ a certificate had also condensed on his arm.","After Song Shuhang, Sage White also used a 40% discount on the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. The total duration of the heavenly tribulation was reduced by 200 days, keeping pace with Tyrannical Song.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater: (??_?)","He originally thought that Tyrannical Song was the most special of the three, but now it seemed that he was the special one. When the other two were special, he, the husky who had mixed into the wolf pack, became a special anomaly.","“How do I condense a law that can reduce the effects of the heavenly lightning?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater slapped his dislocated chin back and couldn’t help but ask.","The lotus flowers of virtue from before were very precious. It was very likely that there were only a few of them in the myriad worlds. However, the ‘law of reducing the effect of heavenly tribulation’ on Tyrannical Song and Sage White seemed to be able to be replicated. After all, Tyrannical Song and Sage White had it at the same time.","If it could be replicated, it would be a blessing for other Eighth Stage Profound Sages to transcend their tribulation.","“Hmm, he should be struck by heavenly tribulation, heavenly lightning, heavenly punishment, and so on. He should be able to come out after being struck to a certain extent, right?” Song Shuhang replied.","“Maybe I should eat some heavenly tribulation or something?” Senior White added.","He and Song Shuhang had several common characteristics. They had both experienced heavenly tribulation, eaten heavenly lightning, and suffered heavenly punishment.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was speechless.","Suffering heavenly punishment? Eating the heavenly tribulation?","Farewell!","Heavenly punishment was a game that would kill anyone who suffered it. He had also never heard of eating heavenly tribulation!","Tyrannical Song couldn’t learn the ‘Heavenly Thunder graduation certificate.’","Sage Monarch Melon Eater gave up on this idea.","“Senior White, let’s continue. By the way, Senior White, have you prepared your New Year’s gift?” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and drew runes in the air while asking.","“Yes, it’s rare for me to be awake during the new year.” Senior White nodded.","“Is there a share for me? The seniors in the group said that they won’t give me red packets this year. They’ll only give red packets to my disciples.” Song Shuhang felt stifled.","If Senior White didn’t give him a red packet, then the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group would give him a red packet for the new year, a treatment that Tyrannical Song would never get.","“Well, if you want it, I’ll send it to you too.” Senior White said.","“Thank you, Senior White!” Song Shuhang was so touched that he couldn’t speak.","At the same time, he stretched out his hand and slapped the void!","The ‘fatball’s research on heavenly tribulation and heavenly punishment’ that he had extracted from the smoke demon core was extracted.","The research data of these fat balls had already been calculated by Song Four, the ruler of the Netherworld, and had become Song Shuhang’s property.","Song Shuhang followed the fat ball’s research and continuously sent runes into the void, fusing them with the heavenly tribulation above his and Senior White’s heads.","After the ‘forced discount’ attack of the ‘heavenly lightning graduation certificate,’ Song Shuhang also used the ‘fat ball research’ attack on the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage Realm!","The fat ball boss’s information attack effect was outstanding. It instantly caused a 300-day compression effect on the Thousand Day Calamity!","Above Song Shuhang and Senior White’s heads, the strength of the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage began to increase!","The fat ball’s 300-day heavenly tribulation duration was carried out by compressing the power of the heavenly tribulation.","In other words, the power of the Thousand Day Tribulation that had lasted for nearly a year was forcefully compressed.","Violent thunder roared above their heads.","The power of the heavenly tribulation broke through crazily, and its power instantly surpassed the power of the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater next door was stunned.","The level of the runes Tyrannical Song had pushed out was too high, and Sage Monarch Melon Eater couldn’t understand a single one of them. This was knowledge that was beyond the comprehension of Eighth Stage Profound Sages and even Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders.","Although he couldn’t understand the runes, he could feel the effect—the duration of the heavenly tribulation had been compressed!","Tyrannical Song, what are you doing?","Why did he compress the power of the Thousand Days Tribulation? Although this would reduce the length of the heavenly tribulation, it would increase the power of the heavenly tribulation. The gains would not make up for the losses!","Sage Monarch Melon Eater subconsciously wanted to warn Song Shuhang, but he suddenly remembered that Song Shuhang had reached the Ninth Stage Realm before he had even finished transcending his tribulation, as well as those seven ‘overlord divine pillars.’ He forcefully swallowed the words he wanted to remind him.","With Tyrannical Song’s current strength... Perhaps he could really make it through?","“It’s about the same as my budget.” Song Shuhang said with satisfaction.","Under the influence of the Heavenly Thunder graduation certificate and the fat ball’s research materials, the duration of the thousand-day tribulation was reduced by more than 500 days in one go. The difference between this data before and after was not too big.","And before this, he had spent nearly three months with Sage Monarch Melon Eater.","Therefore, the original 1,000-day tribulation only had about 410 to 420 days left.","And in these 400 days, the effect of the Golden Lotus of Merit had to be deducted!","400 days was so short that ordinary Eighth Stage Profound Sages would cry.","However, Song Shuhang and Senior White weren’t satisfied.","“Continue. Next step, Shuhang.” Senior White said.","“Roger that, Senior White!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and touched his body.","The seven Sage Seals appeared one by one.","After the seven great Sage Seals, another special ‘seal’ appeared—it was the Realm Lord Seal ‘Overlord Realm’!","Sector lord authority also had the effect of weakening the heavenly tribulation!","Next to him, Senior White also stretched out his hand and pointed, summoning a small tree-shaped illusory image. This was the World Tree of the Dream Realm, which represented the authority of the Realm Lord of the Dream Realm!","“Again, again?” Senior Melon Eater felt that he was already a little numb."]},{"number":2856,"title":"Chapter 2856: Good morning, Shuhang","paragraphs":["Chapter 2856: Good morning, Shuhang","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was the authority of a Sector Lord! Song Shuhang and Sage White had actually managed to create something like this, and two of them at that!","This was a qualification that even Immortal big shots rarely obtained!","The myriad worlds were so vast, and there were quite a number of Immortals who had survived since the Supreme Ancient Immortal Realms. However, the number of Immortals who had the authority of a Realmlord did not exceed ten, or perhaps even less. It was unknown if there were even five!","Sector lord authority had the effect of avoiding calamities, many cultivators knew about this. However, this function had never been used since ancient times.","After all, the ones who truly controlled a world were basically all Immortal big shots. After they had the authority of a Sector Lord, why would they even need to undergo tribulations?","No one had expected that Song Shuhang and Sage White would actually obtain the authority of a Sector Lord before the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage and put it into actual combat!","Why are the two of you so awesome?","Sage Monarch Melon Eater felt that his ‘Sage Name’ was too realistic. Right now, he was just a standard Melon Eater!","A large portion of the energy of the heavenly tribulation above his head was transferred to the next side, and it crazily struck toward Song Shuhang and Sage White. Therefore, Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s tribulation pressure was greatly reduced.","He even had the time and energy to pay attention to Song Shuhang and Sage White’s tribulation. He was like a small audience member, constantly shocked by Song Shuhang and Sage White’s actions.","In just a few hours, his fish jaw had dislocated countless times.","Other than being shocked and shouting ‘666,’ he couldn’t find the meaning of his existence in this heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage!","The scene of Song Shuhang and Sage White transcending their tribulation really caused Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s ‘Tribulation Transcending Temple’ to collapse!","“From the ‘Virtuous Golden Lotus’ at the beginning to the ‘Heavenly Lightning Graduation Certificate,’ then to the terrifying rune knowledge, and now to the ‘Sector Lord’ authority, how many more methods do Tyrannical Song and Sage White have to forcefully discount the heavenly tribulation?” At this moment, Sage Monarch Melon Eater actually felt pity for the big shot of the heavenly tribulation.","The Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation above his head was probably the most humiliating heavenly tribulation in history, right?","From the moment Tyrannical Song’s true body returned, the onlookers could only see the majesty of the heavenly tribulation constantly being discounted.","Hua","The power of the Tyrant Realm Sage Seal was fully unleashed, enveloping the Sector Lord Tyrannical Song.","Behind Song Shuhang, a huge illusory world appeared. This world was filled with the aura of destruction, but amidst the destruction, there was a new life brewing!","The Tyrant’s Realm was in a state of ruin, but its potential was unlimited.","The pendants on Song Shuhang’s body would definitely be able to develop it well, just like how he developed his ‘small inner world.’ Perhaps in the future, the disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect who worked for free in the Inner World could move to the Tyrant’s Realm after the contract was completed and become the first sect to enter the Tyrant’s Realm!","Song Shuhang didn’t need to worry about these things. In any case, as long as the big shots on his pendant were idle and bored, they could occasionally make a move and develop the Tyrant’s World into a prosperous world.","On the side, Sage White’s might wasn’t any weaker than Tyrannical Song’s.","The World Tree in his hand turned into a giant tree that supported the sky. The World Tree spread its branches and leaves, and the entire illusory Dream Realm was attached to the World Tree. The authority of the Realm Lord of the Dream Realm was attached to Sage White, making him look even more ethereal and handsome.","Sage White and the illusory Dream Realm were a perfect match!","Above his head, the menacing heavenly tribulation was weakened once again. Originally, there were only 400 days left of the 1,000-day heavenly tribulation, but this time, it was reduced from three digits to two digits!","Sector lord authority reduced the duration of the heavenly tribulation by close to a year.","Song Shuhang’s thousand-day heavenly tribulation only had 80 days left.","Senior White’s thousand-day heavenly tribulation was weakened to a similar extent as Song Shuhang’s. His authority as the ‘Realm Lord of the Dream Realm’ was stronger than Song Shuhang’s, but he wasn’t the real Realm Lord. Instead, he used the World Tree as a medium to temporarily transfer the authority to himself. Therefore, the authority of the Dream Realm’s Realm Lord was similar to Song Shuhang’s authority of the Realm Lord Tyrannical Song.","“Senior White, I still have about eighty days left,” Song Shuhang said.","“It’s about the same on my side,” Senior White nodded and said, “Do you have any other methods?”","‘There are other methods?’ Sage Monarch Melon Eater felt that his heart was getting nervous as Sage White asked.","Could there really be a discount?","The thousand-day tribulation was suddenly reduced to 80 days. Sage Monarch Melon Eater felt so envious that he was about to cry.","A mere eighty days was simply too fast for cultivators!","But even so, Sage White and Song Shuhang were still dissatisfied.","“I still have ghost fairies,” Song Shuhang said.","The ‘Forgotten Divine Technique’ that the ghost spirit fairy possessed seemed to have undergone a special strengthening, and it had the effect of affecting the heavenly tribulation.","As long as the ghost fairy spirit and the golden lotus of virtue were added, Song Shuhang was confident that he could reduce the 80 days to a single digit.","“How much longer can it be compressed?” Senior White asked.","Song Shuhang speculated, “I’m not too sure about the specifics. However, I feel that if I work hard, coupled with the fact that my self-incarnation has the cultivation of the Forgotten Divine Technique at the ninth layer, I should be able to compress 80 days into eight days.”","“Eight days? Then wait a moment. Let me do it first, then you can summon the ghost fairy,” Senior White said.","From the looks of it, Senior White also had a method to influence the heavenly tribulation.","Song Shuhang wasn’t surprised at all.","In fact, even if Senior White said that he had a magical treasure that could make the heavenly tribulation call him big brother, Song Shuhang wouldn’t doubt it.","In Song Shuhang’s heart, Senior White was equivalent to Senior White Doraemon.","“I’ll summon my main body first. In the final segment, my avatar has finally completed its mission,” Senior White’s upper body said.","After saying this much, Senior White’s upper and lower body were separated by his waist.","A disposable flying sword was summoned, and the upper body of Senior White’s clone left the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm with a whoosh.","He could enter and leave as he pleased.","He didn’t give the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation space any face at all!","The Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Space did not seem to have any intention of stopping Sage White from leaving. In fact, it seemed to have opened a back door for Sage White.","A few breaths later.","With a whoosh, a flying sword flew over, carrying the upper body of Senior White’s main body.","The two halves of Senior White merged!","That unparalleled charm spread out, and even the heavenly tribulation above his head seemed to be infected by this charm. It was obvious that it froze for a moment.","‘Is Sage White going to use his charm to conquer the heavenly tribulation?’ Sage Monarch Melon Eater next door had an absurd guess in his mind.","“I seem to have slept?” Senior White opened his eyes and looked around in confusion. Then, he lifted his sleeve and quietly wiped the saliva from the corner of his mouth. Finally, he looked at Song Shuhang. “Good morning, Shuhang.”","“Good morning, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said."]},{"number":2857,"title":"Chapter 2857: Oh No, Close Your Eyes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2857: Oh No, Close Your Eyes!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although he did not know if it was morning or night in China on Earth, since Senior White said “good morning,” then it was “good morning.”","Song Shuhang smiled.","Half of Senior White’s main body had been hanging on the World Tree in the Dream Realm for a long time. From the looks of it, half of Senior White’s main body had fallen asleep after closing the door?","This was a very rare thing!","After all, Senior White was different from Song Shuhang. He was a madman who went into seclusion.","Song Shuhang was the kind of person who would say, “I actually went into closed-door cultivation for half an hour today. I’m really something.”","However, Senior White was like, “Eh, I have half an hour? Why don’t I go into seclusion?”","Especially when he had just come into contact with Song Shuhang, Senior White was racing against time to enter seclusion. From time to time, he would enter Ah Bai’s seclusion mode.","And it was this kind of closed-door cultivation expert who actually fell asleep during closed-door cultivation!","Song Shuhang should be the only one sleeping in seclusion.","Therefore, Song Shuhang felt a little guilty—could it be that he had led Senior White astray?","“During this seclusion, I came into contact with some laws. Because I was in the Dream Realm and had the authority to control the Dream Realm, I came into contact with those laws through dreams,” Senior White said coolly, wiping the saliva from the corner of his mouth and placing his hands behind his back.","“I see,” Song Shuhang nodded.","In the Dream Realm, after gaining the authority to control the Dream Realm, one could come into contact with the laws through dreams. It was similar to how he had entered the state of enlightenment through killing Heavenly Emperor Ta Ta.","Also, Senior White was sleeping in seclusion, so he was relieved that he hadn’t infected him.","“Senior White, what law did you comprehend? Is it related to transcending the tribulation?” Song Shuhang asked again.","“Yes.” Senior White nodded. “Right, Shuhang. I’ll need to borrow the two sets of your Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure.”","“No problem!” Song Shuhang replied.","With a thought, 65 life-bound magical treasures flew out of his life-bound spiritual lake. The Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, which had been nourished by his life-bound spiritual lake, became even brighter.","Then, the Defiant Whale Glove on his right hand also flew down.","On the glove, the artifact spirit Little Fairy was kneeling with her right hand raised high. She was like a big sister among artifact spirits, commanding the actions of all the life-bound artifacts.","The remaining 65 life-bound magical treasures were arranged neatly. An Artifact Spirit Embryo appeared on each magical treasure and followed closely behind Little Fairy.","“Oh my god,” Senior Melon Eater, who was next door, was shocked again. At this moment, he was really at a loss for words. He could not say more words to express his feelings.","Tyrannical Song’s 66 life-bound magical treasures had all condensed weapon spirits!","What kind of operation was this?","No one in the myriad worlds would believe such a thing, right?","Even the legendary Immortal big shots would have one or two magical treasures with artifact spirits. But Tyrannical Song had a total of 66 magical treasures with weapon spirits!","Sage Monarch Melon Eater had lived for so long, but this was the first time he had seen such a large group of artifact spirits.","“Even if I were to share this matter with fellow Daoists in the universe after the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation ends, others would think that I’m bragging, right?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater thought to himself. Moreover, he was bragging without a draft.","Not only that, but when Sage Monarch Melon Eater carefully observed them, he also discovered that these 66 life-bound magical treasures were all at the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm!","No, this was not the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm—it was beyond the ninth grade!","As a Tribulation Transcender who was about to advance, Sage Monarch Melon Eater already had a relatively clear concept of the level of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","Tyrannical Song’s 66 life-bound magical treasures were definitely not as simple as Ninth Stage!","This was a magic tool that had surpassed the limits of the Ninth Stage.","“Could it be that these 66 magical treasures are all Immortal divine weapons? Isn’t this too exaggerated?” At the same time, Sage Monarch Melon Eater suddenly felt that his heart was beating uncontrollably!","Dong dong dong!","His heart was beating like a drum.","It was because of Tyrannical Song’s 66 magical treasures! These 66 magical artifacts actually emitted a unified heartbeat ripple, causing the living beings beside them to involuntarily have their hearts beat along with this ripple!","This was a heart-pounding feast.","The terrifying Tyrannical Song, was he planning to force everyone who saw him to have their hearts beat faster?","‘In this world, I’m afraid it’s already very difficult to find a magical treasure that’s stronger than Tyrannical Song’s ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, right?’ Sage Monarch Melon Eater thought to himself as his heart beat faster.","At this moment, Sage White also made his move.","White Saint took out an immortal sword.","The immortal sword was unsheathed, and there was also a cute weapon spirit wandering on the immortal sword. It was a miniature version of White Saint.","“Yo, Shuhang,” Meteor Sword’s tool spirit waved at Song Shuhang.","“Yo, Little Star,” Song Shuhang replied.","After the sword spirit of the Q version of Meteor Sword was unsheathed, it stretched out its hand and pointed at the scabbard.","In the next moment, the scabbard split open and turned into a complete set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure.","This was the set that Senior White had obtained when he saw White Wielder of the Will in the ruins.","This set of Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure was personally forged by Heavenly White.","It wasn’t a Dao Artifact, but it had some Dao Artifact properties.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater used his tail to gently touch his swollen face.","Sage White’s Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure was even stronger than Tyrannical Song’s two sets!","“Shuhang, I need temporary control,” Senior White said.","“I’ve already activated it for Senior White,” Song Shuhang cooperated.","This was the tacit understanding between him and Senior White.","Senior White nodded. He stretched out his hand and pointed at the three sets of the Combined Magical Treasure.","The three sets of magic tools quickly combined.","Buzz","Under Senior White’s control, the magical treasure turned into a divine bridge.","This divine bridge seemed to cross space, cross the other shore, and cross time, connecting the past, present, and future!","In ancient times, Sage White had used a set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure as a brick and casually threw it...In the main world, Song Shuhang had forged two sets of life-bound magical treasures because Senior White Two liked them. Then, the brick hit his head.","At this time, the divine bridge seemed to have connected to the concept of ‘White Wielder of the Will casually tossing it’ and the point where Song Shuhang forged two sets of magical treasures.","The divine bridge condensed and stood in front of Song Shuhang and Sage White.","“Fellow Daoist Melon Eater, stand still,” Senior White faintly smiled at Sage Monarch Melon Eater.","Then, under his control, the divine bridge also crossed Sage Monarch Melon Eater, covering him within the range of the divine bridge.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s kindness toward Song Shuhang and Sage White was finally repaid.","Under Sage White’s control, the other end of the divine bridge was directly placed above the heavenly tribulation in the void.","Vaguely, an extremely oppressive aura was released.","“Undying,” Song Shuhang, the “undying information expert,” was the first to notice.","He was a man who had come into contact with undying information many times and was still alive and kicking.","“Immortal?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater quickly closed his eyes.","He was an extremely experienced Profound Sage. Furthermore, he had entered the Virtue Network before and roamed around it, obtaining a lot of information from it. Compared to ordinary cultivators, he knew more about the terrifying concept of “undying.”","Moreover, because he was shocked by Song Shuhang and Sage White’s series of actions, Sage Monarch Melon Eater didn’t doubt the possibility of Sage White’s fiddling with the information of the undying at this time.","Subconsciously, he already believed it!"]},{"number":2858,"title":"Chapter 2858: Does This Pose Contain Special Hidden Information?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2858: Does This Pose Contain Special Hidden Information?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Sage Monarch Melon Eater now had invincible confidence in Sage White and Tyrannical Song!","After all, Tyrannical Song and Sage White’s actions from the beginning to the end of this heavenly tribulation were outstanding.","Now, even if someone told Sage Monarch Melon Eater that Sage White was actually the Wielder of the Will and that Tyrannical Song was the ruler of the Netherworld, Sage Monarch Melon Eater would still nod and believe it!","You’re right about everything you say, I believe everything you say—it’s superstitious.","Therefore, Sage Monarch Melon Eater believed it on the spot when Tyrannical Song brought up the matter of Sage White fiddling with information about immortality.","He chose to close his eyes and restrain his curiosity. He didn’t want to look at the undying information.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater closed his eyes very quickly. He was afraid that if he closed his eyes too late, he would be immersed in the “information of immortality” and be unable to extricate himself. In the universe, almost no cultivator could move their eyes away after seeing the “information of immortality.”","Such information was just that fatal.","“Don’t worry, this isn’t true undying information, it’s just a simulated signal. It can also affect the heavenly tribulation and compress its duration,” Senior White’s voice sounded.","The divine bridge that he had borrowed Song Shuhang’s two sets of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts Combined Magical Treasure to forge wasn’t really able to travel through time. Instead, he used this divine bridge to read the information of a certain mark in the world.","Then, he borrowed the special properties of his body and the Combined Magical Treasure to read the information of the Heavenly White Mark and simulate it again.","Fortunately, Wielder of the Will White didn’t erase his existence from the root like the First and Second Wielder of the Will, which was why Senior White was able to do this.","Therefore, the “Heavenly Dao White Immortal Information” condensed in the void at this moment was only a superficial copy of the information. It was not as fatal as the real “Immortal Information.”","“Fellow Daoist Melon Eater, you don’t have to look away. You can take the opportunity to take a look at these undying information clones. Perhaps you can get some inspiration from them,” Senior White reminded him.","This could be considered as a small benefit that he had left for Fellow Daoist Melon Eater. After all, Senior White felt very bad for messing up his heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.","“Can I really watch it?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater asked.","“It’s fine, Senior Melon Eater. At most, your eyeballs will explode. Don’t worry. For us, it’s fine if we dig out the eyeball that exploded and regrow it,” Song Shuhang replied with experience. “There won’t be any side effects.”","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was speechless.","Why did things like exploding eyeballs and gouging eyeballs sound like clipping fingernails to Tyrannical Song? Tyrannical Song, what have you experienced in the past few months?","However, with Sage White and Tyrannical Song’s double guarantee, Sage Monarch Melon Eater carefully opened his eyes and looked in Sage White’s direction.","In his field of vision, Sage White and Song Shuhang were standing at one end of the divine bridge, and there was another “Sage White” with a blurry face standing at the other end of the divine bridge.","As for Sage Monarch Melon Eater himself, he was standing in the hole under the bridge.","“Is that the information of immortality?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s gaze turned to the other end of the divine bridge, where “Sage White” was.","Two White Saints, two styles, double the visual enjoyment...I was worth it today!","There probably couldn’t be a more beautiful scene in this world, right? After all, there was only one Sage White in the myriad worlds. It should be very difficult to find such a scene of two whites opposing each other.","As Sage Monarch Melon Eater pondered, his gaze was involuntarily attracted by the “blurry Sage White” on the other side of the divine bridge.","What the other person was emitting was the rough and copied undying information. This kind of imitated undying information that wasn’t even close to the surface had unimaginable uses for cultivators below undying.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s eyes were fixed on the blurry Sage White, firmly memorizing his image and information.","As he stared at it for too long, his eyes began to dry up and hurt.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater subconsciously wanted to look away.","“Don’t avert your gaze. At most, your eyeballs will explode. This kind of opportunity might only come once in a lifetime,” Tyrannical Song’s voice sounded in his ear.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater gritted his teeth and held his eyelids.","At the same time, he noticed something out of the corner of his eye—Tyrannical Song was completely unaffected!","Tyrannical Song’s eyes were fixed on the “Immortal White Sage Information Body” at the bridgehead.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song... Don’t your eyes hurt?” Sage Monarch Melon Eater couldn’t help asking.","“It doesn’t hurt. Instead, it feels very comfortable. After all, I’ve experienced it several times,” Song Shuhang said with a smile. “Therefore, my eyes are already used to this level of pain. However, Senior Melon Eater, you don’t have to doubt yourself. When I first saw the ‘information about the undying,’ my eyes almost exploded. Even with the Scholarly Sage’s eye, I couldn’t withstand it.”","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was speechless.","Tyrannical Song’s reply contained too much information, and he didn’t know how to reply.","“Senior White, is the effect out yet?” Song Shuhang asked. At this time, he had already completely absorbed the information of immortality in the clone of the White Brand of the Wielder of the Will and fused it into his pseudo-immortal mode.","After coming into contact with the “information of the undying” time and time again, Song Shuhang could clearly feel that his “pseudo-immortal mode” had reached a limit.","All he needed was an opportunity, and his pseudo undying mode would undergo a transformation.","And this “heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage” might very well become the opportunity for him to enter the pseudo-undying mode!","“Yes, the effect has reached my expectations,” Senior White nodded.","On the other side of the divine bridge, the White Mark of the Heavenly Dao suddenly spread its wings and one of its legs retracted.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater:","After being slightly stunned, Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s heart stirred!","Could it be that this posture contained some special meaning?","Should I remember it and turn into a human to ponder over it?","On the other side.","As White Wielder of the Will’s unique posture appeared, the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation above his head was pressed against the ground and rubbed once again.","Song Shuhang sensed it and found that the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage, which originally only had 80 days of lifespan left, had once again shortened his lifespan.","The remaining 80 days of his lifespan were compressed ten times in one go, from 80 days to 8 days—and this was only the portion of the heavenly tribulation that Song Shuhang had.","As the main body of the spell, Senior White’s side was even more effective. The remaining 80 days of the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage were directly compressed to one day, and in the end, he couldn’t even gather 24 hours...","Even though Sage Monarch Melon Eater was standing in the middle of the bridge, he still received some benefits. The duration of his heavenly tribulation had also been reduced by about 60 days.","“Next, it’s up to you,” Senior White said to Song Shuhang. “Try to reduce the time it takes for you to transcend the tribulation to less than a day. Then, we can complete the ‘Thousand Days Tribulation’ at the same time and return from the realm.”","“Senior White, with your words, I’m sure I’ll be fine,” Song Shuhang nodded.","He reached out and gently knocked on his chest.","The shrunken ghost fairy opened a door and slid out of Song Shuhang’s chest as if she were on a slide."]},{"number":2859,"title":"Chapter 2859: Sir Heavenly Tribulation’s Last Stand","paragraphs":["Chapter 2859: Sir Heavenly Tribulation’s Last Stand","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the ghost fairy slid down the slide, her body grew larger. By the time she landed, she had already transformed into her normal size.","Song Shuhang was puzzled.","The appearance of a lockable door had already surprised him, but now the ghost fairy had even created a slide?","He couldn’t help but touch his chest, and at the same time, he touched the slide on his chest. The slide was long and spiraled, running from his chest all the way to the ground.","After landing, the ghost fairy reached out to pick up the slide, folded it, and stuffed it back into the door.","Finally, she did not forget to close the door and lock it.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The ghost fairy made an ‘OK’ gesture at him.","Heavens, what’s going on inside my body right now? Why can’t I see any changes through my Inner Vision? Song Shuhang wondered if his body had been emptied.","It was the kind of hollowing out in the physical sense!","“Hang Hang, do you want me to protect you?” asked Meteor Sword’s weapon spirit.","“There’s no need, Little Star. I just need to sync my cultivation technique with the ghost fairy,” Song Shuhang replied.","After saying that, the Selfcentric Corpse Overlord Body behind him took the initiative to step forward.","The Overlord Body began to circulate the level 9 Forget Divine Technique, and his presence instantly became transparent.","Even Song Shuhang himself had begun to forget the existence of the ‘Overlord Body.’","For a moment, he even began to wonder if he had failed to cut down the third corpse. He almost wanted to make a move on the spot and cut down the third corpse!","On the other side, the ghost fairy nodded slightly and activated the Forgotten Divine Technique in sync with the Self-centric Corpse.","Fairy Ghost Spirit had learned the ? Forgotten Divine Art ? from Scholar Fishfoot’s secret realm, and she had also learned how to influence the length of the heavenly tribulation through the secret realm.","After the Self-centric Corpse and Ghost Fairy Spirit synchronized, the heavenly tribulation targeting Song Shuhang in the sky was stimulated and began to go berserk.","Song Shuhang’s heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage had already experienced several lifespan reductions and compressions, and its power had increased to an extremely terrifying level. At this time, every attack of the heavenly tribulation was enough to cause damage to a genuine Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","Now, with the final compression of the ghost fairy spirit and Self-centric Corpse, Senior White and Song Shuhang’s thousand-day tribulation was finally forced to the final stage!","The two of them had entered the final day of their heavenly tribulation.","“I succeeded,” Song Shuhang said.","His heavenly tribulation had also entered the ranks of less than 24 hours.","“Get ready,” Senior White reminded. “The final tribulation isn’t easy to transcend.”","“Yes!” Song Shuhang nodded.","The final day of the thousand-day tribulation was already extremely terrifying. Many Eighth Stage Profound Sages had survived for 999 days before dying on the last day.","Now, Senior White and his heavenly tribulation had experienced several time compressions and were transcending together, so the power would only be more terrifying!","“I will face this Final Tribulation with the same attitude as I would face an Immortal,” Song Shuhang said calmly.","“Yes, that’s right.” Senior White gently lifted his clothes, and his magical clothes transformed into their original appearance, turning into a handsome white long robe.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater, who was next door, finally came back to his senses from the message of immortality and heard the conversation between Song Shuhang and Sage White.","If two ordinary Eighth Stage Profound Sages were talking like this while transcending a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, they would definitely be bragging. An Eighth Stage Profound Sage challenging an Immortal? There was only death!","But after the conversation between Sage White and Tyrannical Song, Sage Monarch Melon Eater fell into a superstitious state again, and he felt that it was very believable.","Perhaps Tyrannical Song and Sage White had really offended Immortals before?","In the void.","There were also various forms of heavenly tribulation.","The final tribulation, the last 24 hours, was the last chance for the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, and also its last bit of stubbornness!","This time, it no longer held back. All of its methods were revealed!","The modern heavenly tribulation that Sage White had once seen was also condensing. All kinds of modern weapons, missiles, nuclear weapons, and so on were beginning to take shape. Moreover, these modern heavenly tribulations were all strengthened versions of the Ninth Stage.","Countless modern heavenly tribulations formed a huge modern military country in the tribulation clouds.","This was the heavenly tribulation of the [Present Continuous Tense]!","On the side of the modern heavenly tribulation, there were many ancient and unadorned cultivators’ magical treasures, divine weapons, spears of heavenly tribulation, swords of natural disasters, and other heavenly tribulations. There were also cultivators who had fought against the heavenly tribulation in ancient times and left behind powerful individual imprints in the heavenly tribulation. They were also revealed by the heavenly tribulation and turned into ‘humanoid heavenly tribulation’ that stood above the tribulation!","This part was the heavenly tribulation of the past type!","Not only that, but there were also some sci-fi heavenly tribulations condensing beside the past and present heavenly tribulations.","Many weapons that only existed in the concept of the future were also condensed by the heavenly tribulation. The style of those heavenly tribulation weapons revealed infinite killing intent everywhere. These futuristic weapons had strange designs, and it was difficult to judge their effects just from their appearance.","This was a futuristic heavenly tribulation!","It could be said that the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, the Final Tribulation, had gone all out. The past, present, and future forms of the heavenly tribulation were displayed in one breath.","After the three forms appeared at the same time, there would be a faint resonance, and it would also have the power of Time Reincarnation.","In the past, present, and future heavenly tribulations.","All the heavenly tribulations locked onto Tyrannical Song and Sage White!","However, they did not fall directly. Instead, they were still strengthening, stacking and strengthening at a crazy level.","‘This is no longer the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage!’ Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s scalp went numb when he saw this.","No matter how many Eighth Stage Profound Sages there were, they would all die in the past, present, and future reincarnation tribulations!","Sage Monarch Melon Eater could faintly sense the stubbornness of the heavenly tribulation.","Could Tyrannical Song and Sage White survive such a heavenly tribulation?","Just looking at the data, Tyrannical Song and Sage White’s chances of survival were close to zero.","However, Sage Monarch Melon Eater had a mysterious confidence.","“All the best, Tyrannical Song, Sage White! Don’t lose to the heavenly tribulation!” Sage Monarch Melon Eater shouted.","Boom","In the sky, the heavenly tribulation in its past form was the first to fall.","Hundreds of humanoid heavenly tribulations, thousands of spears of heavenly tribulation, and celestial devices of heavenly tribulation fell down!","Below, the sound of explosions was like rolling thunder.","However, Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s eyes widened, and his jaw was dislocated again.","The heavenly tribulation looked so terrifying and mighty, but for some reason, this batch of heavenly tribulations from the past locked onto an empty area far away from Tyrannical Song and Sage White, bombarding it!","It was as if there was an existence that the heavenly tribulation hated the most in that empty space.","Sage White and Tyrannical Song remained unharmed.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was confused.","Today, the Heavenly Tribulation...Was he finally blinded by anger?"]},{"number":2860,"title":"Chapter 2860: Drive","paragraphs":["Chapter 2860: Drive","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If he wasn’t blind, he would see Tyrannical Song and Sage White standing there, while the heavenly tribulation bombarded an empty space far away from them. What was going on?","It couldn’t be an empty threat, right?","He had already reached the Final Tribulation stage, so there was no point in threatening him.","‘Or is the heavenly tribulation afraid?’ Another thought appeared in Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s mind.","Judging from the current situation, the terrifying Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation did seem cowardly.","“Is it the effect of your ghost fairy spirit and self-centric corpse?” Senior White asked.","“Yes,” Song Shuhang nodded. “My ghost fairy spirit has a special secret technique that can affect the heavenly tribulation together with the Forgotten Divine Technique. However, I forgot what kind of secret technique it was.”","This was what made Scholar Fatty Fish’s faction so annoying.","Sometimes, even if he wanted to introduce them and praise their awesome abilities, his mind would go blank the moment he opened his mouth. He wouldn’t know what to say.","Song Shuhang suspected that the reason why the sect of the scholar could be passed down from ancient times to the present day was that the founder of the cultivation technique had constantly forgotten he had taken in a disciple. As a result, this big shot had been constantly looking for disciples in the myriad worlds and taking in successors, which was why this sect had been passed down until now.","“Only affecting the heavenly tribulation?” Senior White asked, noting that Sage Monarch Melon Eater next door didn’t seem to be affected either.","“Yes,” Song Shuhang continued to nod.","The combination of the ghost spirit fairy and the self-centric corpse would only affect the heavenly tribulation, making it unable to lock onto Song Shuhang. However, this “small invisibility” effect wouldn’t affect the people around them.","As for why the heavenly tribulation ignored Senior White, Song Shuhang didn’t know.","When Sage Monarch Melon Eater next door heard this, the word “f*ck” appeared in his mind. He was really at a loss for words!","He had experienced countless storms and waves in his life, transcending heavenly tribulation after heavenly tribulation, but he had never thought he would be able to lie down like Tyrannical Song and Sage White in front of him.","What kind of divine art was Forgotten Divine Art? It could actually bully the heavenly tribulation to such an extent?","Was this faction still accepting disciples?","Melon Eater had lived for so long, so naturally, he had some juniors. He was considering whether he should hand over his junior to Tyrannical Song and devote himself to the series of Forgotten Divine Technique.","“Then, Little Song Song, doesn’t that mean we just have to stand where we are and wait for the final tribulation of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation to finish?” Meteor Sword’s weapon spirit, Q version of Senior White, asked happily.","“I’m afraid not,” Song Shuhang shook his head.","“Why?” asked the Q version of Liu Xingbai, puzzled.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the three forms of the heavenly tribulation in the sky: the past, the present, and the future.","If they didn’t transcend their tribulation in the special Heavenly Tribulation Realm, but in the vast universe of the main world, the heavenly tribulation above their heads might strike some corner of the universe under the effect of the ghost spirit fairy’s secret technique.","Unfortunately, this Heavenly Tribulation Realm wasn’t like the main world, and its area was limited.","Once the heavenly tribulation’s earth-washing full-screen attack landed, Song Shuhang and Senior White would still have to resist.","“But you don’t have to worry too much. Even if the apocalypse attacks all over the place, there will be a ‘central point’ where the damage is the highest. As long as the influence of the ghost fairy spirit’s secret technique is still there, the ‘center’ with the highest damage won’t land near us,” Senior White explained. He stretched out his hand to recall the divine bridge but didn’t disband it.","Clearly, he still needed to use this divine bridge during the tribulation transcendence later.","After the divine bridge returned, Senior White sat sideways on the guardrail of the divine bridge. He stretched out his hand and took out some branches, starting to sharpen the disposable flying sword in preparation for the upcoming battle.","Not far away, the heavenly tribulation that belonged to the “completed past” was still being released continuously, venting crazily.","Violent magic tools and divine weapons bombarded the ground, creating huge pits on the ground, and immortal lightning spears shot out as if they were free...","Only the human-shaped heavenly tribulation formed by the few expert imprints remained silently standing on the tribulation cloud in the void and did not attack.","“It’s coming. The area-of-effect attack is about to land,” Song Shuhang said as he stared at the heavenly tribulation.","The heavenly tribulation of the “past completion” also had a full-range attack.","Twenty-four magic tools formed from pearls were released from the tribulation clouds. Each pearl glowed with five-colored light.","Although it was a projection magical treasure, the power that erupted from the projection magical treasure, transformed from the “final tribulation of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation” that had been compressed and strengthened after the tribulation transcended in a group, was no weaker than the magical treasure itself.","Shua","The 24 Five-Colored Divine Pearls were connected in a string, and each pearl seemed to contain the power of an entire world.","The God Orb fell from the sky. There were no complicated attacks, just simple and crude.","“Can Song Song handle it?” Q Liu Xing Bai asked.","“Leave it to me. I only need to summon the skeletal giant to easily block an attack of this level,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying that, he prepared to condense the “Slow-Witted Song’s big bone shards” spell to protect his body.","However, behind him, a figure took the initiative to meet the attack at an even faster speed.","It was Fairy @#%×!","She first stretched out her hand, and a huge shadow of the ancient Heavenly City was released, covering Song Shuhang and Sage White. It even protected half of the space of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcendence Realm.","The power of this technique far surpassed that of ordinary Tribulation Transcender techniques, and it possessed some of the power of “Immortal technique.”","After casting the protective spell, Fairy @#%× took the initiative to attack!","Being beaten passively was not her style.","“Go ” the virtuous lamia called out.","The virtuous fat whale jumped out of Song Shuhang’s body and swelled up, turning into a mount.","At the same time, the virtuous lamia’s tail split into nine tails, and she jumped up with all her might. Her tail was like a squid plate that was attached to the back of the virtuous fat whale.","The snake and the whale charged towards the 24 divine pearls.","“Fairy, don’t forget to bring your weapon,” the Good Separation of the three corpses shouted.","The Good Separation put his palms together and raised them above his head. His monk robe wrapped around him tightly, and his legs stood side by side. His entire body formed a straight “one.”","Then, like a spear, the Good Separation tore through the air.","In the air, the virtuous lamia stretched out her hand and clamped the “Tyrant Monk Spear” at her waist. Endless light of virtue burst out from the bald head of the good corpse, and it was extremely dazzling.","The dazzling light of virtue condensed into a forty-meter-long blade of light through the palms of the Good Separation.","She was like a shining female knight, brave and fearless, charging towards the terrifying heavenly tribulation!","At the same time, she shouted a battle cry, “You’re a bug! Stop tickling me!”","‘Is such a terrifying heavenly tribulation just a bug to her?’ Sage Monarch Melon Eater stared at Fairy? and thought to himself."]},{"number":2861,"title":"Chapter 2861: The Final Blow","paragraphs":["Chapter 2861: The Final Blow","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As if he had guessed Senior Melon Eater’s thoughts, Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. “Bugs that tickle. What a nostalgic name.”","However, now he, Tyrannical Song, was already a little old Xu that was hard to deal with. He was no longer that weak bug from before.","After seeing the virtuous lamia charge out, Song Shuhang stopped the formation of the “white bone giant” and loudly reminded her, “Fairy Virtue, be careful when you attack later. Don’t damage the quality of the heavenly tribulation!”","This Heavenly Tribulation Pearl was so good-looking that it made one’s appetite rise at a glance.","Therefore, it was best not to cause too much damage to it.","Although Fairy @#%× didn’t reply to Song Shuhang in the air, her actions were gentler. After all, aside from Lotus Blossoming Tongue and Saber Intent Condensing Lotus Seed, there were very few heavenly tribulation dishes that she could “eat.” As a body of virtue, she could eat many things directly.","In the air, the power of the twenty-four pearls continued to sweep down.","Especially when the virtuous lamia took the initiative to show herself, the twenty-four pearls finally found something they could lock onto, and they focused their fire on the virtuous lamia.","Facing the combined attack of the twenty-four pearls, the virtuous lamia was not afraid at all. She didn’t even dodge. She raised the “Tyrant Monk Spear,” and the forty-meter-long spear of light met the power of the twenty-four pearls head-on, going against the current.","The power of the beads was like a boundless sea, pouring down.","And the spear in the virtuous lamia’s hand was the divine staff that opened the way through the vast ocean!","As soon as the power of the divine beads was struck by the tip of the spear, it exploded and split into two, revealing a path for the virtuous lamia to pass through.","In the blink of an eye, the virtuous lamia had arrived in front of the main bodies of the twenty-four pearls.","She lightly flicked the tip of her spear and skillfully displayed her gentle strength.","The twenty-four beads that were strung together were gently scattered, but there was no movement on the surface of the beads.","The virtuous lamia continued to stir, and the beads were thrown into the black hole of the “Longevity Pillar, Kun King Pillar” below, stored inside the Kun King Pillar for preservation.","“Ya ” After exploding the twenty-four beads, the virtuous lamia raised her spear and aimed it at the humanoid heavenly tribulation formed by the marks of the experts on the tribulation cloud.","Then, she launched a new charge without hesitation.","Since becoming Tyrannical Song’s power of virtue, as long as Tyrannical Song didn’t die, she could be resurrected indefinitely. Therefore, she was not afraid even if it was one against ten.","Moreover, the “Benevolent Tyrant Monk Spear” in her hand also had the tail of a husky. As long as she used Benevolent Tyrant, the virtuous lamia would be infected and become especially happy.","Below.","“My head hurts.” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","He had wanted to use the secret technique of the ghost spirit fairy to consume more of the heavenly tribulation’s firepower, but he didn’t expect Fairy @#%× to be so active that she directly hit the tribulation cloud.","“But this is also good. Besides, it’s the Final Tribulation. Let’s just go up and blow it up.” Senior White stood up, and there were already more than ten disposable flying swords beside him.","It seemed that Senior White was already prepared.","“Senior White, since you’ve said so, let’s go!” Song Shuhang said. He stretched out his hand and gently waved it, arranging for the virtuous lamia to receive reinforcements.","Ever since Tyrannical Song started cultivating, he had transcended a heavenly tribulation once a month on average. Every time he transcended a heavenly tribulation, he had always been the one bullying the few. When facing a heavenly tribulation, he would always form a group to fight it. When had the heavenly tribulation ever bullied him with numbers?","Wasn’t it just a humanoid heavenly tribulation formed by more than ten “expert imprints”?","After Song Shuhang willed it, several figures appeared on his body and followed the virtuous lamia into the sky.","One of them was Song Shuhang’s Pure Card clone, who had been transcending the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation on Tyrannical Song’s behalf. After merging with his main body, he was retrieved and split again, and his combat strength was synchronized with his main body’s.","The Evil Corpse and Selfcentric Corpse followed closely behind.","The seven “overlord divine pillars” also soared into the sky, providing support for the virtuous lamia.","“I’ll cut the battlefield. We don’t have to face the past, present, and future tribulations at the same time.” Senior White lightly jumped and stood on the guardrail of the divine bridge.","With a light tap of his finger, more than ten disposable flying swords tore through the air and pierced toward the tribulation cloud.","“Divide the battleground? Senior White, are you planning to send the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage into the Wielder’s small black room?” Song Shuhang’s heart stirred, and he asked.","“There’s no need to go through so much trouble ” Senior White pursed his lips and smiled.","More than ten primary flying swords pierced into the tribulation clouds. Like a dividing line, they pierced between the clouds, the present, and the future heavenly tribulation.","Soon after, under the watchful eyes of Song Shuhang and Sage Monarch Melon Eater, the entire tribulation cloud space was divided into three separate spaces.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s eyes widened. Was he going to create another independent space in the “Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Space”? He could do this?","A world within a world was something that even most experienced Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders could not do. As for Sage White, he was only at the Eighth Stage.","“Let’s go. In fact, it’s a waste to blindly avoid the Final Tribulation. You still have to endure the final tribulation directly. It will have a more tempering effect.” Senior White said.","He gently stepped on the divine bridge, and it lifted Song Shuhang and Senior White up. The other end of the bridge was placed in the “present tribulation” space.","Senior White and Song Shuhang followed the divine bridge and entered the modern heavenly tribulation that represented the “present.”","Countless “modern heavenly tribulations” were still spinning in a daze—they were still unable to lock onto Tyrannical Song’s position. If they wanted to attack Song Shuhang, they could only detonate the strengthened nuclear weapon.","However, according to normal circumstances, this batch of nuclear weapons would only detonate after they landed.","“Shuhang, are you ready? I’m going to detonate all the ‘modern heavenly tribulations.’” Senior White said.","Song Shuhang hurriedly used the Four Great Body Tempering Divine Techniques.","Mutated Steel Hands, Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha, Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, and Fatty Ball’s Liquid Golden Body Technique.","After the four body-tempering techniques were fully activated, a large group of monkeys dressed in scholarly attire appeared, holding scriptures in their hands.","But this time, before these holy apes could speak, Senior White made a move first. The spiritual energy in his hand condensed into a line, and he gently drew a line.","The “modern heavenly tribulations” exploded one after another.","The power of the heavenly tribulation exploded, swallowing Song Shuhang and Sage White.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater, who was below, couldn’t understand what Song Shuhang and Sage White were doing. He didn’t understand why they would suddenly send themselves to the door and let the heavenly tribulation bombard them.","Song Shuhang used all his strength to support the four great body-tempering techniques. The power of the heavenly tribulation was crazily attacking his body, bringing him waves of pain.","Not only that, but Song Shuhang’s divine sense was also affected by the explosion of the heavenly tribulation.","“Senior White? Senior White, where are you?” Song Shuhang discovered that he and Senior White seemed to have been separated during the explosion.","Senior White didn’t respond to him.","Song Shuhang frowned.","Don’t tell me that Senior White’s evasive attribute is acting up at this time?","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang put away the four body-tempering divine techniques. He changed his state to pseudo undying mode.","As soon as he completed the transformation, the power of countless heavenly tribulation explosions surged into the smoke of the pseudo-immortal mode, supporting his body."]},{"number":2862,"title":"Chapter 2862: Returning the Favor with Their Own Methods","paragraphs":["Chapter 2862: Returning the Favor with Their Own Methods","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang’s current “pseudo-immortal mode” was much stronger than its initial state. Every time he encountered information about “immortality,” his pseudo-immortal mode would upgrade, patching itself.","Thus, the violent power of the heavenly tribulation merged into his “pseudo-immortal body.” Apart from feeling a bit of pain, it wasn’t enough to cause fatal damage to Song Shuhang’s pseudo-immortal body.","However, Song Shuhang still felt uneasy—such a significant figure like Senior White had suddenly disappeared.","Based on past experience, now was not the time to stand out. If necessary, he could consider retreating.","Just as Song Shuhang was thinking this, Senior White’s voice rang in his ears, “Don’t panic...”","Senior White and the Meteor Sword were still nowhere to be seen, but his primordial spirit projection’s arm was in Song Shuhang’s elbow.","At this moment, through Senior White’s arm, the information of the heavenly tribulation that had entered Song Shuhang’s body was quickly analyzed by Senior White.","Under Senior White’s guidance, Song Shuhang’s brain began to operate at a high frequency—something he hadn’t done in a while.","Additionally, with Song Shuhang’s authorization, all the knowledge about the heavenly tribulation in his mind was extracted to support Senior White’s analysis. When it comes to big data, information is more important than money.","The data Song Shuhang extracted was a significant help to Senior White’s analysis.","Tyrannical Song’s understanding of the heavenly tribulation was exceptionally deep, far surpassing that of cultivators in the same realm. Even some Immortals might not have as thorough an understanding of the heavenly tribulation as Song Shuhang!","Since the beginning of his cultivation, apart from the big shots and seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, the big shot of the heavenly tribulation had been accompanying Song Shuhang the longest!","They would meet once a month, sometimes even several times.","Every tribulation was a variation, with endless patterns. To give Song Shuhang a fresh experience every time he transcended the tribulation, Sir Heavenly Tribulation put in a lot of effort.","Even the father of the heavenly tribulation, Divine Punishment, Song Shuhang had encountered several times.","His understanding of the heavenly tribulation had reached a level where he could write and publish his own book!","Senior White’s understanding of the heavenly tribulation was also unfathomable. He could play with the heavenly tribulation in the palm of his hand. Every time Senior White transcended the tribulation, it wasn’t him transcending it, but the heavenly tribulation transcending him.","The top experts of the two worlds combined the data of the heavenly tribulation and analyzed the power that had invaded Song Shuhang’s body.","The analysis speed instantly evolved from 3G to 5G. With a whoosh, all kinds of heavenly tribulation forces were instantly exploded, and the analysis was completed.","However, Senior White’s goal wasn’t just to analyze the information of the heavenly tribulation. Every time Senior White attacked, he would directly target the core elements of the matter.","This time was no exception.","Senior White combined the information about Song Shuhang and himself, as well as the information about the final tribulation of the Ninth Stage, and pointed at the transcendental laws of the heavenly tribulation. This was similar to the laws of the Profound Sage Speech, which were the exclusive laws of the Wielder of the Will.","In theory, these laws couldn’t be grasped by cultivators, but under Senior White’s violent analysis, they slowly appeared in front of Senior White and Song Shuhang.","Even though he had only analyzed the tip of the iceberg of the heavenly tribulation’s laws, Song Shuhang was still greatly shocked.","“Senior White, you’re simply too awesome.” Song Shuhang felt as if he had transformed into Sage Monarch Melon Eater next door. His mind was filled with the urge to shout to express his admiration for Senior White.","“Yes, I know,” Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang didn’t even need to remind him that he was too awesome.","“I mean, Senior White, your action of analyzing the heavenly tribulation laws was awesome,” Song Shuhang added.","“Oh,” Senior White replied.","‘Eh? Why did it become a one-word reply? Could it be that Senior White isn’t satisfied with my gifts?’ Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","Just as they were in deep thought, more of the heavenly tribulation laws were exposed to Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Song Shuhang felt that his head was starting to swell and ache, as if his brain had been struck by lightning. He felt a numbing pain—this was the same as when he had come into contact with the Profound Sage Speech. It was the price he had to pay for coming into contact with transcendental laws.","If it wasn’t for the fact that he often came into contact with undying information and the pseudo-undying mode, his brain might have already been unable to withstand the impact of the heavenly tribulation laws and his head blown up by the law information!","“My head hurts,” Song Shuhang said.","“Endure it and it will pass. Hold on,” Senior White’s voice rang out.","“Don’t worry, Senior White. I’m a professional when it comes to enduring pain,” Song Shuhang said confidently.","“Yes,” Senior White said.","“Actually, Senior White, you’re also very handsome usually. Not only are you handsome when analyzing the heavenly tribulation laws, but your actions are also extremely handsome,” Song Shuhang endured the pain in his head and tried to shout 666 from the side.","“Tch ~ Shuhang, what’s wrong with you today? I’m busy analyzing the laws here. Don’t mess around first,” Senior White said seriously.","“Little Song Song, if you’re bored, do you want me to sing for you?” the QQ version of Liu Xingbai’s voice rang out.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","It must be because of the intense headache that caused my brain to fall into chaos.","“Stop fooling around. We’re transcending the tribulation,” Senior White reminded.","Boom, boom, boom~","The modern heavenly tribulation in its present form was still exploding, pouring its power into Song Shuhang’s body. As Senior White’s progress in analyzing the laws of the heavenly tribulation increased, Song Shuhang’s head grew bigger and bigger, and he felt dizzy.","Next door, the heavenly tribulation of the past had already reached its end. The virtuous lamia, Song Shuhang’s clone, Song Shuhang’s three corpses, and the Overlord Divine Pillar were working together to attack.","The Overlord Divine Pillar and the virtuous lamia each displayed their magical powers, and all kinds of spells and innate abilities emerged one after another.","On the other hand, Song Shuhang’s clones, evil corpses, and self-corpses were relatively lacking.","When they faced the humanoid heavenly tribulation branded by experts, they did not waste any time. They condensed their defenses and rubbed their hands together to form “Lightning Palms” of various sizes to clash with the humanoid heavenly tribulation.","Humanoid Heavenly Tribulation A: “River of the Immortal Sword~”","Tyrannical Song’s clone: “Small City-Level Lightning Palm!”","Humanoid Heavenly Tribulation B: “Fighting Transformation Great Dao Fist Technique~”","Evil Corpse: “Overlord God Pillar + Mid-Level City Lightning Palm!”","Humanoid Heavenly Tribulation C was speechless.","The C-tribulation stood on the tribulation cloud in confusion.","In the next moment, a Mid-Level Upper City-Level Lightning Palm engulfed him mercilessly.","For a time, in the past Heavenly Tribulation Space, palm lightning of various sizes continuously exploded.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater had never thought that Tyrannical Song would be able to play tricks with just his “Lightning Palm!”","Moreover... he didn’t know if it was an illusion.","As the battle continued, Tyrannical Song’s clone and his three corpses used the Lightning Palm, and the aura of the heavenly tribulation began to emerge from it!","The Lightning Palm of the Heavenly Tribulation exploded the Heavenly Tribulation!","He would return the favor with his own methods!"]},{"number":2863,"title":"Chapter 2863: Senior White, Do You Know How to Perform a C-Section?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2863: Senior White, Do You Know How to Perform a C-Section?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior White had only analyzed the tip of the iceberg of the heavenly tribulation laws, but Song Shuhang himself held the ‘heavenly lightning graduation certificate.’ This certificate was a form of comprehension of the heavenly lightning within Song Shuhang’s body—a muscle memory and understanding that had been struck into him.","Thanks to the dual effects of the heavenly lightning graduation certificate and Senior White’s analysis of the heavenly tribulation laws, Song Shuhang’s clone and his three corpses could slightly enhance their lightning techniques with the power of the heavenly tribulation.","Even though the big shot of the heavenly tribulation was cowardly in front of Senior White, it was extremely fierce when facing other cultivators.","The heavenly tribulation had various effects, including breaking through evil and yin qi. Lightning techniques of the same power, when combined with the effects of the heavenly tribulation, would deal double damage to cultivators.","The heavenly tribulation itself restrained cultivators, which is why transcending tribulations was so difficult. Even a heavenly tribulation of the same level as a cultivator would have several times the lethality.","However, when Song Shuhang’s clone and the three corpses used the lightning technique enhanced with the heavenly tribulation’s effects, the additional damage caused by the tribulation was mostly canceled out. Combined with the effect of the heavenly lightning diploma, the damage enhancement was basically nullified.","Song Shuhang’s clone could directly feel the attack power of the humanoid heavenly tribulation weakening, while the lethality of the Lightning Palm increased significantly.","With the pressure relieved, the virtuous lamia, Song Shuhang’s clone, and the three corpses had more room to maneuver.","After Song Shuhang’s clone killed the two humanoid experts, he collaborated with the three corpses to capture the tiger-shaped expert alive, suppressing him for the Kun King Pillar’s black hole to absorb and preserve.","A humanoid heavenly tribulation felt like eating a person, but a tiger-shaped heavenly tribulation did not have this problem!","With the cooperation of his clone, the virtuous lamia, and the Overlord Divine Pillar, the heavenly tribulation of the ‘past’ was quickly cleared out.","At the same time, the explosion of the ‘present’ form of the heavenly tribulation was also reaching its end.","The explosion of the modern heavenly tribulation began to weaken, leaving only the aftermath of the explosion.","“It’s almost done,” Senior White’s voice rang out.","He had to put aside the analysis of the Heavenly Tribulation Laws for now. Some things could not be rushed. Moreover, Song Shuhang’s condition had already reached its limit.","Even with his primordial spirit’s strength and spiritual power, he was beginning to feel dizzy. If this continued, there might be a danger of a headshot.","“Senior White, are you not going to continue analyzing it?” Song Shuhang shook his head and asked.","“Next time... There’s no hurry,” Senior White said.","“However, this is already a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. We won’t have another chance,” Song Shuhang said.","Everyone knew that the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage was the last heavenly tribulation for cultivators. Although there was still the concept of ‘Immortal’ above the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","However, being an Immortal wasn’t a true level of cultivation. This was just a situation where the proud sons of the heavens, unable to attain immortality, relied on their own powerful methods to forcefully take ‘half a step’ above the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm and forge the path of immortality.","The Immortal realm could be said to be a substitute for the Heavenly Dao.","So, when a Tribulation Transcender stepped out on their path and entered the ‘Immortal’ realm, there was no official heavenly tribulation descending.","In other words, the officials didn’t actually recognize the level of ‘Immortals.’ In the eyes of the officials, Immortals were still classified as Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders.","“I can still hold on. Senior White, you don’t have to worry about me. Furthermore, I’m currently in a ‘pseudo-undying state.’ Even a headshot wouldn’t be able to cause me any fatal injuries. This head of mine survived the heavenly punishment... I believe I can hold on. Senior White, continue!” Song Shuhang said.","The last heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage, the last chance to analyze the heavenly tribulation laws—if he missed it now, he might miss it forever.","If he didn’t fight for it now, when would he?","He, Song Shuhang, was also ambitious!","Without ambition, he would not have been able to advance to Rank-9 in nine months.","“It’s fine, don’t worry. Although this Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation is our last heavenly tribulation, we can freeload on someone else’s Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation,” Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“As long as we can transcend the tribulation in a group and use my disposable flying sword to break through the small black room, we still have a chance to enter the ‘Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation’ world and come back to take a look at the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation. Although it would strengthen the heavenly tribulation and even strengthen it to a very extreme degree, we are only studying the heavenly tribulation. We don’t have to worry about the consequences,” Senior White continued.","Only Senior White could do this.","Only people like him and Song Shuhang, who had many methods to weaken the heavenly tribulation and had discounts, would not be afraid of the strengthening of the heavenly tribulation brought about by the ‘group tribulation.’ And only Senior White’s disposable flying sword—Small Black Room Breaking Version—could allow them to come and go freely in the space of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation. They could come and go as they pleased.","“Then who should I find to freeload on the heavenly tribulation?” Song Shuhang asked.","As long as he didn’t look for the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, he wouldn’t feel any pressure. Without absolute confidence, he would subconsciously resist the option of bringing the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group to transcend the tribulation.","“Just look around. For example, if you have any enemies who want to transcend the heavenly tribulation of the 8th Stage, we can also trick them,” Senior White said hypothetically.","“Wonderful!” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and pondered for a moment. Then, he suddenly sighed. “My disappointing enemy, Young Master Hai, is only at the Fifth Stage Realm.”","Song Shuhang discovered that his ‘great enemy’ had a huge gap.","From the low-level rival Altar Master to the middle-level rival Young Master Hai... his ‘great enemy’ had suddenly jumped to the level of an Immortal, a ruler of the Netherworld, a Heavenly Dao relic, a Dao artifact, and even a Tribulation Transcender.","He wanted to find someone from his ‘rivals’ who was in the 8th rank or 9th rank, but he couldn’t find one!","“We’ll talk about this later. As long as you want it, there will always be,” Senior White said.","“That’s true,” Song Shuhang said.","As long as Senior White wanted it, there would always be someone who could be the target of the heavenly tribulation of the 8th Stage.","“Now, keep your head clear. I’m going to summarize the ‘laws of heavenly tribulation’ that I’ve just analyzed and twist them into one,” Senior White said.","“Roger that.” Song Shuhang patted his head.","In the depths of his consciousness, the originally scattered heavenly tribulation laws were combined under Senior White’s deduction.","When this law that only the Wielder of the Will could control was condensed, a lot of power in Song Shuhang’s body was drawn in.","He had a pseudo-immortal body, the Golden Core Formation’s Star Path Great Dao Diagram, the Inner World that was suppressed by the Heavenly Tribulation Space, the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, and even the talent of ‘cultivation chat.’","Everything related to the ‘Heavenly Dao’ and ‘undying’ was provoked and stirred by the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Laws.’","One power after another was triggered.","In the end, in Song Shuhang’s stomach, a small life also began to resonate violently.","That was Song Shuhang’s daughter, whom he expected to be pregnant with for at least a few years.","She was the body of the fat ball after losing its soul. Now that she was being moved, Song Shuhang felt as if she was going to give birth prematurely.","“Eh? No way! Don’t do that.” Song Shuhang said.","Senior White was confused.","“Senior White, do you know how to perform a C-section?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","Senior White was speechless."]},{"number":2864,"title":"Chapter 2864: Ruthless Tyrannical Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2864: Ruthless Tyrannical Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even Senior White didn’t know how to answer Song Shuhang’s sudden question transcending the tribulation and having a C-section were two completely unrelated matters, but now they were actually colliding with each other. It was very strange.","After a while.","“I feel that even if I know how to do a C-section, it won’t solve your problem,” Senior White seriously pondered and replied.","As everyone knew, abdominal delivery was targeted at women. Therefore, even if they were to invite a divine doctor who knew how to perform a C-section to perform an operation on Song Shuhang, the divine doctor wouldn’t know which part of Song Shuhang’s stomach he should cut to get the baby out of Song Shuhang’s body.","C-section couldn’t save Tyrannical Song!","“Speaking of which, can’t we just have a good tribulation?” asked the Q version of Liu Xingbai.","“I also want to...” Song Shuhang said in pain.","However, she would not allow the daughter in her stomach to do so!","In fact, Song Shuhang hoped that every time he transcended the tribulation, it would go smoothly and not cause any more trouble.","For a period of time, his greatest requirement for the heavenly tribulation was to let him transcend an ordinary heavenly tribulation. It did not require mutation, formation, acceleration, or explosive power.","However, this wish was destined to be unfulfilled.","He had already transcended the final tribulation of the Ninth Stage, but he had not encountered a normal heavenly tribulation that went smoothly. In the future, even if he came back to meet the heavenly tribulation big shot again, he could only ‘freeload’ other people’s heavenly tribulation and not transcend it himself.","“Why don’t you consider natural birth? I once read some information and found that everyone on the Internet recommended the benefits of natural birth,” the Q version of White Meteor suggested. The pure Q version of White Meteor could quickly answer Song Shuhang’s question.","“The problem is that I don’t have that function,” Song Shuhang said. “In addition, this little fellow isn’t ‘pregnant’ in the normal sense. She’s growing in my life-bound spiritual lake through some special method.”","If he could give birth naturally, he would not be so troubled.","If it really doesn’t work, I’ll wait for Fairy @#%× to come back and see if she has any delivery methods.","However, just as this thought appeared in his mind, he received a negative signal from Fairy @#%×. Her method of delivering babies was only suitable for Song Shuhang’s fat whale golden core, and not for his main body.","After all, she couldn’t make Song Shuhang spit out the child, and Tyrannical Song wasn’t from Planet Namek.","“Can you endure until the end of the tribulation?” At this time, Senior White asked.","“It feels a little difficult,” Song Shuhang said. “My current situation is the same as the final stage of the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique.’ I’m afraid I won’t be able to hold on for much longer.”","After all, he was the inheritor of the Saint’s secret technique who had mastered the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique,’ allowing the world to understand the greatness of motherly love.","He understood the experience of the last segment of the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique.’","Moreover, perhaps in order to match the feeling of being pregnant and giving birth, his stomach, which originally had an eight-pack, actually began to swell.","No matter how well-defined one’s abdominal muscles were, they would be smoothed out by pregnancy and become round. Just like life, no matter how sharp one’s character was, it would be cruelly smoothed out by reality and become smooth.","“Pseudo undying smoke mode, can you separate her?” Senior White suggested.","“She is entrusted to my little golden core ‘mechanical core reactor.’ If she enters the pseudo-immortal mode, she will also turn into smoke with me. She will not become independent,” Song Shuhang said.","If he wanted to separate her, he would have to separate her and the little golden core from the mechanical core reactor. However, humans and demonic beasts were different. It was impossible for a Golden Core to be spat out like a demonic core.","“Then why don’t we... I’ll let Meteor Sword stab you and dig your daughter out,” Senior White continued. “Although I won’t have a C-section, you know that my luck has always been pretty good.”","In a situation where there was no choice, why not rely on luck?","You just have to be yourself, and the rest is up to the heavens.","“Why don’t we try?” Song Shuhang said.","As soon as he finished speaking, Meteor Sword suddenly came out of the ‘explosive wave of the heavenly tribulation’ and appeared in his left hand, which was held by Senior White’s lucky hand.","“Yo, Little Song Song, I’m here.” Senior White’s sword spirit was hanging on the sword tail like a pendant, waving at Song Shuhang.","“Next, Xiao Xiao, please help me with the power of my sword!” Song Shuhang said seriously.","Q version of Liu Xingbai,”Leave it to me! I have a form. After I stab it in, I guarantee that I can lure your daughter out.”","“What form?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","“Watch me.” The QQ version of Liu Xing Bai said proudly.","As he spoke, Meteor Sword swung gently, and a string of barbs suddenly popped out from the sword body...Every single one of the barbs was flickering with a chilling intent.","It was the ‘Meteor Sword Guardrail,’ and after Senior White’s modification, it became a ‘barbed bar.’","After stabbing the sword into the enemy’s body, pulling it out again was simply cruel!","If the barbs were not used, he only needed to shake them slightly, and these barbs could form an umbrella surface, allowing Meteor Sword to turn into a Meteor Umbrella. It was very convenient.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He lowered his head and looked at the cute version of Meteor White.","The Q version of White Meteor blinked his eyes and looked at Song Shuhang, his eyes full of the meaning of ‘praise me, quickly praise me.’","From the looks of it, it wasn’t a two-faced monster. It simply thought that the ‘barbs’ could help Song Shuhang with his sword.","“Cough, forget about this barbed mode...Newborn children are more fragile. Let’s not treat her in such a rough way.” Song Shuhang said.","“Really?” The QQ version of Liu Xing Bai said with some disappointment.","“Thank you for thinking of me, but there’s really no need.” Song Shuhang said. Even if he could endure pain at a very high level, he didn’t want to be stabbed by Meteor Sword.","“You’re welcome. As long as I can help Little Song Song.” The QQ version of Liu Xingbai said as he put away the barbs with some regret.","“Phew ~” Song Shuhang took a deep breath.","Then, he raised Meteor Sword and aimed it at his abdomen.","He focused his mind and began to lock onto the position of his mechanical core reactor. Then, he held Meteor Sword upside down and aimed the tip of the sword at his abdomen.","In a while, what he was going to do wasn’t a physical “Crotch Slash,” but to directly send Meteor Sword into his original dantian and make contact with the mechanical core reactor.","As Song Shuhang concentrated his mental energy, the resonance between the laws of the heavenly tribulation and the immortal object in his body became stronger.","The resonance was like waves, wave after wave...After a few waves, even the ‘Profound Sage Speech’ that was hiding in a corner was triggered.","This law was now bound to the ‘live broadcast channel’ of Song Shuhang’s ‘cultivation chat’ client.","When it was triggered, the cultivators who had downloaded the ‘cultivation chat client’ in the universe sensed it.","Everyone subconsciously looked up at the sky...","Skygazing’s action was like a signal, guiding everyone into the live broadcast of the speech channel.","Thereupon, the scene of Tyrannical Song holding Meteor Sword in reverse and making a gesture at his abdomen appeared in front of everyone.","Big Boss Tyrannical Song had a C-section!","Being ruthless to others, and even more ruthless to oneself, this was Big Boss Tyrannical Song!"]},{"number":2865,"title":"Chapter 2865: Tyrannical Song Teaches You How to Condense Immortality","paragraphs":["Chapter 2865: Tyrannical Song Teaches You How to Condense Immortality","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A few days ago, all the cultivators in the myriad worlds felt regretful. After Tyrannical Song’s “last speech,” they could no longer enjoy the monthly “Profound Sage Speech.”","Under normal circumstances, a Profound Sage Speech was something rarely heard, even once in hundreds or thousands of years. The appearance of Big Boss Tyrannical Song had significantly increased the level of “listening” among practitioners across the universe.","It is easy to go from simplicity to extravagance, but difficult to go from extravagance to simplicity.","After getting used to the benefits of Big Boss Tyrannical Song’s monthly speech, losing it all of a sudden made them feel empty, as if something was missing.","But now, Tyrannical Song had used his strength to prove it. Even if the “Profound Sage Speech” event ended, he could still set up a stage by himself and surprise the cultivators in the myriad worlds.","Even if the world no longer provided a “speech platform,” they would build their own!","“However, what is Big Boss Tyrannical Song doing?” The cultivators of the universe began discussing in their communication groups and discussion forums via the “Cultivation Chat.”","On the screen, Big Boss Tyrannical Song was using his sword to trace along his stomach. Was he going to cut open his own belly?","Moreover, perhaps it was because of the camera angle, but why did it seem like Tyrannical Song’s belly was a bit big, almost like he had a small paunch?","“Could it be the expert appraisal technique?” someone exclaimed in shock.","Could it be that Big Boss Tyrannical Song was using the “expert appraisal technique” on himself again? But what was the point of doing that? Why cast this spell on himself?","“Big Boss Tyrannical Song, could it be that you want to improve the ‘expert appraisal technique’? So, you’re testing the law on yourself?” someone guessed a terrifying possibility.","For a moment, all the cultivators in the universe who guessed this possibility began to tremble.","The simple “expert appraisal technique” was already very terrifying, but Big Boss Tyrannical Song wasn’t satisfied and wanted to improve it?","Ordinary cultivators only saw the surface.","But the big shots of the universe saw something deeper from Tyrannical Song!","For example, in the “Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group,” the big shots had a deeper discussion.","“My Home Has a Twin-Eggface”: “Did you see that? Tyrannical Song seems to have information that surpasses the Immortal level.”","The topic was brought up.","“Yes, I noticed it too. That information wasn’t the Great Dao of Immortals... It’s more like the legendary undying information!” replied the Sage of Imperial Beasts. “I thought I was seeing things,” replied the Sage of Imperial Beasts. “But now that Senior Goudan mentioned it, I’m a little more confident.”","“What is Tyrannical Song trying to do?” Saint Sickle Heavenly King said.","“Unfortunately, the live broadcast is a little unclear... There are also some problems with the angle, which makes people anxious. If the angle were better, we could get more information.” The Immortal big shot of the group, ‘Notionless King,’ spoke out.","Not long after King Non-Phase spoke, the cultivators of the universe suddenly found that the image of Tyrannical Song’s live broadcast had become several times clearer, and the angle began to rotate continuously, broadcasting Tyrannical Song from every angle.","At the same time, the Black and White Dragon Lady, Fairy He Cheng, appeared and said, “I feel that as long as we continue watching, we’ll know what Tyrannical Song is up to. In addition, he came into contact with the ‘information of immortality’ when he was an Immortal. After he took over the authority of the ruler of the Netherworld as a mortal, he indeed set his sights on the ‘Wielder of the Heaven’.”","“In other words, he really doesn’t want to vindicate the Heavenly Dao but wants to possess the Heavenly Dao’s authority.” The Primordial Witch said.","As she spoke, after obtaining the consent of the group members, the Primordial Witch pulled a few more friends in... They were all Immortal-level existences.","It was estimated that in the future, when this group grew stronger... In the future, those who wanted to vindicate the Immortal Wielder of the Will only needed to beat up the members of this group from the beginning to the end. They would almost be able to achieve the effect of “suppressing the world” and become a Wielder of the Will seed.","“Phew ” Song Shuhang didn’t know that he was about to be cut into pieces. He was currently broadcasting it live in the universe.","He took a deep breath and mentally prepared himself.","Then, he held Meteor Sword and locked onto the position of the mechanical core reactor, stabbing it in!","Tyrannical Song really stabbed himself!","All the practitioners in the universe stared at Tyrannical Song with wide eyes.","They believed that Tyrannical Song wouldn’t do anything meaningless during the live broadcast of the universe... Therefore, Tyrannical Song must have a very deep reason for doing this, and everyone needed to understand it.","Perhaps someone would be able to comprehend something from Tyrannical Song’s actions, and it wasn’t impossible for them to break through.","Ding","Under Song Shuhang’s control, the tip of Meteor Sword successfully came into contact with the mechanical core reactor.","The tip of the sword collided with the core reactor, producing a crisp sound.","The sound of the collision was long and unending...","The clang was not only the collision between the tip of the sword and the core reactor, but also the collision of three Maxims!","Senior White’s laws that belonged to Meteor Sword, the fat ball’s Wielder of the Will’s information that was left behind on the core reactor, and Song Shuhang’s laws!","The sound of the Great Dao was produced after the three laws and the power of information collided lightly!","To the practitioners in the universe, this ding was like a treasure trove, hiding a huge amount of wealth.","Many cultivators fell into a state of enlightenment after hearing this long sound!","As for Song Shuhang’s body, a series of reactions were produced because of the sound of the Great Dao.","The laws of the heavenly tribulation, the rules of the Profound Sage Speech, the pseudo-immortal body, the immortal information of Daoist Priest Virtue from the tomb of Nine Cultivators, the information of the fat ball, the information of Senior White’s immortal body, and so on. All the information related to ‘immortality’ began to gather toward the mechanical core reactor.","At the same time, on the whale core in Song Shuhang’s original dantian, the ‘Dragon Talisman Reincarnation’ rune started to light up.","Song Shuhang’s life-bound whale core had once transformed into a Nascent Soul when it was breaking through... But later on, under the effect of the resurrection method ‘Dragon Talisman Reincarnation’ rune obtained from the Black Dragon World, the shattered lifeblood whale core reformed. He only left the mark of the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation on his body.","The Dragon Talisman Reincarnation had a long history. It was related to the Black Dragon World and contained some information about Lady Long Luo... Moreover, it had a certain connection with Fairy Skylark’s bone of eternity.","At this moment, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation mark on the whale core was activated.","In the void of the Tribulation Transcender Realm, the fingernail that Song Shuhang had left on Fairy Skylark’s primordial spirit reacted.","Somehow, the Bone of Immortality was touched.","The Scholarly Sage’s eye opened in Song Shuhang’s eye socket.","The Saint’s Eye was projected into the void as if it was performing a series of password verifications.","A moment later, the power of the bone of eternity was projected onto the dragon talisman reincarnation imprint of the whale core.","In the end, all the information and power related to ‘undying’ was gathered into the mechanical core reactor!","“Wait a minute!” Song Shuhang suddenly called out.","He realized that his daughter, who was supposed to be born prematurely, was not being born again. Moreover... it showed signs of being refined.","Was she going to be refined like a magic tool instead of being born?"]},{"number":2866,"title":"Chapter 2866: Don’t Become a Slave to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2866: Don’t Become a Slave to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang had absolutely no intention of refining the girl inside the “mechanical core reactor” at all!","The girl’s life was already very tragic. She had been a lab rat since she was young, modified into a half-human, half-machine body, and implanted with a mechanical core reactor.","After escaping from the laboratory with great difficulty, she was lucky enough to meet Song Shuhang and gain her freedom.","However, she had just tasted the sweetness of “freedom,” but because of the heavenly tribulation, she was “killed” by Song Shuhang and was revived with the help of the “resurrection coin.”","Yet, her tragedy was not over! Before she could complete her resurrection, something happened midway and she was involved in the incident of the fat ball boss’s backup activation. She couldn’t even protect her body and began to collapse.","In the end, with the help of Song Shuhang’s Impregnating Gaze + Embryonic Gaze + an accident, she fell into Song Shuhang’s stomach and became the embryonic form of the Song Family’s daughter.","If the golden-haired mechanical girl’s life was pulled out alone, it would definitely be a tragic and tear-jerking movie.","She was clearly a very sensible and obedient little girl, but she was suffering a pain that she shouldn’t be suffering at her age.","So, Song Shuhang hoped he could give her a perfect new life.","This was also the reason why Song Shuhang still braced himself and thought of ways to give birth to the golden-haired mechanical girl safely, even though he was very resistant to the idea of getting pregnant.","But now, just as his “daughter” was about to be born, something unexpected happened at the last step. Inside the mechanical core reactor, she was like a magic tool that was about to be refined.","Once she was refined, her rebirth would be completely finished. In the future, she would become Song Shuhang’s special magical treasure and lose her independence.","This wasn’t the perfect rebirth that Song Shuhang wanted to give her.","“Little Star, help me!” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice.","“I will cooperate with you,” Q-version of White Meteor also noticed the abnormality of the “daughter” in Song Shuhang’s body. “However, this matter doesn’t just require you and me to work hard. She also needs to work hard on her own!”","Although it was an accident that he wanted to be refined into a magical treasure, it was also due to the cooperation of his daughter in the mechanical core reactor.","She seemed to have developed a fear of the concept of “living.” When she was about to be reborn, a fear of reality welled up in her heart. She was afraid of “living.”","“I’ll try my best to comfort her,” Song Shuhang said.","With a thought, he forcefully stopped the refining process of the magical treasure inside the mechanical core reactor.","However, at this moment, all the undying information and the power of the bone of eternity gathered together, forming an unstoppable torrent that was gathering towards the mechanical core reactor.","After Song Shuhang forcefully stopped this process, it caused a certain degree of backlash.","An intense pain surged from his abdomen. This was a pain that was even more painful than pregnancy and childbirth. It was a pain that involved the concept of immortality.","Song Shuhang’s face turned pale, and the precious “Transcender” cold sweat on his forehead began to secrete. If he were to throw away his cold sweat, every drop would be able to create a glacier!","After all, compared to tears, the cold sweat of a Tribulation Transcender was even rarer.","Song Shuhang opened his mouth in pain, but he couldn’t let out a single scream. It was so painful that he couldn’t make a sound. He could only tightly hold Meteor Sword’s hilt and tremble to endure the pain.","“Little Song Song, are you alright?” Q Liu Xing Bai asked worriedly.","“No... Things, give me a little... Time, to slow down,” Song Shuhang replied while trembling.","Then, he slowly sat down on the ground and found a comfortable position to lie down.","Under the puzzled gazes of the practitioners from all over the universe, he curled up into a ball like a leech that had been sprinkled with salt. His body twitched slightly and seemed to have shrunk by more than half.","‘What’s wrong with Big Boss Tyrannical Song?’","‘Looks like it’s very painful... Did he successfully modify the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique’?’","‘A pain that even Senior Tyrannical Song couldn’t bear? Then how terrifying would the improved Expert Appraisal Technique be?’","‘Do we still want to watch Senior Tyrannical Song’s next ‘speech’?’","Similar discussions spread in the various groups of the Cultivation Chat.","Looking at Big Boss Tyrannical Song twitching in pain, all the cultivators in the universe, especially the little noobs, felt fear in their hearts.","But the Immortals with strong eyesight could see that inside Tyrannical Song’s stomach, many different kinds of “immortal information” were colliding!","Unfortunately, this “immortal information” existed in Tyrannical Song’s body and couldn’t be observed by outsiders. Even an Immortal could only make a rough guess.","‘Tyrannical Song is forcefully fusing with the information of immortality? However, the undying information is fighting in his body, which is why he is in so much pain now?’","‘Using a cultivator’s body to forcefully come into contact with the “law of immortality” and not die, and even forcibly fuse them together, Tyrannical Song is truly terrifying.’","Time ticked by.","Song Shuhang was in pain for more than ten minutes before the pain finally subsided.","His Pain Endurance attribute had completely recorded the pain data this time, and his body began to secrete an immunity to this kind of pain.","After a few minutes, Song Shuhang’s complexion recovered a little.","At the same time, all the information of eternity and the projection of the bone of eternity were revolving around the mechanical core reactor.","“Phew ” Song Shuhang took a deep breath, and once again grasped Meteor Sword’s hilt with both hands.","The tip of the sword gently touched the “mechanical core reactor” again.","ding","The sound of the Great Dao reverberated when they touched again.","With this touch, Song Shuhang transmitted his “thoughts” to the girl inside the mechanical core reactor.","One can’t just look at the past. If one is always bound by the past, one will not be able to look forward and will ignore the beauty in front of them.","“Death isn’t scary. What’s scary is being intimidated by the false tiger skin of death and becoming its slave.”","“You’re still young. Your new life has just begun.”","“Let me tell you, death is nothing. Even if I die a hundred times, I will not succumb to death.”","“Cultivators can be afraid of death, but they can’t really be scared by death.”","“I’ll let you see my experience of facing death.”","Song Shuhang took advantage of the opportunity to give his “eldest daughter” some advice, give her courage, and let her face death again.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang began to play the story of his “deaths” to his “daughter.”","The “world of the golden lotus” died time and time again, collapsed time and time again, and was resurrected time and time again. In the end, not long after obtaining the “resurrection magical treasure,” all sorts of accidents happened. Their bodies exploded, they used their bodies to refine weapons, they were cut into pieces, they were left with only their heads under the heavenly punishment, and they were blasted into pieces by the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage...","Death experiences unfolded one after another.","The undying information and the power of the bone of eternity surrounding the “mechanical core reactor” were also drawn in by Song Shuhang’s repeated death experiences, resonating with each other and starting to move in a strange trajectory."]},{"number":2867,"title":"Chapter 2867: Thanks to the Heavenly Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2867: Thanks to the Heavenly Tribulation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Tyrannical Song’s memories of his numerous deaths were like a key, unlocking the mysteries of the power of the Bone of Immortality.","Death was the only way to decipher the power of the Bone of Immortality, much like fingerprints recorded by a fingerprint lock. In addition, the resurrection method from the Black Dragon World, the “Dragon Talisman Reincarnation” imprint, served as that “fingerprint lock.”","Once the two fused, the power of the Bone of Immortality led, followed closely by the rest of the immortality information, circulating within Song Shuhang’s body.","The power of the Bone of Immortality became active and split into two parts. One part continued guarding the “mechanical core reactor,” while the other ran amok within Song Shuhang’s body.","All of the Immortal Information was similarly split into two by the power of the Bone of Immortality.","The “death record” Song Shuhang was playing for his “daughter” continued... His extensive experience with death meant that it would take a long time to play through.","Every time the recorded Song Shuhang “died,” the power of the Bone of Immortality guided the immortality information and randomly established a node within Song Shuhang’s body.","This process was entirely random, without any discernible pattern.","Song Shuhang’s deaths were random, and so were the node placements by the power of the Bone of Immortality.","Inside the “mechanical core reactor,” Song Shuhang’s daughter embryo was also diligently absorbing the experiences of Tyrannical Song’s deaths.","The rebirth of the golden-haired mechanical girl was thorough, almost akin to reincarnation, with her previous life’s memories wiped clean.","Except for an instinctive fear of being “alive,” she had forgotten nearly everything.","In her current state, she was in a truly nascent form... At most, her intelligence would be superior to that of an ordinary child.","Her condition resembled the reincarnation of an immortal from myths and legends.","Song Shuhang had long worried that his daughter would end up like Nezha, with a three-year pregnancy.","Now, his daughter’s condition was similar to Nezha in the mythical story. Without memories of her previous life, she only retained a strong learning ability and talent.","For a newborn baby to watch her father’s continuous deaths, Song Shuhang was a genius in logic.","He didn’t consider whether his extraordinary death experiences might have the opposite effect, potentially making his daughter even more afraid of being alive.","Fortunately, Song Shuhang’s luck was pretty good. In other words, Senior White was on his side this time.","Despite being in her newborn state, his daughter had a strong capacity to accept many things. Moreover, she could vaguely sense Song Shuhang’s concern for her and the message he wanted to convey.","After all, father and daughter were connected... Moreover, the father-daughter relationship had the special effect of a “mother-daughter relationship.” They were truly connected by blood.","Under Song Shuhang’s blind manipulation, the reincarnated body of the golden-haired mechanical girl actually shed her fear of living and was no longer afraid of death.","If her father wasn’t afraid of death, then she, having inherited his bloodline, shouldn’t be afraid either.","His intelligent daughter began to become optimistic.","Simultaneously, the two death messages on her body were added to Song Shuhang’s death experience package.","These were the golden-haired mechanical girl’s death information from her previous life. The first time was when she was killed by Song Shuhang, and the second time was when the fat ball big boss used his “Dao formation,” forcing her body to dissipate.","“Calm down. I’ll bring you out and let you reappear,” Song Shuhang felt his daughter’s mentality change and secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","However, now was not the time to give birth to his daughter. The mechanical core reactor was surrounded by undying information and the power of the Bone of Immortality. He needed to wait until the information of immortality and the power of the Bone of Immortality in his body completed their transformation. That would be the best time for his daughter to be born.","With this in mind, Song Shuhang used his consciousness to examine the power of the Bone of Immortality and the Immortal Information Stream in his body.","The power of the Bone of Immortality was still running amok... He wondered when it would complete its transformation. How long would the transformation last?","“Should I use appraisal on myself?” Song Shuhang suddenly thought.","As soon as this idea appeared in his mind, a portion of the data from the Bone of Immortality was transmitted to Song Shuhang.","This was the information hidden in Skylark’s Bone of Immortality. After combining it with Song Shuhang’s physical condition, it deduced that it had been three years.","The Bone of Immortality and the Immortal Information Stream would take three years to transform.","This result wasn’t feedback from the secret appraisal technique, but rather the deduction power of the Tribulation Transcender. At this time, Song Shuhang’s brain was extremely active. Therefore, he only needed to think about some things, and the deduction power of the Tribulation Transcender level would quickly operate, combining various clues and using the body of the Tribulation Transcender to guide the heavenly secrets to deduce an answer.","“Three years?” Song Shuhang’s heart twitched.","Did he have to maintain this pattern for three years?","He and Senior White had agreed to celebrate the New Year, so how could he spend the next three years like this?","“I might need external help...” Song Shuhang said.","“Song Song, what kind of help do you need?” QQ Liu Xing Bai asked.","“I need to speed up,” Song Shuhang said.","“Speed up? I’m best at this!” QQ Liu Xing Bai giggled.","“Time acceleration,” Song Shuhang quickly added. “I need time acceleration, not in terms of physics.”","“Oh...” QQ Liu Xing Bai said dejectedly.","“Shuhang, are you ready? I’m preparing to detonate the futuristic heavenly tribulation,” Senior White’s voice rang in his ears.","There wasn’t much time left. They had to fight to destroy the final futuristic heavenly tribulation.","“I’m fine, Senior White... However, my main body might not be able to help in the future tribulation,” Song Shuhang replied.","“No problem. I’ll work with your clone, your three corpses, and Fairy @#%×,” Senior White said.","After saying this much, Senior White took Song Shuhang’s clones and opened the door to the area where the futuristic heavenly tribulation was located.","A few breaths later.","Explosions sounded continuously.","The weapon in the future tribulation was strange and unpredictable. Many weapons that existed in theoretical concepts were deduced by the power of the heavenly tribulation and turned into calamities.","The weapons of the future were all on fire. Space weapons, dimensional reduction weapons, civilization destruction weapons, antimatter weapons, star annihilation weapons, and so on were all coming out.","The futuristic heavenly tribulation was the final tribulation of the Ninth Stage Final Tribulation. It was the final highlight.","Amidst the chaotic gunfire, some of the firepower would occasionally fall on Song Shuhang, who was curled up into a ball. However, they were unable to break through Song Shuhang’s defense.","Amidst the flames of war, a beam of light suddenly hit Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang felt that the space around him was frozen.","Was this a space weapon?","No, it wasn’t that simple!","In the frozen space, time was also affected. In this small space, time began to accelerate crazily.","“It’s here. This is the help I want,” Song Shuhang called out.","At this moment, he needed to help Sir Heavenly Tribulation with a row of 666s.","Thank you, Sir Heavenly Tribulation, for your strong support!","When he needed it the most, Sir Heavenly Tribulation had given him charcoal in the snow.","In the sealed small space, time was accelerated crazily and isolated from the outside world.","Song Shuhang felt that his lifespan was starting to decrease rapidly!","But he was happy to be cut!"]},{"number":2868,"title":"Chapter 2868: Senior, You Died","paragraphs":["Chapter 2868: Senior, You Died","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This weapon beam, involving the concept of time and space, was extremely brutal. While it sped up the flow of time in a small area, it did not allow the victim’s consciousness to keep up with the flow of time.","The victims could clearly sense the acceleration of time around them, but their consciousness was like watching a movie fast-forwarded—so fast that they couldn’t react in time.","They wanted to use their consciousness to control their bodies, but due to the limitations of their consciousness, their bodies and consciousness could not be consistent.","The victims could only watch their lives slip away in the fast-forwarded scene. Their lifespan was exhausted, but they could do nothing.","“The effect of this attack is simply explosive... What a pity. If I had grasped the Temporal Laws like the Heavenly Emperor, perhaps I would be able to simulate such an attack method?” Song Shuhang thought enviously.","He wondered if he would be able to develop the ‘time function’ after delving deeply into the ‘Longevity Pillar·Emperor Destruction Pillar.’","Additionally, the attack of the space-time concept had come too suddenly. Otherwise, if Song Shuhang had seized the opportunity, he might have been able to condense the heavenly tribulation pillar-light pillar of time.","While Song Shuhang was letting his imagination run wild, the time in his body accelerated at a crazy speed. In the blink of an eye, several months had passed!","If this continued, it would only take three years to finish eating two Li Lemons.","Song Shuhang was in a good mood.","In a special space that corresponded to Song Shuhang’s happy mood.","An illusory figure lay on the ground, motionless.","“Senior, are you feeling better?” The girl with the plaited hair squatted beside the illusory figure and asked.","The illusory figure trembled and said, “Let me... lie down for a while longer.”","“Senior, do you want some hot water?” The girl with the plaited hair took out a cup and asked.","“Thank you... I don’t need it. Just let me take my time.” The illusory figure tried his best to squeeze out a bitter smile. This smile should be the taste of coptis.","“Oh.” The girl with the plaited hair held the cup and blew on it. “Senior, is this an old injury?” she asked. “Recently, I often see you trembling in pain.”","“It’s an old problem, but it’ll be fine in a few years. Don’t worry about me.” As he spoke, the painful expression on the illusory figure’s face faded significantly.","His innate ability had already taken effect, and he began to work hard to become immune to and adapt to this type of pain.","“Oh, it’s good that it can be cured.” The girl with the plaited hair nodded slightly, feeling a little relieved. After all, the way the Senior had been writhing in pain just now was quite worrying.","After ten breaths of time.","Suddenly, the illusory figure looked up at the void with a dumbfounded expression.","“Senior, did something happen again?” the girl with the plaited hair asked.","“Three years? F*ck,” the illusory figure said in a daze.","Three years had passed just like that? Then what do you want me to do?","“What three years?” As she spoke, the girl’s eyes lit up under her long bangs. She seemed to have thought of something.","“Tyrannical Song is about to give birth... However, we can’t let him be born like this.” The illusory figure struggled to prop himself up and waved at the girl with the plaited hair.","“You want Shuhang to continue carrying the child? Could it be...” The girl with the plaited hair recalled the hint that Senior White Two had gotten from White Wielder of the Will.","‘Two different individuals vindicate the Dao at the same time.’","Could it be that Song Shuhang was pregnant while vindicating his Dao?","“No, it’s not to let him continue to be pregnant... But this child couldn’t come out in such a way. Come over. I’ll give you temporary authority to help Tyrannical Song.” The illusory figure said slowly.","The girl with the plaited hair was confsued.","“This is Cheng Lin’s ability.” The illusory figure raised a trembling hand and pointed it at Ye Si. “As Cheng Lin’s daughter, you can also borrow this ability temporarily.”","“What ability?” The girl with the plaited hair asked. She felt that after the illusory figure touched her, she had gained some sort of spell effect.","“The path of longevity that breeds new life. Go and help Tyrannical Song reincarnate the child safely.” The illusory figure said.","“You’re going to have a baby?” The girl with the plaited hair blushed. “Isn’t it too fast?”","“It’s fine. Three years have passed. In theory, Tyrannical Song should be able to legally give birth.” The illusory figure trembled. This trembling was due to anger.","“That’s not what I meant, Senior,” the girl with the plaited hair said.","“Oh, are you talking about yourself? Don’t worry.” The illusory figure gave her a thumbs up and comforted her. “You only used Cheng Lin’s secret technique to reincarnate this child. In other words, this child was created by Cheng Lin, so it could be considered Cheng Lin’s karma... Therefore, she’s not your child. At most, she’s your sister. Don’t feel burdened!”","The girl with the plaited hair: “!!!”","“Relax, you can do it. As long as you think of her as your sister, you will be able to accept it smoothly,” the illusory figure comforted.","“Senior, you’re dead.” the girl suddenly said.","The illusory figure was confused.","“The cause of death is poisoning. The time of death is tomorrow.” the girl with the plaited hair said.","After saying this, she waved the huge scroll in her hand and smashed it into the air, opening up the passage between her and Tyrannical Song.","While the illusory figure was dumbfounded, the girl with the plaited hair unlocked the door to her home and escaped.","After entering, she did not forget to lock the door.","The illusory figure was speechless.","Why was this girl suddenly angry? Did I do something wrong again?","“Fairies are indeed unpredictable existences.” The illusory figure sighed.","After all, he only had the “Guidance Guide + Correspondence Formula” regarding Sister White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, and Immortal Fairy White Bones. Without the help of the guide, he couldn’t do anything.","In the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Song Shuhang had been fast-forwarded for more than three years.","“A mere three years is much easier than Lady Onion’s hundreds of years of green onion life.” Song Shuhang said calmly.","Moreover, this was still fast-forwarded.","Not to mention three years, even three hundred years or three thousand years would not be able to do anything to him.","After three years, the ‘bone of eternity’ and the rest of the ‘information of immortality’ in Song Shuhang’s body had already completed their transformation.","They used the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation mark as their nest and condensed into small balls of light.","Within the ball of light, Song Shuhang’s experiences of dying time and time again were being played.","The undying radiance that was wrapped around the mechanical core reactor finally dissipated.","It was time to cut his daughter out.","Song Shuhang grabbed Meteor Sword tightly and prepared to take action.","However, just as he was about to take action, a figure suddenly appeared from his glass heart.","A girl with plaited hair appeared out of thin air in his Heart Aperture!","Song Shuhang was stunned.","‘Am I going to give birth to twins in one go?’"]},{"number":2869,"title":"Chapter 2869: When I Return, I’ll Give Senior Copper Trigram a Beating!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2869: When I Return, I’ll Give Senior Copper Trigram a Beating!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang felt something was definitely off with his thought process.","After an immortal fairy appeared in his heart’s aperture, his first reaction was to think that he was about to have twins. This reaction was utterly bizarre.","However, there was a reason for his mind to suddenly jump to the idea of having twins—it was because this fairy and Song Shuhang shared a bloodline connection.","This sensation was strikingly similar to the connection Song Shuhang had with his current “daughter.”","So, when his brain received this bloodline connection information, it immediately inferred the possibility of twins. The celestial-level brain’s every step of reasoning had a basis; it didn’t conjure answers out of thin air.","“Hi” Song Shuhang tried to greet the little fairy in his heart’s aperture.","“Don’t ask. If you ask, I’m getting myself a sister,” the braided literary girl retorted.","Song Shuhang was confused.","The fairy’s response also turned into a “clue” that his brain received, forming data for reasoning.","Judging by the braided literary girl’s response... Could she also be my daughter? And born a long time ago?","No, that’s impossible. I’m only turning nineteen after the New Year. How could I have a daughter from a long time ago?","But the literary girl fairy in his heart’s aperture looked very annoyed, very angry.","Song Shuhang suppressed his doubts and watched her actions silently.","The literary girl fairy took a deep breath, trying to calm her extremely bad mood.","After adjusting her mindset, the literary girl fairy formed a lotus flower seal with her hands, activating the attached secret technique.","A lotus flower phantom bloomed around the fairy. She stood on the lotus platform as if she were born from the lotus. The special effect was at least worth a hundred million yuan.","“Eh? Is this Cheng Goudan’s path of longevity?” Song Shuhang asked.","After all, he was very familiar with Fairy Cheng Goudan now. It wasn’t the first time he saw her path of longevity. So when he saw the literary girl fairy use this “Cheng Lin-style hundred-million-yuan special effect scene.” He immediately recognized it.","Thinking about Cheng Lin’s path of longevity made Song Shuhang frown.","He vaguely recalled something, but it seemed to be blocked.","“Heavenly Black Room effect? Secret technique of Fish Gill Layman? Or something else?” Song Shuhang thought while directly private-messaging Fairy Cheng Goudan.","“Fairy Cheng Lin, are you there?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Don’t ask if I’m here. I don’t know how to answer you. What if you’re here to borrow money? You’re so poor you can’t even squeeze out a spirit stone,” Fairy Cheng Goudan replied.","“You don’t have to worry about that. I only borrow money from Senior White. Since I already owe him a lot, I don’t know when I’ll pay it all back. Owing two isn’t as bad as owing one,” Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Cheng Goudan was speechless.","I was just replying casually. Why are you so proud?","“Fairy Cheng Lin, besides you, who else can use your path of longevity?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Gou Dan’s father? Although I’ve never seen him use it, I feel he probably can. After all, he knows a lot of things,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","“Then... is Father Goudan a fairy?” Song Shuhang probed.","“I’m sending this message, word for word, to Father Goudan. Prepare to die, Song Goudan,” Fairy Cheng Lin said.","Song Shuhang was confused.","His intuition told him that Cheng Goudan was deliberately hiding something. She was trying to divert the topic on purpose!","There must be something fishy here!","“Oh, he’s mad now. Song Goudan, when you come out of the ‘Nine-grade Heavenly Tribulation,’ be prepared to face Goudan’s father’s dragon fist attack,” Fairy Cheng Lin added.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“By the way, besides Father Goudan, you might also be able to use my path of longevity,” Fairy Cheng Lin suddenly added.","“Me?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes, after all, you are Song Gou Dan,” Fairy Cheng Lin said, but her tone was very strange, clearly implying something.","Song Shuhang was deep in thought.","Then, he looked at the literary girl fairy in his heart’s aperture again.","First, using the process of elimination... She definitely wasn’t Goudan’s father!","Nor was she Fairy Cheng Lin!","So, she was most likely me!","Heaven and earth are divided into yin and yang, and humans are divided into male and female.","When this idea popped into Song Shuhang’s mind, he suddenly felt the bloodline connection with the literary girl fairy deepen to an inseparable level.","It was a relationship evolution.","“Eh?” The literary girl fairy, who was casting a spell, looked up at Song Shuhang in confusion.","She could feel Song Shuhang forcibly breaking through the “cut-off root” Heavenly Black Room effect, deepening their connection.","If one day, Song Shuhang completely broke the “cut-off root” effect, there would be no separation between them.","“Did you remember something?” The literary girl fairy probed.","“Yes, I remembered something. There is no separation between you and me,” Song Shuhang replied enigmatically.","The literary girl fairy was speechless.","When I get back, I’m dragging Senior Copper Trigram out to give him a beating—this kind of “profound and mysterious” way of speaking is definitely influenced by fortune-tellers. It’s a common problem among them.","“Fairy, are you trying to use Cheng Lin’s path of rebirth to help me reincarnate my ‘daughter’?” Song Shuhang asked.","This time, the literary girl fairy didn’t reply. She just opened the lotus flower seal in her hands and said, “Bind!”","With a soft shout, another lotus flower bloomed in Song Shuhang’s life-dantian.","The lotus leaves closed, enveloping Song Shuhang, the literary girl fairy, and the mechanical core reactor.","It was indeed Cheng Lin’s path of longevity, nurturing new life.","The immense vitality enveloped Song Shuhang, with a strong life-extending effect. The three years of life span he lost from the “Temporal Heavenly Tribulation Weapon” were replenished, and he even gained extra.","Inside the lotus.","Cheng Lin’s path of longevity focused on the “mechanical core reactor.”","Song Shuhang and the literary girl fairy’s souls emerged. They pressed their palms together in a transmission posture, forming a platform to support the “mechanical core reactor.”","Cheng Lin’s path of longevity’s vitality continuously infused the body of the “daughter” in the mechanical core reactor, reconstructing her body.","During this process, residual power from the Fat Ball’s final moves was drawn out, merging into the immortal light group imprinted by the “Dragon Talisman Rebirth.”","If the residual power of the Fat Ball’s final moves wasn’t dealt with, letting Song Shuhang directly deliver the blonde girl through a cesarean section would expose her to the world, risking her dispersal again and even potential heavenly punishment in extreme cases.","The duration of Cheng Lin’s path of longevity wasn’t long.","After a dozen breaths, the billion-yuan special effect lotus opened again.","Song Shuhang stood on the lotus platform with his hands behind his back.","In his heart’s aperture, a window of the mind opened—a literal mental window, with the glass heart opened.","Then, a pair of slender hands stretched out from the window of the mind.","The hands held a mechanical ball, with strong life force swirling inside.","This mechanical ball was the reincarnated form of the “blonde mechanical girl.”","Song Shuhang took the mechanical ball and finally breathed a sigh of relief. “Fortunately, I don’t have to deliver a child like humans do, either naturally or through a C-section. Otherwise, as a man, I couldn’t accept it.”","The entire process was like him using the “spiritual lake” to nurture a magic weapon, then taking it out when it was ready.","In this way, he could accept it psychologically.","“Bye bye” The literary girl fairy in his heart’s aperture closed the “window of the mind,” locking it from the inside.","This showed she had a very strong territorial awareness.","“Wait, fairy, tell me how to open this ball. I can’t just use a sword to cut it open, right?” Song Shuhang called out.","But the fairy in his heart’s aperture was already gone.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He looked down at the metal ball in his hand.","“Although the process was bumpy, from a certain perspective, you’re still my daughter,” Song Shuhang said. “How are you going to come out?”","As soon as Song Shuhang finished speaking, the mechanical ball in his hand received the command and began transforming coolly—like a Transformer, continuously assembling and switching.","“My daughter is a Transformer!”","At the same time.","As the mechanical ball transformed, the “Dragon Talisman Rebirth” rune in Song Shuhang’s body seemed to resonate with it and also began changing!","The power of the immortal bone and the immortal information material highly compressed, turning into a small “bone” shaped object.","Was it about to condense an “immortal bone”?","“Could I have an immortal bone like Fairy Cloud Sparrow?”","“Calm down, don’t get too excited... Condensing an immortal bone isn’t that easy!” Song Shuhang kept his expectations in check. “The Fat Ball overlord went to great lengths to create a ‘pseudo-immortal bone.’ What I’m about to condense might?not be the same.”","But even so, Song Shuhang was still excited.","At the very least, he was about to have his first “immortal bone” after becoming a Profound Sage.","Finally, after a long transformation, the mechanical ball in Song Shuhang’s hand turned into a “cat-shaped mechanical life form” with its own unique characteristics.","It wasn’t as cute as a Transformer.","The cat-shaped mechanical life form looked up at Song Shuhang and softly cried, “Meow~.”","Song Shuhang was at a loss.","So, was this a “Cat Transformer”?"]},{"number":2870,"title":"Chapter 2870: I Am Immortal, Hit Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2870: I Am Immortal, Hit Me!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“There’s no other way. I’ll have to summon the virtuous lamia back to squeeze the ball of light out again,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","With a thought, he recalled his pendant, clone, and the three corpses. He then told the virtuous lamia about how the fat whale golden core had swallowed the ball of light with the undying attribute.","The pendant, the clone, and the three corpses returned.","“You want Fairy @#%× to squeeze the ball of light out of the fat whale golden core?” the evil corpse, Belly Button Black Tyrant, asked.","Song Shuhang was surprised. “You can call Fairy @#%& by her name?”","The evil corpse was speechless. “Why are you focusing on that?”","“If you want Fairy? to stroke the whale, it’s too late,” Song Shuhang’s good corpse, Erha Ba Shan, said from the side.","Even the good corpse could call the virtuous lamia by her name!","Song Shuhang began to wonder if his tongue was defective.","“The undying light orb is gone,” the self-centric corpse, whose sense of existence had already become negative, reminded him.","“Yes, I saw it,” Song Shuhang said, looking up at the sky. In fact, this change had occurred right after he told the virtuous lamia about the fat whale golden core’s Light-Devouring Ball.","Perhaps the fat whale golden core was worried that the ball of light would be squeezed out by the virtuous lamia, so it began to digest it with all its might.","In short, Song Shuhang was also in despair.","Within the Natal Spirit Lake, the fat whale golden core sank to the bottom. The undying light ball it had swallowed started to mutate.","The ball of light was originally in the process of condensing the bone of eternity, but after being swallowed by the fat whale golden core, it didn’t stop condensing. In fact, it directly turned the fat whale golden core into a part of itself.","The ball of light and the fat whale golden core began to fuse.","On the golden core, the Golden Core composition, the Star Road Map, and the nine thick Golden Core dragon patterns changed. It was as if they had just received their salary, and the Golden Core composition and the Golden Core dragon pattern began to shine.","The moment one receives their salary is the brightest moment in life!","The fat whale golden core was extraordinary to begin with. The several thick golden core dragon channels on it were added by Senior White Two using the temporary authority of the Wielder of the Will for Song Shuhang, and they contained the concept of ‘immortality.’","In addition, after its core shattered into a Nascent Soul, it relied on the ‘dragon talisman reincarnation’ method to resurrect itself, so it had the same attribute as Skylark’s immortal bone.","The fusion of the two did not produce any repulsion. Instead, it was like a carefully designed gear that perfectly matched.","“Don’t cry. Stand up bravely and face your sadness,” Fairy @#%× said, patting Song Shuhang’s head while reciting her lines.","“Do you want some candy, Song Song?” Q-version Liu Xing Bai also comforted him.","“Thank you, but there’s no need. Actually, I’m not sad. Little Star, don’t be led astray by Fairy Virtue. Sometimes, her lines don’t have any deep meaning. She’s just saying it for fun,” Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, the fusion of the fat whale golden core and the undying light ball in his body was completed.","The speed of the fusion was extremely fast. It felt like the fat whale golden core was really afraid that the virtuous lamia would squeeze out the ball of light it had swallowed, so it was working so hard.","After the fusion, the fat whale golden core became heavier.","It tried to float up from the natal spiritual lake, but it could not move. In the past, it could also use the ‘inflating’ method to expand its body and float to the surface of the water.","But now, the body of the fat whale golden core couldn’t expand. Every scale on its body had become indestructible, and no power could destroy them.","This was the concept of immortality!","After the fat whale golden core fused with the ball of light, its body transformed into a form similar to Skylark’s bone of eternity.","On its forehead, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation brand had also evolved. At this time, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation brand, which had already used up its resurrection power, was once again filled with energy. This meant that Song Shuhang could use its power to revive at any time.","“As expected, this is evolving towards Fairy Skylark’s bone of eternity. However, the fat whale golden core seems to be lacking something compared to the bone of eternity,” Song Shuhang said as he opened his mouth and spat out the fat whale golden core, just like how a demon beast would swallow its inner core.","The golden core of a cultivator was different from the inner core of a demon beast. The golden core of a cultivator could not be swallowed and spat out at will. Normally, only when a cultivator self-destructed his golden core would he have the chance to see his golden core with his naked eye.","However, the fat whale golden core in Song Shuhang’s body didn’t take the usual path.","The other small golden cores in Song Shuhang’s body were still normal, but this fat whale golden core was able to be spat out like a monster core. Furthermore, it had a whale spray technique.","As Song Shuhang opened his mouth and spat, the fat whale golden core was summoned, and it slapped its tail in the air. Pure spiritual energy turned into a fountain and sprayed out from its nostrils.","“Hmm, as expected, it feels like it’s still lacking in essence compared to the Bone of Immortality. The current fat whale golden core has a state similar to undying but lacks the aura of undying or something like that,” Song Shuhang pinched his chin and sized up the fat whale golden core.","The fat whale golden core had indeed transformed into the bone of eternity state. However, this undying was like a knockoff. Normally, when a cultivator saw an undying, their consciousness would fall into it, unable to extricate themselves. In the end, they would become the undying lord and sleep forever. If one was slightly weaker, just seeing the concept of undying would cause one to go blind, or even die.","The Law of Immortality was no joke.","However, the fat whale golden core was approachable and didn’t have any airs.","He was certain that it was lacking something compared to the Bone of Immortality, or perhaps it had not evolved to the perfect stage.","“Isn’t it enough for me to die?” Song Shuhang guessed.","Fortunately, Song Shuhang had taken the initiative to adjust his mentality from the beginning and lowered his expectations. Therefore, even if it was a fake bone of eternity, Whale, he was not disappointed. Instead, he felt that he had earned a lot.","Even if he was a fake undying, he was still undying!","As long as one was undying, they would have one attribute.","“It’s you. Go, undying fat whale golden core!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and grabbed his fat whale golden core. Like throwing a baseball, he threw the fat whale golden core toward the center of the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, where the fire energy was fierce.","“Fire at me. Don’t pity me just because my jindan is immortal!”","“If you have the ability, let my Golden Core break through my defense!”","“Come on, don’t be a coward!”","Puff? ?Puff? The fat whale golden core’s nostrils continuously spewed out spiritual energy springs, cooperating with Song Shuhang to provoke the heavenly tribulation.","Rumble","The final futuristic heavenly tribulation was indeed guided. Countless heavenly tribulation weapons focused on the fat whale golden core, pouring all kinds of attacks on it, vowing to blast it into pieces!"]},{"number":2871,"title":"Chapter 2871: Immortal Ascension","paragraphs":["Chapter 2871: Immortal Ascension","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The moment Song Shuhang threw out the ‘Immortal Fat Whale Golden Core’, the final tribulation of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation was destined to have no chance of turning the tables. It could only gradually come to an end with a dazzling explosion.","In the face of the concept of immortality, there was nothing in the universe that could destroy it.","Thousands of heavenly tribulations and methods couldn’t do anything to the undying fat whale golden core.","The heavenly tribulation’s concentrated attack on the fat whale golden core was more like its indignant roar before it retreated!","Space weapons, karma weapons, magic weapons, star annihilation weapons...The future concept heavenly tribulation that made one’s scalp tingle poured down on the fat whale golden core, but it only made the fireworks in the last scene more dazzling.","Song Shuhang held Meteor Sword in one hand and the metal ball in the other, calmly looking at the radiance of the ‘Final Tribulation’.","In his hand, the deformed metal ball had already transformed into half of its body.","The upper half of the ball turned into the young form of the blonde girl, while the lower half stopped changing for the time being. The main reason was that the first transformation was more complicated. Halfway through the transformation, the newborn golden-haired mechanical girl felt a little tired and stopped to rest.","“It’s over.” Song Shuhang said indifferently.","“Yes, it’s over.” Meteor Sword Dao.","Behind him, the three corpses and clones stood on the left and right, the virtuous lamia stood in the center, and the Tyrant God Pillars acted as background decorations.","After all, this was his final heavenly tribulation. Song Shuhang wanted to take a big picture as a memento.","Where’s Senior White?” Song Shuhang asked after he stood up.","“I’m in the midst of leveling up. Please wait a moment.” Senior White’s voice rang out. The heavenly tribulation was about to end, so Senior White had started to advance from the Eighth Stage Realm to the Ninth Stage Realm.","Song Shuhang didn’t need to go through this process, because he had already stepped into the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation with the help of the Three Separations technique.","The next update of his ‘weak Immortal’ realm would only be activated after he left the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","Senior White, we’ll wait for you.” Song Shuhang and the pendants continued to stand in their positions, waiting for Senior White to come over and take a photo with them.","Next door.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater couldn’t say anything else.","Shock was something that one would become numb to after experiencing it too many times in one breath.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was currently in this numbed state. For a short period of time, nothing could shock him. Even when he saw Song Shuhang spit out the fat whale golden core with the ‘immortal information,’ Sage Monarch Melon Eater calmly accepted it.","Now, after the combination of Tyrannical Song and Sage White left, he could silently transcend the rest of his heavenly tribulation.","Most of the power of this heavenly tribulation had already been absorbed and consumed by the super VIP combination of Tyrannical Song and Sage White. Melon Eater was 100% confident that he would be able to pass the next heavenly tribulation.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was in a serene mode, but the other cultivators in the universe didn’t have this mode to use!","Song Shuhang’s cultivation chat ‘live stream’ was still active.","Previously, amidst the futuristic Apocalypse explosions that filled the sky, the live broadcast screen was filled with holy light and nothing could be seen. Now that the heavenly tribulation was coming to an end, the scene of Song Shuhang and his surroundings in the live broadcast became clearer.","When the scene was restored, the practitioners of the universe happened to see Song Shuhang spitting out the golden core!","Of course, the images of the live broadcast had been edited by Miss Long Luo. For example, the immortal fat whale golden core had been blurred by Miss Long Luo so that the viewers would not be affected by the immortal attribute of the fat whale golden core. At the same time, it was also to protect the information about the fat whale golden core and prevent others from seeing through Song Shuhang’s little secret.","‘What is this? Was it a Golden Core? Why does it look like a whale?’","‘Eh, Big Boss Tyrannical Song is an Immortal-level existence, so why does he have a golden core?’","‘Could it be that the Golden Core Dao we cultivate is a simplified model, and the real Golden Core should be the whale core? It’s just that it has been simplified, and even the name has changed from whale core to golden core?’","Senior Tyrannical Song spat out his golden core? ‘Truth be told, Big Boss Tyrannical Song isn’t human!’","‘Nine dragon patterns... As expected, an existence like Senior Tyrannical Song is a top genius with nine dragon patterns.’","‘Although it’s a little blurry and I can’t see the exact appearance of these nine dragon patterns, don’t you think these nine dragon patterns are a little too thick?’","As soon as the fat whale golden core appeared, it caused a heated discussion among the practitioners in the universe.","Only the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were very calm. They already knew about Song Shuhang’s nine dragon patterns, the fat whale golden core, and the fact that he could spit out golden cores. In the past, Song Shuhang had even performed the ‘spitting out golden core + spraying water’ performance in front of everyone.","The live broadcast slowly progressed in the discussion.","After spitting out the ‘golden core’, Song Shuhang threw the golden core at the heavenly tribulation.","This was simply a scalp-numbing operation...Even demon beasts that could spit out their demon cores to attack would definitely not easily spit out their demon cores to face the heavenly tribulation unless they were at the end of their path when transcending the heavenly tribulation.","‘Eh, Big Boss Tyrannical Song is transcending his tribulation again?’","‘It can’t be wrong. The location where he threw his Golden Core was the Heavenly Tribulation region! Could it be that Senior Tyrannical Song is transcending his tribulation again and preparing for a Profound Sage Speech?’","‘Speaking of the Profound Sage Speech, I think Big Boss Tyrannical Song seemed to have just improved the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique’.’ Many people in the universe recalled this matter.","Instantly, a depressing atmosphere spread in the group chat of cultivators.","However, this suppression did not last long before it was broken by the impact of the next live broadcast!","On the live broadcast screen.","The Destruction-level Final Tribulation descended toward the Fat Whale Golden Core.","The violent power of the heavenly tribulation destroyed everything!","In the area where the Final Tribulation was bombarded, space collapsed, everything was destroyed, and the world seemed to be coming to an end.","However, no matter if it was the water tribulation, fire tribulation, lightning tribulation, golden tribulation, spatial tribulation, karma weapon, or world-destroying weapon, they couldn’t leave a scratch on the surface of the golden core.","The fat whale golden core floated leisurely in the center of the destruction.","Heaven and earth decayed, but I am immortal. All things were destroyed, but I am not destroyed!","‘Immortal!’","Even if the Golden Core was marked by Miss Long Luo and the information was hidden...The Immortals were still able to deduce the attribute of ‘undying!’","The Immortal big shots in the ” Tyrannical Song Research Exchange Group ” and the top-notch Tribulation Transcenders who had stepped into the embryonic form of their own Great Dao couldn’t help but call out.","They couldn’t control their throats. If they didn’t scream, they would feel uncomfortable.","Previously, they had vaguely sensed that Tyrannical Song was gathering the information of the undying.","But when Tyrannical Song really created the Immortal Golden Core, the Immortal big shots felt that their worldview had been unreasonably shaken.","Without vindication, without bearing the will of heaven, without wielding the heavenly dao, could one establish immortality?","Then wouldn’t the meaning of us desperately fighting for the opportunity to vindicate dao and become the heavenly dao be greatly reduced?","‘A golden core is only the beginning. Since Tyrannical Song has mastered this technique, as long as he is given time, will he be able to use this technique on other parts of his body and transform himself bit by bit? From the Golden Core to the Primordial Spirit, from the inside out, from the internal organs to the bones and skin, all of them become immortal?’ Group member Clown Emperor speculated.","Through the assembly method, as long as there was enough time, an immortal Tyrannical Song that had yet to vindicate the Dao would take shape, right?","‘But perhaps, this is not a bad thing for us. If Tyrannical Song completely grasped this technology, he wouldn’t compete with us for the position of the Wielder of the Will, right?’ A member of the group, Saint Scythe Heavenly King, a survivor of the ancient Heavenly City, said.","The Heavenly King’s words were very reasonable, but as soon as they thought about how the seat of the Heavenly Dao they were fighting for was something Tyrannical Song didn’t want, the Immortals felt very uncomfortable.","Every Immortal was a prodigy, and their self-esteem was extremely strong.","They wanted to seize the ‘eternal throne’, but they still had to hope that Tyrannical Song wouldn’t fight for it. If that was the case, even if they obtained the seat of the Heavenly Dao in the future, they might feel inferior to Tyrannical Song!","In the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","“Ah Bai is also done!” The Q version of Meteor White hung on the hilt of his sword and swayed.","“Is Senior White coming out?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yeah.” Liu Xing Bai replied.","As he spoke, an illusion like that of the immortal realm unfolded at the center of the explosion where the fat whale golden core was located.","The aftershock of the final tribulation explosion was directly suppressed by the immortal realm’s illusory realm.","The aura of this illusory realm was also extremely special and erratic.","“Is this the Dream Realm Projection?” The evil corpse of the three corpses asked.","“No.” Song Shuhang shook his head.","Although the Dream Realm was illusory, it was still a member of the ‘main world’ of the myriad worlds.","The Immortal Realm illusion before him gave off a feeling that it did not belong to this world, and was incompatible with the main world. If one had to describe it, it felt somewhat similar to the Black Dragon World.","What exactly was this Immortal World?","Just as he was thinking, a gentle light pillar shot down from the Illusory Immortal Realm.","Senior White’s figure appeared within the pillar of light.","The gentle light set off Sage White, and coupled with the illusion of the immortal world above his head, Senior White looked like a descending immortal.","However, it wouldn’t be a problem to call the current Senior White a banished immortal. Sage White had already advanced to the Tribulation Transcender Realm!","He was no longer White Saint, but White Immortal...People.","Under the gentle light, Senior White, who was dressed in white, slowly stretched out his hand, as if he wanted to touch the ‘immortal world’ with his hand.","Senior White’s movements were very, very slow.","Not far away, Song Shuhang, the pendant, and his clones suddenly felt their hearts tighten.","The Senior White in front of him seemed to have become distant.","It was as if as long as he reached out his hand and touched this ‘Immortal Realm’, he would ascend to immortality and be cut off from everything in the world. He would no longer belong to the human world.","For some reason, Song Shuhang, the pendant, and his clones held their breaths and didn’t make a sound.","Senior White’s finger was still slowly extending forward, and it was only a hair’s breadth away from the illusory immortal realm...","Just as Senior White’s finger was about to touch the Immortal World, he suddenly retracted his finger and smiled.” I belong here now. There are many interesting fellow daoists here. Hmm... Shuhang, you still owe me a lot of spirit stones.”","Hua","Following Bai Qian’s words, the illusory image of the Immortal World shattered and dissipated. From then on, it would never appear again."]},{"number":2872,"title":"Chapter 2872: Since it’s Senior White’s Request, of course I’ll Agree","paragraphs":["Chapter 2872: Since it’s Senior White’s Request, of course I’ll Agree","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang didn’t expect that owing Senior White a lot of money would eventually become one of the karma that Senior White left behind.","For the first time in his life, he realized that it might be a very fortunate thing to have no money to pay off a debt for the time being.","“What kind of place is that ‘Immortal World Illusory Realm’? They had never heard of cultivators entering other worlds after becoming Tribulation Transcenders! Even if you control the Heavenly Dao and prove your immortality, you will only be able to open up a plane that belongs to you in the myriad worlds. You will still exist in the myriad worlds.” Pavilion Master Chu’s voice sounded in Song Shuhang’s mind.","The scene of Senior White becoming a Tribulation Transcender was also broadcasted through the live broadcast. Pavilion Master Chu, Immortal Fairy White Bones, Sister White Dragon, and the others all saw this scene in the Tyrant’s Realm.","Therefore, before Song Shuhang could come out of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help but ask through the ‘cultivation chat’ function.","Not only Pavilion Master Chu, but all the members related to Senior White were also very curious about this scene.","“Will it be a world after transcendence?” Song Shuhang couldn’t remember the name of the self-conscious zombie, and it suddenly said faintly.","Heavenly Dao Bai was also a very special person among the various Heavenly Dao. He was the only Heavenly Dao who had once transcended half a step. Back then, if it wasn’t for the Heavenly Dao’s responsibility that was like a kite’s string that held him back, he might have already successfully transcended.","Senior White and White Wielder of the Will clearly had a deep connection.","Therefore, could it be that after Senior White advanced to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm, White Wielder of the Will left him an opportunity to enter the state of transcendence?","“If transcending is so easy, Heavenly Dao Bai wouldn’t have left behind clues about two different individuals vindicating their Dao at the same time...Moreover, no one knew what the state of transcendence would be like. Only Senior White knows it a little. Perhaps after transcending, even the ‘dimensions’ will be different from ours. It’s hard to say if there’s such a ‘world after transcendence’,” Song Shuhang replied.","Perhaps after transcending, it would become a world itself? For existences that had not transcended, their horizons were naturally limited to the world and dimension they existed in.","In addition, as a mortal who had come into contact with the information of true immortals the most, Song Shuhang could vaguely sense that the illusory immortal realm didn’t have the aura of ‘surpassing the main world’, and didn’t have the concept of’ transcendent’.","It was very likely that the illusory immortal realm was only related to Senior White himself.","In Song Shuhang’s mind, many clues related to Senior White were drawn out, and he used his Tribulation Transcender-level deduction ability to make deductions.","In the past, with the permission of Senior White and Senior White Two, he had used the secret appraisal technique on Senior White.","‘He once lived on behalf of his good friend for more than 70 years. 70 years later, he traveled through the myriad worlds and came to the present world by chance.’","‘A unique existence in this world. The source of his existence is different.’","These two clues were the feedback the secret appraisal technique gave him back then.","Senior White... From the very beginning, he did not belong to this world.","Afterward, in order to find more clues related to Senior White, and to grow back the body that had been struck by the heavenly punishment, Song Shuhang and Senior White entered the Holy Mountain of the beast cultivation world.","Within the ruins of the Holy Mountain, there was a special world left behind by Tiandao Bai, and it was suppressed by Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","In that place, Song Shuhang obtained some clues regarding Senior White from the clues left behind by White Wielder of the Will.","First of all, Senior White wasn’t the ‘sister’ that White the Wielder of the Will had left behind for Senior White Two.","In addition, White Tendo had once left a message,’Little White is still Little White. He can only be him. He has a different past from us and is ultimately born into a ‘White’ that is different from us. He had nothing to do with my experiment. I didn’t interfere with him, but he finally appeared in front of me.’","“Maybe. The illusory immortal realm just now was Senior White’s original world,” Song Shuhang said.","It was a myriad worlds that did not belong to the present world.","It was something White Wielder of the Will had sensed after entering the state of ‘Half-step Transcendent’. It was a’ White ‘who had a different past from White Wielder of the Will and White Two, and was ultimately born into a different’ White’.","Even Bai Youyou didn’t know what the world in White Wielder of the Will’s eyes looked like after transcending half a step. Song Shuhang couldn’t imagine it either... After all, he was limited by the current myriad worlds.","However, from the clues left behind by Tiandao Bai, the concept of time and space wasn’t the same in Tiandao Bai’s eyes. Even the past, present, and future could be overturned.","If that was the case, at the moment of transcending half a step, White Heavenly Dao might think about the regrets he had made up for.","Tiandao Bai had mentioned in his message that he had two huge and complete failures in his life.","The first was when he was young and watched Little White disappear before his eyes.","The second was when he transcended the Heavenly Dao. He had only transcended half a step, but he was bound by the Heavenly Dao’s authority. He had failed to the point where there was no way out.","If White Tendo had ever thought of making up for his past regrets...Perhaps this was the reason for the appearance of this white world.","Even if Tiandao Bai didn’t take the initiative to interfere.","If it was really as Song Shuhang guessed... It was very likely that Senior White’s realm had reached the limit of the ordinary Tribulation Transcender realm in the main world, and the current myriad worlds had given him a chance to return to his original world. Or rather, it was restoration.","Opposite him.","After the Illusory Realm and the gentle light completely dissipated, the white-robed Senior White yawned and bent over with a smile. He stretched out his finger and gently poked the undying fat whale golden core.","Dong","When his fingers came into contact with the fat whale golden core, a pleasant drumbeat sounded.","The fat whale golden core fell into Senior White’s palm.","Senior White held the fat whale golden core and stepped on the air. He came to Song Shuhang’s side and asked,” You guys are standing in a row. Are you going to take a photo?”","“Yes, after all, this is my last tribulation. I want to take a photo to remember it.” ” I’m just waiting for Senior White,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Alright,” After saying this, Senior White turned his head and said to Sage Monarch Melon Eater, who was being struck by the heavenly tribulation,” Fellow Daoist Melon Eater, do you want to take a photo with us? Even so, I can only give you a background wall angle.”","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was speechless.","If Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song was the one who raised this condition, he would definitely spit on Tyrannical Song’s face-I’m still transcending my tribulation!","However, it was Sage White who raised this condition...Immortal Bai.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater grinned.” No problem. I’ll try my best to cooperate with everyone,” he said as he endured the heavenly tribulation.","“Then let’s change our angle.” Senior White stretched out his hand and pulled the ‘divine bridge’ that the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure had transformed into.","Thereupon, Song Shuhang and Senior White stood side by side at the bridgehead.","In the second row, the three corpses and Song Shuhang’s clone were separated from each other, and the virtuous lamia stood between them.","The Tyrant God Pillars were arranged in a formation, adorning it.","The holy ape phantom appeared above his head, acting as a mascot.","In the corner of the camera, on the other side of the bridge, Sage Monarch Melon Eater was still being struck by lightning.","“Smile.” Senior White stretched out his hand and used a ‘copying technique’ to copy this scene.","Taking advantage of the time after the photo was taken.","“Senior White, is it really okay if I don’t go back?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Yes.” Senior White nodded.","Senior White, is that your hometown?” Song Shuhang asked.","“I don’t have a hometown anymore.” Senior White stretched out his hand and stored the photocopied image into several gemstones. He then handed one of them to Song Shuhang and comforted him. “Don’t think too much about it. Also... My intuition tells me that once I choose to return, I’m afraid that even the concept of my existence will turn into nothingness.”"]},{"number":2873,"title":"Chapter 2873: What’s This, Such a Teeth-Gritting Situation?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2873: What’s This, Such a Teeth-Gritting Situation?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Senior White’s final words seemed like a casual excuse to comfort everyone, easing their guilt.","Song Shuhang reached out to take the gemstone Senior White handed him, infusing a strand of ‘Immortal Yuan’ into it—a stage where a cultivator’s energy levels evolve again after reaching the ninth-rank Heavenly Tribulation Immortal, progressing from initial blood and qi power to true qi, then spirit power, profound saint’s mystique, culminating in the current ‘Immortal Yuan’.","Each transformation marked a significant qualitative leap in a cultivator’s strength.","As he injected this strand of immortal energy, a picture of everyone together popped up on the gemstone.","In the forefront of the photo, Senior White held a plump whale-sized golden pill in his left hand, while Song Shuhang held a transforming mechanical daughter in his right hand, perfectly symmetrical and visually pleasing.","Moreover, this printed spell-preserved photo had a few seconds of dynamic time.","Senior White captured several moments of everyone smiling, including the ‘Spectating Saint’ in the adjacent space who, even while being fiercely struck by heavenly thunder, managed to squeeze out a gracious smile, laughing through his tribulation.","People who smile often generally have good luck!","“Looking at this photo, it suddenly feels like a high school graduation picture,” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but sigh.","After taking his high school graduation photo, he graduated from his alma mater.","Today, after taking this group photo, he was graduating from the ‘Heavenly Tribulation’!","Senior White smiled faintly. He reached for another piece of gemstone, packaged it with a disposable flying sword ? Poxiaoblackcave edition, flicked it with his fingers, and sent it to the Spectating Saint next door as a memento.","“Unconsciously, this has actually become my last encounter with Heavenly Tribulation... In the future, even if I want to see Heavenly Tribulation again, I’ll have to rely on others. Such is life,” Song Shuhang put away the Immortal Yuan, and the printed pattern retracted into the gemstone.","Just like leaving alma mater, even though in the future he could still visit his high school, his identity had permanently changed. He wouldn’t return to campus as a student, just as a passing visitor.","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang felt a subtle sense of reluctance.","But, people inevitably grow up.","You can’t stay in high school forever... Cultivators are the same way. As long as they keep advancing, someday they will overcome all Heavenly Tribulations and grow into great Immortal bosses.","“We’re about done. Let’s go,” Senior White said. He didn’t share Song Shuhang’s deep attachment to Heavenly Tribulation.","Under their feet, the Thirty-Three Beast Combination Artifact dispersed. Two sets returned to envelop Song Shuhang, merging into the Spiritual Lake to nourish him, while one set landed on Senior White’s Meteor Sword, transforming into a scabbard.","At the same time, the live broadcast from various worlds was cut off—this time, there was no lecture from Ba Song!","The practitioners from all realms felt both regretful and relieved.","This bittersweet feeling was hard to describe.","“Elder Eater, we’ll take our leave first. See you in the mortal realm!” Song Shuhang clasped his fists and bid farewell to the Spectating Saint.","“Wait, Ba Song, Senior White, don’t rush off! After passing through Heavenly Tribulation, there’s still a ‘Soul Endowment to Immortal Void’ phase. Only by endowing the soul to the void can one truly ascend to Immortality! Don’t miss this step,” the Spectating Saint reminded hurriedly as Song Shuhang and Senior White prepared to leave.","Elder Eater was in a simple state and always thinking of others, making him a true whale among whales.","Ba Song could leave as he had already reached the level of Immortal before entering Heavenly Tribulation. But Senior White had been promoted from the eighth to the ninth level, without ever undergoing the ‘Soul Endowment to Immortal Void’ phase throughout the process.","“Thanks for the reminder, Elder Eater, but when our soul reached the eighth level, it was successfully endowed into the Immortal Void. So we’re good,” Song Shuhang waved his hand in farewell.","Elder Eater was startled.","You endowed your soul into the Immortal Void at the eighth level? How did you manage that?","As cultivators, why do you have so many tricks up your sleeves?","Or is it that most of us cultivators have been doing it wrong, and we should actually start endowing the soul into the void when it reaches the eighth level?","Under Elder Eater’s gradually dimming spotlight eyes, Song Shuhang and Senior White waved goodbye. Their figures gradually faded out of the ninth-rank Heavenly Tribulation space, returning to the mortal realm.","As soon as the two stepped out of the Immortal Tribulation space, pure original energy gathered in the void, rushing into their bodies to replenish what they had expended during the tribulation...","This was a major benefit of advancing to the ninth rank of Heavenly Immortals.","If there was any consumption, it would be replenished; if not, this part of the original energy of the heavens and earth could increase the strength and quantity of the ‘Immortal Yuan’, enhancing their cultivation.","A series of Heavenly Immortal characteristics appeared on Song Shuhang and Senior White.","This was an inspection process in the Heavenly Immortal world. After passing the tribulation, the cultivator had to ensure that all ‘Heavenly Immortal functions’ were fully equipped without omission.","“Oh right, Shuhang, this is for you,” Senior White reached out and handed the ‘Immortal Whale Golden Pill’ to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang pinched the Immortal Whale Golden Pill and swallowed it like swallowing a sword.","The Merit Snake Beauty pinched her chin in contemplation—perhaps next time, in addition to snatching lines, she could also snatch the ‘Immortal Whale Golden Pill’.","She and Song Shuhang were one body, able to freely enter and exit Song Shuhang’s ‘spiritual lake of life’.","Therefore, after swallowing the Immortal Whale Golden Pill, she could also hide in the spiritual lake of life and release the golden pill.","This way... she was once again ahead of the Fairy of Creation.","In this struggle, she won again!","After swallowing the Immortal Whale Golden Pill, Song Shuhang gently touched his stomach. “Next time, I should consider developing a trash-talk skill.”","“Dragon’s Breath?” Senior White asked.","“Yeah, Fat Whale Spit?” Song Shuhang replied. “When trash-talking, I could take the opportunity to spray the ‘Immortal Whale Golden Pill’ out to kill enemies. The effect would be awesome.”","An immortal pill couldn’t be easily destroyed.","Senior White pondered for a moment and nodded. “Sounds interesting. When I have time, I’ll develop a simple spitting skill for you.”","“Thanks, Senior White... Ah~” Before Song Shuhang could finish his words, suddenly a big mouth appeared out of nowhere in the void, biting down on half of Song Shuhang and leaving only his legs outside.","In the void, the head of the Catastrophic Turtle slowly emerged.","The turtle chewed hard and made a crisp little sister’s voice: “Teeth-gritting, what’s this?”","“It’s Shuhang,” Senior White reminded.","“It’s you!” The Catastrophic Turtle little sister clearly recognized Senior White.","Then she immediately recognized what she was chewing on: “It’s you, the teeth-gritting Ba Song! What, why is it you again?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","I was just about to ask, why is it you again?","This time I didn’t use the Skylark Fairy’s parts, right? Why are you targeting me again?","Don’t tell me it’s the Immortal Whale Golden Pill!"]},{"number":2874,"title":"Chapter 2874: Tyrannical Song’s Three Questions","paragraphs":["Chapter 2874: Tyrannical Song’s Three Questions","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang this time didn’t use Senior Skylark’s spare parts, nor did he employ any resurrection magical treasures related to her. So he racked his brains... and could only think of his undying fat whale golden core.","As Song Shuhang struggled to expand the space in his head, preparing to question Disaster Sister Turtle, the virtuous lamia finally seized an opportunity.","She condensed her virtuous body and wrapped Song Shuhang in her snake tail for protection. Then, she boldly taunted Disaster Sister Turtle, “Call me daddy!”","Disaster Sister Turtle was startled.","“You actually want to be my daddy?”","“Screw you, you mere Tyrannical Song with broken teeth! Do you believe I’ll call my daddy over right now?”","Disaster Sister Turtle gnashed her teeth in frustration. Her teeth, strong enough to crush a Ninth Stage magical treasure, chewed fiercely on Song Shuhang and the virtuous lamia.","However, now her teeth couldn’t even break through the defense of the virtuous lamia, let alone harm Song Shuhang. Instead, she ended up with a toothache.","The Disaster Turtles were semi-biological, semi-mechanical lifeforms. While much of their bodies were mechanical, some parts retained biological aspects and could feel pain.","“Don’t chew like that. Spit, your spit is about to flow out,” Song Shuhang exclaimed in fear.","On the side, Senior White sat on the Meteor Sword, smiling as he watched Song Shuhang and Disaster Sister Turtle. They had encountered this Disaster Sister Turtle many times before and were familiar with each other.","Therefore, the sight of Disaster Sister Turtle vigorously chewing on Song Shuhang appeared to Senior White like playful antics among juniors.","Senior White had no intention of intervening... as long as it didn’t break through their defenses, and Song Shuhang didn’t ask for help.","“This isn’t spit, it’s a kind of fuel!” Disaster Sister Turtle retorted loudly.","“Fine, fuel, I believe it’s fuel, okay? Just don’t let it spill out again! My Fairy Virtue here is so scared she wants to retreat,” Song Shuhang pleaded.","“You’re doomed, sinful Disaster Turtle. Today, no one can save you! Anyone tainted with Tyrannical Song’s blood will be the enemy of the entire Tyrant Song faction. You can’t escape, even if you flee to the ends of the earth. However, if you obediently cut off your head, I can spare your family’s lives,” the virtuous lamia said timidly.","As she recited her lines, she shrank into Song Shuhang’s body, avoiding the saliva called ‘fuel’.","The names in this line were replaced by her original voice in a cowardly state.","“Do you know what this fuel is for? I’ll let you see it up close!” Disaster Sister Turtle shouted while chewing on Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was shocked.","Verbal cannon!","It was the verbal cannon he had just thought of learning!","Boom!","What Disaster Sister Turtle secreted from her mouth was indeed a type of ‘fuel’. Under Disaster Sister Turtle’s control, it ignited and transformed into a fierce Turtle Roar Cannon!","Its power was at least at the Ninth Stage level!","“Tremble under my Turtle Roar Cannon, Tyrannical Song. This time, I’ve adjusted myself back in the clan and even raised my level to the Ninth Stage. This shot is a Rank-9 attack equivalent to a human’s!” Disaster Sister Turtle forcefully activated the Turtle Roar Cannon.","She remembered that Tyrannical Song was an Eighth Stage Profound Sage... it definitely wouldn’t feel good taking her attack head-on.","“What a coincidence? You’re also Ninth Stage,” Song Shuhang remarked.","Disaster Sister Turtle was confused.","“I just came out of the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Space, so now I’m also at the Ninth Stage!” Song Shuhang boasted.","Disaster Sister Turtle was at a loss for words.","You still want to boast at a time like this?","Die!","Turtle Roar Cannon, Fire x3!","Meanwhile, Senior White had a notebook in hand. Drawing runes on it, he nodded as he drew, “I see. So this is the principle behind the Turtle Roar Cannon.”","“It requires a certain fuel to enhance the power of its breath several times. However, human bodies and Disaster Turtle bodies are different. We can’t use spit as fuel...”","“Perhaps I can start with one of Shuhang’s pendants and add a ‘birth fuel’ process to it to complement him.”","“The runes of the Turtle Roar Cannon can be further simplified. The principle is quite simple. Compressing it to three runes shouldn’t be a problem.”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The light from the Turtle Roar Cannon struck Song Shuhang, held in Disaster Sister Turtle’s mouth, pierced through him, and then turned into a beam of light disappearing into the distant horizon!","After firing the Turtle Cannon, Disaster Sister Turtle felt much better. Sometimes, it was better not to suppress her irritable mood but to let it out.","“Is it over?” Song Shuhang asked.","Disaster Sister Turtle was speechless.","“Then, shall we have a serious talk?” Song Shuhang suggested.","Disaster Sister Turtle chewed twice more, only to end up with a toothache. She had no choice but to spit out Song Shuhang in frustration.","After Song Shuhang was spat out, the virtuous lamia reappeared and cast several ‘Cleansing Curses’ on herself.","“No injuries at all?” Disaster Sister Turtle looked at Song Shuhang with inexplicable grievance.","“Ah, actually, your Turtle Roar Cannon is very powerful. But I’m special. I could withstand this level of damage when I was Eighth Stage. Now that I’ve advanced to Ninth Stage, it’s no problem,” Song Shuhang reassured.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang glanced at the new shell on Disaster Sister Turtle’s back.","“It’s newly installed machinery. How could a new shell grow back so easily? Your hair doesn’t grow that fast, let alone my shell,” Disaster Sister Turtle said angrily.","On the other side, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but use the ‘hair growth technique’. With a swish, jet-black hair that reached his back grew out. When he shook his head, the hair fluttered in the wind—much like a shampoo advertisement.","“Take that!” Disaster Sister Turtle said angrily. Wasn’t this slapping her face?","Indeed, she and Tyrannical Song didn’t get along.","Next time she sensed Skylark’s ‘immortal aura’ item, she had to be cautious and see if it was Tyrannical Song.","If it was Tyrannical Song, she would avoid him.","Can’t afford to provoke or can’t afford to hide?","“Cough, let’s discuss serious matters.” Song Shuhang sat cross-legged and said, “Is the aura on my body similar to Senior Skylark’s?”","“Nonsense. If it wasn’t similar, how could I make a mistake?” Disaster Sister Turtle said.","“Then why can you distinguish between Senior Skylark’s main body and her parts? You retrieve only her parts after she dies and resurrects, but you don’t retrieve her original body. Is there a difference between my current immortal aura and Senior Skylark’s original body?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Also, why is your Disaster Turtle clan responsible for retrieving Senior Skylark’s parts? Will there be issues if parts tainted with immortal aura are left in the modern world?”","“And who assigned your Disaster Turtle clan the mission to retrieve the undying parts? Which Heavenly Dao big shot was it?”"]},{"number":2875,"title":"Chapter 2875: I’ll Study Hard Later!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2875: I’ll Study Hard Later!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A mere Tyrannical Song actually asked me such a question? Why should I answer your questions? The giant turtle of disaster activated the ‘rebellious mentality’ skill in her heart.","“Yes, I’m quite curious about these questions,” Senior White, who was sitting on Meteor Sword, raised his head and said.","He had been curious about Fairy Skylark’s resurrection method for a long time. However, because Fairy Skylark was a good friend of his, it was not good for him to study her. He couldn’t kill Skylark and then study her resurrection method.","Not long ago, after Senior White found out that the giant turtles of disaster were secretly retrieving the undying parts, he also thought about who created them. But later on, there were too many interesting things, and Senior White accidentally forgot about this question.","Now that Song Shuhang had asked these questions, it was exactly what Senior White wanted.","“Sage White... Does Celestial Elder Bai want to know the answer too?” The giant turtle of disaster’s tone became cheerful. “I’ll tell you what I know. However, because I’m younger, I don’t know some things in detail. When I return, I will ask the elders for advice. I will share it with you the next time we meet.”","“Deal,” Song Shuhang said.","“Then I’ll answer the questions of Geya Song one by one,” said the lady from the giant turtle of disaster.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Besides Soft Feather, I’m probably the member with the most Daoist names and nicknames in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","“First of all, we don’t have any impression of which Wielder of the Will we are,” the lady said.","“No impression?” Song Shuhang asked. “But are you sure that you are a descendant of a certain Heavenly Dao?”","“Yes. Every clansman, including the little turtle that just hatched from the turtle egg, knows very well that we are the followers of the Wielder of the Will. We have the ‘legacy mark’ that is similar to a real dragon. Moreover, after our strength reaches the ninth stage, our heads can also transform into dragon heads... Look at me, I have a small horn on my head now,” the lady from the giant turtle of disaster said proudly.","“It really is a dragon horn. It has the same structure as Big Sister White Dragon, but it’s not as cute as Su Clan’s Sixteen’s horns,” Song Shuhang commented.","The giant turtle of disaster was speechless.","F * ck you, Tyrannical Song. What’s so cute about dragon horns? This thing is a symbol of dominance, dominance!","“Did the giant turtle clan of disaster first appear in the immemorial era?” Song Shuhang suddenly asked.","“Yes.”","“Then, it should be the first Heavenly Dao,” Song Shuhang replied.","This was because among so many Heavenly Dao, only the First Heavenly Dao had completely cut off its source. There was no record of him in the world, and everything related to him had been erased.","The second Wielder of the Will, the ‘Wielder of the Will of the Eyeball’, had also used the same method as the first Wielder of the Will to wipe away all traces of his existence. However, he hadn’t done so thoroughly. Although he had wiped away most of his traces, there were still some hidden records of him. In particular, he still had the body of the ruler of the Netherworld, which was a huge source of information.","As for those who fulfilled the conditions described by the giant turtle of disaster—being a Wielder of the Will, but forgetting which Wielder of the Will, being an existence from the primordial era, and possessing the strange and unpredictable innate ability of ‘Space-Time Traverse’—only the First Wielder of the Will was the most suitable.","Song Shuhang described his guess.","His speculation was not far from the mark.","Senior White nodded in agreement.","“In other words, Fairy Skylark already existed during the immemorial era?” Liu Xingbai, the Q card, sat cross-legged in the air. He pinched his chin with one hand and asked seriously.","“Yes, Fairy Skylark,” Song Shuhang nodded. “Actually, it has existed since the Supreme Ancient Immortal Realms.”","She had experienced generations of Heavenly Dao changes and even became the teacher of the Scholarly Sage in ancient times.","In fact, the origin of Fairy Skylark’s existence might be even more ancient.","“If that’s the case, Fairy Skylark is still at the Seventh Stage Realm. Even I find it a little unbelievable,” the QQ version of Liu Xing Bai said seriously.","“Perhaps realms are meaningless to her. A long time ago, she was able to endure the heavenly tribulation of the Eighth Stage, but even now, she doesn’t seem to be very interested in advancing to the Profound Sage Stage,” Song Shuhang said.","Moreover, who could guarantee that Fairy Skylark was really only a Seventh Stage Venerable?","Since the immemorial era until now, even a Paramecium could become a spirit, right?","“Has your Giant Turtle of Disaster recorded Fairy Skylark’s realm?” Song Shuhang looked at the big sister turtle of disaster.","“I have to go back and check the information, but we’re only responsible for recovering the parts. We don’t even have much contact with her actual body. There might not be many records of her realm,” the lady replied.","Senior White gently poked his chin with a pen. “Then, what kind of disaster will it cause if we let the parts with the ‘immortal aura’ stay in the main world?”","“Yes, if we leave it alone, someone with a mind to obtain these parts of immortality can make them into weapons that can destroy an entire world,” the lady said seriously.","If Song Shuhang hadn’t transformed into Skylark’s form, she definitely wouldn’t have told him about this. But now, Song Shuhang was a moving disaster. She had to remind him not to be like Skylark, turning into piles of spare parts and forcing them to work overtime.","[A world-destroying weapon?] Song Shuhang suddenly had a thought.","He stretched out his hand and activated the Overlord Realm’s Realm Lord Seal.","The next moment, he used Spatial Translocation.","Senior White and the big sister turtle of disaster were all teleported into the ‘Overlord Realm’.","“Heaven’s Secrets are concealed!” Song Shuhang lightly knocked on the Realm Lord Seal.","Under the authority of a sector lord, the heavenly secrets of the entire Tyrant Realm were concealed, unable to be divined or probed.","In addition, Song Shuhang activated the ‘Tomb of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue’ and guided Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s power, adding a double layer of protection.","Pavilion Master Chu Daofao, Fairy Creation, Black Panzi, and the other pendants all returned after seeing Song Shuhang return.","“What happened?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze.","The giant turtle of disaster also looked at Song Shuhang, who had suddenly gone crazy, in puzzlement.","“Is it a weapon that can destroy the sun?” Song Shuhang asked seriously.","“How would I know? I didn’t build it before,” the lady rolled her eyes.","“Wait a moment,” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and waved.","The Emperor Destroying Pillar formed by the Heavenly Emperor and the Solar Destruction Virus appeared.","“Look, isn’t this pillar handsome?” Song Shuhang said.","The giant turtle of disaster was speechless.","“Does it have the aura of a weapon made from an undying component?” Song Shuhang asked again.","“I’m just a young disaster turtle. I don’t have a deep understanding of a lot of knowledge,” the lady sighed.","“You and I are very similar,” Song Shuhang nodded. “Me too. Although I’m already at the Ninth Stage, I still don’t have enough basic knowledge about the cultivation world.”","The giant turtle of disaster was speechless.","I’ll study hard and improve every day!","“I’ll call my father over.” The big turtle of disaster finally decided."]},{"number":2876,"title":"Chapter 2876: Tyrannical Song, I Need a Favor","paragraphs":["Chapter 2876: Tyrannical Song, I Need a Favor","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The disaster giant turtle lady really didn’t want to call her father over because she felt that, having reached level nine, she was already a reliable and mature disaster giant turtle. She couldn’t call her dad for everything.","However, she couldn’t figure out the aura of the “Emperor Destroying Pillar” that Song Shuhang had taken out, nor could she determine if the “Sun Destruction Virus” was related to the “immortal qi part.”","Moreover, White had a curious expression on his face.","Not wanting to disappoint Elder White, the disaster giant turtle lady finally decided to summon her father.","“Wait, if your dad comes over, will he suddenly bite me like you did?” Song Shuhang suddenly thought of this and reminded her, “To prevent that, why don’t you tell your dad about me before you call him over?”","He remembered that the disaster giant turtle lady’s dad seemed to possess the combat strength of an Immortal? With her dad’s strong bite, he might even crush his bones. Song Shuhang felt he had to be cautious.","“It’s too late. I’ve already called my dad over,” the disaster giant turtle lady said as she sent a signal to her father.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","It was too obvious! I clearly saw you sending a signal—this is the Hegemony, my territory. You can’t hide the signal you sent to Father Turtle from me!","“Daughter, what happened this time?” In the air, Father Turtle’s huge dragon head emerged from the space.","Then he saw Song Shuhang and his daughter standing opposite each other.","The moment I came out, I saw Tyrannical Song dissing my daughter again?","“Tyrannical Song, don’t touch my daughter!” Father Turtle said angrily, and the classic “Roaring Turtle Cannon” began to condense, locking onto Tyrannical Song. This time, Father Turtle didn’t hold back; the power of the Roaring Turtle Cannon was condensed to the maximum.","“It’s a misunderstanding. Don’t shoot. We’re having a friendly discussion this time,” Song Shuhang hurriedly waved his hand.","Father Turtle looked at his daughter.","“Dad, smell it. Is there an immortal aura in the air tonight?” the lady said.","Father Turtle paused for a moment, and at the same time, his gaze locked onto Song Shuhang.","A moment later, he extinguished the Turtle Roaring Cannon and revealed a strange look. “Tyrannical Song, you didn’t put Skylark’s parts on yourself, did you?”","“I don’t have such a twisted hobby,” Song Shuhang shook his head. He had only given the head of Senior Skylark to Pavilion Master Chu Two, but he had never considered replacing Skylark’s parts.","He didn’t want to be chased by the giant turtles of disaster day and night.","“Then... did you take the Bone of Immortality?” Father Turtle suddenly looked at Song Shuhang with a serious expression, and his gaze became unfriendly.","It seemed that the giant turtles of disaster were not only responsible for retrieving the parts left behind by Skylark after her death but also for secretly protecting Skylark’s Bone of Immortality?","“Don’t worry, no one can take Fairy Skylark’s Bone of Eternity now. The Scholarly Sage set up a backup plan when he was still alive, and Skylark’s immortal bones are now being guarded by the Scholarly Sage’s ashes,” Song Shuhang replied.","“So that’s how it is. Is it the backup plan of the amazing Saint when he was alive? What a terrifying and persistent man,” Father Turtle nodded.","As he spoke, his huge body squeezed out of the void.","Although the disaster giant turtle lady was huge, compared to her father, she could be described as small and exquisite.","After Father Turtle squeezed into the main world, the void around him began to collapse. The space was distorted and turned into a chaotic layer of space.","This was also one of the reasons why their race was known as the “Giant Turtles of Calamity.” Due to their special talent of “Space-Time Traverse,” their true bodies would cause space to collapse if they stayed in the main world for a period of time. If they were not careful, they would bring disaster to the main world. The stronger the giant turtle of disaster, the more severe the spatial collapse it caused.","“If the immortal aura on your body wasn’t because of Fairy Skylark...” Father Turtle sized up Song Shuhang and suddenly thought of a possibility. “You didn’t condense something similar to the Bone of Immortality, did you?”","“Luck and coincidence,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","“Damn it, you’re increasing our workload,” Father Turtle couldn’t help but stand up. He cupped his fists at Song Shuhang and begged, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I have to ask you something.”","Song Shuhang was confused.","At this time, Father Turtle was begging him. Could it be that he wanted to borrow the undying fat whale golden core to do something?","“Tell me about it first and see if I can do it.”","“You can definitely do it,” Father Turtle said seriously. “I investigated you after we met last time. After all, an existence like you who dares to confront the ruler of the Netherworld head-on is destined to become a big shot in the myriad worlds in the future. After the investigation, I also understand a little about your personality.”","“Haha, haha,” Song Shuhang felt a little embarrassed after being praised in front of him.","“I know that with your personality, it’s impossible for you not to die. It’s true that an existence like you can’t help but have the desire to court death,” Father Turtle continued.Y0u can read sh0rt, t0uching, and r0mantic st0ries ab0ut c0uples, as well as children’s st0ries f0r free 0n sitest0rys(.)c0m","Song Shuhang had an incredulous look on his face.","Are you complimenting me? Is this really the attitude of someone begging me for help?","“So, after obtaining a treasure like the Bone of Immortality, if you die, can you die cleanly without leaving any parts behind? To be honest, our clan has done our best just to help Fairy Skylark clean up the mess. It’s really difficult to spare manpower to help you pack up your body parts,” Father Turtle said in a deep voice.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","You turtle, do you know how to speak human language? If I didn’t have a question to ask you, do you believe that I would smash your turtle shell?","“How do I die cleanly?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet took the opportunity to ask.","“I mean it literally,” said Father Turtle.","“The kind of death where the bones are crushed and the ashes are scattered?” Pavilion Master Chu made a tick.","“It’s best not to leave any ashes,” Father Turtle added. “If there’s an ‘immortal aura’ lingering in the ashes, it won’t be easy to clean it up.”","“All the best, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. The next time you die, don’t even leave behind your ashes. Believe in yourself, you can do it!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said happily, and the “Tyrannical Song’s tomb” on its body began to shine crazily.","Ever since Senior White Two changed the words on the stone tablet into an inscription, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had changed... He didn’t like to fight against the big shots of the universe with Song Shuhang anymore.","Song Shuhang sighed and used the World in the Sleeve to put Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet away.","Then, he lifted the “Emperor Destroying Pillar” and handed it to Father Turtle. “Fellow Daoist, please help me take a look. Is the ‘Sun Destroying Virus’ sealed in this pillar made of an ‘immortal aura part’?”","Father Turtle took the pillar, and his face became serious.","He stretched out his claws and gently stroked the Emperor Destroying Pillar.","The Celestial Emperor’s energy and the power of the star-destroying virus were entangled. Under the guidance of Father Turtle’s spell, the power of the virus was seen through and analyzed.","After a while, Father Turtle raised his head. “That’s right. It’s a disaster caused by the immortal aura components. But... this raw material isn’t Skylark’s component.”","In other words, apart from Skylark and Tyrannical Song, there were other sources of “immortal aura parts”?"]},{"number":2877,"title":"Chapter 2877: Do You Need a Sample? Fresh, from Senior Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2877: Do You Need a Sample? Fresh, from Senior Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang already had some suspicions about the Stellar Destruction Virus, and now, with confirmation from Father Turtle, he knew this virus was indeed a significant problem.","Moreover, the person who created the virus was even more troublesome.","He wondered if Song Pangqiu had found anything when he went to the main world to investigate the star destruction virus.","“Fellow Daoist, your giant turtle clan of disaster has collected so many parts of Skylark since the immemorial era. Did you collect other people’s parts during that time?” Senior White asked as he twirled the pen in his hand.","“No, since ancient times, the only parts we’ve collected are Fairy Skylark’s. From ancient times until now, she was the only one who had the Bone of Immortality. If I hadn’t seen Tyrannical Song today, I wouldn’t have believed that there would be a ‘bone of eternity’ in this world,” Father Turtle said in a deep voice.","The Bone of Immortality defied common sense.","It was impossible for the Wielder of the Will to cut off a piece of his own bone. Under the concept of ‘indestruction,’ the Wielder of the Will might not even be able to cut a refreshing hairstyle, let alone dig out a piece of his own bone.","And if one hadn’t become a Wielder of the Will, they would never be able to come into contact with the concept of immortality. How could they condense the bone of eternity?","In the past, the giant turtles of disaster thought that the bone of eternity in Skylark’s body was the only exception.","But today, Tyrannical Song had shattered their old beliefs.","However, Father Turtle could sense that even the ‘bone of eternity’ in Tyrannical Song’s body wasn’t complete. It was still lacking something compared to Skylark’s.","“Shuhang, do you have any clues?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in a daze. She could feel that the temperature of Song Shuhang’s head had risen slightly. It was obvious that he was thinking about something.","“There are not enough clues, so I don’t dare to make a conclusion now,” Song Shuhang replied.","As they were talking, a small ball appeared outside the Tyrant’s Realm.","That was a part of Song Pangqiu’s body!","It only needed to follow some kind of instinct to sense that the ‘main body’ had returned from the tribulation, so it split off a part of its body and came to report to the ‘main body.’","After Song Shuhang felt a part of Fatty Song’s body, he swallowed his saliva. As expected of the big boss, Fatty Song. He had used the authority of a sector lord to block the heavenly secrets, but the big boss still sensed his return.","How strong was the fat ball boss’s obsession with him!","“Main body, I’ve returned to report,” a part of Ball Song’s body said.","With a thought, Song Shuhang transferred this part of Ball Song’s body over through the authority of a sector lord.","On the other side of the Tyrant’s Realm.","Zither Master Zheng Yi, Immortal Fairy White Bones, and Island Master Golden Trigram sensed the existence of ‘Fatty Song.’ The three of them didn’t get close. After all, Song Shuhang seemed to be talking about some private matters.","However, Song Shuhang didn’t deliberately block them.","Therefore, they heard the contents of the conversation clearly.","“Any results from the investigation?” Song Shuhang faced a part of Fatty Song’s body and tried his best to remain ‘calm,’ asking in a calm tone.","“Yes, the main body. I randomly selected ten planes from the myriad worlds in the main world, and then randomly selected more than ten stars from these ten planes for random inspection. The result of the transfer was not very optimistic. Out of a total of 113 stars, 63 of them had the Stellar Destruction Virus hidden within them. The virus was extremely deep. If I hadn’t seen the sample, I might have ignored it,” Ball Song replied.","Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","This was terrible news.","In other words, this virus lurked in most of the stars in the modern world.","Was he trying to destroy the entire universe?","‘The clues match up bit by bit.’ Song Shuhang sighed.","“Main body, do we still need to transfer more?” Ball Song asked.","Song Shuhang nodded slightly and said, “Try to take as many samples as possible. I want to see how many planes and stars in the universe are infected. Increase the scope of the transfer and get as accurate data as possible.”","“No problem, leave it to me,” Ball Song’s clone thought for a moment and said, “Also, the main body... We should be more careful these days.”","“What’s wrong? What else did you discover?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","Ball Song nodded and said, “Yes... When I was collecting the data, I passed by the Netherworld Realm. I thought that there was a sun in the Netherworld Realm, and the Devil Sun could be considered a type of star. Therefore, I wanted to take a few samples from the Netherworld Realm. Then, I saw something that was very disadvantageous to us.”","“What is it?” Many things instantly flashed through Song Shuhang’s mind. Could it be that the thing in the Netherworld Realm that made the fat ball feel uneasy was Bai Youyou?","“It’s our corpses!” Ball Song said seriously.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Father Turtle was stunned and couldn’t help but say, “D*mn, you left the parts behind? Tyrannical Song, what do you want?”","“To be precise, it’s our ‘remains.’ It should be something like this. I vaguely remember this word... When this thing appears, it means that we’re very likely in trouble. Be wary of him.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","This Heavenly Dao Molt?","Could it be that the fat ball had coincidentally seen his Essence Soul Projection Two-Overlord Corpse?","After the homeless Essence Soul Projection Two was taken away by Bai Youyou, it fused with the power of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball and evolved into an Overlord Corpse.","It seemed that Ball Song had probably seen this thing.","“I understand. I’ll be careful,” Song Shuhang said seriously.","“Okay, then I’ll continue to investigate. We won’t be scared by the remains. We want to reach the peak of the myriad worlds.” After encouraging Song Shuhang, Fatty Song’s small body broke through space and disappeared.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Wait, don’t go yet... Tyrannical Song, where is your corpse? In the Netherworld? Where are the coordinates?” Father Turtle shouted.","“Senior, please calm down. That’s not my corpse. That’s my Heavenly Dao Molt,” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","Father Turtle was confused.","Heavenly Dao Molt? Why do you have this thing?","“Moreover, the most important thing for us is... How to solve this ‘star destroying virus.’ We need a vaccine,” Song Shuhang reminded.","At this time, Black Panther suddenly came out of the shadow and called out, “Senior Song, do you need a sample of the ‘star destruction virus’?”","“A sample?” Song Shuhang asked. “Oh right, I should have asked Song Fatty Qiu to find a way to seal a sample of the dormant state over. Don’t detonate it.”","“Senior Song, there’s no need to go through so much trouble. Senior Song,” Black Panther said timidly, “I might have something ready-made in my main body that you need.”","“Soft Feather?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","Speaking of which, a few days ago, Soft Feather, Senior Turtle, Lady Onion, and the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword had been adventuring in the Dream Realm.","Did they also find the Stellar Destruction Virus in the Dream Realm?"]},{"number":2878,"title":"Chapter 2878: The Married Male’s Flirtations","paragraphs":["Chapter 2878: The Married Male’s Flirtations","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Dream Realm, near the core of the illusory sun.","Soft Feather, Scarlet Heaven Sword, Senior Turtle, and Lady Onion silently floated near the core.","Scarlet Heaven Sword and Senior Turtle joined hands to set up a barrier to isolate the heat of the illusory sun, protecting Soft Feather and Lady Onion.","At this time, Senior Turtle looked at the black substance at the center of the illusory core and asked in puzzlement, “What is this?”","Although the mass of substance was black, it gave off a burning sensation similar to the ‘old godmother’... as if it could explode at any moment.","Just looking at this black substance made one feel a burning sensation all over their body!","“If I’m not wrong, this is the stellar explosion virus. It’s something that Senior Song warned us to pay attention to. I didn’t think that there would be such a thing in the illusory sun of the Dream Realm,” Soft Feather said, sitting on Senior Turtle’s back and taking out a magical treasure that looked like a telescope, observing the black substance from a distance.","According to Senior Song, this thing had the power to detonate a star and destroy a small world.","He didn’t expect that even the ‘illusory sun’ in the Dream Realm would be infected by this virus.","“What will happen if it detonates?” Lady Onion asked, cowering.","She was the little demon with the lowest cultivation level present, and her body was delicate and fragile. Without Senior Turtle’s protection, a little energy impact would have been enough to kill her.","“According to Senior Song, once this thing explodes, it will detonate the entire star. Then, it would destroy the entire star and everything around it. Moreover, this virus is very domineering... Even Immortals might be infected by the virus and die in the explosion of a star,” Soft Feather explained.","The scene of the death of Heavenly Emperor Da Da fully proved how terrifying the Stellar Destruction Virus was.","Senior Turtle and Scarlet Heaven Sword immediately strengthened the barrier’s defense, completely cutting off the space inside the barrier from the outside world, preventing any power from seeping in.","“Can such a dangerous thing be sealed?” Lady Onion asked. At the same time, she looked at Senior Turtle and Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Don’t look at me. I’m just a sword that can emit saber qi. Seals are not in the same system as me,” answered the Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Senior Turtle replied with a serious expression, “Don’t touch this thing. It’s too dangerous.”","“Then what should we do? Just look at it? Or quietly leave?” Lady Onion suggested.","At this time, Soft Feather said, “Yes, Senior Song and Senior White might come over. Should we wait?”","Black Panther had already told Song Shuhang and Senior White about their situation.","Right now, the Dream Realm was Senior White’s territory.","It wouldn’t be long before Senior White and Senior Song arrived.","“Wait, something’s wrong,” Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly reminded them.","Senior Turtle was startled by Scarlet Heaven Sword’s sudden shout. He quickly expanded the defensive barrier and strengthened it. “Did something happen?”","“I might have been poisoned?” Scarlet Heaven Sword said.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, don’t mess around,” Lady Onion waved her small hand. “You’re a heart demon. What kind of poison could you get?”","“Virus,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said in a soft voice. As it spoke, it created another barrier between itself and Soft Feather, Lady Onion, and Senior Turtle.","Lady Onion was startled.","“Is it the Stellar Destruction Virus?” Soft Feather looked at Scarlet Heaven Sword. After all, there was only one virus source in the surroundings.","“Yes, it should be this virus. I feel like my whole body is burning... How did this virus spread? We’ve been holding up the barrier the entire time. From the beginning to the end, no energy should have seeped through the barrier,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said.","“Soft Feather, Lady Onion, and I are all fine,” Senior Turtle replied after examining himself, Lady Onion, and Soft Feather.","Lady Onion heaved a sigh of relief and then asked, “By the way, isn’t this ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ only targeted at ‘stars’? Why is it that even Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword is infected?”","“Perhaps because Scarlet Heaven has been using my main body to execute the Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique, causing me to become a heart demon. But in the end, my body has accumulated a large amount of fire laws and power. When I release them all, they are comparable to the Grand Sun Primordial Fire. So, he was mistaken?” Scarlet Heaven Sword guessed.","“Then what should we do?” Lady Onion asked in a panic.","“What do you mean?” Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, what will you do? Will you explode after getting infected?” Lady Onion didn’t want to lose Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","This was because Scarlet Heaven Sword was the only one who could stab Song Shuhang’s heart the most ruthlessly. Without it, who would be responsible for stabbing Song Shuhang’s heart in the future?","“I’m a heart demon. If it explodes, so be it... I can recondense it with my main body later. What’s there to be afraid of?” Scarlet Heaven Sword said indifferently.","Heart demons were like the light of virtue, how could they be killed so easily?","As long as the main body did not completely cut off the heart demon, the heart demon would always exist.","“Besides, I’m also a weapon. Do you think weapons are afraid of viruses? I feel like this virus is really powerful now,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said happily. “It’s as if I’ve been coated with a layer of poison. If Tyrannical Song used me to stab someone, he might even be able to inflict a ‘Star Destruction Virus’ poison damage. It’s interesting to think about it.”","Look, this was a true heart demon!","“Soft Feather, aren’t Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White here yet?” Senior Turtle asked.","“They’re here. Senior Song just confirmed the coordinates with me, and Senior White is in charge of the teleportation,” Soft Feather replied.","Senior White controlled the ‘World Tree’ of the Dream Realm, and after confirming the coordinates, he could send it over with just a thought.","The illusory sun couldn’t stop Senior White.","Hua","Not far behind Senior Turtle, the sound of space being torn apart could be heard.","Then, a domineering dragon head drilled out of the space.","“This is it, huh?” The domineering dragon head’s gaze fell on Lady Onion and Senior Turtle’s body.","What a beautiful girl in a turtle","It would have been great if they had met a few years earlier. Unfortunately, it had already married and started a career. The only thing it could do now was probably to flirt with the married male turtle.","“Hi, pretty girl. What’s your name?” the domineering dragon head said.","“Are you calling me?” Lady Onion asked.","Soft Feather blinked her eyes and looked at the turtle body that the domineering dragon head was slowly squeezing out of the space. Then, she turned her head to look at Senior Turtle. Pretty Turtle?","“Where’s Tyrannical Song?” Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","“Here,” Song Shuhang and Senior White’s figures appeared on the turtle shell.","After Senior White appeared, he lightly jumped up from the turtle shell and stepped on the void, heading toward the location of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus.’","With every step he took, the shadow of the World Tree’s branch would spread out and grow under his feet. This was the prestige of the Dream Realm’s World Tree that had taken the initiative to coax the ‘Acting Realm Master’ Ah Bai.","This was the difference between a mature plane and a newborn plane.","Tyrant World wouldn’t take the initiative to show off to Song Shuhang"]},{"number":2879,"title":"Chapter 2879: A Little Spicy and Scorching!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2879: A Little Spicy and Scorching!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A mature universe not only manages itself but also supplies energy to its master, soothes its master to sleep, and even passively acts tough on behalf of its master.","Although the Dream Realm was small, it was undoubtedly a mature plane of the myriad worlds.","It was not something that Song Shuhang’s newly born ‘Tyrant’ could compare to.","“No matter how many times I see him, Bai Xian is still so handsome,” said the giant turtle of disaster as she emerged from space.","Senior White slowly approached the stellar destruction virus.","Father Turtle and Song Shuhang followed closely behind.","“As expected, it’s exactly the same as the virus aura in the Celestial Emperor’s world,” Song Shuhang reminded. “Don’t detonate it easily; otherwise, the Dream Realm will suffer great losses.”","Besides detonating stars, the virus would replicate and spread rapidly the moment it exploded. Given enough time and space, it could destroy the entire Dream Realm.","“Sure enough, there’s an object ‘stained with the aura of immortality’ inside, but it doesn’t belong to Tyrannical Song or Fairy Skylark,” Father Turtle said seriously, squeezing beside Senior Turtle. He turned his head and asked in a deep voice, “What’s your name, fairy?”","“My name is Dongfang Pei,” Senior Turtle said slowly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Good name. I really like the surname Dongfang, and the word ‘Pei’ is also very suitable for a fairy. This name is simply born for a fairy,” Father Turtle praised.","“Thank you for the compliment,” Senior Turtle nodded.","Song Shuhang was speechless again.","The giant turtle of disaster couldn’t stand it anymore and reminded him, “Dad, that’s the name of the Great Eastern Emperor from the ancient Heavenly City. He’s the best hammer in the world. I remember him.”","Father Turtle was confused.","On the side, Lady Onion asked uneasily, “Senior White, is there a way to deal with this ‘virus’?”","Everyone around her was a big shot. As a newbie, she was facing such a terrifying thing together with the big shots, which put a lot of pressure on her. She wasn’t Soft Feather, so she didn’t have such a tough mind.","Therefore, she immediately sought help from the omnipotent Senior White.","After following Song Shuhang for a long time, the concept of ‘Senior White is omnipotent’ had unknowingly entered Lady Onion’s heart.","If there was something that Senior White couldn’t solve alone, then he would find two Senior Whites!","“It involves the concept of immortality... Even sector lord authority isn’t easy to control,” Senior White furrowed his brows and fell into deep thought.","His sector lord authority used the World Tree to influence the Dream Realm, which meant there would be a slight discount when operating. And this virus involved undying information, making it a little tricky.","“Right, Senior White, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was infected by the Stellar Destruction Virus just now. It seemed that as long as there was something similar to a star, it would become the target of the virus infection. This should be a clue and something we need to pay attention to,” Soft Feather reminded.","“Let me see,” Senior White curiously came to Scarlet Heaven Sword’s side and stretched out his hand to grab it.","Scarlet Heaven Sword cooperated and opened the barrier, allowing White Xian to grab it.","“Is Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword alright?” Song Shuhang asked.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword laughed proudly. “I’m fine. After being infected by the virus, not only am I not affected, but I’ve also gained some unexpected attack attributes.”","“That’s good.” Song Shuhang heaved a sigh of relief and asked, “By the way, do you feel uncomfortable after getting infected by the virus?”","“A little. It was just a little hot at the beginning. I felt like my body was about to burn up and explode at any moment. But after a while, it recovered,” Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Then, your whole body will turn red, just like me now,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword said.","As he spoke, everyone noticed that Song Shuhang’s body suddenly turned red, like a small lobster in a sauna.","“Senior Song, not good, you’ve also been infected by the virus,” Soft Feather said.","“Ah, I understand, Soft Feather.” Song Shuhang looked at his arm.","He had won the lottery!","At this time, his body was red and emitting high temperatures. There was also a slight spiciness, but the spiciness was low, not enough for Song Shuhang to lick his lips.","“Why are you infected by the virus? Weren’t you fine back in the Celestial Emperor’s world?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in puzzlement.","“Maybe it’s because I was only at the Eighth Stage Realm last time, and now I’ve advanced? There’s another possibility. Is it because the Steel Avatar has returned?” Song Shuhang replied.","Now that the Steel Clone had combined with Heavenly Emperor’s Sun Ship, it was equivalent to a small sun. Last time, the Steel Clone was controlled by the Celestial Thearch. But this time, the connection between the steel clone and Song Shuhang had been restored.","“Shuhang, will you also explode like a star? Do you still have resurrection on you?” Lady Onion asked.","“Don’t worry, it’s fine,” Song Shuhang replied. “Moreover, the virus didn’t invade the depths of my body... It only infected the surface of my body.”","The Stellar Destruction Virus couldn’t enter the depths of Song Shuhang’s body at all!","He had so many pendants on his body, his defense was extremely strong, his magic treasures were piled up, and several fairies resided in his body. In addition, he had the undying fat whale golden core guarding his dantian.","The virus could only wriggle inside Song Shuhang’s skin, unable to even touch his flesh.","If necessary, Song Shuhang only needed to shed a layer of skin to separate himself from the Stellar Destruction Virus.","For Song Shuhang, who had a strong recovery ability, shedding skin was no more troublesome than taking off clothes and putting on clothes.","“Besides, it’s best if it invades my body. It’s equivalent to giving us a sample. Let’s find an independent space to study this virus,” Song Shuhang added.","“Where to research? The Wielder’s small black room?” Senior White said.","“Or the Heavenly Tribulation Realm. I actually want to see if the heavenly tribulation will have a special reaction when it faces this virus,” Song Shuhang said.","Tyrannical Song, who had just graduated from the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm, suddenly found an excuse to go back and visit Sir Heavenly Tribulation.","“Then I’ll have to find someone who can freeload on the heavenly tribulation,” Senior White said.","“If there are conditions, we might be able to try ‘Divine Punishment,’” Song Shuhang was getting restless.","“Let’s wait for the heavenly tribulation and the divine punishment. For now, let’s study this virus first,” Senior White pondered for a moment and said, “Fellow Daoist Turtle, send the uninfected fellow daoists out of this illusory sun first. I want to see if I can send this entire illusory sun into the Heavenly Dao Prison World to do an experiment.”","“No problem, leave it to me,” the lady said.","After everyone had temporarily left the illusory sun, Senior White used his authority as a sector lord and placed a batch of disposable flying swords around the illusory sun.","At the same time, Senior White used the authority of a sector lord to separate the entire space of the Dream Realm to prevent any accidents during the experiment from detonating the illusory sun and expanding the disaster."]},{"number":2880,"title":"Chapter 2880: Luck Is with Song Shuhang!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2880: Luck Is with Song Shuhang!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The illusory sun wasn’t actually large. It just appeared huge because it was closer to the ground.","Additionally, even the light and heat it emitted were illusory, so there was no need to worry about the disposable flying swords getting incinerated.","Senior White used the World Tree to control the authority of the Dream Realm’s sector lord and scattered a large number of “Disposable Flying Swords: Small Dark Room Destruction Edition” around the periphery of the illusory sun.","The disposable flying swords were arranged in a ring, like a planetary ring, encircling the illusory sun.","“Senior White, isn’t it a bit wasteful to use so many disposable flying swords?” Song Shuhang asked.","After all, the Disposable Flying Sword: Small Dark Room Destruction Edition was extremely precious. If used well, it could even deceive an Immortal into giving it away. Senior White had thrown out so many at once; this should be all he had left, right?","“It won’t be wasted. The materials for the flying swords are all sourced locally. Moreover, I’m very familiar with the ‘Small Dark Room Destruction’ model and can make hundreds of them in a single thought.” Senior White replied. With the increase in his realm, the strengthening of his primordial spirit, and his practice, Senior White could definitely produce this model of disposable flying sword in bulk.","“Senior White, if you have extra disposable flying swords, can you give us a batch?” Song Shuhang thickened his skin and asked Senior White for some. He vaguely remembered that he still needed to go to the Wielder’s small black room to pick up someone, but he couldn’t remember who exactly.","There was a limit to the number of times the turtle shell immortal boat could be used, and Song Shuhang couldn’t even remember which Wielder’s small black room the person he wanted to pick up was in... That was why he had his eyes on the disposable flying sword.","“It’s no big deal. I’ll make a bundle for you later.” Senior White agreed. As long as he had the right materials, making a bundle would be a simple task for him.","“Thank you, Senior White!” Song Shuhang said. With a bundle of disposable flying swords, he could enter and exit any small black room he wanted. It would be perfect for searching for treasures or picking up people.","Even if, in the future, he accidentally triggered the Wielder’s Machinery Laws and was sent into the Wielder’s small black room by the Wielder’s laws, he could still come out freely!","Buzz? Under Senior White’s control, the disposable flying swords that formed the planetary ring began to hum, and their power began to connect.","The power of space transformed into a network of light that connected all the disposable flying swords together.","“We’re ready. Everyone, step back a little. I’ll send the ‘illusory sun’ into the Heavenly Dao Prison first. If you’re interested, you can follow me. Shuhang, Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, you two who are poisoned, come with me.” Senior White called out.","“No problem.” The Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword rotated slightly and took the initiative to hang itself around Senior White’s waist.","Song Shuhang took a step forward and landed on Meteor Sword alongside Senior White.","“Song Song, move forward a little... You stepped on my accelerator.” The QQ version of Liu Xing Bai said.","“I’m sorry.” Song Shuhang took a small step forward.","“Let’s go!” Senior White formed a sword seal.","Boom Space shook.","The space where the illusory sun was shattered like a mirror, revealing the pitch-black dimensional space below.","Senior White waved his hand, and the disposable flying swords wrapped around the illusory sun crashed into the space of the other dimension.","Immediately after, Meteor Sword let out the sound of engine rumbling as it followed the illusory sun.","The black hole-like dimensional space swallowed the illusory sun, Senior White, and Song Shuhang.","In the air, the sound of the virtuous lamia screaming in Song Shuhang’s place could be heard.","Father Turtle looked at the pitch-black dimensional space in front of him with a heavy heart. A moment later, he looked up at the sky. “When we saw the scene of ‘the student surpassing the master,’ as the ‘blue’ side, we were very sad.”","“Yes, I am.” The giant turtle nodded in agreement.","The “Disposable Flying Sword: Small Dark Room Destruction Edition” was an improved version of the “space-time walk” function of the giant turtles of disaster.","However, even the giant turtle of disaster wasn’t confident that it could send such a huge illusory sun into the Wielder’s small black room. After all, their ability to traverse spacetime only worked on themselves.","Bai Xian played with this ability.","“Wait, Senior White and the others have already gone in. If we want to follow them, how are we going to get in?” Lady Onion suddenly said.","Although she was afraid, the sun and virus that could explode at any time had already disappeared.","And Senior White didn’t leave behind any disposable flying swords for everyone to use.","Therefore, Lady Onion could also act like she wasn’t afraid after the fact.","“Don’t worry, little onion monster. If you want to enter the Heavenly Dao Prison World, my daughter and I can help you.” Father Turtle laughed.","It was very concerned about the “undying aura substance” in the “star destruction virus.”","After Song Shuhang and White Immortal had stabilized their situation, they would definitely follow them and see the progress of the experiment.","“Let’s follow them in five to six minutes.” The lady said.","“We don’t have to wait that long. As long as the memories of Tyrannical Song, White Immortal, and the illusory sun start to blur, we can seize the time to enter.” Father Turtle replied.","Once their memories started to blur, it meant that Tyrannical Song and the others had successfully entered the Heavenly Dao Prison World.","Lady Onion was speechless.","Should I think of a good excuse to use the “Leave Escape” technique?","“It’s starting. My memories of Shuhang are a little blurry.” Senior Turtle said.","“The memory of Senior White is still fine, but the memory of the illusory sun is a little blurry.” Soft Feather added.","“Then get ready. Let’s go!” Father Turtle stretched out his claws toward Lady Onion and Senior Turtle and said, “Fairy, can I give you a ride?”","“I don’t need it. I’ll just wait outside. Why don’t you help me bring Lady Onion inside?” Senior Turtle stretched out his claws and pulled Lady Onion off the shell because Lady Onion seemed to want to follow him in and watch the experiment.","Lady Onion was speechless.","Wait, give me some more time. Let me think of a good excuse to ask for leave.","“Don’t worry, Fairy. Leave it to me. I’ll take good care of her.” Father Turtle answered seriously.","It stretched out its claws, preparing to catch Lady Onion.","Wait, I suddenly feel a little uncomfortable? I’ll just accompany Senior Turtle to rest outside!” Lady Onion’s body jumped up with all her might, leaving Father Turtle’s claws.","The green onion sprout that was stuck on the enlightenment stone spun a few times in the air and returned to Senior Turtle’s shell.","However...","Just as Lady Onion was doing a 360-degree somersault in the air, a wave of explosion suddenly appeared in the pitch-black dimensional space in front of her!","It was the impact of a star exploding, just like the scene in the Celestial Emperor’s world!","The illusory sun that Senior White and Song Shuhang had brought to the Heavenly Dao Prison had exploded?","With Senior White here, the sun actually exploded?","Not good? The mascot is with Song Shuhang!” Lady Onion suddenly thought of something while doing the somersault, and she shouted."]},{"number":2881,"title":"Chapter 2881: The Onion Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2881: The Onion Tribulation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As the mascot, Senior White had entered the Wielder’s small black room together with Song Shuhang!","However, the illusory sun exploded due to the stellar destruction virus. The violent explosive impact overflowed from the black hole dimensional space as if it was going to destroy everything!","He was clearly avoiding disaster!","Senior White held a supreme position in Lady Onion’s heart, and the mascot was just one of the many images of Senior White in her heart.","The attribute related to the ‘mascot’ was precisely Senior White’s ability to ‘seek good fortune and avoid disaster.’ Senior White’s luck would always allow him to avoid disaster without realizing it. This kind of evasive action wasn’t even something that Senior White would do on his own initiative.","From the looks of it, Senior White had followed Song Shuhang into the Wielder’s small black room to avoid the disaster and the explosion of the star!","In other words, now, luck was not on their side!","If the impact of the star’s explosion rushed out of the black hole dimensional space, Lady Onion and the others standing nearby would bear the brunt of it and become the first victims!","Right now, they were standing in the ‘danger’ position.","[Why didn’t I think of this? I should have followed Senior White and Song Shuhang in!] Lady Onion said regretfully.","As long as she stayed by Song Shuhang and Senior White’s side, she wouldn’t be in danger.","Song Shuhang and Senior White were publicly recognized as the best team in the Nine Provinces Number One Group!","At this time, Lady Onion hated her ‘sudden cowardice’ from before.","If only I hadn’t been scared before","However, there weren’t so many ifs in green onion life!","Rumble","A thunderous voice sounded from the black hole-like dimensional space. This sound wasn’t transmitted through her ‘ears.’ It was like a demonic sound that directly entered Lady Onion’s mind and exploded inside it.","“Aiyaya, I’m going to die, I’m going to die,” Lady Onion screamed as she hugged the green onion shoot with her small arms.","Just as she was doing a 360-degree somersault in despair... the impact of the star explosion did not come out of the black hole.","The pitch-black dimensional space suddenly produced a reverse suction force that directly sucked back all the power of the explosion!","The terrifying explosive power was forcefully pulled back into the dimensional space.","The pitch-black dimensional space turned into a true black hole, devouring everything around it!","“It didn’t come out? Are we saved?” Lady Onion was delighted.","When she saw the scene of the ‘explosive power’ being sucked back, her heart jolted. Could it be... did Song Shuhang’s constitution of ‘everyone can enjoy the good fortune, and I’ll take care of the bad’ come into play? At the critical moment, all the disasters were retracted and exploded in Song Shuhang’s direction?","“Heavens, be careful!” At this time, Senior Turtle instantly made a move and grabbed the enlightenment stone under Lady Onion’s feet with his claws.","The black hole formed by the dimensional space had a terrifying suction force.","Senior Turtle, Big Sister Turtle of Disaster, Soft Feather, and Father Turtle were all strongly attracted by this. Lady Onion, who had been doing 360 somersaults in the air, was the one who suffered the most.","“Be careful, hold on! Don’t get sucked in...” Father Turtle shouted.","This black hole-like dimensional space was the rift that led from the main world to the Heavenly Dao Prison World. Right now, the rift was still affected by the stellar explosion virus.","If he fell in, who knew what would happen?","He might die! The pitch-black abyss in the passage made even Father Turtle feel uneasy.","If they fell into it, even their giant turtle race might not be able to return.","“It’s breaking, it’s breaking, it’s going to break! Senior Turtle, don’t let go!” Lady Onion screamed.","Under the pull of that terrifying suction force, Lady Onion’s green onion sprout was stretched out like a rubber band.","If it was an ordinary seedling, it would have broken under such a terrifying suction force.","However, Lady Onion was still a little onion spirit who had succeeded in her cultivation. Especially during the days in the Inner World, she often accompanied Pavilion Master Chu to soak in the living spring, listened to Senior Turtle’s lectures, and worked hard in her cultivation. Now, her onion body was very tough!","For example, now... even though the green onion had been stretched to fifteen meters long, it still did not break.","“It’s better to break it!” Lady Onion was in so much pain that she started crying.","After the green onion body was broken, she still had the green onion root.","With the nourishment of the living spring and spirit herbs, it wouldn’t be long before she could grow another green onion sprout.","Unlike now, the 15-meter-long onion rope was still unending.","Sometimes, being too strong was a form of torture.","“I’ll help you cut it,” Senior Turtle said with heartache.","Its claws gently shot out, brushing past Lady Onion’s green onion.","A cold light flashed, and Lady Onion’s 15-meter-long green onion body was pulled into the black hole by the gravitational force. It was completely crushed.","Seeing this scene, Lady Onion felt as if a knife had been twisted in her heart.","Senior Turtle comforted her, “Lady Onion, don’t be too sad.”","“It’s fine. I’ll get used to it if I break it again and again,” Lady Onion replied.","Senior Turtle nodded, then grabbed Lady Onion’s root and enlightenment stone back.","Rumble ~ After swallowing Lady Onion, the vortex in the black hole suddenly let out an even louder rumbling sound.","The suction force became stronger and more violent.","Crack","The Dao Comprehension Stone, which had been through many hardships, let out a grinding sound at this moment. Cracks appeared on the enlightenment stone.","“My Dao Comprehension Stone!” Lady Onion said with heartache.","Since Song Shuhang had advanced too quickly, he had no use for the enlightenment stone in less than half a year. Therefore, the actual ownership of this enlightenment stone had already belonged to Lady Onion, and it could be considered a part of her salary.","Now, this precious enlightenment stone had actually shattered.","“Heavens, don’t move!” Senior Turtle shouted.","Crack ~ The entire enlightenment stone suddenly shattered, and several pieces of the enlightenment stone, along with Lady Onion’s green onion sprout, were pulled into the black hole by the suction force.","Senior Turtle’s claws stretched out again, trying to grab Lady Onion. However, due to the suction force, its claws only managed to grab a few pieces of the enlightenment stone.","“Dead, dead, dead,” Lady Onion shouted.","“Revival Coin!” Senior Turtle shouted.","This ‘resurrection gold coin’ was also the only resurrection magical treasure Song Shuhang hadn’t used up in time. In the end, he gave one to each disciple, Sixteen, and Soft Feather. As a pet, Lady Onion also got one.","“Aaah ” Lady Onion continued to scream, as if she hadn’t heard Senior Turtle’s voice.","Senior Turtle gritted his teeth and prepared to jump forward and bring Lady Onion back.","Right at this moment, a ray of treasure light flashed past.","It was the Dao artifact, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. It automatically protected its master!","Although it seemed to be more intimate with Song Shuhang, the fact that Lady Onion was the current ‘Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue’ wouldn’t change.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’s precious light wrapped around the enlightenment stone fragment and Lady Onion’s root, protecting her.","At the same time, another figure appeared in the void.","It was Song Shuhang’s clone that was controlling Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword!","Song Shuhang’s clone grabbed Scarlet Heaven Sword with one hand and forcefully entered the black hole. Then, he used his other hand to grab the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ and Lady Onion.","“Boss Song ” At this moment, Lady Onion was so moved that she almost cried.","“Aaah ~” Before she could finish feeling touched, Song Shuhang’s clone hugged her and let out a wave of miserable screams. Then, he was swallowed by the black hole along with the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and the Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“Boss Song ” Lady Onion really cried this time.","As expected of ‘Song Shuhang, I’ll Fight If You’re in Trouble.’ After he appeared, he perfectly shouldered the disaster.","Song Shuhang’s clone, Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword, Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and Lady Onion were like a huge rock, forcefully blocking the hole in the black hole!","The black hole dimensional space calmed down... Song Shuhang’s clone and Lady Onion also disappeared."]},{"number":2882,"title":"Chapter 2882: Soft Feather’s Growth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2882: Soft Feather’s Growth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Amid Lady Onion’s tear-jerking cries of “Boss Song,” the entire team was swallowed by the black hole dimension.","The two cries of “Boss Song” carried different emotions. The first was Lady Onion, touched to the point of tears, while the second was Lady Onion, heartbroken and sobbing.","On the other side of the black hole dimension, Senior Turtle stretched out its claws, stunned for a long time.","It had seen the majestic appearance of the “Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber” and Song Shuhang’s clone stepping out of the dimensional passageway, grasping Lady Onion with the “Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword.”","Honestly, this combination was already more powerful and reliable than it!","Senior Turtle had fully believed that the combination of Song Shuhang’s clone, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber would successfully bring Lady Onion back.","But it had never expected that such a seemingly strong combination would be like meat buns being delivered to a dog—an entire basket of meat buns, all of them never to return.","“Heavens...” Senior Turtle could only squeeze out this word after a long time.","Other than looking up at the sky, it had no other words to express its complex emotions.","“Can we still save them?” Soft Feather asked via voice transmission. At this moment, she was tightly holding the new shell of the disaster turtle lady.","Father Turtle shook his head. “It’s meaningless. Even if I go in myself, I might not come out safely.”","Moreover, it wouldn’t take such a risk for Lady Onion and Tyrannical Song’s clones—their relationship wasn’t that good.","Besides, the disaster giant turtles were better at destruction than rescue. They had an inherent effect of “collapsing the present space.”","If it forced its way into the black hole dimension, it might have the opposite effect. It was possible that the black hole, just filled by Lady Onion’s group, would explode again after they entered, making the ending even worse.","Soft Feather frowned.","She looked at the pitch-black dimension and fell into deep thought.","Senior Turtle’s eye happened to catch a glimpse of Soft Feather deep in thought. It suddenly found that Soft Feather, when seriously thinking, gave off a very reliable feeling!","The pensive Soft Feather and the usually lively Soft Feather were two completely different styles.","“Soft Feather, you don’t have to worry too much. Just now, I saw the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ chasing after Lady Onion to protect her.” The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was a Dao Artifact, a creation of the Immortal Heavenly Dao. Besides, with Song Shuhang, who always surprises people, this matter hasn’t reached a desperate situation yet.” Senior Turtle consoled.","Song Shuhang was very unexpected. Sometimes, you’d feel he had everything under control, and then he’d die. Other times, you’d think he was dead for sure, but he’d force his way out of a desperate situation!","He was a special player, bronze in good times and king in bad times.","Moreover, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was a Dao Weapon and might have some hidden trump card to protect itself.","Even Lady Onion herself was an onion sprout with great luck.","More than one senior had personally said that Lady Onion had the “appearance of the Wielder of the Heaven.”","Therefore, she would definitely be fine!","Senior Turtle’s words were comforting both Soft Feather and itself. Among Song Shuhang’s pendants, it had the best relationship with Lady Onion.","“Yes.” Soft Feather replied.","Just now, while silent, Soft Feather had been contacting Lady Onion through the “cultivation chat” function, trying to confirm her condition.","However, Lady Onion didn’t reply.","It was very likely that she was in dire straits.","Soft Feather stretched out her hand and gently pressed it on her chest. This was the first time she had experienced losing a companion, watching helplessly as her companion was devoured.","Among them was Senior “Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword,” who had a good relationship with her Black Panther clone, and Song Shuhang’s pet, Lady Onion, who had always been on good terms with her.","This gave her a huge shock.","In an instant, Soft Feather, who used to be cheerful and lively, seemed to have grown a lot.","Judging from her serious expression, she seemed to have made up her mind.","On the other side, the pitch-black dimensional space began to slowly close.","The sacrifice of Lady Onion’s meat bun team’s clones might still be effective. At least, it was like a sacrifice that appeased the anger of the black hole.","Seeing that the pitch-black dimensional space was about to close, Soft Feather stretched out her hand, took out a magical treasure similar to a drone camera, and threw it in.","Perhaps Lady Onion’s group had fallen into the Wielder’s small black room with the protection of the Scarlet Heaven Sword and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","Under Soft Feather’s control, the magical treasure began to explore the dimensional space.","However, in the images shown by the photographic magical treasure, there were no traces of Lady Onion and Song Shuhang’s clones, nor were there any remains.","“Could it be that when Lady Onion and Senior Song’s clones were swallowed by that black hole, they were directly swept into another space?” Soft Feather thought to herself.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was a Doctrine Artifact. Even if it was destroyed by the power of space, there would at least be fragments left behind. It was impossible for nothing to be left. No matter what, it was still a Doctrine Artifact!","The scouting camera artifact rolled around and suddenly disappeared, losing its signal.","In fact, Soft Feather’s memory of this “scouting magical treasure” also started to blur.","The reconnaissance magical treasure had fallen into the Wielder’s small black room?","The door of the Wielder’s small black room that Senior White and Senior Song had pushed open after the explosion of the stellar destruction virus hadn’t closed yet?","“Eh, wait... Whether it’s Senior White or Senior Song, I haven’t forgotten them.” Soft Feather suddenly noticed this!","Song Shuhang’s memory, which had already begun to blur, became clear again.","Could it be that during the explosion, Senior White and Senior Song had both left the Wielder’s small black room and returned to the main world?","“Senior Song, are you alright?” Soft Feather quickly contacted Song Shuhang through the “cultivation chat.”","“Still alive,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Senior Song, is your clone still alive?” Soft Feather asked again.","This time, Song Shuhang didn’t reply immediately.","Moments passed.","Song Shuhang said, “Heavens, it seems... Lost contact? Soft Feather, I’ll reply to you later.”","From the conversation, it was clear that Song Shuhang was very busy right now.","The explosion of the illusory sun and the virus within it drowned Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Song Shuhang took out the “Emperor Destroying Pillar” and created a pure land amidst the explosion and the virus. He also tried to use the “Emperor Destroying Pillar” to absorb the power of the virus and strengthen the pillar.","Not long ago, when Senior White sent the illusory sun into the Wielder’s small black room with the disposable flying sword, the illusory sun seemed to have been “plucked” from a huge network.","Without the control of the network, it would explode.","“Senior White, it seems like we have to find a new experimental subject,” Song Shuhang turned his head and said to Senior White.","When he turned his head, he saw that Senior White seemed to be in a daze.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Fellow Daoist White ” At this time, the voice of a man that Song Shuhang was familiar with suddenly rang out not far away.","Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at the source of the sound. In the next moment, he saw the light of virtue that looked like an Audi’s headlights."]},{"number":2883,"title":"Chapter 2883: I Placed My Hopes on the Future","paragraphs":["Chapter 2883: I Placed My Hopes on the Future","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This might be karma.","All along, Song Shuhang had been the only one who had used the dazzling light of virtue to turn into an Audi’s headlights to shine on others. The only light of virtue that could blind him was his own... And today, he finally tasted the feeling of being blinded by someone else’s light of virtue.","“Who’s pretending? It’s too dazzling ”","Even with Song Shuhang’s special eyeballs, it took him more than three breaths to get used to the light of virtue!","This was definitely not the effect of the light of virtue alone. This blinding light of virtue was definitely mixed with other powers. Otherwise, Song Shuhang would never have been blind for such a long time.","“Who is it?” Senior White also raised his head and looked at the source of the sound.","Unlike Song Shuhang’s treatment, when Senior White recovered from his absent-minded state and turned his head to look at the source of the sound, the light of virtue that was originally like an Audi lamp instantly dimmed and turned into a weak light like a candle.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Did the difference in treatment have to be so obvious?","“Senior Song, be careful. Don’t die.” At this time, Soft Feather sent another message.","Song Shuhang took the time to comfort her, “Don’t worry, Soft Feather. I’m resurrected now; I won’t die ”","Then, he shifted his gaze to the ‘ball of light of virtue.’","There, a Daoist formed from the light of virtue stood quietly at the center of the explosion of the illusory sun in the Dream Realm.","It was him!","Without the cover of the dazzling light of virtue, Song Shuhang recognized the other party at a glance.","It was the Immortal Daoist who had appeared in Song Shuhang’s ‘dream’!","This was a certain Heavenly Dao who had reignited the extinguished stars of the myriad worlds and reversed karma to restart the myriad worlds!","Moreover, it seemed that Immortal Daoist Big Lamp knew Senior White.","Of course... The Immortal Daoist definitely didn’t know the ‘Senior White’ in front of him, but the ‘White Wielder of the Will’ from the distant past.","“Are you calling me?” Senior White looked at the Immortal Daoist.","On the other side, the Daoist formed by the light of virtue did not answer.","“When you see this video, I should be completely dead.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He almost couldn’t control his emotions.","It was mainly because he was very sensitive to the words ‘completely dead.’","However, the Immortal Daoist in front of him wasn’t a clone or a consciousness.","“It seems that this is just a video message. It’s content that has been recorded long ago. After a series of conditions are met, it will be triggered, activated, and played.” Pavilion Master Chu said in a daze.","Senior White also noticed this.","He, Song Shuhang, and Pavilion Master Chu didn’t say anything else and listened carefully to the message.","“To be honest, I’m not sure if you can receive the video I left behind. I hid it well... Because he couldn’t let that guy find out about this video. But because I hid it too well, I was worried that you wouldn’t be able to find it. This made things difficult for me, but after considering Fellow Daoist White’s luck, I decided to take a gamble.","I believe that with Fellow Daoist White’s luck, you’ll be able to see this image one day!” the Immortal Daoist continued.","“In addition, Fellow Daoist White, when you saw this video, it meant that you must have discovered the hidden problems in many of the stars in the universe, right? I’m sorry to have left you with such a mess in the end.”","“The ‘star destruction virus’ was created based on the aura of an undying object. I once worked with that guy and found out part of the production process of the Stellar Destruction Virus. Unfortunately, without the complete production method, it will be difficult to crack it.”","“A part of the ‘child virus’ is only made from ‘undying aura materials,’ so it’s quite easy to deal with. However, a portion of the Mother Virus was created with a true ‘undying body.’ That’s something that even the power of the Heavenly Dao can’t erase!”","“A virus created from a true ‘undying body’? Since it was an undying, an undying that even the Heavenly Dao couldn’t erase, how could it be made into a virus? Also, since it’s undying, how do we split it?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in puzzlement.","She communicated with everyone through voice transmission so as not to interrupt the recording.","“Could it be that there’s a stronger concept above undying that can break it?” Song Shuhang guessed.","It was just like the settings of some unrated games—VIP had the ‘magic immunity’ attribute, but super VIP had the ‘magic break immunity’ privilege, and then super VIP had the ‘anti-magic break immunity’ talent.","Break through defense while spending endless money.","“The Heavenly Dao and the undying aren’t so childish.” Senior White shook his head.","According to the Immortal Daoist’s description, during his term of office, there seemed to be a certain Wielder of the Will who retained a portion of his ‘eternal body’ after he took over?","In fact, there was even someone active among the previous Heavenly Dao?","“I finally reversed the karma, but I don’t know how long this effect can last... Moreover, even if he reversed karma, it would only delay the destruction of the myriad worlds by a step. The root of the virus is still there.” The Immortal Daoist’s message continued.","“I placed all my hopes on you, Fellow Daoist White!”","Song Shuhang recalled the memory of the Immortal Daoist building the tomb of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue in his ‘dream.’ Among them, the Immortal Daoist had said that he had already placed his ‘hope’ on the future!","Now, it seemed that he had indeed placed his ‘hope’ on White Heavenly Dao.","However, it was possible that he had hidden the information too well. It was only until today that Senior White of the main world took it out.","“Time is running out, Fellow Daoist White. The future is in your hands! My Merit Net will try to hold on for as long as possible to fight for you.” the Immortal said.","As he spoke, the ball of light of virtue exploded, pressing down on the aftermath of the explosion of the illusory sun.","The power of the illusory sun’s explosion was forcefully suppressed.","This was the trump card left behind by the Immortal Daoist to counter the Eternal Star Destruction Virus. It could also be a protective measure for Fellow Daoist White.","Under the suppression of the power of virtue, the ‘star destruction virus’ that had already exploded was pushed back.","An object smaller than sand finally appeared in front of Song Shuhang and the others.","“Undying can’t cut... The Immortal Heavenly Dao could not even cut his hair. However, if the main body of this Immortal Heavenly Dao is a piece of sand or a combination of similar particles, can it still split its body after it vindicates dao?” After seeing this grain of sand with the aura of immortality, Song Shuhang suddenly had an idea and said,”","“I’ll ask my main body about this. Maybe I can get some answers?” Senior White pondered."]},{"number":2884,"title":"Chapter 2884: The Virtuous Lamia’s Rejection","paragraphs":["Chapter 2884: The Virtuous Lamia’s Rejection","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior White, why don’t you divine my fortune and see if my speculation is reliable?” Song Shuhang suddenly had an idea.","All he had to do was write “yes,” “no,” and “other” on the divination sticks and ask Senior White to draw lots for divination. He might be able to get the answer he wanted!","“You’re really quick-witted,” Pavilion Master Chu said, somewhat dazed—Tyrannical Song always revealed his strange wisdom in some unexpected places.","“We’ll try it later,” Senior White didn’t refuse. After all, it was just a casual draw.","As he spoke, he looked at the tiny “particle of eternal aura” suppressed by Daoist Priest Virtue. This tiny thing was the source of the “Stellar-Destroying Virus.”","Song Shuhang also looked at the “virus particle” and said, “Immortal Daoist Virtue entrusted the future to Senior White. He probably wants Senior White to get rid of this ‘destruction virus’ and clean up the mess he left behind.”","“He entrusted it to Heavenly Dao White,” Senior White said. “Additionally, from Daoist Priest Virtue’s message, it seems the ‘net of virtue’ he left behind can’t suppress these viruses forever. Moreover, it won’t last for long.”","However, he did not know how long this “not long” was.","After Daoist Priest Virtue, the Heavenly Dao changed, and two eras, the White Heavenly Dao and the Heavenly Dao Sphere, occurred.","The two great eras far exceeded the concept of “not long.”","So, how long could the Merit Net last?","If they were lucky, the virus might only break out in a few years, decades, or even centuries. If they were unlucky, the virus might break out in a few days or even immediately.","“What worries me even more is that if Daoist Priest Virtue left a message for ‘White of the Heavenly Axiom,’ then the safety period of the ‘Virtue Net’ he set is likely to be calculated after ‘White of the Heavenly Axiom’ took office,” Pavilion Master Chu reminded him calmly.","The Merit Net had probably already passed its shelf life.","“By the way, didn’t Senior White discover the ‘star destruction virus’?” Song Shuhang looked at Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and asked. With Senior White’s active personality, it was impossible for him not to notice the Eternal Star Destruction Virus, right?","“In fact, I don’t know much about what happened after my lord vindicated the Dao. You must know that before my master vindicated his Dao, the phoenix of the beast cultivation world borrowed the sacred mountain that suppressed the beast cultivation world. After my master became undying, he suddenly came to my side and left a message for Hegemon White,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet replied.","“The last time we met, he didn’t mention anything about the virus,” Senior White said slowly.","“I’ve never heard him mention it either,” Song Shuhang rubbed his eyebrows. The last time he saw White Wielder of the Will, he remembered that he was looking at the future with the eyes of a god. During this time, Senior White did not mention anything else.","“Perhaps... in Senior White’s era, these ‘star destruction viruses’ were in the incubation period?” Pavilion Master Chu pondered and speculated.","The fact that the “Eternal Stars” of the universe were filled with viruses definitely couldn’t be hidden from the eyes of the current Wielder of the Will.","From the message left behind by Daoist Priest Virtue, it could be seen that Daoist Priest Virtue had reversed karma in the end, and during that time, he might have cleaned up the ‘destruction virus’ in the stars of the myriad worlds.","Only the ‘Immortal Destruction Virus’ that was created from the true ‘eternal body’ remained. It could not be wiped out by the Heavenly Dao’s authority.","This part of the virus might not be a lot. After Bai Tiandao took office, it had been in the incubation period and did not attract his attention.","Pavilion Master Chu made a guess based on the clues left behind by Daoist Priest Virtue.","This should be the closest speculation to the truth.","“Then, in the era of the fat ball boss... after finding the right opportunity, the virus will start spreading again?” Song Shuhang continued to speculate.","The fat ball boss was different from the Heavenly Dao in the past. After it vindicated Dao, its main body was lacking. Halfway through, it would enter the ‘mechanized program’ stage, becoming a mechanical body that carried out the duties of the Wielder of the Will according to the program.","The ‘star destruction virus’ might have seized this opportunity and started to spread wantonly.","The fat ball boss’s mechanical state at that time was a good opportunity for many people.","“So, this is the fault of the Scholarly Sage?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","“Bei Daidai ~ Yiya ~ Zha!” Fairy Creation appeared and waved her fist at Fellow Daoist Stone.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet shrank his body in fear, turning into a small token and hanging on Song Shuhang’s waist.","“In short, let’s get rid of this thing first,” Senior White said.","Although this ‘virus particle’ was suppressed by Daoist Priest Virtue’s remaining power, this wasn’t the main world. Without the support of the ‘Merit Web,’ Daoist Priest Virtue’s power would eventually dissipate.","“Right, Merit Net!” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and brought out Fairy @#%×. “Fairy Virtue,” he asked, “do you have a plan?”","In this world, only Fairy Virtue, Sage Monarch Melon Eater, and the master and disciple of the Almighty Merchant could enter and exit that mysterious net of virtue at will.","In the past, Song Shuhang didn’t expect that this ‘net of virtue’ that covered the myriad worlds would actually protect the myriad worlds and suppress the virus.","Fairy? blinked and fell into deep thought, as if she were organizing her words.","A moment later, Fairy opened her mouth and reported a string of names. “The path to immortality... Dual System Virtue Technique... Eat melons...”","“Could it be that the blank path to immortality in the Merit Net is a way to deal with it? We have to wait for Senior Melon Eater to attain immortality?” Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","To be honest, even with the complete path to immortality, Senior Melon Eater couldn’t achieve immortality in a few years. It was very likely that it would take more than a hundred years, or even longer.","The path of cultivation was one step at a time.","It would take a very long time to accumulate the power from the initial Tribulation Transcender realm to the peak of the Tribulation Transcender realm.","While he was looking forward to Senior Melon Eater attaining immortality, Song Shuhang might as well look forward to himself. At the very least, he would be able to attain immortality earlier than Senior Melon Eater.","“Fairy Virtue, why don’t you try the path to immortality?” Song Shuhang’s heart suddenly moved. The virtuous lamia was now in the ‘weak Immortal’ realm under the push of his enormous power of virtue.","Once she grasped the blank path to immortality, she could become a new Immortal in a short period of time.","The virtuous lamia shook her head.","During the ancient Heavenly City era, she did not choose to inherit this path to immortality. The current her still wouldn’t inherit it.","“Looks like there’s something hidden behind this. Or is this path to immortality very costly?” Song Shuhang guessed.","“Speaking of which... so the Dual System Virtue Technique and the path to immortality were left behind by Daoist Priest Virtue?”","When they first came into contact with the Dual System Virtue Technique, Song Shuhang and the others felt that the creator of this technique stood at an extraordinary height and created this technique from the perspective of overlooking everything in the world.","It turned out that this was the creation of this cultivation technique from the perspective of the Heavenly Dao!"]},{"number":2885,"title":"Chapter 2885: White’s Decision","paragraphs":["Chapter 2885: White’s Decision","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Though for unknown reasons, the “Heavenly Dao Technique” was incomplete, only reaching the eighth realm.","Nevertheless, the “Worldly Dual Virtue Merit Art” still possessed many extraordinary divine abilities.","Both the Virtuous Lamia and the Sage Monarch Melon Eater, practitioners of this technique, had obtained the authority to enter the “Merit Network.”","Not to mention the blank “Path to Immortality” hidden within this merit network.","There was a time when Song Shuhang suspected that the “Almighty Merchant” might have left behind this path to immortality—after all, the Almighty Merchant was equally mysterious, with a body full of intriguing points.","Now, it seemed that this “Path to Immortality” and the “Worldly Dual Virtue Merit Art” cultivated by the Virtuous Lamia were both left behind by Daoist Priest Virtue.","It was even possible that the Almighty Merchant was connected to Daoist Priest Virtue!","“If we think along these lines, there might be some clues,” speculated Song Shuhang. “For instance, maintaining this merit network definitely requires a stable energy supply. This network spans across myriad worlds, so the consumption must be immense. And the Almighty Merchant, zealously collecting spirit stones and spirit veins... could it be related to this?”","Thinking this way, the Almighty Merchant was simply an unsung hero quietly safeguarding world peace and making money.","It touched her slightly.","Senior White was speechless.","He felt Song Shuhang was overthinking it. The reason why the ‘Almighty Merchant’ was fervently earning money shouldn’t be to replenish the consumption of the merit network. The reason was simple—after all, even if the ‘Almighty Merchant’ earned a large amount of spirit stones every second, it wouldn’t be enough to sustain the merit network.","The vast merit network that covered the myriad worlds consumed an enormous amount of energy, far beyond what spirit stones could support.","“The power left behind by Daoist Priest Virtue is starting to weaken,” warned Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","Without the “Merit Network” to provide continued energy, the image of Daoist Priest Virtue before them began to fade, unable to suppress the virus particles for long.","“Why don’t we just let it explode? After all, this is the Heavenly Dao’s small black room,” Pavilion Master Chu suggested absentmindedly.","As long as Senior White took Song Shuhang away, the virus particles could explode to their heart’s content.","“Whether it explodes or not is secondary. Our main purpose in coming here is to study how to deal with this virus and find a solution,” said Song Shuhang. “After all, we can’t let Senior White send all the virus-infected ‘stars’ in the universe into the Heavenly Dao’s small black room.”","Senior White extended his hand towards the virus particle, quickly attempting various seals to see which would be effective against the virus.","Senior White had mastered many types of seals: spatial seals, elemental seals, seals on objects, and surface-sealing techniques...","Hundreds of sealing techniques flashed over the virus particle, but none had much effect.","Senior White withdrew his hand and said slowly, “We need to attain the Dao of the Heavenly Dao.”","Anything related to the aura of undying would suppress anything that wasn’t undying. To target the undying, one needed the same level of undying power.","“An undying needs another undying to suppress it, and... even if we find a way to solve the virus, it’s impossible to solve all the viruses in the stars of the universe in a short time,” Senior White pondered.","In the universe, there were big and small worlds. The small ones might only be a planetary system, while the big ones might encompass an entire vast universe.","In the vast universe, stars were endless.","If one were to deal with them one by one, the time required was simply incalculable.","Only by attaining immortality and becoming the Dao of the Heavenly Dao could one use the authority of the Heavenly Dao to suppress and expel the virus in a short period of time.","“Senior White, are you going to attain the Dao?” Song Shuhang looked at Senior White.","“In comparison... actually, I hope you can attain the Dao. White Two probably thinks the same as me,” Senior White suddenly said.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Senior White and Senior White Two actually had such high expectations of me?","“However, the Heavenly Dao Seat has too many unstable elements. Our understanding of the Heavenly Dao is still too limited. According to our current understanding, the Heavenly Dao Seat isn’t as peaceful as we imagine. It’s a big pit. So... I don’t want you to attain immortality,” Senior White added.","The more one understood about undying, the more its instability became apparent.","Clearly, it was ‘indestructible.’ Even if the world was destroyed, the Immortal Heavenly Dao could still exist. But the Heavenly Daos of past generations had changed.","The Immortal Seat wasn’t as good as everyone thought.","Considering this, Senior White didn’t want Song Shuhang to get involved in such trouble.","“Therefore, if we really want to attain the Dao... we have to consider the clues left behind by Heavenly Dao White, right?” Song Shuhang rolled up his sleeves, retracting the ‘Defiant Whale Glove’ on his right hand, revealing his fingers.","Now that his strength had reached the Ninth Stage Realm, Song Shuhang had a clear grasp of the secret appraisal technique. Even if he wasn’t wearing gloves, he wouldn’t accidentally activate the secret appraisal technique when his fingers touched an object.","The reason he had been wearing this glove was partly out of habit and partly because the ‘Defiant Whale Tool Spirit Fairy’ lived in it. Song Shuhang preferred to let her observe the outside world and grow.","“Two different individuals attaining the Dao simultaneously,” Senior White said slowly.","It sounded simple, but he still had no idea how to execute it.","“Is the method Shuhang used to get pregnant feasible?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","“An individual attaining the Dao must at least reach the level of a Tribulation Transcender who has condensed their own embryonic form of the Great Dao. Without that level, you don’t even have the qualifications to attain immortality,” Song Shuhang explained.","Getting pregnant wasn’t actually feasible.","“What about the ghost spirit? Although the ghost spirit and its master are technically the same entity, Senior Song’s ghost spirit is somewhat different, right?” Black Panther suggested.","“But my ghost fairy spirit still isn’t considered two complete entities,” Song Shuhang said, pressing his finger onto the ‘virus particle’ and activating his appraisal.","‘A virus clone created from an object tainted with an immortal aura... This is a subsidiary body of the Immortal Virus Mother.’","‘Solution: The Emperor Destroying Pillar can devour a small portion of the ‘Immortal Aura Virus Spawn’. Other solutions: Unknown.’","‘Note: Please do not come into direct contact with the virus.’","Song Shuhang replied, “The absorption capacity of the Emperor Destruction Pillar is limited... Are there any other solutions?”","As for the warning not to come into direct contact with the virus, Song Shuhang already had a method to deal with that.","He lightly flicked his finger, shedding a layer of glove-like skin.","He had prepared to shed his skin when coming into contact with the virus."]},{"number":2886,"title":"Chapter 2886: The Perfect Cooperation Between White and Song","paragraphs":["Chapter 2886: The Perfect Cooperation Between White and Song","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Don’t throw it around!” Pavilion Master Chu’s voice reminded him from above.","If he threw his body parts around like this, the giant turtles of disaster would cry. From this perspective, Song Shuhang, with his powerful self-healing ability, posed more of a headache for the giant turtles of disaster than Skylark.","Skylark’s parts usually remained behind after her death.","On the other hand, Song Shuhang could continually shed parts in his daily life, and he even had a hobby of digging out his own eyeballs.","If this continued, the workload of the giant turtle of disaster would increase tenfold.","“Don’t worry, Senior Pavilion Master Chu. I know what to do. Besides, I won’t let anything go to waste,” Song Shuhang said.","He was a man who knew how to maximize the value of everything. Whatever fell into his hands, he could make the best use of it!","Furthermore, he couldn’t afford to waste the things he shed.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and utilized his versatile spiritual energy. The ‘glove’ that had been discarded closed around his wrist, transforming into a sealed ‘handbag.’","Soon after, the aura around Song Shuhang’s body intensified, and his immortal essence surged.","“What are you doing?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","“Senior White!” Song Shuhang suddenly shouted.","Beside him, Senior White swiftly drew his sword and slashed at the ‘virus of undying energy.’","Earlier, Senior White had applied hundreds of sealing techniques to this ‘virus,’ but none had affected it. Moreover, the residual power of Daoist Priest Virtue was weakening the virus’s suppression. It seemed Senior White could no longer do anything to the virus particles.","As Senior White’s sword slashed down, hundreds of sealing runes appeared near the virus, suppressing it.","Senior White’s sword qi descended!","The virus particles, originally as small as sand, were split apart by the sword qi and shattered into even smaller pieces.","At this moment, the hundred sealing runes surged forward, each combining with the last bit of Daoist Priest Virtue’s power to contain the scattered ‘virus particles.’","Unless it was a true undying, it would remain shattered.","However, even after being divided into hundreds of pieces, Senior White’s seal couldn’t completely contain these ‘virus particles’ and could only temporarily restrain them.","Pavilion Master Chu was bewildered.","She couldn’t comprehend what Immortal White and Song Shuhang were doing.","Moreover, why did it feel like there was an extraordinary unspoken understanding between Immortal White and Song Shuhang?","Was Senior White’s sword strike clearly intended to synchronize with Song Shuhang?","“Perfect timing!” At this moment, Song Shuhang suddenly raised his hand, as if performing radio calisthenics... Or as if he were removing his clothes.","The next moment, he employed the ‘Tyrannical Song Molting’ technique, stunning Pavilion Master Chu.","When he had entered the Wielder’s small black room, Song Shuhang’s body had been infected by the virus.","However, the Eternal Star Destruction Virus could only move on the surface of Song Shuhang’s skin, causing it to turn red. It couldn’t penetrate deeper into his body.","In other words, Tyrannical Song’s Skin could block this virus to some extent.","Just now, after Song Shuhang had shed the skin on his right hand and sealed the ‘wrist’ part, the infected ‘virus’ couldn’t even escape.","Only undyings could deal with undyings.","He could also use a pseudo undying to confront them!","Song Shuhang’s body possessed the attributes of ‘pseudo-immortality’ and ‘infected by the aura of immortality.’","After removing the complete ‘Tyrannical Song skin,’ the virtuous lamia automatically appeared and spread the wings at her waist, shielding Song Shuhang to prevent exposure.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and hurled the ‘Tyrannical Song Shedding Skin’ at the virus particles that had been shattered into hundreds of pieces and sealed.","The virus particles were covered by Tyrannical Song’s skin.","The ‘Shedding Gloves’ flew over and connected to Tyrannical Song’s skin.","“Are you planning to use your molting to seal the virus particles?” Pavilion Master Chu asked, puzzled.","“No, of course not that simple. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have asked Senior White to help me destroy the virus.” Song Shuhang formed a seal with his right hand, and the space between his eyebrows began to glow.","Only after the ‘virus particle’ had been shattered, sealed, and then covered by Tyrannical Song’s skin could the next step proceed!","“Take it. This is my final fortune” The ‘Throne of Wealth’ on Song Shuhang’s right hand glowed.","The divine third eye opened.","Krypton Gold Strike!","Hua","Tyrannical Song was attracted to the mark of the Throne of Wealth and merged into the small vortex in Song Shuhang’s right hand.","The precious ‘false Immortal’s skin, the Eternal Star Destruction Virus, the source of the Immortal aura virus, and the power of virtue left behind by Daoist Priest Virtue’ were all transformed by the vortex!","“It’s done.” Song Shuhang laughed.","Once it became Tyrannical Song’s ‘treasure,’ it would fall within the range of the paywall!","After being split, the virus particles temporarily sealed would not be able to resist during the sealing period, fulfilling the premise of ‘pay-to-win.’","Although there weren’t many treasures in this wave, their quality was extremely high!","Daoist Priest Virtue was the Immortal Wielder of the Will. The virus was contaminated with the aura of immortality, and Tyrannical Song’s molting also possessed the aura of immortality and a pseudo-immortal state.","Every single treasure was connected to undying.","The vortex began to condense, transforming into a dot of light on Song Shuhang’s fingertip!","“Divine Strike-Krypton Gold Strike!” Song Shuhang said slowly.","Accompanied by the divine strike, his voice turned into thunder that reverberated in the Wielder’s small black room.","The virtuous lamia made a praying gesture with both hands and floated behind Song Shuhang, using her wings to shield him.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song was like a legendary deity descending.","The third eye moved, and the Scholarly Sage’s eye also focused on a certain spot in the Wielder’s small black room.","Song Shuhang’s finger suddenly changed direction and pointed at the spot where the divine third eye and the Scholarly Sage’s eye were locked.","Hong","The radiance of the Divine Strike pierced through space.","Under this attack, the world changed.","At this moment, the entire world was left with only this dazzling radiance—a radiance infused with strands of immortal power!","Under the illumination of this light, a tiny figure appeared in a corner of the Wielder’s small black room.","It was the image of a tiny illusory sun.","The illusory sun also projected ‘gazes.’","Its gaze was fixed on the radiance of the Divine Strike, unable to shift away.","The light of the ‘Krypton Gold Strike’ landed on its body.","The illusory sun shattered... Without resistance, it was directly obliterated.","On the side.","Senior White extended his hand and gently lifted his arm, concealing Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit inside.","A Tyrant God Pillar emerged.","Overlord God Pillar Longevity Pillar Series-Void Sun Pillar!","It was the ‘Virtual Sun Pillar’ that Song Shuhang had condensed after Senior White, Song Shuhang, Fairy Skylark, and Immortal Fairy White Bones had annihilated the Illusory Rising Sun in the Dream Realm.","This Void Sun Pillar instantly elongated, its tip landing on the spot where the Divine Strike had erupted.","The shattered fragments of the illusory sun were absorbed by the Void Sun Pillar.","Virtual Sun Pillar Growth +1","The collaboration between Senior White and Song Shuhang was flawless."]},{"number":2887,"title":"Chapter 2887: The Last New Year","paragraphs":["Chapter 2887: The Last New Year","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The sudden wave of coordinated attacks left no trace of prior communication.","Even Pavilion Master Chu, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Black Panther, and the others didn’t realize when Song Shuhang and Senior White had started their collaboration.","“Phew” Song Shuhang raised his finger and lightly blew the smoke off his fingertips. “With enough money, I’ll even blow up a god for you to see!”","“That line is great, but now it’s mine!” the virtuous lamia recited.","“Mine!” Fairy Creation followed up.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Senior White beckoned and recalled the Divine Overlord Pillar, now shining even brighter after its reinforcement it was part of the growth series and had limitless potential!","“Was the one blown up by the Krypton Gold just now the ‘Void Sun Big Boss’? He doesn’t seem completely dead!” Black Panther said.","“When did you guys notice the trace of that ‘Void Sun’?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet couldn’t help but inquire—he hadn’t sensed anything at all.","“And when did you decide to cooperate? Was it when Senior White started using the sealing technique?” Pavilion Master Chu asked simultaneously.","“From the moment it took advantage of the chaos caused by the sun’s explosion and sneaked into the ‘Heavenly Path Small Black Room World’ behind the passage we opened, I sensed it,” Song Shuhang said, gently patting the Sun Pillar.","With the Void Sun Pillar in hand, even if the Void Sun Big Boss hid well, it couldn’t escape.","Similarly, with the Pillar of Heavenly Axiom, even if the Demon Emperor wanted to sneak up on Song Shuhang in the future, it would be impossible.","“Are we chopping up the ‘viruses’ to maximize their value for Krypton Gold?” Soft Feather asked.","Senior White replied, “Yes, if we don’t chop them up... sealing them won’t be easy.”","“After sealing them properly, I can destroy them all at once. Otherwise, if they explode halfway, they won’t count as raw materials for Krypton Gold,” Song Shuhang added.","“Is the ‘Void Sun Big Boss’ related to the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet calmly speculated.","The Void Sun seemed to have some responsibility in the Dream Realm. For so many years, it had ruthlessly killed the assemblies of laws in the Dream Realm to prevent the emergence of a Sector Lord. Moreover, it guarded the Dream Realm as if protecting something important.","It seemed the Dream Realm was a crucial part of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ plan!","“The Dream Realm is a very unique plane world. Though not large, it connects to myriad worlds. Inner demons can influence cultivators across various worlds through the Dream Realm... Perhaps the Dream Realm was originally a hub or springboard for the spread of the Stellar Destruction Virus,” Senior White said slowly.","“In other words, Senior White, by completing the ‘God Creation Plan’ in the Dream Realm and creating the World Tree, you coincidentally disrupted a crucial part of the ‘Myriad Worlds Destruction Plan’?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","‘Senior White’s luck also plays a part in this coincidence.’","A few days ago, Senior White had been eager to complete the ‘God Creation Plan’. He wasn’t just trying to transcend his tribulation and become a Tribulation Transcender as soon as possible, but also disrupt the universe’s destruction process.","Perhaps the influence of the Dream Realm went even deeper.","“In short, we must firmly control the Dream Realm from now on. We cannot allow anyone else to interfere,” Song Shuhang said solemnly.","“Don’t worry. Any beings in the myriad worlds who dared to steal from my master have all met their ends!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said confidently.","“Senior White, I hope I haven’t stolen anything from you, right?” Song Shuhang suddenly felt anxious.","Senior White couldn’t help but laugh and shake his head.","“Also, Shuhang, besides scouting for the Stellar Destruction Virus, we need to keep an eye on this ‘Void Sun’. Apart from the Dream Realm, it likely has other clones or incarnations in other worlds and planes,” Senior White reminded.","“Alright, I’ll see if I can contact Song Pangqiu later to keep an eye on this,” Song Shuhang nodded. “I feel like we might uncover the clues we need from this ‘Void Sun’.”","The Void Sun seemed connected to the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’.","Song Shuhang wanted to follow this thread to find useful information.","With that said, he placed his hand on the Sun Pillar. With a smooth motion, he performed a hundred rounds of the Blade Nurturing Technique as a reward for the Pillar’s meritorious service.","“I’ll document the experimental data of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ this time... Shuhang, I’ll give you a copy of the data later to pass on to White Hegemon of Netherworld, see if he can come up with more useful plans,” Senior White said.","“No problem,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“And then... it will be time for New Year’s once they return. After the New Year, I need to go into seclusion,” Senior White said softly.","“How long do you plan to seclude yourself this time?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Don’t worry, it won’t be for long this time. I need to contemplate the feasibility of two different individuals vindicating their Dao simultaneously. I’m quite content with my current life, so... I don’t want this universe to just disappear,” Senior White said.","Ever since he advanced to Rank-9, he had refused to go back. He intended to stay here forever.","If he couldn’t figure out the possibility of two different individuals vindicating their Dao at the same time, then he would attempt to vindicate his own Dao.","To be honest, the Immortal Heavenly Dao seemed rather intriguing.","“I understand... Then after the New Year, I’ll also go into seclusion,” Song Shuhang said firmly.","‘If I can’t figure out the plan left behind by Senior White, perhaps I should try to prove my immortality?’","Since he began cultivating, he had always felt his realm advancing rapidly. Even if he didn’t actively pursue it, his cultivation progressed quickly—it was a fact.","Perhaps... Was he also like Lady Onion, possessing the potential of the Heavenly Dao?","‘Maybe this year’s New Year will be the last one I celebrate.’","The thought flashed through his mind.","In his Heart Aperture, the ghost spirit fairy seemed to sense his thoughts and fell into deep contemplation.","The thoughts sensed by the ghost spirit fairy were transmitted back to that ‘special world’.","Inside the special world.","Ye Si slowly closed the book.","Beside her, an ethereal figure lay motionless on the ground.","“Something on your mind?” the ethereal figure asked.","“Yeah, I want to return to the main world,” Ye Si said.","“What for?” the figure asked.","“New Year,” Ye Si replied.","“Oh... New Year,” the figure turned around. “Go ahead. What’s the name of Shuhang’s third corpse again? Anyway, cooperating with him might allow you to make an appearance in the main world.”"]},{"number":2888,"title":"Chapter 2888: Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, Eighth Revolution!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2888: Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, Eighth Revolution!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the small black room of the Heavenly Dao.","Behind him, the dimensional space passage that connected the mortal world and the Heavenly Prison had returned to its original state.","However, Lady Onion, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, Song Shuhang’s clone, and Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword had not emerged.","The disaster giant turtle lady and Father Turtle waited silently at the passage.","Due to her heavy thoughts, Soft Feather wasn’t as lively as usual. Instead, she sat calmly on Senior Turtle’s body.","“I just felt Tyrannical Song seemed to have thrown out some parts,” the disaster giant turtle lady suddenly remarked.","Father Turtle nodded. “I had the same sensation for a moment... Tyrannical Song died once?”","The father and daughter exchanged glances, their eyes filled with bitterness. The Disaster Giant Turtle Clan would probably have to work overtime in the future.","As they spoke, two sword lights flew out of the dimensional space passage ahead.","Song Shuhang and Senior White returned to the mortal world—their somewhat blurry presence fully restored.","Behind them, the strange dimensional space passage gradually closed, shrank, and quickly disappeared.","“Senior Giant Turtle, please don’t talk nonsense. I’m not dead,” Song Shuhang said.","He was perfectly alive and kicking, in good health!","“Then what about the smell of the components we sensed just now?” the disaster giant turtle lady asked.","Song Shuhang waved his hand. “Don’t worry. It’s just parts of my body that I voluntarily threw out. I won’t trouble you. I’ve already found a good way to handle my ‘parts’ and make the best use of them.”","“Make the best use of them?” the disaster giant turtle lady looked puzzled.","“As long as it’s valuable, I can utilize it,” Song Shuhang cryptically replied. “My parts are no exception.”","The disaster giant turtle was stunned by Tyrannical Song’s words. It seemed Tyrannical Song had used a very impressive method to recycle these ‘parts’?","Should he let ‘Fairy Skylark’ learn this technique from Song Shuhang and lighten her clan’s burden?","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","What was there to be proud of?","This method was quite terrifying, alright?","“If I hadn’t stayed by your side for a while and gotten used to it, I probably wouldn’t have been able to adapt to the style of this horror movie,” Pavilion Master Chu muttered.","“By the way, Disaster Giant Turtle Fairy... I’ll send you a copy of the experimental data regarding the Stellar Destruction Virus shortly. Additionally, I hope the Disaster Giant Turtle Clan can help us find the mastermind behind the creation of the Stellar Virus,” Song Shuhang said.","Upon hearing this, the disaster giant turtle lady subconsciously wanted to refuse—cooperate with Tyrannical Song? Impossible!","She hadn’t forgotten about her lost shell!","Before they could cooperate, she had been duped out of her body.","After the cooperation, wouldn’t her turtle body be scammed away?","That’s why she refused!","But before she could refuse, Father Turtle nodded and agreed, “It involves the object with the aura of immortality and is related to our duty. In this matter, our Disaster Giant Turtle Clan will assist you.”","“In this regard, I will engage in ‘information sharing’ with the Disaster Giant Turtle Clan, hoping to obtain more useful clues,” Song Shuhang nodded.","Having said that, he looked around, preparing to take Soft Feather, Senior Turtle, Lady Onion, and the others back.","However, after scanning the area, he couldn’t find any trace of Lady Onion.","“Where’s Lady Onion?” Song Shuhang asked.","Father Turtle suddenly extended his claws towards Song Shuhang, handing him several pieces of Dao Comprehension Stone fragments.","These fragmented Dao Comprehension Stones also had the effect of enhancing comprehension, albeit weaker than a whole Dao Comprehension Stone.","Song Shuhang took the fragments of Dao Comprehension Stones and caught the scent of Lady Onion.","“Senior Song, after Lady Onion’s Stellar Virus exploded, she was swept away by the black hole vortex formed by the dimensional passage... Your clone was also swept away,” Soft Feather raised her head and said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","After the illusory sun exploded, he sent his clone and Senior Mental Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword back to the Dream Realm, hoping his clone could inform Soft Feather and the others of the accident and assist them in resisting the explosion’s power.","Later, Soft Feather messaged him, inquiring about the clone.","At that time, Song Shuhang had lost contact with his clone, but he hadn’t paid much attention. Like the Virtuous Lamia, he could simply use a technique to condense it again after its death.","However, he hadn’t expected Lady Onion to lose contact along with his clone.","“He fell into the vortex of that dimensional space. I’m afraid his chances aren’t good,” Father Turtle said slowly.","Upon hearing this, Soft Feather felt disheartened.","This time, she had truly suffered a blow.","‘In the future, I will never let something like this happen again!’ Young Soft Feather swore silently in her heart.","“Don’t panic... Lady Onion is a little fairy with great luck. Let me check her status first!” Song Shuhang said calmly.","As a man who had weathered countless storms, maintaining calmness in any situation was basic.","As he spoke, Song Shuhang pulled up his friend list in the ‘Cultivation Chat’, checking Lady Onion’s status.","At the same time, he attempted to activate the process of the ‘Clone Mystic Technique’—this attempt wouldn’t actually cancel the previous clone. Instead, it would confirm whether his ‘clone’ was still alive.","Song Shuhang formed a hand seal and cast the spell, then frowned.","He felt that his ‘Clone Mystic Technique’ seemed to have been silenced by some skill and couldn’t be activated.","Thus, he couldn’t confirm the status of his previous clone.","Moreover, he couldn’t even cancel his clone and create another one.","‘This feeling is so familiar... What a strong sense of déjà vu.’ Song Shuhang raised his head, gazing at the sky with inexplicable melancholy in his heart.","As he spoke, he swiped open his friend list and checked Lady Onion’s location.","In the ‘Cultivation Chat’, there was a status bar in the friend list, and this status bar was the most straightforward.","Through this status bar, Song Shuhang could see whether his friends were alive, dead, dead beyond resurrection, or in the process of resurrection.","[Future Successor of the Motherland] Lady Onion, status (offline).","Song Shuhang was confused.","I understand what ‘offline’ means, but what does it mean here?","Was she dead? Alive? Or resurrecting after death?","Song Shuhang tried to send a message to Lady Onion, [Lady Onion, where are you?]","However, with Lady Onion offline, there was no reply.","“At least... it’s not marked directly as dead,” Song Shuhang said.","As long as there was no indication of death, there was still a glimmer of hope.","Song Shuhang reached out, took out a wooden saber, and inserted it into the Dream Realm, setting a coordinate.","He wanted to leave a coordinate here. Lady Onion and the others had disappeared from this spot.","Song Shuhang gently stabbed the Branded Wooden Saber into the ground.","Ding","When he stabbed the wooden saber into the ground, it seemed to hit something.","Song Shuhang lowered his head.","Then, he saw the familiar ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ burst out of the ground and transform into a burning phoenix.","Moreover... At this moment, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was already in the ‘Eighth Revolution’ state!"]},{"number":2889,"title":"Chapter 2889: The Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue – Song One","paragraphs":["Chapter 2889: The Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue – Song One","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, a Dao artifact, was the creation of Wielder of the Will Goudan’s father.","It was one of the few Dao artifacts that appeared in the myriad worlds.","From the immemorial era until now, it had many masters, each with their unique characteristics.","The owner of the saber was known in the cultivation world as part of the “Numerology Cultivators.”","Numerology Cultivation was not a specialized inheritance.","Each generation of Numerology Cultivators was a genius chosen by the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","In other words, the Numerology Cultivators could be Buddhists, Daoists, Confucians, members of the Demon Sect, or even mages from the western cultivation system. They could even be beast cultivators and dream masters from other planes.","There were nine seals on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and each seal increased its power by one grade.","Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue had refined the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber to the Seventh Transformation Realm before passing it on to Lady Onion, the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue.","Lady Onion’s cultivation talent was very strong, and her cultivation speed wasn’t slow either.","After obtaining a cultivation technique truly suitable for her and sufficient resources, she advanced two levels in just over eight months!","This advancement speed could be considered terrifying in the entire cultivation world.","But even so, she was still far from her goal of refining the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber to the Eighth Transformation and passing it on to the Ninth Cultivator.","To be honest, Song Shuhang had never expected to successfully take the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber from Lady Onion and become the true Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","In any case, even if the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had not been refined to rank eight and passed to him, he could still use it at any time and borrow its power.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber actively cooperated with him, so there was no obstacle when he used it.","But now, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had suddenly appeared in front of him in its Eighth Transformation form.","Song Shuhang was stunned for a long time. “Heavens, rank eight?”","The fact that the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was going to undergo the Eighth Transformation meant that Lady Onion had already refined it. Refining the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber to the Eighth Transformation required completing it at the moment of advancing from the Eighth Stage to the Ninth Stage!","Ninth Stage Lady Onion?","I must be dreaming!","No matter how much Song Shuhang’s imagination ran wild, he couldn’t picture the silly green onion twisting its body and using the “demoness’ charm” to take on the form of a Tribulation Transcender Onion.","“Chi ” In the sky, the rank eight Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber spread its wings and let out a cheerful cry.","It hovered above Song Shuhang’s head, releasing the pressure of its Dao treasure.","It was already rank eight. It only needed one more rank to complete rank nine and display the true power of a Dao weapon! It had been waiting for this day for far too long.","After circling once, the phoenix shrank and transformed back into the shape of a saber, hovering in front of Song Shuhang.","At this moment, layers of Dao patterns appeared on the rank eight blade.","These were Dao patterns inscribed by Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father, containing the secret of Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father’s escape. Once the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber completed the Ninth Transformation, this secret would be fully revealed!","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber floated in the air, pointing its hilt at Song Shuhang, waiting for him to grab it.","Soft Feather and Senior Turtle looked at the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and their hearts skipped a beat. If the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was still in the main world, then perhaps Scarlet Heaven Sword and Lady Onion were also in the main world?","“Is this the Eighth Transformation Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber?” Pavilion Master Chu looked at the saber in a daze.","“Shuhang, it’s waiting for you,” said Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“Yes,” Song Shuhang replied.","After thinking for a moment, he slowly reached out and grabbed the handle of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had reappeared after being lost. To learn about Lady Onion, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Song’s clone, which had disappeared with it, he could obtain this information by inheriting the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","Every Numerology Cultivator could read some information about the previous saber masters on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","If Lady Onion, the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, had truly refined the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, there should be some information left behind by her on it.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and grabbed the saber handle, choosing to carry out the inheritance of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue.","As soon as the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber came into contact with his hand, the saber and the person resonated simultaneously, and he easily entered the state of “Saber Man as One!”","Song Shuhang’s talent in saber techniques, the cooperation of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and the karma between Song Shuhang and Goudan’s father made him and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber a perfect match.","It could be said that in the myriad worlds, no one was more suitable than him to become the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue!","The raging flames spread on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and the flames transformed into lotus flowers that wrapped around Song Shuhang. Wielder of the Will Goudan’s father was not only obsessed with looks but also with lotus flowers. Many of the things it fiddled with were related to lotus flowers.","Inside Song Shuhang’s chest, the ghost fairy opened the window and took the initiative to get out. Then, she held Song Shuhang’s right hand with both hands and grasped the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","The Inner World resonated, and a projection of a lotus flower belonging to the Inner World appeared inside the flaming lotus, enveloping Song Shuhang.","The Lotus Blossoming Step function, which represented the innate skill of the world of the black lotus, automatically appeared and supported Song Shuhang’s feet.","The Lotus Blossoming Tongue skill that represented the world of the golden lotus was also activated, and countless fragrant lotus flowers appeared around Song Shuhang.","There were even Great Daos that began to resonate between heaven and earth. Through the resonance between the Great Daos, a name rang out: Cheng Goudan!","This was the Daoist name that Goudan’s father had personally given Song Shuhang and Cheng Lin, and at this moment, it was also related to the cause and effect.","Amidst all kinds of strange phenomena, a “contract” appeared on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","On it were the signatures of the “Numerology Cultivators” of past generations.","This included Song Shuhang, Lady Onion, Venerable Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, and Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue...","At this time, the signature of “Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue – Song One,” representing Song Shuhang, shone brightly.","“Song One? I remember that I left behind Tyrannical Saber Song One’s Dao name, right?” Song Shuhang was stunned.","However, no matter how the signature changed, the last owner of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was Tyrannical Song!","At this moment, all the Numerology Cultivators who were still alive in the myriad worlds felt something.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, which hadn’t been able to complete the Ninth Transformation Ultimate Mode since the immemorial era, had finally reached the hands of the Ninth Cultivator after all kinds of hardships!","Moreover, the Ninth Cultivator might be able to complete the refinement of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber very quickly.","Because this Ninth Cultivator was Tyrannical Song!","Song Shuhang didn’t let down the expectations of the past generations of Numerology Cultivators.","At the same time that he officially inherited the title of the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, he officially began the sacrificial refinement of the last transformation.","An endless stream of immortal elemental energy poured into the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber from Song Shuhang’s hand.","The good corpse dominated the good, the evil corpse dominated the evil, and the self-corpse dominated the balance? He stepped out of the three flowers above Song Shuhang’s head.","The Three Separations Slaying Secret Technique allowed Song Shuhang to reach the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm before he finished transcending the heavenly tribulation of the Ninth Stage.","After that, Song Shuhang, who had gone through the “Thousand Days Tribulation” with Senior White, would be able to advance a step further!","And now was the time.","The Ninth Transformation of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber required the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue to complete the refinement of the saber the moment he broke through to the Ninth Stage Realm.","Song Shuhang’s current realm allowed him to steadily drive the car. Although the speed wasn’t fast, it was steadily approaching the limit of the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm.","According to Senior Three-Eyed’s previous speculation, Song Shuhang had a chance to break through the limits of the Tribulation Transcender Realm and reach the level of a “weak Immortal.”"]},{"number":2890,"title":"Chapter 2890: Call Me Song One","paragraphs":["Chapter 2890: Call Me Song One","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Song Shuhang was refining the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, the immortal essence of the Tribulation Transcender circulated once inside the saber. Then, more than half of the consumed immortal essence was returned.","The amount of immortal essence that was sent back was reduced by more than half, but the quality had increased significantly.","After all, Song Shuhang already had a ghost spirit, and every ton of immortal elemental energy in his body would be refined and purified by the ghost spirit. The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber could actually purify his immortal essence a second time on this basis!","In addition, the feedback immortal essence also contained some information about the Dao pattern.","This information was a key—the key to deciphering the information on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","As the process of refining the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber continued, the data of these Dao patterns became more and more complete.","Song Shuhang, who was in the state of “Saber Man as One,” had a huge advantage in deciphering Dao patterns.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber would take the initiative to cooperate with him and decipher the Dao patterns on the saber.","Behind him, the ghost fairy spirit and the Inner World could provide assistance to Song Shuhang.","At this moment, Song Shuhang’s brain seemed to have been blessed. The secrets of the Dao patterns on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber were continuously developed and understood by him.","Eight Dao patterns on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had already been unsealed, and the ninth Dao pattern was slowly being released as Song Shuhang refined it.","Each of the eight Dao patterns that had been unsealed contained some techniques left behind by Wielder of the Will Goudan’s father. They were all techniques to strengthen the energy in one’s body and increase energy control.","Some strengthened the energy defense in the body. After the second stage, the power in the cultivator’s body would automatically protect the body. From protective zhen qi to protective ling power to protective immortal essence, the first Dao pattern left behind by Goudan’s father was to strengthen control in this area.","There was a way to strengthen energy attacks. As long as one followed a certain circulation technique, the energy in one’s body would be attached with the effect of a Dao pattern when it was released, and finally, the effect would exceed the limit of one’s own realm!","Using a cultivator of the Fourth Stage as an example, if this technique was used, a cultivator of the Fourth Stage could rely on his true qi, which had been sublimated to the limit, to fight head-on with the spiritual energy of a cultivator of the Fifth Stage!","If a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender were to use this method, after the “Immortal Origin of a Tribulation Transcender” in their body sublimated to the limit, they would similarly be able to produce an effect that exceeded the limits of their Immortal Origin!","Other than the enhancement of defense and attack, there was also the extreme control of the energy in his body. This was a technique to accurately use every wisp of energy in his body so that the energy in his body would not be wasted.","Each of the eight Dao patterns contained information that was targeted at the most basic energy control and strengthening of cultivators.","For other cultivators, there might be many techniques that they couldn’t use, especially for cultivators who had advanced to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm or the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm. Their control over their own energy had already reached a microscopic level.","However, to Song Shuhang, the information contained in each of these eight Dao patterns was extremely precious. What Tyrannical Song lacked the most was the foundation...","Other cultivators might not have much to improve in this aspect. However, Song Shuhang still had a lot of room for improvement in this aspect!","Moreover, Song Shuhang knew that the things within these eight Dao patterns were all warm-ups.","In fact, the ninth Dao pattern might even be a warm-up segment left behind by Wielder of the Will Goudan’s father.","Only after the warm-up was completed would he be able to face the secrets of the Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father’s escape technique after gathering all nine Dao patterns.","The process of refining the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber was very stable. It progressed steadily and did not cause any accidents.","But... Song Shuhang wanted to get the information from the saber, but he couldn’t read it!","“There’s no information about the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue,” Song Shuhang said.","The information on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber regarding Lady Onion’s identity as the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue had only stopped at the moment when Lady Onion accepted the identity of the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue and obtained the inheritance of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","“Could it be that the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue has changed midway?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet guessed.","The number cultivation system would change a blademaster every time it changed. However, it did not mean that he could cultivate the saber to the next transformation without any worries just because he was chosen as the saber master.","The cultivation world was cruel. Even the blademaster could die in the middle of the journey.","This was especially true for cultivators who had to undergo the baptism of the heavenly tribulation every time they advanced a level. They might die halfway before they could complete the “saber worship.” In that case, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber would have no choice but to change its owner.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber had signed many “reserve digital cultivators” in the contract, and they were all reserve swordmasters.","“Lady Onion’s situation...It was too special. To be honest, I’m still a little confused even though I’m holding the “Eighth Revolution” Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,” Song Shuhang said.","After saying this, he gently knocked on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, and said, “Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, it’s always Lady Onion, right?”","Even if there was no information about the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber itself was a divine weapon with a spirit, and it was alive.","“Buzz” Although the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber couldn’t speak, it could transmit its meaning to Song Shuhang through the “saber-man unity” state.","It was Lady Onion!","The Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue had always been Lady Onion, and she was the one who had refined the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber to the eighth rank!","“So, Lady Onion didn’t die,” Song Shuhang said.","As for the “Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue’s information” in the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, it was very likely that Lady Onion didn’t want to leave a record, so she deleted it.","“Buzz” The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber once again transmitted its thoughts and used its answer to prove Song Shuhang’s guess.","As expected, Lady Onion had taken the initiative to delete the records regarding the Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue.","While answering Song Shuhang’s question, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber also used the “saber-man fusion” mode to betray the previous saber master, Lady Onion. It told Song Shuhang that the information regarding the “Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue” had been deleted.","It was as if he had been pulled into the trash bin, and the delete was complete.","However, this didn’t mean that these “messages” had been completely deleted.","Of course, this part of the “information” was not so easy to read.","As the Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue, if Song Shuhang wanted to read this part of the data, he would have to continue to increase the intimacy between him and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. The state of being one with the saber wasn’t enough, and he needed to go one step further!","“I see. To me...But it’s not a problem!” Song Shuhang laughed.","Then, he stretched out his head and swung his hand. His long hair condensed into more than 20 braided hands, which fell on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber at the same time.","In an instant, a warm light flashed and fell on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","“It’s out! Scumbag Song’s ultimate skill, Cheap Love!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet couldn’t help but exclaim.","The Saber Nurturing Technique relied on quantity to win, and the love in each saber nurturing technique was so cheap that it made one’s heart ache. However, under the effect of thousands of shots per second, even the cheapest Saber Nurturing Technique could accumulate to an explosive effect!","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber kept making cheerful chirps.","The speed at which the ninth pattern on the saber was unsealed seemed to have stepped on the accelerator and started to accelerate.","The signature of Ninth Cultivator of True Virtue Song One appeared once again.","This time, Pavilion Master Chu finally noticed the signature.","Song One?","“Who are you?”","“Tyrannical Saber Song...Oh, no.” The man in her memory raised his head and gritted his teeth.","“Call me Song One!”"]},{"number":2891,"title":"Chapter 2891 - 8.5-Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 2891: Chapter 8.5-Heavenly Dao","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was Song One, not Song One.","Although the pronunciation and meaning were the same...However, these were two different ways of writing.","A man’s mouth was a liar.","Pavilion Master Chu would at most believe a little of Slow-Witted Song’s recent secretive words. Among these two points, there was also one point for her friendship and trust.","She knew that Slow-Witted Song had his own difficulties, and there were some things that he couldn’t reveal at the moment...Therefore, Pavilion Master Chu didn’t ask too many questions.","Anyway, it was pointless to ask. There was no way to get the truth out of that guy’s mouth.","[What can be confirmed is... Song Shuhang isn’t anyone’s reincarnation or backup plan.] Even the Immortal Heavenly Dao and the ruler of the Netherworld had confirmed this many times.","However, this was the most troublesome part.","“Song One.” Pavilion Master Chu looked at the signature on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and called out softly.","“Tyrannical Saber Song One!” Song Shuhang immediately corrected him.” I wrote Tyrannical Saber Song One at that time, but later, the words ‘Tyrannical Saber’ faded. This is the daoist name Senior White gave me!”","“Yes, that’s my daoist name.” On the side, Senior White hid the bun he was eating behind his back and replied seriously.","“Shuhang...Tell me, do you have any clues?” “You know what clues I want to ask about,” Pavilion Master Chu suddenly said.","Song Shuhang’s arm, which was holding the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’, couldn’t help but stiffen.","“What kind of riddles are you talking about?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","Looking at Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.” Pavilion Master Chu,” he promised,” I happen to have the ‘Tomb of Nine Virtues’ here.” If you need it in the future, I’ll lend it to you!”","“Pow ” Pavilion Master Chu let out a bubbling sound.","In the living spring of the Inner World, Pavilion Master Chu’s main body only revealed half of her face, and her eyes were looking at the sky of the Inner World.","The headquarters of the special world [Heavenly Dao Must Step Down Alliance].","The members of the Alliance were gathered together again today.","“I didn’t expect the current Heavenly Dao to die so easily.” A golden monk sat on the palm of a huge muscular Vajra statue. He clasped his hands together as if he had let go of the obsession in his heart. His entire aura became ethereal. Even the Immortal halo above his head became merciful.","“Congratulations on obtaining your wish, Fellow Daoist.” On the scholarly scholar statue, Daozi held a scroll in his hand and congratulated the golden monk.","The monks of the Titanium Temple had an old grudge with the deceased Heavenly Dao. The Titanium Temple had lost its inheritance in the cultivation world. Even if the Heavenly Dao was not destroyed, the Titanium Temple would not dare to reopen its inheritance.","This was also the reason why the masters of the Titanium Temple had joined the Heavenly Dao Must Step Down Alliance.","Now, the Heavenly Dao had inexplicably collapsed during Tyrannical Song’s tribulation speech, and Tyrannical Song had obtained the special Sage Name ‘Tyrannical Annihilation’. The Heavenly Dao dissipated, and the karma and obsession of the monks of the Titanium Temple disappeared.","Recently, the great master of Titanium Temple, who had been in a good mood, had even taken the initiative to become a ‘boastful troll army’ and bragged about Tyrannical Song. Because the Heavenly Dao had died while Tyrannical Song was giving a speech, the great master of Titanium Temple had a good impression of Tyrannical Song!","He wanted to blow up Tyrannical Song.","Ye Si was sitting on the statue of Empress Cheng Lin.","“Now that the Heavenly Dao has collapsed, why don’t we change the name of the Heavenly Dao Alliance!” Ye Si impatiently suggested.","She had wanted to change this name for a long time, and today was the right time.","” Fairy Little Ye Si, names are fleeting. It doesn’t matter what you call yourself.” On the statue of a Daoist priest next door, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven stroked his beard and said with a smile,” What’s important is, who will vindicate the next Heavenly Dao?”","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven wasn’t interested in ‘proving the Dao in person.’ He was more interested in nurturing a Wielder of the Will or assisting an Immortal in proving the Dao.","“It doesn’t matter who attains the Immortal Heavenly Dao. I only have one request...No matter who vindicates dao, please help me break the curse on my clansmen.” An ancient demon statue with a hideous face rose up, and the Eight-Armed Demon Venerable stood on top of it. His Immortal light wheel was filled with sorrow.","“Fellow Daoist Daozi, let us assist you in attaining the immortality of the Heavenly Dao.” At this moment, a handsome silver-haired man with a cold expression spoke up.","It was the Great Northern Emperor!","At some point, the Great Emperor had actually been pulled into this alliance and became a member.","“If it was a few months ago, I would have been able to prove my Dao to be immortal and restore the name of the scholarly faction.” Daozi was no longer sloppy. Instead, he had changed his appearance and turned into a graceful scholar.","“Eh? Daozi big shot, you don’t want to vindicate dao anymore?” Ye Si asked in confusion.","During the last gathering, Daozi was still like,’If you don’t want to vindicate the Dao, then let me do it! I want to vindicate my Dao and become immortal! Why did his stance suddenly change?","“Because I found a better candidate. Someone more suitable than me to vindicate dao.” Daozi held the scripture in his hand and revealed the gentle smile of his eldest senior brother back in the Scholarly Sage’s era.","“Tyrannical Song?” Scarlet Heaven Sword in Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s hand suddenly said.","“It’s Tyrannical Song...Teacher’s reincarnation.” The corners of Daozi’s mouth curled up.","“Fellow Daoist Daozi, ordinary people don’t know the details, so they think that Tyrannical Song is the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage. However, with our realms, how could we not see it? Tyrannical Song isn’t the reincarnation of anyone, nor is he the backup plan of the Scholarly Sage.” The master of the Titanium Temple said.","“That’s not a problem.” “Tyrannical Song is fated with the scholarly faction, and he is fated with my teacher! The left eye my teacher left behind is in his hands; he has my teacher’s teaching technique, the Impregnating Gaze; he cultivates the special Body of the Buddha technique of my scholarly faction; he helped open up the world of the golden lotus of my scholarly faction; he once summoned my teacher’s obsession as an incarnation to fight against the ruler of the Netherworld in the scholarly faction; and even our most beloved junior sister is now in Tyrannical Song’s body. Isn’t this enough?”","Whether Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage or not was no longer important. What was important was how the myriad worlds viewed Tyrannical Song.","Daozi wanted to vindicate the Dao to prove that his teacher wasn’t weaker than others and was completely qualified to vindicate the Dao and become immortal.","Therefore, Tyrannical Song was more suitable to vindicate the dao than him!","More importantly, Daozi didn’t say it out loud. To be honest, he wasn’t confident that he could defeat Tyrannical Song.","Even if everyone present knew that Tyrannical Song hadn’t truly become an Immortal, Daozi didn’t have the confidence to win against him.","It wasn’t that Tyrannical Song himself was really powerful, but that his network of human relations was terrifying... There were also many cheats...","“However, Shuhang doesn’t necessarily want to attain immortality. He isn’t passionate about fighting for the seat of the Heavenly Dao, and he’s even a little resistant to it.” Ye Si said at this moment.","Daozi:","Fellow Daoist Daozi, regardless of whether Tyrannical Song vindicates the Dao in the future, before he does... Are you interested in becoming a Heavenly Dao?” At this moment, an illusory shadow appeared and stood on Cheng Lin’s statue.","“Overstepping Heavenly Dao?” Daozi put away the scroll and asked in puzzlement.","” Yes, between the eighth and ninth Wielder of the Will, the 8.5th Wielder of the Will.” The illusory figure said."]},{"number":2892,"title":"Chapter 2892: Thrice Reckless Borrowing Books","paragraphs":["Chapter 2892: Thrice Reckless Borrowing Books","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When the concept of the 8.5th Heavenly Axiom was brought up, the room fell silent.","“The seat of the Heavenly Dao is no trifling matter, and it’s not something we can decide or reserve. Even Brother Daozi, who once claimed he wanted to compete for the position, did not have absolute confidence in proving his Dao and surpassing the other Immortals in the myriad worlds. So, how do you intend to manage this 8.5-generation Heavenly Dao? What criteria will be used to determine the position?” asked the master of the Titanium Temple calmly.","With his obsession broken, he entered a temporary state of serenity, making him the calmest in this discussion.","The Heavenly Axiom wasn’t their personal playground. No one could just claim it.","Daozi also questioned, “Moreover, why is it a ‘transition Wielder of the Will’ instead of directly becoming the 9th Wielder of the Will? The Heavenly Dao is eternal. How do you make the Immortal Heavenly Dao ‘temporary’? As long as one becomes the Wielder of the Will and it’s not controlled by personal will, there’s no such thing as ‘temporary’ in theory, right?”","“And the battle for the ninth Wielder of the Will is ongoing; the ninth Wielder of the Will could emerge at any moment. Why then create an 8.5 Heavenly Dao now? Never mind that; I just want to know if this 8.5 Wielder of the Will can lift the curse on my clansmen’s bodies?” inquired the Eight-Armed Ancient Demon Venerable.","It was the only otherworldly demon in the myriad worlds that retained its consciousness. The curse it sought to break caused the otherworldly demons to lose their intelligence and become wild bosses for the universe’s practitioners.","“Do I have to pay a huge price to become the 8.5 Wielder of the Will?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven asked while stroking his sword. “And what is your aim? What do you want the 8.5th Wielder of the Will to help you with? What challenges lie ahead?”","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven’s question was direct and insightful.","With the ninth Wielder of the Will on the verge of being born, the reason for creating the 8.5th Wielder of the Will had to be that something crucial needed handling between the eighth and ninth Wielders.","“Fellow Daoists, please, allow me to explain,” began the illusory figure, which soon solidified into the form of a fairy the ‘Fairy of the Dead’ Cheng Goudan.","“First, the ‘8.5 Wielder of the Will’ I mentioned is not the true Wielder of the Will. There are extreme restrictions on his authority and ‘immortality.’ Therefore, he cannot become the Ninth Wielder of the Will. He can only act as a temporary Heavenly Dao until the Ninth Heavenly Dao takes office, executing part of the Heavenly Dao’s authority. Once the Ninth Wielder of the Will vindicates the Dao, the 8.5 Wielder of the Will will retire,” explained Fairy Cheng Goudan.","“How?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven asked slowly.","“The Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City... and the authority of the Heavenly Emperor,” Fairy Cheng Goudan replied.","“Why is this tied to the Ancient Heavenly City?” asked the Great Northern Emperor.","“Scarlet Heaven, my inner demon is gone! I’m going to meet little friend Song Shuhang,” Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly interrupted.","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven gently patted Scarlet Heaven Sword to quiet it.","Fairy Cheng Lin smiled and continued, “The perfect Dao of the ancient Heavenly City is a Dao completed by the deceased Heavenly Dao. After the battle between the Eighth Wielder of the Will and the Scholarly Sage, it had a flaw. Thus, the ‘Ancient Heavenly City Plan’ was created to mend it. This is how we influence the Heavenly Dao.”","Back then, if they hadn’t interfered with the Ancient Heavenly City’s grand plan, the Heavenly Dao Ball might have repaired itself.","“Is that so?” The Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable asked in surprise.","“Our 8.5-term Heavenly Axiom Plan leverages this. The grand plan was a way for the Eighth Wielder of the Will to mend itself. Triggering conditions were set so that once met, the perfect Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City and the Heavenly Emperor would be absorbed into the Heavenly Dao, fixing its flaws.”","Everyone understood at this point. If the Eighth Wielder of the Will hadn’t collapsed, the perfect combination of the Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City and the Celestial Thearch would have been its missing part.","But now, the Heavenly Dao Ball had collapsed, and the Heavenly Dao was without a master.","If they could create the perfect combination of the Dao of the Heavenly Court and the Heavenly Emperor and trigger the conditions left by the Heavenly Dao Ball, the Heavenly Emperor and the Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City would be absorbed and become part of the Heavenly Dao.","In theory, this would grant a portion of the Heavenly Dao’s authority and possibly some of its eternal nature, making it fitting to call it the 8.5-generation Heavenly Dao.","“But it’s too risky,” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven said slowly.","No one could guarantee that they wouldn’t lose their will after being absorbed by the Heavenly Dao Ball’s backup plan. If everything were erased and they became part of the Wielder of the Will, the so-called 8.5 Wielder of the Will would be a futile endeavor.","“Therefore, we need to use some methods left by the Scholarly Sage to assist in this mission,” Fairy Cheng Goudan said, looking at Daozi.","“The method left by the Teacher?” Daozi pondered. “You want to use the Teacher’s method of ‘swallowing a portion of an existence?’”","Using the Scholarly Sage’s method to leave a portion of himself before becoming the 8.5 Wielder of the Will could work. The remaining part would be absorbed and become part of the Heavenly Dao.","This way, even if his consciousness was wiped away, he could still control the 8.5 Wielder of the Will with the remaining part of his existence.","The Scholarly Sage’s method of ‘devouring a portion of an existence’ was highly unconventional. After swallowing it, even after the Heavenly Dao Ball advanced to the Heavenly Dao, it couldn’t directly retrieve the missing part and had to continue proving its immortality with the missing part.","“However, the Teacher’s ability was personal talent. Before the final battle with the previous Wielder of the Will, no one knew of this talent,” Daozi added.","No one had forced the Scholarly Sage to use this talent before. Usually, challengers were easily defeated by the Scholarly Sage. Once the Dimension Portal was opened and the enemy’s tracks locked, the iron fist of knowledge would eliminate over 60% of the enemies.","In the main world, Song Shuhang’s refinement of the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’ had reached a crucial stage. The rank nine dao pattern was already 90% complete.","At that moment, a message came from the cultivation chat.","[Zhiyin·Pathogen] Frice Reckless Mad Saber:","“Yes, Senior Thrice Reckless. What’s the matter?” Song Shuhang asked. It was rare for Senior Thrice Reckless to reach out.","“I want to borrow a book from you,” Frice Reckless Mad Saber replied.","“A book? What book?” Song Shuhang was puzzled. What kind of books could he have?","Song Shuhang knew he didn’t have many books on cultivation. Moreover, his collection was not particularly impressive.","Most of what he had, the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group had as well, and they were better stocked.","Could it be that he wanted to borrow the ‘5-Year College Entrance Examination and 3-Year Simulation’ from him?"]},{"number":2893,"title":"Chapter 2893: You Are The Senior!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2893: You Are The Senior!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber borrowed books from him, Song Shuhang could only think of books outside the ‘cultivation world’.","“Frice Reckless Mad Saber: ‘The Confucian Classics.’”","“I have this?” Song Shuhang was stunned for a few moments before suddenly remembering.","I do have it!","He recalled the Scholarly Sage’s magical treasure, the Confucian Classics, which was sealed within the ‘sealing pillar’ by the Heavenly Dao Ball. He had won it from the fat ball’s avatar through a gambling ritual!","“Senior Thrice Reckless, the Confucian Classics is indeed in my hands, but it’s still sealed in the pillar and hasn’t been unsealed. I’ll need some time to undo the seal... Also, the Confucian Classics isn’t really mine. It belongs to the scholarly faction,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Don’t worry. I can have Senior Skylark inform the scholarly faction. They should be willing to lend the Confucian Classics. As for the seal, can you unseal it as soon as possible?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied, adding a “Please~”.","“Senior Thrice Reckless, since you’ve asked, I’ll do my best,” Song Shuhang replied. “Right, we’re currently in the Dream Realm. Can you give me your coordinates? I’ll pull you over.”","“No need, I’m nearby. I’ll come to you soon. I want to see you too,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said.","“Alright. After you arrive at the Dream Realm, head directly to Senior Skylark’s coordinates. I’ll meet up with you,” Song Shuhang said.","Ending the conversation, Song Shuhang turned to Fairy Creation. “Fairy Creation, there’s something I need to discuss with you.”","“Dumby?” Fairy Creation asked.","“A senior wants to borrow a book from me.” With a thought, Song Shuhang took out the ‘sealing pillar’ from his Inner World.","“Yiyala? Ah Song?” Fairy Creation asked.","“Yes, it’s Senior Thrice Reckless. He wants to borrow the Confucian Classics,” Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Creation was speechless. She crawled out of Song Shuhang’s body, hugged him, and shook her head.","“Senior Thrice Reckless said he’s willing to borrow the book through Fairy Skylark. So, I want to ask for your opinion. After all, this Confucian Classics belongs to the scholarly faction and you,” Song Shuhang explained.","If Fairy Creation wasn’t willing, he could only refuse Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","Fairy Creation frowned and pondered after hearing Skylark’s name, seeming to be in a dilemma. After a while, she slid down from the sealing pillar and raised one finger at Song Shuhang, then added two more fingers.","“Three days? I’ll remind Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber,” Song Shuhang nodded. “Thank you on behalf of Senior Thrice Reckless, Fairy Creation.”","“Reckless ” Fairy Creation looked up.","“Hahaha,” Song Shuhang smiled, and the hair on his head condensed into more ‘braided palms’ that fell on the sealing pillar of the Scholarly Classic. Instantly, the radiance of the Blade Nurturing Technique lit up like an explosion.","As his strength increased, Tyrannical Song’s Nine Slashes of Braid Saber secret technique became more powerful. At the same time, the ‘Cheap Love’ secret technique also grew more terrifying!","Every second, thousands of Saber Nurturing Techniques landed on the sealing pillar simultaneously. The sealing pillar was soon covered in a layer of rainbow divine artifact radiance.","In the past, Song Shuhang would have needed at least a day and a night to open this sealing pillar. Now, in just a few minutes, it began to collapse.","“Please open a small window,” Song Shuhang said to the sealing pillar.","As he spoke, another 100 shots of the Saber Nurturing Technique landed. A gap slightly larger than a book slowly opened on the seven-colored sealing pillar. Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and easily took out the Scholarly Sage’s magical treasure, the Scholarly Classic.","“Thanks,” Song Shuhang said. Then, he put the sealing pillar back into his Inner World. If used well, it could even trick the ruler of the Netherworld!","As soon as he took out the Confucian Classics, Righteousness Qi spread out from the ritual implement, covering a radius of ten thousand miles like a domain. Some of the inner demons in the Dream Realm squeaked, suppressed by the Morality and unable to move. In this domain, only the special Black Panther could move naturally.","Fairy Creation stretched out her hand and took the Classic of Confucianism from Song Shuhang’s hands, her delicate hand carefully stroking the book. Her expression was filled with nostalgia. She must have thought of the Scholarly Sage.","“Hey? Shuhang, I’m here,” Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s voice rang out in the sky.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber handsomely put away his saber and landed in front of Song Shuhang.","“Senior Thrice Reckless, long time no see,” Song Shuhang, refining the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, couldn’t move too much.","“Long time no see, Shuhang. How many times have you died recently?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked.","Song Shuhang was speechless. “Senior Thrice Reckless, are you speaking like a human?”","Song Shuhang immediately turned to Fairy Creation. “Fairy Creation, we won’t be borrowing it anymore. Hurry up and put away the Scholarly Classic!”","“Why can’t I control my mouth?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber sighed. “I’m sorry, Shuhang. I was wrong!”","“That’s more like it,” Song Shuhang winked at him.","Fairy Creation reluctantly handed the Classic of Confucianism to Thrice Reckless.","“Three days? That’s enough,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber smiled.","Black-skinned Soft Feather: “!!!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless. Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded. Apart from Song Shuhang, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber could also understand Fairy Creation’s special language? Could it be... Was this the special code of the Death-Courting World? Only people with a certain level of Death Seeking Points could comprehend it?","“Senior Thrice Reckless, why do you want to borrow the Classic of Confucianism? Do you need help?” Song Shuhang asked.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber took the Confucian Classics and said, “I borrowed this Confucian Classics mainly to help an old friend with a small matter. Shuhang, you don’t have to worry. Thank you for this.”","“It’s almost the new year. Senior Thrice Reckless, remember to give me a big red packet during the new year,” Song Shuhang reminded him. It was his first time spending the New Year in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and he hoped to receive a few red packets.","“Do you have any shame? You’re a Tribulation Transcender. It’s fine if you don’t give us red packets during the New Year, but you actually want to ask me for red packets?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber spoke, feeling sad.","“But you are a senior,” Song Shuhang still wanted to argue.","“Senior Song, you are my senior,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber cupped his fists at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was speechless. Was there a need for a red packet?","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber stretched out his hand and flipped through the Confucian Classic elegantly. Then, he waved his hand and said, “Senior Song, see you later.”","At the side, Fairy Creation quietly looked at Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s posture as he flipped through the book, then turned to look at Song Shuhang, falling silent."]},{"number":2894,"title":"Chapter 2894: Demonic Sound!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2894: Demonic Sound!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Even if it’s just a few spirit stones, it’s still something,” Song Shuhang looked at Senior Thrice Reckless’s disappearing figure, feeling very wronged. For the sake of a few spirit stones, Senior Thrice Reckless actually gave up his identity as a senior. Was it necessary? Was there really a need for that?","“It’s not a matter of a few spirit stones. It’s a matter of dignity,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet reminded him. “He’s a Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor, yet he gave you a red packet, a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender who’s about to become a ‘weak Immortal’ soon. You’re shameless, but he’s even more shameless.”","Song Shuhang turned his head and looked at Senior White—this was probably the only red packet in the Nine Provinces Number One Group for this year’s New Year. In addition, Senior White Two, Senior Three-Eyed, and Father Gou Dan should be able to get some red packets.","After seeing Song Shuhang’s aggrieved expression, the senior who was munching on the bun was slightly stunned. Then, he took out a bag of buns from his spatial magical treasure and said, “Do you want some?” There were many kinds of fillings: inner demons, heavenly tribulations, evil illusions... I recommend filling it with soup and evil filling. It’s a mixture of soup and evil filling. It’s suitable for one bite.”","“Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s new work?” Song Shuhang asked.","Senior White nodded. “Immortal Fairy Bie Xue just made it and secretly gave it to me.”","“I don’t have a share?” Song Shuhang asked. He was clearly conducting experiments in his Inner World, providing most of the raw materials such as evil illusions, inner demons, and heavenly tribulations, and even providing the methods to deal with inner demons and heavenly tribulations... Why wasn’t there any for him after all the buns were finished?","“Yes, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue only prepared my portion,” Senior White said.","Song Shuhang opened his Inner World. “Chu Chu, give me ten buns with Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s fillings!”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was speechless. “What are you saying? Do you believe that in a few days, I’ll release ‘Tyrannical Song stuffed buns’ and ‘Tyrannical Song’s disciple Chu Chu stuffed buns’?”","On the other side, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber brought the Confucian Classic to the World Tree. Song Shuhang’s preparatory disciple, the monster tree Miruru, had now become the carrier of the World Tree in the Dream Realm. On the top of Miruru’s tree, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue and Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly were slowly waking up.","With the help of Song Shuhang and Senior White, they had successfully placed their primordial spirits in the void and projected their primordial spirits back to their corporeal bodies in the main world. After successfully placing their primordial spirits in the void at the Eighth Stage Realm, the bottleneck for them to advance to the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm in the future had been broken. Advancing from Rank-8 to Rank-9 was just a matter of accumulation for the two of them.","Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark woke up with a yawn. When she opened her eyes, she saw Thrice Reckless Mad Saber holding a large book. “Eh? Thrice Reckless, you actually read books?” Skylark said in shock. Thrice Reckless, who loved to read, was too different from what she remembered!","“Senior Skylark, I’m also a genius who has the talent to independently develop new spells,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said handsomely. “And knowledge is power. As long as the book in my hand is heavy, hard, and strong enough, no one can be hit by my knowledge and remain unscathed.”","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was speechless. “I’ve been sleeping for a few days. It’s getting a little boring.” Skylark rubbed her eyes.","“Looking at Soft Feather’s Moments, they went to blow up a star to play, and now they’re finishing up,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said.","Lord Spirit Butterfly: “!!!” My daughter went to blow up a star? Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s heart beat faster. And Thrice Reckless, shut up! Although I don’t know what’s going on, don’t continue talking!","“Exploding stars? How do we blow it up?” Fairy Skylark asked in puzzlement.","“I don’t know. Besides, I don’t dare to play.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber gave him a thumbs up.","“Let’s go!” Skylark suddenly jumped up, her long blue hair fluttering like a cape. She stretched out her hand and grabbed Thrice Reckless, and a magical treasure flashed between her fingers. In the next moment, she and Thrice Reckless disappeared from the Dream Realm and fled to another world.","“Aaah ” Vaguely, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s panicked screams could be heard.","“Fellow Daoist Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, I’m going to see my daughter,” Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly said after being slightly stunned.","“Let’s go together. I also have to see what Fellow Daoist White and Shuhang have done. Even the star was destroyed by them.” Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was also a little flustered.","In a certain star field in the main world, Skylark carried Thrice Reckless and flew through the star field at high speed. Thrice Reckless Mad Saber held the Confucian Classics in his hands. When he reached a certain position, he gently threw the Confucian Classics out. Along the way, he also added a ‘spell message’ to the Confucian Classics.","“Eh? You don’t want that book anymore?” Skylark asked in puzzlement. She could sense the Scholarly Sage’s aura from that book.","“It’s not that I don’t want it, but I’m doing a small favor for an old friend according to our agreement. Three days later, the Confucian Classics will return to Shuhang by itself,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied.","“You actually have an old friend still alive?” Skylark was surprised. “Birds of a feather flock together. To be able to become your old friend and still be able to live until now, your vitality is really tenacious!”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “???” Senior Skylark, are you mocking me?","“Let’s go and study the stars.” Skylark was in a good mood, and she dragged Thrice Reckless Mad Saber forward.","“Wait a moment, I’ll install the resurrection magical treasure first.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said in despair, “I’m just a Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor, and I’ll melt the moment I touch a star.”","In the void, the Confucian Canon slowly floated in the air. A moment later, the Confucian Classics moved on its own. The Confucian Code broke through space and locked onto an aura, directly performing a space jump. In the space world of the headquarters of the [Heavenly Dao Must Step Down Alliance], Daozi was discussing with his allies about the possibility of recreating the Scholarly Sage’s innate ability.","“In short, it’s impossible to reproduce Teacher’s talent. We know nothing about the principles behind that innate ability or how it works. His teacher had only used that talent once, only against the previous Heavenly Dao. I only found out about it after the incident,” Daozi shook his head.","As he was speaking, the space in front of his face suddenly collapsed. A thick book suddenly drilled out of the space and smashed into his face.","“Who ambushed you? What a villain!” Daozi said angrily. Cheng Goudan, who was beside Ye Si, was also slightly stunned. This space was very special. Someone had actually locked onto Daozi and used an attack on his face? Moreover, Daozi actually didn’t dodge it?","“What book is this?” Ye Si’s attention was on the book. It looked very interesting, and she wanted to read it.","Daozi caught the book that had hit his face, and his expression suddenly changed. “Confucian Classics? Why is it here?” Daozi’s voice trembled. Moreover, there seemed to be a message spell in this book!","He hurriedly reached out and pressed on the Confucian Classic. “Cough This is the message: San Ben Ben ” A big man pinched his throat and let out a sweet and magical voice, flooding his brain!"]},{"number":2895,"title":"Chapter 2895: Saint’s Message","paragraphs":["Chapter 2895: Saint’s Message","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For a moment, Daozi had the urge to smash the *Confucian Classics* to the ground. However, considering that this book was his teacher’s magical tool, the incomparably important *Confucian Classics*, Daozi forcefully suppressed the urge to smash the book. Nevertheless, the terrifying “Three Dumb Dummies” voice still echoed in his head like a demonic chant.","‘Who was this?’ he thought. ‘Pinching her throat and calling out in such a coquettish manner—it was simply terrifying.’","“What do you mean?” the master of the Titanium Temple asked curiously.","He felt there must be a deeper meaning behind the words “Three Stupids.” “Could it be some kind of password?”","“How would I know?” Daozi replied, feeling like he was being scolded.","“Who gave you this *Confucian Classics*?” the Great Northern Emperor asked in puzzlement.","“I don’t know either!” Daozi smiled bitterly.","“Then where did this *Confucian Classics* come from? It locked onto you,” the Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable asked.","“I didn’t see it clearly!” Daozi looked up at the sky.","“Why don’t you know anything?” Scarlet Heaven Sword said.","Daozi was speechless. ‘I’m also in despair! I don’t want to be ignorant, and I want to appear knowledgeable, but I truly don’t know!’","“As for the *Confucian Classics*, it should have been with Shuhang,” Ye Si reminded him.","“So, little friend Shuhang was the one who sent the *Confucian Classics* over?” the Great Northern Emperor asked.","“No, Shuhang doesn’t know about this place,” Ye Si shook her head. Then, she added, “Also, I’m guessing that ‘Three Stupid Stupid’ should be Fairy Creation’s language.”","“Impossible, my junior sister’s voice isn’t that bad,” Daozi immediately defended his junior sister. “Who in the universe doesn’t know that the little junior sister that the Scholarly Sage had taken in possesses the sound of nature?”","“I meant ‘language language.’ It’s just that it sounds awkward when called out by this voice,” Ye Si said. “Senior Daozi, you should be paying attention to Fairy Creation, so... you should know that Fairy Creation doesn’t speak human language anymore.”","“I only reacted when Ye Si said that... This is indeed Fairy Creation’s language. Daozi should be able to understand it, right?” Scarlet Heaven Sword said.","Daozi was speechless. ‘I don’t understand either! I don’t understand what Junior Sister meant by “dazed,” “yayaya,” or “Yalaso”! My junior sister doesn’t speak human words, so I’m also in despair!’","At this time, Ye Si opened her eyes and said, “I just synchronized the information of the ghost spirit clone on Shuhang’s body. Senior Thrice Reckless just borrowed the *Confucian Classics* from Shuhang.”","“Is it that terrifying man? I have a deep impression of him,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said. “That’s a pathogen,” Scarlet Heaven Sword added. “Daozi, remember to disinfect it.”","Daozi was speechless. ‘Was it the little fellow Daoist that Grand Master Skylark had recently taken a fancy to?’","In fact, even after experiencing countless blows, the scholarly faction had been paying attention to Skylark’s news. After all, she was the teacher of a Saint.","“Could it be that Grandmaster Skylark asked him to give this book to me?” Daozi said slowly.","He stretched out his hand and flipped open his teacher’s *Confucian Classics*. The scholarly faction had always been paying attention to Skylark, so Daozi knew more than anyone else how special Skylark was. If Skylark was the one doing all the impossible things, it would be understandable. She was a special existence with countless secrets.","‘At this time, Grandmaster Skylark gave me this *Confucian Classics* because... Is it useful to me?’ Daozi kept flipping through the *Confucian Classics*. Finally, when he flipped to the last page, he suddenly saw a message. This message had always been ‘hidden’ until Daozi personally flipped to the last page of the *Confucian Classics*.","“This is Teacher’s handwriting,” Daozi’s voice was filled with excitement.","‘When you read this message, it means that the *Confucian Classics* has been successfully handed over to you. I’ve arranged some backup plans for you and your junior brothers. It’s just that these backup plans might have flaws. Even I can’t predict the future completely. These flaws may cause the resurrection to be incomplete. I believe that you will have found the answer when you open the last page of the *Confucian Classics*. So, in the end, Daozi... I’ll leave your junior brothers to you.’","These words were not continuous. It was obvious that when the Sage wrote down this passage, he had repeatedly revised, crossed out, and rewritten it. In fact, every sentence was written by the Sage after repeated deductions.","“Is this a backup plan that Teacher left behind for us?” Daozi’s heart ached. He thought of his junior brothers who were currently in the world of the golden lotus. The revival of his junior brothers wasn’t perfect, and there were flaws. They did not have much time left. Fortunately, Song Shuhang lent his special ‘glazed eyeballs’ to delay the disappearance of his junior brothers. ‘Everything was just as his teacher had predicted. Although he was resurrected, there was a flaw in the resurrection. His teacher back then had already predicted the future to such an extent?’ He felt that... ‘It was as if someone was reminding his teacher of his future deeds. Or perhaps, his teacher had “seen” the future?’","And the final words. “Have you handed your junior brothers to me?” Daozi stretched out his hand and gently caressed the *Confucian Classics*. ‘Yes, the answer was right in front of him. 8.5 Ren Tiandao. Even if it was just a temporary “transition Wielder of the Heaven,” without the complete authority of the Heavenly Dao, without complete immortality. However, if it was just to solve the “resurrection defects” of his junior brothers, it should still be possible.’ And the instant Daozi closed the *Confucian Classics*, he could faintly sense an ability emerging from it. It was the innate ability of his teacher, the Scholarly Sage, to devour all existences.","“The contract for Dao Vindication 8.5 Heavenly Dao has arrived,” Daozi raised his head, and his face was filled with determination. “The Scholarly Sage’s innate ability to ‘devour existence’ is in this *Confucian Classics.* Fairy Cheng Lin, I’m willing to become the 8.5th Wielder of the Will.”","“The Scholarly Sage’s message... Could it be that the Scholarly Sage has already predicted this?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven gently tapped Scarlet Heaven Sword and said slowly. “As expected of a legendary existence. He had already deduced to this extent in ancient times!”","“What an amazing saint, you live up to your reputation,” the master of the Titanium Temple was convinced.","“Even though I was once defeated by him, he is the only person who can make me sincerely submit,” the Eight-Armed Ancient Demon Venerable said. In order to save his clansmen, he naturally fought for the position of the Heavenly Dao. Those who had fought for the seat of the Heavenly Dao had naturally been pressed to the ground by the Scholarly Sage.","“There will be danger,” Cheng Goudan said.","“I’m willing to bear the responsibility.”","“Yes.” Daozi nodded. “Then, after you become the 8.5 Wielder of the Will, what do you need me to help you face?”"]},{"number":2896,"title":"Chapter 2896: Actually, I’m Already Taken!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2896: Actually, I’m Already Taken!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Daozi was doing this to save his junior brothers and sisters. The Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable was trying to undo the curse on his clansmen. Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven aimed to support a Wielder of the Will to ascend the throne.","So, what were the wishes of Fairy Cheng Lin and the others who had put in so much effort to promote the ‘8.5-term Wielder of the Will Plan’?","“After Fellow Daoist Daozi attains 8.5 Heavenly Daos, I hope you can help me free my best friend who is bound by the Dao of the ancient Heavenly City,” Cheng Goudan replied.","Among the Immortals of the ancient Heavenly City, there were still a few who were bound by the Dao of the Heavenly City and were in a petrified state. Now that the Heavenly Dao had collapsed, even the Celestial Thearch had set up a trap to transform into the Dao and disappear. If he wanted his petrified friend from the Heavenly Court to escape and revive, he could only seek help from the authority of the Heavenly Dao.","“I understand,” Daozi nodded slightly.","This wasn’t the first day he had worked with Fairy Cheng Lin and Slow-Witted Song. He knew they had been working hard to revive a group of close friends from the ancient Heavenly City.","Fairy Cheng Lin’s goal was similar to his and the Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable’s: they were all trying to save the people they cared about. Similar goals and obsessions always resonated easily.","“Since everyone’s goal has been set, when will the 8.5 Ren Tiandao Project begin?” Daozi asked, already a little impatient to vindicate the 8.5 Heavenly Dao and make up for the flaws of his junior brothers and sisters.","The Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable also said impatiently, “The sooner we start this plan, the better. Fairy Cheng Lin, what do we need to do for this plan?”","“This plan requires everyone’s cooperation,” Fairy Cheng Goudan said. “I wouldn’t be able to complete it in a short period of time by myself. It’ll take a lot of manpower and resources just to perfect the Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City.”","“In other words, we have to complete the ancient Heavenly City as much as possible?” Daozi lightly tapped on the ?Confucian Classics? as he thought of the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City the scholarly faction had collected. If necessary, he could step forward and ask for the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City. Compared to the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction and his junior sister, the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City was naturally less important.","“I have a question,” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven interjected. “Fellow Daoist Song and Fellow Daoist Cheng, why aren’t you the ones who vindicate the Dao in this plan? Why do you want to drag Daozi along?”","“I have the same doubts,” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven continued, looking at Fairy Cheng Lin. “The plan requires the ‘perfect Dao of the ancient Heavenly City + Heavenly Emperor.’ Fellow Daoist Song and Fairy Cheng Lin, you control the identity of the ‘Heavenly Emperor,’ right? So why do you have to let Daozi vindicate the Dao instead?”","“Is there a greater hidden danger?” the Great Northern Emperor asked.","“Fellow Daoist Song and Fairy Cheng, if there’s a hidden danger, just tell me. Don’t worry, no matter how great the danger is, I won’t retreat,” Daozi said. As the leader of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders of the scholarly faction, he had to protect all the scholarly disciples in his master’s absence.","“If the danger is too great and Daozi is unwilling to bear it, I’ll go,” the Eight-Armed Ancient Demon Venerable said.","“No, it’s not a problem of hidden danger. The reason I don’t vindicate the 8.5 Heavenly Dao myself is because of my personal identity,” Fairy Cheng Goudan waved her hand.","The big shots on the statue all looked at Fairy Cheng Goudan in confusion.","“Now that things have come to this, I won’t hide it from everyone anymore,” Fairy Cheng Erdan smiled and said. “Although I became the Jade Lake Empress in the ancient Heavenly City, in fact, I’m a ghost spirit.”","“Ghost spirit?”","“Impossible!”","This was explosive news. If announced, it would become the headline of the myriad worlds!","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven nodded and said, “No wonder. I’ve always felt that Fairy Cheng Lin’s existence was very strange. I didn’t expect her to be a ghost spirit.”","“Since you are a ghost spirit, how did you attain immortality?” the master of the Titanium Temple asked in puzzlement.","“Because I’m special! I am also the most special part of the ghost spirits. In fact, the Heavenly Emperor of the ancient Heavenly City was also partially made up of ghost spirits. She vindicated her Dao and became the strongest existence after the Scholarly Sage,” Fairy Cheng Lin replied.","The Great Northern Emperor was speechless.","The Celestial Thearch was also a ghost spirit?","Why didn’t our Four Great Emperors notice this?","” It’s precisely because I’m a ghost spirit that I can’t vindicate immortality. If I do, it will affect the existence corresponding to me,” Fairy Cheng Lin continued to throw out explosive news.","“Affect the corresponding existence? Fairy Cheng Lin, are you currently ‘taken’?” The Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable was in disbelief.","It was one thing for Cheng Lin to be a ghost spirit, but she actually had an owner? Which fairy in the myriad worlds had the strength to become Fairy Cheng Lin’s main body? Everyone knew that the form and gender of a ghost spirit corresponded to its main body. Since Cheng Lin had the body of a fairy, the person corresponding to her should also be a fairy.","“Interesting. Fairy Cheng Lin, you said earlier that you don’t want to affect your main body. In other words, your main body’s goal is the ninth Wielder of the Will, right?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven speculated. “You didn’t vindicate the 8.5 Wielder of the Will because you were worried it would affect your main body’s vindication of the 9th Wielder of the Will?”","“Yes, it’s mainly because of this,” Fairy Cheng Lin nodded.","“Then, was this 8.5 Heavenly Dao plan also proposed by your main body?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven continued to ask.","“No, he doesn’t have the ability,” Fairy Cheng Lin shook her head. “In fact, our state is different from that of ordinary ghost spirits and their main bodies. We have always acted independently since ancient times. He knows nothing about our operation and plans.”","“Fairy Cheng Lin, can you tell us who your corresponding ‘main body’ is?” Daozi asked.","“Yes, it’s someone everyone knows. But please allow me to keep it a secret for now. Soon, everyone will know,” Fairy Cheng Goudan said.","Everyone fell into deep thought.","“In addition, there’s another reason. In the process of freeing the fellow daoists bound by the Great Dao of the ancient Heavenly City, we need a ‘substitute’ to replace those fellow daoists. We used our own division as the foundation to create a batch of substitutes. This segment requires us to take action. This is also why we can’t replace the 8.5-point Heavenly Axiom,” Fairy Cheng Goudan explained.","They needed to use their clones to replace their close friends from the ancient Heavenly City."]},{"number":2897,"title":"Chapter 2897: The problem is that the Heavenly Dao isn’t something that can be achieved just because you want to","paragraphs":["Chapter 2897: The problem is that the Heavenly Dao isn’t something that can be achieved just because you want to","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven pondered for a moment and then said, “For me, as long as I assist a Heavenly Dao in taking office, I’ll have fulfilled my wish. So, there’s no problem on my side. Next, let’s talk about how to perfect the Dao of the ancient Heavenly City. I don’t know much about it.”","To Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, it didn’t matter whether Fairy Cheng Lin and Fellow Daoist Song had other plans. His interest was to push the 8.5 Heavenly Dao forward. Then, he would see who was more suitable for the ninth Wielder of the Will.","“Me too,” Daozi said, gripping the Confucian Canon tightly.","“Me too,” the Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable nodded. “In order to save my best friend from the ancient Heavenly City, Fairy Cheng Lin and I share the same goal,” the Great Northern Emperor said slowly.","“Although my obsession has been broken, we are still friends. I can help. Furthermore, I also want to witness the birth of the 8.5th Wielder of the Will,” the master of the Titanium Temple said with his palms together.","“First of all, we need to bring back as many fragments of the ancient Heavenly City as possible,” Fairy Cheng Lin said.","The Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable frowned slightly. “Do we need to bring them all back? This might not be easy... Back then, the ancient Heavenly City shattered too badly, and its fragments spread throughout the myriad worlds.”","“There’s no need to bring them all back. We only need more than half of the fragments to carry out the Perfect Ancient Heavenly City Plan. We’ve been collecting and rebuilding the ancient Heavenly City. Now, we only need to bring back one-fifth of the fragments. Yes, try to pull back the more important parts. One fragment of the important parts of the Heavenly City is equivalent to dozens of ordinary fragments,” Fairy Cheng Goudan explained.","“Then, I’m going back to the scholarly faction. The ancient Heavenly City!” Daozi stood up and said, “After the destruction of the ancient Heavenly City, the scholarly faction collected many fragments. The Celestial Thearch used the golden bodies of my four junior brothers to exchange for some of them, but a portion has already been transferred to the world of the golden lotus in the scholarly faction. I’ll go now and bring these fragments of the Heavenly Court.”","“If we go back, should we bring some gifts to the scholarly faction?” Fairy Ye Si suddenly said, “Tomorrow is Chinese New Year’s Eve in the main world. It’s a very special day.”","“New Year?” Daozi seemed to fall into a distant memory. A gentle smile appeared on his face. After a while, he sighed softly.","After saying that, Daozi opened a spatial rift and left with his true body, heading toward the entrance to the world of the golden lotus.","“I’ve collected some fragments of the Heavenly Court before. I’ll go get them now,” the Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable said. Their otherworldly demons had the habit of collecting treasures. Even if cursed and losing their minds, this habit remained. This was why many otherworldly demons dropped a lot of treasures when killed as wild bosses.","The Eight-Armed Immemorial Demon Venerable tore through space and flew away.","“If it’s a fragment of the Heavenly City, do you need me to see Golden Trigram?” The Great Northern Emperor looked at Fairy Cheng Lin.","Cheng Lin and the Great Northern Emperor knew that Golden Trigram had attained immortality and inherited the position of the Heavenly Emperor. The new Heavenly Emperor, Golden Trigram, had a large number of fragments of the Heavenly Court. However, it wasn’t easy to get these fragments from him.","“As for Golden Trigram, I’ll talk to him personally. Our plan might need his help,” Fairy Cheng Goudan said slowly. Golden Trigram was the legitimate successor of the Heavenly Emperor, and their 8.5 Heavenly Axiom Plan couldn’t avoid him.","“Alright, I’ll leave Golden Trigram to you. Then I’ll go meet little friend Tyrannical Song. He also has part of the Heavenly City fragment. Moreover, it’s time to bring my turtle back,” a gentle smile appeared on the Great Northern Emperor’s cold face.","The ten-thousand-year-old glacier suddenly smiled, cold and warm.","“Wait, Great Northern Emperor. Can you leave Shuhang to me?” Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested, “Shuhang and I have a good relationship. It should be easier for me to talk to him. Moreover, I sensed my inner demon suddenly disappeared. It just so happens that I have to ask Song Shuhang what happened.”","Scarlet Heaven Sword couldn’t wait to see Tyrannical Song.","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven was speechless. “Then, why don’t we go together?” the Great Northern Emperor said. “Scarlet Heaven, I’ll go with the Great Northern Emperor. Is that alright?” Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven was speechless again. “I’ll go with you,” Ye Si stood up and lightly patted her skirt. “It’s almost New Year. I want to spend it with Shuhang.”","This year might be the last New Year she and Song Shuhang would spend together. As Cheng Lin and Fellow Daoist Song’s 8.5-term Wielder of the Will plan unfolded, as Fairy Cheng Lin’s spokesperson, she would inevitably be involved. Therefore, she cherished this opportunity to celebrate the New Year.","“Be careful,” Fairy Cheng Goudan gently patted Ye Si’s head.","“Go,” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven sighed and said to Scarlet Heaven Sword.","Another spatial gate opened in the void. Scarlet Heaven Sword, the Great Northern Emperor, and Ye Si left together, heading straight for Song Shuhang’s location.","The entire headquarters of the [Heavenly Dao Must Step Down Alliance] suddenly became deserted.","“Other than collecting the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City, is there anything else we can help with?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven sighed and asked Fairy Cheng Lin.","“I wanted to ask the same question,” the master of the Titanium Temple nodded in agreement.","“Yes. Reversing the ancient Heavenly City and Celestial Thearch, allowing Daozi to become the 8.5 Wielder of the Will, requires the power of the heavenly tribulation. Therefore, we need to find a reliable junior or a trustworthy member who is about to transcend the tribulation. At that time, we can borrow their heavenly tribulation,” Fairy Cheng Lin said.","They would just take on the heavenly tribulation and would not affect its power too much.","“A member who transcends the heavenly tribulation?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven pondered. He thought of Lady Onion. Back then, he felt that Lady Onion, who had the ‘appearance of the Wielder of the Will,’ should still be with Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. Li Tiansu’s daughter, Li Yinzhu, whom he had a brief affinity with, should also be with Tyrannical Song.","“Why don’t I go see Tyrannical Song?” Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven thought to himself.","Song Shuhang’s position.","“About 98% progress. Stuck.” Song Shuhang frowned and looked at the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber in his hand. At this time, the intensity of the immortal elemental energy in Song Shuhang’s body was surging. He had already broken through the limit of an ordinary Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, reaching the level of a weak and grown-up Tribulation Transcender like the ‘Three Separations Executioner’ from the immemorial era. However, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’s Nine Revolution Dao Pattern did not break through as well. This was different from what he had expected.","“Could it be that I have to wait until I truly step out of my own path, advance half a step into the Tribulation Transcender realm, and become an ‘Immortal,’ before I can complete the Nine Transformations? Or perhaps... Are you waiting for me to vindicate dao and become immortal?” Song Shuhang frowned. However, whether it was the Immortal Realm or the Immortal Heavenly Dao, it was not something that could be achieved just like that!","Just as he was thinking, a spatial gate opened beside him.","“Shuhang, Scarlet Heaven Sword is back!” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword’s voice rang out. After that, the Great Northern Emperor with a cold expression appeared, as well as a fairy maiden that Song Shuhang almost subconsciously ignored.","At this moment, they had all come out of the special space with their true bodies and were no longer affected by the effect of cutting off their roots.","“Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, Senior Beifang, why are you here?” Song Shuhang went up to them."]},{"number":2898,"title":"Chapter 2898: Seniors, do you want to give me meat buns?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2898: Seniors, do you want to give me meat buns?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“I’m naturally here to look for you!” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword hung himself on Song Shuhang’s waist with ease, nestling next to the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. “I suddenly felt my inner demon had disappeared, so I thought of coming to find you...” he said. In the end, Scarlet Heaven refused to let me leave. I finally found an excuse to come and see you.”","After saying this, Scarlet Heaven Sword kept nudging Song Shuhang’s waist with its hilt, hinting at him.","In the past, it had left the ‘Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword’ with Song Shuhang, and whenever the sword was hit by several hundred rounds of the ? Saber Nurturing Technique ?, the real body of Scarlet Heaven Sword would sense it from afar and relish it. However, nothing beat the sensation of receiving the Saber Nurturing Technique firsthand. Now that it finally had the chance, it couldn’t wait to enjoy the massage.","“Senior, I’ve shifted the position of my kidney. Don’t knock... it’s hollow inside,” Song Shuhang said.","Scarlet Heaven Sword was speechless.","What the heck? Who cares about your kidney? I don’t have any ulterior motives for your waist. What does it have to do with me whether your waist is hollow or not? Moreover, you’re a man with a hollow waist—doesn’t that make you weak?","“Buzz” At this moment, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber chirped softly at Scarlet Heaven Sword, as if greeting a long-lost friend.","“Buzz buzz~ I haven’t seen you in a while... Eh? Wait a minute, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber is actually nearing the ninth transformation?” Scarlet Heaven Sword was suddenly stunned.","It had stayed by Song Shuhang’s side with the inner demon for a long time and had a good understanding of the special Daoist treasure, the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber’. Every revolution of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber needed to be completed by the previous ‘blademaster’ before it was passed on to the next blademaster.","The previous swordmaster, Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, was a silly onion that Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven had nurtured on a whim. Silly onion completed rank eight, didn’t that mean...that idiot had advanced to the Ninth Stage?","“What the heck! Did Lady Onion awaken?” Scarlet Heaven Sword was stunned. Could it be that silly onion really possessed the appearance of the Heavenly Dao as Scarlet Heaven had predicted?","“In fact, this matter is also related to the disappearance of your inner demon, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword,” Song Shuhang said. “Not long ago, your inner demon, my clone, Lady Onion, and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber all went missing.”","“And then?” Scarlet Heaven Sword asked.","“Currently, only the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber has returned. As you can see, it has already completed the eighth transformation. I’m refining it to complete the last step of the ninth transformation,” Song Shuhang said.","Scarlet Heaven Sword was speechless.","After pondering for a moment, Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Could it be that something happened to Lady Onion, and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber found a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender to become the ‘Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue,’ and completed the Eighth Revolution?”","“No, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber has confirmed that Lady Onion is the one who completed the ‘Eighth Revolution Sacrificial Refinement,’” Song Shuhang said.","“Heavens. Shuhang, I need to calm down,” Scarlet Heaven Sword said. “It’s best if you let me relax and calm down.”","Song Shuhang was speechless. Senior, if you have something to say, just say it. How tiring is it for me to guess?","Song Shuhang flicked his hair, and it turned into a hundred hands that pressed on Scarlet Heaven Sword’s body at the same time. Some of them landed on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. The radiance of the ? Blade Nurturing Technique ? exploded. The dazzling light was like a ‘holy light,’ hitting Song Shuhang’s waist and creating a huge ball of holy light, changing the atmosphere.","At times, the addition of holy light would make one imagine even more.","Three seconds later, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber didn’t move at all and didn’t make any sound. They hung on Song Shuhang’s waist silently. The corner of the Great Northern Emperor’s eyes twitched.","The Great Emperor felt that Scarlet Heaven Sword was no longer surnamed Scarlet Heaven, but Song.","Additionally, when Song Shuhang used the ? Saber Nurturing Technique ? and released his immortal elemental energy, the Great Northern Emperor could clearly sense Song Shuhang’s current realm—the Triple-Separated Tribulation Transcender Realm!","Slaying a Triple Separations Tribulation Transcender...this had already surpassed the limits of an ordinary Tribulation Transcender and had entered the level of a weak Immortal!","All of a sudden, the Great Northern Emperor felt like he was choking on a rice cake.","When I was in seclusion, was it really only a few months and not a few thousand years?","Just as he was thinking about it, his Ah Gui’s happy voice came from the side.","“My Lord, you’ve broken out of seclusion!” Senior Turtle called out happily.","The Great Northern Emperor turned his head and looked at his Ah Gui with gratification. Fortunately, his Ah Gui was different from Scarlet Heaven Sword.","“My Lord, while you’re finally out of seclusion, quickly undo the seal on my body!” Senior Turtle spun and landed in the Great Northern Emperor’s arms. “After being suppressed to the Eighth Stage Realm, I feel that I can’t play any role in the midst of so many pendants. I can’t display the strength of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender. I’m simply dragging you down.”","The Great Northern Emperor: “???”","Pendant? Numerous pendants?","“Don’t worry, the Heavenly Dao has already collapsed. The chaotic period is over. I’ll release your seal now.” The Great Northern Emperor’s expression didn’t change as he said coolly.","He stretched out his hand and pressed it on Ah Gui’s body. He began to undo the realm suppression seal on its body and release its Ninth Grade strength.","“Oh right, my Lord. Which lord are you now?” At the same time that the realm seal on Senior Turtle’s body was removed, it suddenly remembered something.","Other than the Great Northern Emperor that Song Shuhang had revived, there seemed to be another cold Great Northern Emperor in Slow-Witted Song’s golden world.","“Since I know the seal on your back, which one do you think I am?” The Great Northern Emperor revealed a trace of gentleness at the corner of his mouth and gently patted the turtle shell.","“Then... My Lord, have you come into contact with another Great Emperor?” Senior Turtle’s realm began to be released, and it slowly rose back to the Ninth Stage.","“There’s no need to worry about the other ‘me’. After some time, it would fuse with the Dao of the Heavenly Courts and become part of the ‘Completion Plan’. In fact, the other me was never me,” the Great Northern Emperor explained.","That was the old shell that he had shed through ‘death.’","“And my visit this time is also related to this matter,” the Great Northern Emperor looked at Song Shuhang and said. “Shuhang, I came here this time to borrow something from you.”","“Senior Beifang, please speak,” Song Shuhang said.","The Great Northern Emperor had once helped him a great deal. If there was anything he could do to help the Great Emperor, he would do his best to help.","“I want to borrow the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City,” the Great Northern Emperor said. “Don’t worry. Once I’m done using it, I promise to return it in one piece. Moreover, after we succeed, we can give you more fragments of the ancient Heavenly City as compensation for borrowing the fragments of the Heavenly City.”","The Great Northern Emperor’s conditions were very tempting.","However, Song Shuhang was a little embarrassed and said, “Senior, it’s not that I don’t want to lend it...” Instead, after the ancient Heavenly City fragment entered my Inner World, it had already fused with my Inner World. Even if I wanted to lend it, I couldn’t.”","The Great Northern Emperor pinched his chin and fell silent.","He seemed to be secretly communicating with someone.","After a while, the Great Northern Emperor said, “In that case, Shuhang, can you lend us your Inner World to carry out a ritual? When the time comes, we will transfer the fragment of the Heavenly City to your Inner World and complete the ritual. Don’t worry, we won’t interfere with the operation of your Inner World. If necessary, you can limit the scope and authority of the Inner World.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Directly enter my Inner World to carry out the ritual? Send the Heavenly City fragment into my Inner World? Seniors, are you trying to send meat buns into a dog’s mouth?”","Song Shuhang knew that his Inner World had the habit of secretly licking the ‘path of the Heavenly City.’"]},{"number":2899,"title":"Chapter 2899: Spare My Dignity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2899: Spare My Dignity!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Song Shuhang didn’t want to deceive the Great Northern Emperor. If the “path of the Heavenly City” that the Great Northern Emperor and the others moved to the fragment of the Heavenly City in his Inner World was affected, their plans might fall apart, and Shuhang would feel uneasy.","“Is that a problem?” The Great Northern Emperor asked, noticing Shuhang’s troubled expression.","“Senior Beifang, it’s not an issue of trust. I’d gladly lend you my Inner World. However, if the fragment of the Heavenly City enters, I might lose something important,” Shuhang explained.","“Lose something? Are you worried that the fragment won’t be able to move out once fused with your Inner World? You don’t have to worry about that,” the Great Northern Emperor reassured. “Once our plan is completed, you can keep that part of the fragment. Only a few key fragments are needed for the Heavenly Court, and you can keep an eye on those.”","“No, that’s not it. My Inner World might absorb the Dao of the Heavenly Emperor from the ancient Heavenly City,” Shuhang clarified.","The Great Northern Emperor was taken aback. “The Dao of the Heavenly Court could also be absorbed?”","“Yes, and if that happens, it could jeopardize the ‘8.5 Heavenly Dao Plan’ that Cheng Lin and Slow-Witted Song mentioned. The plan requires a complete combination of the Dao of the Ancient Heavenly City and the Heavenly Emperor,” Shuhang explained.","“Can you control this?” the Great Northern Emperor asked.","“I can try, but it’s risky. My Inner World might instinctively absorb the Dao of the Heavenly City, like a fire burning a flammable object,” Shuhang said.","The Great Northern Emperor rubbed his forehead in frustration. He fell silent, communicating with someone remotely again. Shuhang waited patiently for his response.","At this moment, Senior White’s gaze fell on a spot behind Shuhang.","“What’s wrong, Senior White?” Shuhang asked.","“What kind of filling do you want?” Senior White asked abruptly.","“Are you still thinking about buns? How about a heart demon filling?” Shuhang joked.","“I wasn’t talking to you,” Senior White replied.","“???” Shuhang was confused.","Senior White handed Shuhang a bun filled with inner demons and then placed another bun with an ‘evil filling’ behind him. A soft voice behind Shuhang thanked Senior White.","It was then that Shuhang noticed a fairy floating in the air, half-lying on his back and fluttering like a flag. She placed her hands on his shoulders and rested her chin on his head while nibbling on the bun.","“Happy New Year in advance, Shuhang,” the fairy said sweetly.","“Happy New Year,” Shuhang replied, feeling an inexplicable closeness to her.","“What gift do you want this year?” Shuhang asked naturally.","“What gift do you want this year?” the fairy echoed, their thoughts seemingly in sync.","“Forget it. I’ll think of a gift myself,” the fairy waved her hand dismissively.","Shuhang smiled faintly and nodded. The fairy was both distressed and happy as she noted, “As your realm increases, our connection deepens. Soon, our thoughts might be completely synchronized.”","“You and I are one,” Shuhang recalled lines he had heard during the ‘Three Corpses Execution’.","“Wrong. You and I are one, but we are not one,” the fairy corrected, taking a big bite of her bun.","Pavilion Master Chu was bewildered by their exchange.","After a while, the Great Northern Emperor finished his remote communication. “Little friend Shuhang, we reached an agreement. Your Inner World can absorb the Dao of the Heavenly City, but during the ritual, please restrain it as much as possible. Is that okay?”","“Senior Beifang, I’ll do my best to help,” Shuhang agreed.","“Then it’s settled. I’ll make some adjustments to the Heavenly City fragment to suit your Inner World,” the Great Northern Emperor said, nodding at his Ah Gui.","“My lord, I need to stay with Tyrannical Song for a while to help find Lady Onion,” Senior Turtle said. “Don’t worry about me. I’ll be safe.”","The Great Northern Emperor left, and soon after, several figures appeared beside Shuhang: Island Master Golden Trigram, Zither Master Phoenix Rites, and Immortal Fairy White Bones.","“Was Senior Beifang here just now?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked.","“Yes, he was here to borrow the fragment of the Heavenly City,” Shuhang replied.","“Island Master Golden Trigram, I remember you have many fragments of the Heavenly City,” Shuhang added.","“You’re not thinking of taking my fragments, are you?” Island Master Golden Trigram retorted.","“Don’t worry, I’m the new Heavenly Emperor. Show me some respect!” Shuhang joked."]},{"number":2900,"title":"Chapter 2900: She Tricked Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2900: She Tricked Me!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As Island Master Golden Trigram spoke, he accidentally used too much strength while stroking the rabbit, causing it to bark in dissatisfaction.","“Senior Island Master, you’ve misunderstood,” Song Shuhang hurriedly waved his hand and said. “Actually, I don’t have many requirements for the fragments of the Heavenly City. I’m just using them to expand my small world. Now, my Inner World is big enough... Therefore, you don’t have to worry that I’ll aim at your Heavenly City fragment.”","Moreover, Golden Trigram was the second Heavenly Emperor chosen by Da Da Zi, so all the fragments of the Heavenly City belonged to him in name. With Song Shuhang’s personality, it was impossible for him to snatch the treasures of his own people.","Island Master Golden Trigram was speechless. Then, when you suddenly want to expand your small world in the future, will you have designs on my Heavenly Court again?","“Besides, it’s not me who wants to borrow the fragment of the Heavenly City this time. It’s the Great Northern Emperor and his people,” Song Shuhang continued.","“By the way, why did the Great Northern Emperor come here to borrow the fragment of the Heavenly City?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked curiously. “Could it be that the Great Emperor also wants to reopen the Heavenly Court?”","“The Great Northern Emperor and the other Four Great Emperors are all very strange. I have a feeling that they won’t have any thoughts of rebuilding the Heavenly Court,” Zither Master Fengyi said, her claws tapping thoughtfully.","She had a feeling that before the Heavenly Court was destroyed, the Four Great Emperors, the Ancestral Golden Dragon, and the other elders who built the Heavenly Court with the Celestial Emperor were all mysterious. For example, when the Ancestral Golden Dragon was in the middle stage of the ancient Heavenly City, it only had a name in the Heavenly City and rarely returned.","“Fellow Daoist Beifang and the others have a big plan...” At this moment, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, hanging on Song Shuhang’s waist, suddenly said.","Pavilion Master Chu Daofou, Zither Master Fengyi, Immortal Fairy White Bones, and the others all looked at Scarlet Heaven Sword. They had almost forgotten that Scarlet Heaven Sword had come with the Great Northern Emperor. They had obviously been together before and might have been a small group.","“What plan? Could it be that Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven also participated in this plan?” Immortal Fairy White Bones asked curiously.","“It should be a plan to save myself. I can’t reveal the details... However, someone should be looking for you soon, Fellow Daoist Golden Trigram,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword said.","“As expected, you’re still after the fragment of my Heavenly City?” Island Master Golden Trigram stroked the rabbit. “But no matter who comes, they won’t be able to borrow the fragment of the Heavenly City.”","“Speaking of which... Senior Island Master, now that you have left the mysterious island and have been chatting with me, isn’t your mysterious island now empty? At this time, if someone wants to ‘borrow’ the mysterious island and directly move it away?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet on the other side of Song Shuhang’s waist couldn’t help but remind him.","Island Master Golden Trigram was speechless. That’s right. The Great Northern Emperor was familiar with Song Shuhang, which was why he came to ‘borrow’ the fragment of the Heavenly City. However, the other teammates of the Great Northern Emperor might not be familiar with him. What if the other party wanted to forcefully borrow the fragment of the Heavenly City and directly targeted his mysterious island?","“I have to go back,” Island Master Golden Trigram rubbed his glabella.","Although the Ancestral Golden Dragon and another fellow daoist proficient in the 36 transformations were still on the island, neither of them was reliable. As expected, it was better for him to go back and guard the mysterious island.","After deciding to leave, Island Master Golden Trigram looked at Song Shuhang—this was the same ‘Senior Song’ who had been a newbie when he first arrived on the mysterious island last year, but had now become a ‘Three Separations Tribulation Transcender’. He had traveled thousands of miles from the mysterious island to meet up with Senior Song because he had been tricked by the previous Heavenly Emperor and wanted to confirm Senior Song’s true identity!","Additionally, some time ago, when he was accepting the inheritance of the Heavenly Emperor and the Dao of the Heavenly City as the new Heavenly Emperor, he had vaguely sensed Senior Song’s forceful interference. At that time, Island Master Golden Trigram, who had received the ‘Dao of the Heavenly City’, vaguely felt that the ‘Senior Song’ that the Heavenly Emperor spoke of gave him a very familiar feeling. Therefore, after fusing with the Dao of the Heavenly City, he immediately came to find Senior Song.","However, he did not expect... This ‘Senior Song’ was actually the newbie who had come to his mysterious island last year. Now, hearing the Heavenly Emperor call him ‘Senior Song’ and ‘Senior Island Master’ again and again, Golden Trigram felt his stomach ache.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, before I leave, I have a question to ask,” said Island Master Golden Trigram.","“Senior Island Master, please ask,” Song Shuhang said.","Island Master Golden Trigram sighed and said, “Why did Heavenly Emperor call you Senior Song? What is your relationship with her?”","“Da Da Zi?” Song Shuhang said.","Island Master Golden Trigram: “???”","“She called me ‘Senior Song’ because she was joking. Of course, it might also be related to Soft Feather,” Song Shuhang said.","“Senior Song is how I address Senior Song,” Soft Feather raised her hand.","Song Shuhang continued, “Da Da Zi’s rebirth this time took over Soft Feather’s ghost spirit... Taking it and not returning it, this kind of behavior must be severely condemned!”","“I see,” Island Master Golden Trigram slightly nodded. No wonder he saw that Soft Feather looked exactly the same as the Heavenly Emperor who had inherited his throne. It turned out that the Heavenly Emperor had taken over this little fairy’s ghost spirit.","“So she was the one who tricked me from beginning to end.” Island Master Golden Trigram’s heart ached.","When he received the inheritance of the Heavenly Emperor, it was easy to explain why he felt so familiar with Tyrannical Song. After all, Song Shuhang had been to the mysterious island before.","After the doubts in his heart were explained to a certain extent, Island Master Golden Trigram cupped his fists at everyone and said, “Then, fairies, fellow Daoists... I have to make a move first. Next time, I’ll come to the mysterious island as a guest.”","Many of the people present were members of the ancient Heavenly City. They were all familiar with each other, so there was no need to be too polite.","After saying that, Golden Trigram began to cast a spell, preparing to open a spatial passageway to return to the mysterious island.","But right at this time, Song Shuhang’s state of enlightenment suddenly changed.","The special state of comprehension after killing the Heavenly Emperor’s Essence Soul finally had a breakthrough after a long period of accumulation and backstage operation. Next to Song Shuhang, the ‘laws’ related to the Heavenly Emperor appeared. There was a portion of the Dao of the Heavenly Court and the Dao of Time that Tiandi Zi was most proficient in. In particular, the Dao of Time resonated with Song Shuhang. The two were highly compatible. Song Shuhang’s ‘secret appraisal technique’ and ‘dreamland’ talent were both related to time.","The data of the Heavenly Emperor’s Dao of Time was analyzed and transformed into simple information that Song Shuhang could understand bit by bit.","When everyone present saw Song Shuhang, their hearts stirred. Due to the influence of the ‘Dao of Time’, when everyone saw Song Shuhang, the scene of their first contact with him began to appear in their minds... After that, he met Song Shuhang, got to know him, and got to know him.","Golden Trigram also turned his head and looked at Song Shuhang. However, the memory that appeared in his mind wasn’t the new Song Shuhang on the mysterious island. In his mind, there was a dusty memory that broke out of its shell. That was the scene when he was still young..."]}]);
